#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CandySlam/CandySlam.uexp
msgctxt "::7194F0B243D1A791F80116AF508CEFFD"
msgid ""
"Have you ever wanted to punch candy in the face? Now you can. \\n\\nThis "
"candy must be punched off of the conveyor belts and into the candy piles to "
"be safely packaged! It’s the only way to keep things interesting.\\n\\nDon't"
" punch anything else but candy though, we don't want any of that."
msgstr ""
"사탕을 한 대 때려 보고 싶으셨나요? 이제 가능합니다. \\n\\n이 사탕은 컨베이어 벨트에서 쳐서 사탕 더미로 보내야 안전하게 "
"포장됩니다! 그래야만 흥미진진하니까요.\\n\\n사탕 외에는 아무것도 치지 마세요. 그런 건 원하지 않습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CatsackSnowballToss/CatsackSnowballToss.uexp
msgctxt "::266085B34DF0131DBF0EB08D682D0930"
msgid "Avalanche"
msgstr "Avalanche"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CatsackSnowballToss/CatsackSnowballToss.uexp
msgctxt "::DCFD3E2C463D58FC4D4BD6912BE8E197"
msgid "Pickup Snowball"
msgstr "눈뭉치 줍기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CatsackSnowballToss/CatsackSnowballToss.uexp
msgctxt "::B94D486C4BA5A2FF4ABB11A460D0F949"
msgid "Throw"
msgstr "던지기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CatsackSnowballToss/CatsackSnowballToss.uexp
msgctxt "::351139834479EC8ED5F5C9A5D7109057"
msgid ""
"Your catsack friends have invited you to a fun snowball fight!\\n\\nPelt the"
" catsacks with tons of snowballs before time runs out. Blue catsacks are "
"worth double points. Fill the snowball meter at the top of the backboard for"
" bonus points!"
msgstr ""
"고양이 자루 친구들이 신나는 눈싸움에 초대했습니다!\\n\\n시간이 다 되기 전에 고양이 자루에게 눈뭉치를 잔뜩 날리세요. 파란 고양이 "
"자루는 점수가 두 배입니다. 백보드 상단의 눈뭉치 게이지를 채우면 보너스 점수를 받습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CoinRiver/CoinRiver.uexp
msgctxt "::5298D93F4819EC3D0089E386438CB920"
msgid "Coin River"
msgstr "코인 리버"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CoinRiver/CoinRiver.uexp
msgctxt "::A4B2F84A497F5F3E9353BCB1ABF16AEC"
msgid "Rotate Coin Gun Left"
msgstr "동전 발사대 왼쪽으로 회전"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CoinRiver/CoinRiver.uexp
msgctxt "::9B0F60544BE8F46FB7940E9B60FFDD31"
msgid "Drop Coin"
msgstr "동전 떨어뜨리기"

