msgstr "동전 발사대 오른쪽으로 회전"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CoinRiver/CoinRiver.uexp
msgctxt "::7687D4AD4DC99CD94C8B49B17AFB19CD"
msgid ""
"A long time ago, there was gold in a river. We’ve been told it was a pretty "
"big deal. So, live the dream yourself by playing Coin River!\\n\\nAnd don’t "
"forget to remind yourself of the river’s importance by spelling out the word"
" RIVER to begin launching more gold into your bucket!"
msgstr ""
"아주 오래전, 강에 금이 있었습니다. 꽤나 대단한 일이었다고 합니다. 이제 Coin River를 플레이하며 그 꿈을 직접 "
"이루세요!\\n\\n더 많은 금을 양동이에 쏟아붓기 시작하려면 RIVER 철자를 맞춰 강의 중요성을 되새기는 것도 잊지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CoinRiver/CoinRiver.uexp
msgctxt "::6B172FF04620853322532BB29F9783F1"
msgid "You will forfeit all tickets by leaving!"
msgstr "나가면 티켓을 모두 잃습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CoinRiver/CoinRiver.uexp
msgctxt "::F16A7CEF427FAA3DFF80A68FDF21B6D9"
msgid "Drops"
msgstr "드롭"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CowWheel/CowWheel.uexp
msgctxt "::89E0D51645CCCD00AD38EAA627D890CD"
msgid "Ultimate Cow Wheel"
msgstr "얼티밋 카우 휠"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CowWheel/CowWheel.uexp
msgctxt "::9FC6AF8F4ADC8738A88644A06750CCC5"
msgid ""
"The cows are back FOR REVENGE. After centuries of being abducted by aliens, "
"the cows have studied sorcery and magic. The aliens continue to invade their"
" lands and attempt to graze on the cow's RIGHTFULLY OWNED GRASS! The cows "
"will not stand for this any longer! The ULTIMATE revolution has "
"begun!\\n\\nHelp the cows steal and destroy the alien UFOs and be rewarded "
"with tickets. Grab the more important UFOs for larger rewards. And if you're"
" feeling bold, grab letters and spell out M I L K to amplify the cows and "
"bask in the milky goodness of the jackpot."
msgstr ""
"소들이 복수를 위해 돌아왔습니다. 수 세기 동안 외계인에게 납치당했던 소들은 마법과 주술을 익혔습니다. 외계인들은 계속 소들의 땅을 "
"침략해 소들이 정당하게 소유한 풀을 뜯어 먹으려 합니다! 소들은 더 이상 참지 않습니다! 궁극의 혁명이 시작되었습니다!\\n\\n소들을 "
"도와 외계인 UFO를 훔치고 파괴하면 티켓을 받습니다. 더 중요한 UFO를 잡으면 보상이 커집니다. 용기가 난다면 글자를 모아 M I L"
" K 철자를 맞춰 소들을 강화하고 잭팟의 우유 빛 달콤함을 만끽하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CraneGame/CraneGame.uexp
msgctxt "::104E49374814B7A6CA43A19E66C85E0B"
msgid "Pluck-a-pal"
msgstr "플럭어팔"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CraneGame/CraneGame.uexp
msgctxt "::144A267E4139EDDC7EA5BEAE5CBAF0BB"
msgid "Drop Crane"
msgstr "집게 크레인"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/CraneGame/CraneGame.uexp
msgctxt "::6B44328448495DD4DA469AB3B789F1D7"
msgid ""
"You’re on a rescue mission. The objective is to pluck a pal. \\n\\nMove the "
"claw left, right, forward,and backward to line up with a plush pal. When "
"ready to drop the claw, press the button. The claw will attempt to pluck a "
"pal and lift them to you. If successful, retrieve your new pal in the prize "
"bin."
msgstr ""
"당신은 구조 임무 중입니다. 목표는 친구를 낚아채는 것. \\n\\n집게를 좌우·앞뒤로 움직여 봉제 친구와 정렬하세요. 집게를 내릴 "
"준비가 되면 버튼을 누르세요. 집게가 친구를 낚아채 들어 올립니다. 성공하면 경품 통에서 새 친구를 받으세요."

