#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/Dizzy.uexp
msgctxt "::128220F7487B676FEB0BA68F1637025B"
msgid ""
"A powerful storm is surrounding you, filling you with terror. Do you have "
"what it takes to TAKE ON THE STORM SINGLE HANDEDLY?\\n\\nPress the button to"
" stop the traveling light within the jackpot zone. If you miss, the jackpot "
"amount will increase."
msgstr ""
"강력한 폭풍이 당신을 둘러싸 공포로 휩쓸고 있습니다. 혼자 힘으로 폭풍에 맞설 수 있습니까?\\n\\n버튼을 눌러 잭팟 구역 안을 "
"지나가는 불빛을 멈추세요. 놓치면 잭팟 금액이 늘어납니다."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/DragonsTreasure/DragonsTreasure.uexp
