#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryArcade.uexp
msgctxt "::89DCBE954D8AAF9B61BC2CAF15A72A16"
msgid "Corn of the Dead"
msgstr "죽은 자의 옥수수"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryArcade.uexp
msgctxt "::1C81A9864A2E01FF3B094ABF7E24D985"
msgid "Shoot"
msgstr "발사"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryArcade.uexp
msgctxt "::D13988A645D87EEA5BF82189D2EEAFD2"
msgid ""
"The corn has come to life and is RUINING ALL OF OUR STOCKS. THE MARKET IS "
"COMING TO A CRASH. A STOCK MARKET CRASH. THE PROFIT MARGINS ARE DOWN 25% AND"
" THE CORN IS NO LONGER ON THE COB. QUICK DO SOMETHING BEF- *end of "
"transmission*\\n\\n<h1>HOW TO PLAY</>\\n• Shoot <b>evil corn!</>\\n• Do not "
"shoot <b>birds!</>. You will lose 50 points\\n• <b>Cans</> are worth 150 "
"points!"
msgstr ""
"옥수수가 살아나서 우리 주식을 전부 망치고 있습니다. 시장이 폭락합니다. 주식 시장 폭락입니다. 이익률이 25% 떨어졌고 옥수수는 더 "
"이상 껍질에 붙어 있지도 않습니다. 빨리 뭐 좀 하세요, 그전에— *통신 종료*\\n\\n<h1>플레이 방법</>\\n• <b>사악한 "
"옥수수!</>를 쏘세요\\n• <b>새!</>는 쏘지 마세요. 50점을 잃습니다\\n• <b>캔</>은 150점!"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryBoardwalk.uexp
msgctxt "::4BE8DE5C42AF2BBED3B3E888E38654F3"
msgid "Western Shootout"
msgstr "서부 총격전"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryBoardwalk.uexp
msgctxt "::A2B3279E4CA067B7D8A20C8B75C066D2"
msgid "Shoot"
msgstr "발사"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryBoardwalk.uexp
msgctxt "::36B20A4B43FD46A73EAB92B6D37F81E3"
msgid ""
"Howdy partner! Step right up and prove you can survive a western "
"shootout!\\n\\n<h1>HOW TO PLAY</>\\n• Shoot <b>targets!</>\\n• Aim for the "
"<b>center</>for more points!"
msgstr ""
"안녕 친구! 이리 와서 서부 총격전에서 살아남을 실력을 보여 줘!\\n\\n<h1>플레이 방법</>\\n• <b>과녁!</>을 "
"쏘세요\\n• <b>중앙</>을 노리면 점수가 더 높습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryTargetMovementType.uexp
msgctxt "::402017BE4B4DF9B63D6CC4A037E48C18"
msgid "Still"
msgstr "정지"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryTargetMovementType.uexp
msgctxt "::4FE3F22C409205A9EF1584A9AAF05D58"
msgid "Left"
msgstr "왼쪽"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/ShootingGallery/ShootingGalleryTargetMovementType.uexp
msgctxt "::25C548874E90525FD58A0E961825ABFD"
msgid "Right"
msgstr "오른쪽"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/Skeeball/Skeeball.uexp
msgctxt "::EC84D1374673A8DA081CD2B00BF78135"
msgid "Starfield Lanes"
msgstr "스타필드 레인"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/Skeeball/Skeeball.uexp
msgctxt "::C03D35254E7AE6B4194A83ADBBDB5400"
msgid "Pick Up Ball"
msgstr "공 집기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/Skeeball/Skeeball.uexp
msgctxt "::12D22C584730AFDED6C2A2BC75047AEB"
msgid "Charge Throw"
msgstr "차지 던지기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/Skeeball/Skeeball.uexp
msgctxt "::1BBDEC484DA0CB752647E1BFA6DA0510"
msgid ""
"The ultimate arcade game. Often found on boardwalks, this exciting game can "
"also be found at nearly every arcade that's worth its salt.\\n\\nGrab the "
"balls from the ball-return on the right, and roll them up the ramp and into "
"the holes. Aim for the center for extra points.\\n\\n If you’re feeling "
"particularly skilled, getting a pocket in the upper left or upper right will"
" net you a huge bonus! \\n\\n Still, be sure to watch the timer!"
msgstr ""
"궁극의 오락실 게임. 해안 산책로에서 흔히 보이는 이 신나는 게임은 제대로 된 오락실이라면 거의 어디서나 만날 수 "
"있습니다.\\n\\n오른쪽 볼 리턴에서 공을 집어 경사를 굴려 구멍에 넣으세요. 중앙을 노리면 추가 점수를 얻습니다.\\n\\n실력이 "
"된다면 좌측 상단이나 우측 상단 구멍에 넣어 큰 보너스를 받으세요! \\n\\n그래도 타이머를 놓치지 마세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SlamDrop/SlamDrop.uexp
msgctxt "::598CC8344997D6458694FD8C6E8D9B1A"
msgid "Whirl-a-Fish"
msgstr "빙빙 물고기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SlamDrop/SlamDrop.uexp
msgctxt "::4A0ACC784A222F04EDBB48AA96D211CA"
msgid "Drop Ball"
msgstr "공 떨어뜨리기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SlamDrop/SlamDrop.uexp
msgctxt "::68AA3E5F46500FA5077DFA90A537AD38"
msgid ""
"Help the fisherman get the bobber into the water for optimal fish catching! "
"You only get a certain amount of chances before that dastardly pelican "
"swoops in.\\n\\nTo fish, press the button to drop the balls and line them up"
" with the spinning holes below. Try to get the balls into the jackpot hole "
"for a higher score!"
msgstr ""
"낚시꾼이 낚싯찌를 물에 넣어 물고기를 잘 잡도록 도와주세요! 사악한 펠리컨이 덮치기 전에 기회는 정해져 있습니다.\\n\\n낚시하려면 "
"버튼을 눌러 공을 떨어뜨리고 아래에서 도는 구멍에 맞추세요. 잭팟 구멍에 넣으면 더 높은 점수를 얻습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SlamDrop/SlamDrop.uexp
msgctxt "::2940827E437181D554AC2AB8109F45CE"
msgid "Drops"
msgstr "드롭"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/StackEm.uexp
msgctxt "::1EF3492042D42EF17BC955814A55111C"
msgid "Stack 'Em"
msgstr "쌓아 올려"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/StackEm.uexp
msgctxt "::6A8D0C684BFF3E4A7073F1A84CF36E27"
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "정지"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/StackEm.uexp
msgctxt "::BE2DB529458E2EF39D6A9098F7CC25E4"
msgid ""
"So. You think you want to stack squares? You think you want to stack "
"squares, and you need help?\\n\\nAlright. Let's get to the basics.\\n\\n1. "
"Stack the squares.\\n2. Don’t not stack the squares\\n3. Stack 'em\\n4. "
"You’re doing great.\\n5. Stretch those finger muscles.\\n\\nThat didn’t make"
" sense? Well. Just press the button at the right time to line up the moving "
"squares. Make sure to be precise because you’ll lose the squares you don’t "
"stack straight. Stack the squares to the top of the screen and move on to "
"the next level."
msgstr ""
"그래. 네모를 쌓고 싶은 거지? 네모를 쌓고 싶은데 도움이 필요하다고?\\n\\n좋아. 기본부터 시작하지.\\n\\n1. 네모를 "
"쌓는다.\\n2. 네모를 쌓지 않지 않는다\\n3. 쌓아라\\n4. 잘하고 있어.\\n5. 손가락 근육을 풀어라.\\n\\n이해가 안 "
"된다고? 뭐. 그냥 움직이는 네모가 맞을 때 버튼을 눌러 줄을 맞추면 돼. 똑바로 쌓지 않으면 네모를 잃으니 정확하게. 화면 끝까지 "
"네모를 쌓고 다음 레벨로 넘어가세요."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SuperBasketball/SuperBasketBallMachine.uexp
msgctxt "::E3D0AA49495D07052EC2F6B612E53803"
msgid "Super Hoopers"
msgstr "슈퍼 후퍼스"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SuperBasketball/SuperBasketBallMachine.uexp
msgctxt "::10D137F14CEAEEDDDB51339B754B4A52"
msgid "Pickup Ball"
msgstr "공 집기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SuperBasketball/SuperBasketBallMachine.uexp
msgctxt "::5CE8BCDD445F7A65B6862382CB0F32B3"
msgid "Charge Toss"
msgstr "차지 토스"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SuperBasketball/SuperBasketBallMachine.uexp
msgctxt "::AE9A2B1447719D7FC0E0208718ACCE62"
msgid ""
"GOAL!! Are you ready to make it to the home plate?\\n\\nGrab a ball and hold"
" to adjust the power of your throw. Aim the ball at the moving hoop, and try"
" to score as many points as you can in 45 seconds.\\n\\n5 points & tickets "
"per hoop. You get a 50 ticket bonus if you get more than 60 points!"
msgstr ""
"골!! 홈 플레이트까지 갈 준비됐나요?\\n\\n공을 집고 누르고 있어 던지는 힘을 조절하세요. 움직이는 링에 공을 맞혀 45초 안에 "
"최대한 많은 점수를 얻으세요.\\n\\n링마다 5점과 티켓. 60점을 넘으면 티켓 50장 보너스!"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/SuperBasketball/SuperBasketBallMachine.uexp
msgctxt "::8A869A5140D76704157653ADE915B5B7"
msgid "Pick up"
msgstr "줍기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/Tornado/Tornado.uexp
msgctxt "::FD2EE28A4A4AB3CA6F2A09BB0DFB3F85"
msgid "Tornado"
msgstr "토네이도"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/Tornado/Tornado.uexp
msgctxt "::31C245F145CB6181CAFBC69D524CD09C"
msgid ""
"A tornado is no laughing matter. The dog’s lost her tennis balls. All the "
"owner can do to assuage her is to make a game out of her loss.\\n\\nPull "
"back the plunger and try to apply the right force to get the ball into the "
"high points. Stay frosty, and try not to apply too much power as the ball "
"will enter the eye of the storm and not catch any more air."
msgstr ""
"토네이도는 웃을 일이 아닙니다. 개가 테니스 공을 모두 잃어버렸어요. 주인은 그 상실을 게임으로 달래 줄 수밖에 "
"없습니다.\\n\\n플런저를 당겨 적당한 힘으로 공을 높은 점수에 넣어 보세요. 침착하게, 힘을 너무 세게 주지 마세요. 공이 폭풍의 "
"눈으로 들어가 더는 바람을 타지 못합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhackAMole/BugBytes.uexp
msgctxt "::9D1EE55444C05A501ADA0BA50E645C76"
msgid "Bug Bytes"
msgstr "버그 바이트"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhackAMole/BugBytes.uexp
msgctxt "::BEDFEE614FA11D14B377F9B05901080F"
msgid ""
"DESKTOP ASSISTANT: Hey! Finally asking for help? :I\\n\\nDESKTOP ASSISTANT: "
"This is a two programmer job. You’ll both need to eliminate the red bugs "
"with your hammers. Try not to hit the cute, green features. :o\\n\\nDESKTOP "
"ASSISTANT: As you conquer bugs, you’ll have a better eye for more and more. "
"Destroy as many as you can before you ship the game and release it to the "
"public! >:D\\n\\nDESKTOP ASSISTANT: Good luck. :U"
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 비서: 어! 드디어 도움을 청하는 거야? :I\\n\\n데스크톱 비서: 이건 프로그래머 둘이 할 일이야. 둘 다 망치로 빨간 "
"버그를 없애야 해. 귀여운 초록색 기능은 때리지 마. :o\\n\\n데스크톱 비서: 버그를 잡을수록 더 많은 걸 눈에 담을 수 있어. "
"게임을 출시해 공개하기 전에 최대한 많이 파괴해! >:D\\n\\n데스크톱 비서: 행운을 빌어. :U"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhackAMole/WhackAMole.uexp
msgctxt "::ACCD04E6424AE8FBF5C67EBA46397EB4"
msgid "Whack-a-Mole"
msgstr "두더지 잡기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhackAMole/WhackAMole.uexp
msgctxt "::AF4EB13146BFE55922D195AE9DC5DB62"
msgid "Smack Hammer"
msgstr "두더지 망치"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhackAMole/WhackAMole.uexp
msgctxt "::7E8C2A22420F3AA86AA598BE73F49A1F"
msgid ""
"DEFEND YOUR GARDEN. Your poor vegetable friends are under attack. Grab a "
"hammer and teach those guilty moles a lesson.\\n\\nSmack the moles’ hard "
"hats with the hammer, and avoid smacking the cats or you'll lose points. The"
" more moles you aggravate, the faster they will pop up."
msgstr ""
"정원을 지키세요. 불쌍한 채소 친구들이 공격받고 있습니다. 망치를 들고 그 못된 두더지들을 혼내주세요.\\n\\n망치로 두더지의 안전모를"
" 때리고, 고양이는 때리지 마세요. 때리면 점수를 잃습니다. 두더지를 많이 자극할수록 더 빨리 튀어나옵니다."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelMazeSpinner/WheelMazeSpinner.uexp
msgctxt "::E4791E6F4F214DDF8217FC9E3A29A243"
msgid "Prismatic"
msgstr "프리즘"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelMazeSpinner/WheelMazeSpinner.uexp
msgctxt "::6A721BDF46BF987B53BB2689B68F8B45"
msgid "Spin Left"
msgstr "왼쪽 회전"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelMazeSpinner/WheelMazeSpinner.uexp
msgctxt "::4BB783934422EBFD868E0F998ADE0AA0"
msgid "Spin Right"
msgstr "오른쪽 회전"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelMazeSpinner/WheelMazeSpinner.uexp
msgctxt "::62B6D5B946243DA05EDEF0A93A20B55B"
msgid ""
"It's a maze out there. Life. It's so hard to navigate.\\n\\nThat's why we "
"invested in cutting-edge maze technology that will amaze you for all the "
"days to come.\\n\\nTraverse through these carefully, hand picked, and "
"locally sourced walls that will spin your head and put a smile on your "
"beautiful face."
msgstr ""
"세상은 미로투성이죠. 인생이라니. 길을 찾기가 너무 힘들어요.\\n\\n그래서 저희가 준비했습니다. 앞으로 영원히 감탄할 최첨단 미로 "
"기술을요.\\n\\n정성껏 골라 현지에서 조달한 벽들을 지나보세요. 머리가 핑 돌고 예쁜 얼굴에 미소가 번질 겁니다."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelMazeSpinner/WheelMazeSpinner.uexp
msgctxt "::2396BF2A493823BD623B649C9DED37B4"
msgid "Drops"
msgstr "드롭"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelOfFire/WheelOfFire.uexp
msgctxt "::B2A13BEB4DE95F86C579F09332E1335D"
msgid "Wheel of Fire"
msgstr "불바퀴"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelOfFire/WheelOfFire.uexp
msgctxt "::9835E3044F1FB73C5D02B3860B55DB43"
msgid "Pull Back"
msgstr "당겨서 회전"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelOfFire/WheelOfFire.uexp
msgctxt "::7B8A5D3948A89AE84D5BCABC02E1A8CB"
msgid ""
"Can you handle the heat?!\\n\\nSpin the wheel to test your luck. You just "
"may win tickets! Yes, it's that easy. No, you have no control over where it "
"lands. Low effort, but great rewards… sometimes."
msgstr ""
"열기를 감당하시겠습니까?!\\n\\n바퀴를 돌려 운을 시험해 보세요. 티켓을 얻을지도 모릅니다! 네, 그렇게 간단합니다. 아니요, 어디에"
" 멈출지는 제어할 수 없습니다. 노력은 적게, 보상은 크게… 가끔은요."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelOfFire/WheelOfFireAwards.uexp
msgctxt "::1F0E40B34AC94CA184DD11B16B6DD567"
msgid "LowPrize"
msgstr "낮은 경품"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelOfFire/WheelOfFireAwards.uexp
msgctxt "::D0EF0932441690CA6FE66989922DF916"
msgid "HighPrize"
msgstr "높은 경품"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelOfFire/WheelOfFireAwards.uexp
msgctxt "::718C68A349B9BACCD982D4AF365F936D"
msgid "Jackpot"
msgstr "잭팟"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelOfFire/WheelOfFireAwards.uexp
msgctxt "::84F8A56E4028948BCC15339864E6FA98"
msgid "MegaJackpot"
msgstr "메가 잭팟"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelyRigged/WheelyRigged.uexp
msgctxt "::A649CD1240D9929663851A839BCDFD0B"
msgid "Sunlight Roller"
msgstr "햇빛 롤러"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelyRigged/WheelyRigged.uexp
msgctxt "::B6D5C3E448FFAF99FF65DAA401CE6629"
msgid "Drop Coin"
msgstr "동전 떨어뜨리기"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelyRigged/WheelyRigged.uexp
msgctxt "::6968D55A40E050BBE6AC4A800740429F"
msgid ""
"Step right up; step right up! Give this wacky wheel a whirl! Drop a coin and"
" see where it lands!\\n\\nInsert a token down the powered ramp and into the "
"spinning numbered slots. Time the drop right for more points! It's really "
"not rigged. Honest."
msgstr ""
"어서 오세요, 어서 오세요! 이 엉뚱한 바퀴를 한번 돌려보세요! 동전을 넣고 어디에 떨어지는지 보세요!\\n\\n동전을 경사로에 넣어 "
"돌아가는 번호 칸으로 보내세요. 타이밍을 맞추면 점수가 더 커집니다! 정말 조작된 거 아닙니다. 진심이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WheelyRigged/WheelyRigged.uexp
msgctxt "::A050892E462277E5C29BC1A67125BBF2"
msgid "Coins"
msgstr "동전"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhoseHue/WhoseHue.uexp
msgctxt "::63E7F67E4DAF22DEDD7687967BB6D2FD"
msgid "Coloracle 2: Whose Hue?"
msgstr "컬로라클 2: 무슨 색?"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhoseHue/WhoseHue.uexp
msgctxt "::FC94B78F46F7DA997DF290BE4E1BA838"
msgid "Select Colors (up to 2)"
msgstr "색 선택 (최대 2개)"

#. Tower/Content/Blueprint/Actors/Arcade/WhoseHue/WhoseHue.uexp
msgctxt "::CF45071D4700495C29737C9025435967"
msgid ""
"The wheel of fate is spinning. Can you decide what color it will land on? "
"Step on in and experience COLORACLE 2. The sequel to the hit classic color "
"deciding game COLORACLE 1: Hue's Saturation?\\n\\nSelect a color and hope "
"the ball lands on the color. You will be rewarded with riches BEYOND EARTHLY"
" IMAGINATIONS!"
msgstr ""
"운명의 바퀴가 돌고 있습니다. 어떤 색에 멈출지 맞힐 수 있나요? 들어와서 컬로라클 2를 경험하세요. 대히트 색깔 맞히기 게임 컬로라클 "
"1: 색의 채도?의 속편입니다.\\n\\n색을 고르고 공이 그 색에 떨어지길 바라세요. 상상 초월의 부를 얻을 수 있습니다!"

