msgid "A feisty dragon, ready to rumble."
msgstr "한바탕 싸울 준비가 된 덤벙대는 드래곤."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::154021CC4A79FA238460539FB13EBF19"
msgid "Hatch a mystical egg."
msgstr "신비한 알을 부화시키세요."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78E030804D82A440F4BCB48389D4547A"
msgid "Dragon Pet (Rainbow)"
msgstr "드래곤 펫 (무지개)"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9840FD1E4E3C2E31FDFED194BEA3647D"
msgid "A mystical being fused with power beyond imagination."
msgstr "상상 이상의 힘과 융합된 신비로운 존재."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B4B7A26E4B72E4A9A93A1E889DE020FC"
msgid "Hatch a mystical egg."
msgstr "신비한 알을 부화시키세요."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C6F4AF1F4A30E07FB9AE51B53C3B6086"
msgid "Fireplace Hearth"
msgstr "벽난로 화로"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BBD6A33B48919FFD3BDE91BFA00C4F94"
msgid ""
"The campfire's introverted sibling, prefers reading books by itself on "
"stormy nights."
msgstr "모닥불의 내향적인 형제. 폭풍우 치는 밤에 혼자 책을 읽는 것을 좋아합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BC99290048FEA1A4DB893E968007C931"
msgid "Wooden Chest"
msgstr "나무 상자"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::42ACBD6E4BADDC3B7CA2D1A07AA9B3F3"
msgid ""
"All treasures removed before purchase. Spirits of Victorian children who "
"died playing hide-and-seek partially removed."
msgstr "구매 전에 모든 보물을 제거했습니다. 숨바꼭질을 하다 죽은 빅토리아 시대 아이들의 영혼은 일부 제거했습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::55A82AFF49EB287E454F62BB622E2F5D"
msgid "Autumn Harvest Scarf"
msgstr "가을 수확 목도리"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::86BAE8B8488D95FA4BA70E98B7CD9505"
msgid ""
"Traditional turkey fabric, depicting them celebrating a delectable harvest."
msgstr "맛있는 수확을 기념하는 칠면조가 그려진 전통적인 칠면조 천."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A34E3AB34CC61148E48F5F833AC4494F"
msgid "Canvas Torus"
msgstr "캔버스 토러스"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7C38A98446C744F5FD63BE9A7CF671EE"
msgid "A canvas primitive that can display images from the internet."
msgstr "인터넷 이미지를 표시할 수 있는 캔버스 기본 도형."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9319EF23485F9B241FA13595A29EB2A6"
msgid "Mistletoe"
msgstr "겨우살이"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::562126B64ABE4AF8C2AD4F86F0340EA1"
msgid ""
"When two weirdos end up under this, magical things are bound to happen."
msgstr "두 괴짜가 이 아래에 서면 마법 같은 일이 벌어지기 마련입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FB3B131E44DB92B317C3ACB161BB677E"
msgid "Ice Cube"
msgstr "얼음 조각"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::81B047E14AB86E4B32D33E8158692BDE"
msgid ""
"A slippery, throwable chunk of ice. Stack enough and you can make an iceman!"
msgstr "미끄럽고 던질 수 있는 얼음 덩어리. 충분히 쌓으면 얼음 인간을 만들 수 있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3BE6330C452E720D5C193199BE1C8751"
msgid "Ice Sculpture Catsack"
msgstr "얼음 조각 캣색"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F31193D14A1CB6152FF2A59BC4AA0D53"
msgid ""
"Many years ago, a little catsack girl became lost in the woods on a cold, "
"wintry night. She was so alone and scared that she began to sob "
"uncontrollably. As her tears froze on the ground, they formed a new friend "
"out of ice!"
msgstr ""
"오래전, 어린 캣색 소녀가 춥고 눈 내리는 밤에 숲에서 길을 잃었습니다. 너무 외롭고 무서웠던 그녀는 걷잡을 수 없이 흐느꼈습니다. 땅에"
" 흐른 눈물이 얼어붙어 얼음으로 된 새 친구가 되었습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F850225A406822235B20119A668E8769"
msgid "Ice Sculpture Pedestal"
msgstr "얼음 조각 받침대"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE07B27047A53A48B539129EB1D721BE"
msgid "A display pedestal for the coolest creations on the (ice) block."
msgstr "얼음 위 최고의 작품을 전시할 진열 받침대."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::69AAA0074880C31EA8A1BD94E60C3ED3"
msgid "Winter Presents"
msgstr "겨울 선물"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD5D261D4698BE2763DE1E8056FDC349"
msgid "A variety of empty presents  in a variety of empty shapes."
msgstr "다양한 빈 모양의 다양한 빈 선물 상자."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD6995B34B307B0F2C30A0B324839B01"
msgid "Hanging Mistletoe"
msgstr "매다는 겨우살이"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5787B4294B4A70444C8F399AA9018EA1"
msgid ""
"Mistletoe is a parasitic plant resembling a bush suspended in the branches "
"of trees (its host). Some species remain vibrant green throughout the "
"winter."
msgstr "겨우살이는 나무(숙주)의 가지에 매달린 덤불 모양의 기생 식물입니다. 일부 종은 겨울 내내 짙은 초록색을 유지합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0537F9C54EF6D3E5912BF2BFAFF2B5FE"
msgid "Ice Sculpture Snowman"
msgstr "얼음 조각 눈사람"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BA9FD71A4B7C8F28D24115B66524C926"
msgid ""
"This piece is just a little glimpse into the sicked (sick and wicked) and "
"twisted world of the sculptor's mind."
msgstr "이 작품은 조각가가 머릿속 병들고(어둡고) 뒤틀린 세계를 살짝 엿보게 합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E33E652C46C01FFDC2209CA3CE04BE6E"
msgid "Post Process Volume"
msgstr "포스트 프로세스 볼륨"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::72D3EF2040D4B937778DCC859C254636"
msgid ""
"Customize visual effects such as saturation, contrast, chromatic, vignette, "
"grain, bloom, tint, pixelate, etc. within a volume or globally."
msgstr "볼륨 내부 또는 전체에 채도, 대비, 색수차, 비네트, 그레인, 블룸, 색조, 픽셀화 등 시각 효과를 설정합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::493165694FB4DDF01905FA898A3477CB"
msgid "Sky Volume"
msgstr "하늘 볼륨"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::26D4AFFC4EA16B815DB1B3A2582D7BA6"
msgid ""
"Customize the sky, including fog, sun, sun tint, horizon/zenith colors, star"
" colors, and time of day settings within this volume or globally."
msgstr ""
"이 볼륨 내부 또는 전체에 안개, 태양, 태양 색조, 지평선/천정 색상, 별 색상 및 시간대 설정을 포함한 하늘을 설정합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A3AC78524A2474D3998468840B8EC5D6"
msgid "Festive Cushion"
msgstr "축제 쿠션"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CC1025AE4A993A12E6A6339B2776BA5C"
msgid "A cushion only good one time of the year."
msgstr "일 년 중 한때만 쓸 수 있는 쿠션."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E0C30AB9400CCAC677AB7CBAB60B315F"
msgid "Frosting (Plain)"
msgstr "아이싱 (플레인)"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::65EC1EF147C4E494C46BD8955F0EC2E1"
msgid ""
"Perfect for decorating gingerbread facilities and outlining gingerbread "
"infrastructure."
msgstr "진저브레드 시설 장식과 진저브레드 인프라 외곽선 긋기에 딱 맞습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C5AA82C34299EC582EB89D88D6B15D4A"
msgid "Frosting (Candy)"
msgstr "아이싱 (캔디)"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4F5D19C5445297516B05C3AA2FA17406"
msgid ""
"\"Always keep your candies in a line.\" That's what Santa Claws always told "
"me."
msgstr "\"사탕은 항상 줄을 맞춰 두렴.\" 산타클로스가 늘 하던 말이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FCC98D3E4ABCFFFE3FDDE0BBCA1D7145"
msgid "Spinning Dreidel"
msgstr "회전하는 드라이델"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6F9C4E1542A45545B753CC98EFE20302"
msgid "If it never stops spinning... are you still dreaming?"
msgstr "영원히 멈추지 않고 돈다면... 아직 꿈꾸는 중인가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::39B95F9C4BB11258C58E89BF357AD71D"
msgid "Canvas Chocolate Bar"
msgstr "캔버스 초콜릿 바"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F69A44DF48383F3AD941C399FDF72CB2"
msgid "What brand? What taste? Yes!"
msgstr "무슨 브랜드? 무슨 맛? 전부 다!"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B2BC58D44274FA1CB387258582092BE0"
msgid "Oversized Lollipop"
msgstr "거대 롤리팝"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C71113D42188DCDCEAEC7AC8EE57B47"
msgid "How many licks will it take to get to the center of THIS?"
msgstr "이 안쪽까지 가려면 몇 번이나 핥아야 할까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC8E32714605946E0A4DC18EC87FB406"
msgid "Oversized Whipped Cream"
msgstr "거대 휘핑크림"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::751B67A249DE2EEFCFAD15ABB148CA73"
msgid ""
"The horrifying implications of an oversized whipped cream canister are just "
"too much for your mortal mind to comprehend."
msgstr "거대한 휘핑크림 통이 품은 공포는 필멸자의 정신으로는 감히 헤아릴 수 없습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::49420A364ABF5DF59122D09955D43CE1"
msgid "Oversized Round Gummy"
msgstr "거대 둥근 구미"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EFEA3C69491ABF53219CDBA5DE54A895"
msgid "A springy, oversized gummy that you can bounce off of."
msgstr "탄력 있는 거대 구미, 위에서 튕겨 올라갈 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88F992F1497E0F7EEAB814A6008DF117"
msgid "Oversized Square Gummy"
msgstr "거대 네모 구미"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::516A77E94D00D066699B55BC4AD91F33"
msgid "A springy, oversized gummy that you can bounce off of."
msgstr "탄력 있는 거대 구미, 위에서 튕겨 올라갈 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::91AD6FBC4F4A468249D76DB5B5A11A40"
msgid "Oversized Peppermint Swirl"
msgstr "거대 페퍼민트 소용돌이"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D95BAB5F42F07B8AD39E4B942415ABC0"
msgid "Despite looks, it isn't a choking hazard!"
msgstr "생김새와 달리 질식 위험은 없습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8CF4CD4444027A9E116A48BB5A6F0D65"
msgid "Oversized Candy Cane"
msgstr "거대 캔디 케인"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D8D2F624248B12179CE08B1E53EBB94"
msgid ""
"These \"Candied Canes\" are grown near the North Pole, stripped of their "
"peppermint bark, then shipped southwards for happiness throughout the world."
msgstr "이 \"캔디드 케인\"은 북극 근처에서 자라 페퍼민트 껍질을 벗긴 뒤, 전 세계의 행복을 위해 남쪽으로 수출됩니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::98253F6544FB34793F20188E740D9A2F"
msgid "Oversized Ice Cream Scoop"
msgstr "거대 아이스크림 스쿱"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8B7F71314E9E8A14C2047DB10253D9ED"
msgid "A Granny-Sized scoop of ice cream... just how many pints is this?"
msgstr "할머니 크기의 아이스크림 한 스쿱... 이거 몇 파인트나 될까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A98BCAAA4AA52B23DD1DE9A0BEED9B98"
msgid "Oversized Cake Pop"
msgstr "거대 케이크 팝"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07699A0B43BA65B5214CF59023B73C4C"
msgid "At what point does it stop being a \"Pop\" and considered a cake blob?"
msgstr "언제부터 '팝'이 아니라 케이크 덩어리라고 불러야 할까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::55CE290B489A28CF906955B7063B92DA"
msgid "Oversized Rock Candy"
msgstr "거대 락 캔디"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::309532AE467220EC995DBE82B521F862"
msgid ""
"Unlike other candies, this Rock Candy grows upside-down in caves underneath "
"sugar deposits,"
msgstr "다른 사탕과 달리 이 락 캔디는 설탕 광상 아래 동굴에서 거꾸로 자랍니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6FAA3D7748297B1910A2B7B4F888A483"
msgid "Oversized Chocolates"
msgstr "거대 초콜릿"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::63FFD08B48E949F43263CD8AA9C8089B"
msgid "Bon-bons grown in a strange garden of sweets."
msgstr "달콤한 정원에서 자라난 봉봉."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0CBED6B44CF7ED2EB927D596442D0783"
msgid "Oversized Wrapped Chocolate"
msgstr "거대 포장 초콜릿"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::31178F174377BFE2596D7F99812D4E8B"
msgid "The most delicious part is the anticipation..."
msgstr "가장 맛있는 순간은 바로 기다릴 때..."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ECBCA9674C83527D69DF048336360A8F"
msgid "Candy Rope"
msgstr "캔디 로프"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D3A232A84779A998EBB46AA2D41A45BC"
msgid ""
"There's a growing divide across the Plaza... are you Team Candy Rope or Team"
" Swizzlies?"
msgstr "플라자에 커져가는 논쟁이 있습니다... 당신은 캔디 로프파인가요, 스위즐리파인가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::38B619AE49F8BB498010A783E60AFC78"
msgid "Gingerbread Top Hat"
msgstr "진저브레드 모자"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::403C0FFC4669112D50FFE89ADA592F85"
msgid "Featuring 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms, and a spacious walk-in closet."
msgstr "침실 3개, 욕실 2개, 넉넉한 드레스룸까지 갖췄습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9CA53E9A41A8A746493666819B97FE6A"
msgid "Midway Lights"
msgstr "미드웨이 조명"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4DFCF423414DE3571F470DB39C072B74"
msgid ""
"Flashy and eyecatching, good for luring in unsuspecting customers to "
"swindle."
msgstr "화려하고 눈길을 끌어, 방심한 손님을 꾀어내기에 좋습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::93E10DB24518BB10BC586DA323A8341D"
msgid "Canvas Soda Can"
msgstr "캔버스 탄산음료 캔"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AA1F1A274D3F5E8F7B1D40BC241AC628"
msgid ""
"Now you can pretend you have your favourite (contraband) brands of soda! "
"Contains inedible Canvas Liquid."
msgstr "이제 좋아하는 (밀수) 탄산음료 브랜드를 가진 척할 수 있습니다! 먹을 수 없는 캔버스 액체가 들어 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E22220B4F8C5084EE5B2B95F14FC933"
msgid "Ice Sculpture Franky"
msgstr "얼음 조각 프랭키"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::828B18D545AAF4D5C28271BA4F7BA678"
msgid ""
"Carved from decadent, frozen hot dog water by an anonymous \"F.D.\", this "
"piece is titled \"To My Enduring Fans\"."
msgstr "익명의 \"F.D.\"가 얼린 핫도그 물로 조각한 작품, 제목은 \"나의 영원한 팬들에게\"."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2B1A2A0B4CEDA14C329B1E991C4E71D5"
msgid "Ice Sculpture Kalleira"
msgstr "얼음 조각 칼레이라"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::76F0D9C242A62542C1240091A76241D9"
msgid ""
"A self-portrait piece created using ice-o-mancy (patent pending), that's not"
" a book of carols she reading from..."
msgstr "아이스오맨시(특허 출원 중)로 만든 자화상. 그녀가 읽고 있는 건 캐롤 책이 아닙니다..."

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3932281746513F7C1DA6AB9032615774"
msgid "Elf Mutilator"
msgstr "엘프 절단기"

#. Tower/Content/Items/ItemManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED95D7054BAE51668428AC87FAEEB393"
msgid ""
