#. Tower/Content/Maps/Info/MG_Cove_Info.uexp
msgctxt "::F6B459EC45F048DCA60EB3992BFDB0BC"
msgid ""
"YARRRR!!!!!! Ahoy matey!!!! Blast through cannons, roll yer ball down the "
