"Take your golfing to the next dimension by putting through teleporters and "
"advanced alien technologies."
msgstr "텔레포터와 첨단 외계 기술 속에서 퍼팅하며 차원을 넘는 골프를 즐기세요."

#. Tower/Content/Maps/Info/MG_Forest2020_Info.uexp
msgctxt "::D7335BCE4CDFAAADE281B48760C2B489"
