msgctxt "::FF61B1124E876FB0EFBFD582DBED569B"
msgid "The office is on lock down, keep yourself alert at all times."
msgstr "사무실이 봉쇄되었습니다. 항상 경계를 늦추지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Maps/Info/V_Sewers_Info.uexp
