#. Tower/Content/UI/Chat/ChatRules.uexp
msgctxt "::A48063BD4D4AE86263EA05B9C325025B"
msgid ""
"Chat, voice chat, text hats, and condo titles are moderated.\r\n"
"When using chat/voice chat, you must follow these rules:"
msgstr ""
"채팅, 음성 채팅, 텍스트 모자, 콘도 제목은 관리됩니다.\r\n"
