#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/BallRaceMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::2C2F3A5F4819505EB4731880F2CAA789"
msgid ""
"Travel through different worlds full of puzzles and obstacles. To reach the "
"end, get past tricky situations such as crushers, lasers, lava, and falling "
"objects!"
msgstr ""
"퍼즐과 장애물로 가득한 다양한 월드를 통과하세요. 끝에 도달하려면 압착기, 레이저, 용암, 떨어지는 물체 같은 위험을 헤쳐 나가야 "
"합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/BallRaceMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::DA6F04C54EEC236DF84325AED345D944"
msgid "Controller Support"
msgstr "컨트롤러 지원"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/BallRaceMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::333D1CEE4FDD739969B0839E06699BD1"
msgid "Ball Rolling!  1-12 Players"
msgstr "볼 롤링!  1~12 플레이어"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/BallRaceMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::4F254AEB4A82D0AFB4DC789D15C2E4CB"
msgid "Unique Puzzles"
msgstr "독특한 퍼즐"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/BallRaceMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::B26818EE4174A0CB5FACD4A5C1C564EC"
msgid ""
"Each world has its own theme and set of puzzles. The difficulty varies. "
"Carefully roll around the platforms and try not to fall off. "
msgstr "각 월드는 고유의 테마와 퍼즐을 가지고 있으며 난이도도 다양합니다. 플랫폼 위를 조심히 굴러다니며 떨어지지 않게 하세요. "

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/BallRaceMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::1A741ABB4D22C0E1D48A279606BD7542"
msgid "Time Trials"
msgstr "타임 트라이얼"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/BallRaceMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::871D54BC42BA70E81891719CCAAB72AD"
msgid ""
"Compete with other player times and try to land yourself on the top of the "
"leaderboards!"
msgstr "다른 플레이어의 기록과 겨루어 리더보드 최상위에 올라보세요!"

