msgstr "홀인원!"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::7EE6B36147A9C72B4059598EFDEC2100"
msgid ""
"Minigolf is a very relaxing minigame. Sit back and enjoy the views while you"
" putt. Don't fret. Life is good."
msgstr "미니골프는 아주 편안한 미니게임입니다. 퍼팅하며 경치를 즐겨 보세요. 걱정 마세요. 인생은 아름답습니다."

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::8480A5AF496E86188D672883FA33BBA5"
msgid "Controller Support"
msgstr "컨트롤러 지원"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::3EC8863B4E6663C5843CB29DAC5224DE"
msgid ""
"Watch your ball rocket off and explode. With fireworks! And extra points. "
"You've earned it."
msgstr "공이 날아가 폭발하는 모습을 지켜보세요. 불꽃놀이까지! 게다가 추가 점수도요. 충분히 누릴 자격이 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
#. no-translate  # 수동
msgctxt "::BFDAEA2548A9F68687B7089A00C55976"
msgid "®"
msgstr ""

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::47EA1B0C4FC008FF9BF2379541208E44"
msgid "Try for Par"
msgstr "파 도전"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::2642F0A04316334412A6F495AA74EF0D"
msgid ""
"Our Minigolf (batteries not included), rather unsurprisingly, works in the "
"same way as real miniature golf. Just try to get your ball in the hole with "
"the least amount of strokes possible."
msgstr ""
"저희 미니골프(배터리 별도)는 당연하게도 실제 미니어처 골프와 같은 방식으로 작동합니다. 최대한 적은 타수로 공을 홀에 넣기만 하면 "
"됩니다."

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::488FFFB443FC4EF3A251B0A5E2BFEE22"
msgid "So Many Birds!"
msgstr "새가 정말 많다!"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::D3A26EEE44C941B6DB5BEAB0CE932600"
msgid "1-16 Players"
msgstr "1-16명"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::7D8CF9EE405147A6C914E89BE4B173C2"
msgid ""
"Being one under par will give you the score of birdie. Two under par is "
"eagle. Three under par is the elusive albatross. You'll probably get a "
"triple bogey, though."
msgstr ""
"파보다 1타 적으면 버디 점수를 받습니다. 2타 적으면 이글. 3타 적으면 찾기 힘든 앨버트로스입니다. 아마 트리플 보기를 하겠지만요."

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/MinigolfMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::9522033243E59D202FF00097A9D5190C"
msgid "BACK TO MENU"
msgstr "메뉴로"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::B63FCAAB4984DACC249BD0A5993EE4AE"
msgid "PLANET PANIC SERVERS"
msgstr "플래닛 패닉 서버"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::150BA0E74F2846544F3074B14B153247"
msgid ""
"Just before each round starts, there is a very tense moment in which it is decided who becomes the first infected. The good news is that the virus can only be spread by touch. \r\n"
"\r\n"
"Hold the infected players back with your weapons until time ends and you can escape. "
msgstr ""
"매 라운드가 시작되기 직전, 누가 첫 감염자가 될지 결정되는 아주 긴장되는 순간이 있습니다. 좋은 소식은 바이러스가 접촉으로만 퍼진다는 것입니다. \r\n"
"\r\n"
"시간이 끝나 탈출할 수 있을 때까지 무기로 감염된 플레이어를 막아내세요. "

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::96EB438847ACE120B180CC88915987F3"
msgid "First Person Shooter - 4-8 Players"
msgstr "1인칭 슈터 - 4-8명"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::EC845A6A496ED5C424C261B0CD0840E1"
msgid "Infect Everyone"
msgstr "모두 감염시켜라"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::F90616244FFCEE3F8E7B61B59338F074"
msgid ""
"In Virus, you're either alive or infected. Your job as an infected player is to infect everyone. The infected must work as a team to pass on the infection to every human. \r\n"
"\r\n"
"But beware, those who are alive have a stream of bullets and explosives to throw back at you. "
msgstr ""
"바이러스에서는 생존자이거나 감염자입니다. 감염자로서의 임무는 모두를 감염시키는 것입니다. 감염자들은 팀을 이루어 모든 인간에게 감염을 옮겨야 합니다. \r\n"
"\r\n"
"하지만 조심하세요. 살아남은 자들은 총알과 폭발물을 마구 쏟아부어 반격합니다. "

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::74684CDD49BC60B6140AB3A52150A390"
msgid "Last One Standing"
msgstr "마지막 생존자"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::7E400BAE48AE7A605A1A0C86F032E841"
msgid ""
"Have all your fellow teammates become infected? Are you the only one remaining? If I were you, I would run fast. \r\n"
"Really fast."
msgstr ""
"팀원들이 모두 감염되었나요? 당신만 남았나요? 저라면 빠르게 도망가겠습니다. \r\n"
"아주 빠르게요."

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/GameWorldMenus/PlanetPanicMenu.uexp
msgctxt "::CB8A430940FFA38814F9769536CD9EFF"
msgid "BACK TO MENU"
msgstr "메뉴로"

