msgctxt "::3E73043C47579300D3B8788C8719B2AC"
msgid ""
"Kart racing is a competitive sport that offers great rewards to the best of "
"the best! Move up the ranks and earn more units!"
msgstr "카트 레이싱은 최고에게 큰 보상을 주는 경쟁 스포츠입니다! 순위를 올려 더 많은 유닛을 획득하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/UI/MainMenu/TitleMenu/GameWorlds/GWTitleAccelerate.uexp
msgctxt "::1C0CBA2044C9E0642A5318BB92DFC816"
msgid "Scenic Routes"
msgstr "경치 좋은 길"

