#. Tower/Content/UI/RoomManager/RoomCheckIn.uexp
msgctxt "::D93865AA43C42FCFF56D7487ED89354E"
msgid ""
"Show your friends your singing talent, or just relax and listen to tunes in "
"an upscale modern private room."
msgstr "친구들에게 노래 실력을 뽐내거나, 고급스러운 현대식 개인실에서 편안히 음악을 즐기세요."

#. Tower/Content/UI/RoomManager/RoomCheckIn.uexp
msgctxt "::912C482941753CC699F9C085E70E9ACE"
msgid "4 Rooms Available"
msgstr "룸 4개 이용 가능"

#. Tower/Content/UI/RoomManager/RoomCheckIn.uexp
msgctxt "::EDDAC1CC43429D077DF63697EB43D56C"
msgid ""
"All rooms come with a fully featured bar, complementary snacks, and HD TVs."
msgstr "모든 룸에는 완비된 바, 무료 스낵, HD TV가 마련되어 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/UI/RoomManager/RoomCheckIn.uexp
msgctxt "::17ACD1314F5F95E78B09948B58E54DA9"
msgid "B O O K   R O O M"
msgstr "룸   예약"

#. Tower/Content/UI/RoomManager/RoomCheckIn.uexp
msgctxt "::7B8D9D8641370AD2C1521DA01985A979"
msgid ""
"Upon booking, only you and your friends can enter the room. Other players can request access by knocking.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"NOTE: Leaving the building will end your booking!\r\n"
"\r\n"
"All sales are final."
msgstr ""
"예약하면 본인과 친구만 룸에 입장할 수 있습니다. 다른 플레이어는 노크로 입장을 요청할 수 있습니다.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"참고: 건물을 나가면 예약이 종료됩니다!\r\n"
"\r\n"
"모든 판매는 최종입니다."

