msgid "Save Data Control"
msgstr "저장 데이터 제어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::545D77724F7DDBBE65D68BAA71160DA2"
msgid ""
"Grants ability to manage save/load data of the Condo (dedicated servers "
"only)."
msgstr "콘도의 저장/불러오기 데이터 관리 권한을 부여합니다(전용 서버 전용)."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D46A20F246144BA59C5F45A2172C5291"
msgid "Spawn & Edit Own Items"
msgstr "자신의 아이템 생성/편집"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::90BAAE804CF309E831BB6CA160C6FB09"
msgid "Grants ability to spawn, edit, remove, and move their own items."
msgstr "자신의 아이템을 생성, 편집, 제거, 이동할 수 있는 권한을 부여합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FDD6B4264C50AC1666A6C082BA512DA7"
msgid "Edit ALL Items"
msgstr "모든 아이템 편집"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8E86C4624E700F0931DDC0B10B565CFC"
msgid ""
"Grants ability to spawn, edit, and move all items. Note: Players cannot "
"stash or sell items!"
msgstr "모든 아이템을 생성, 편집, 이동할 수 있는 권한을 부여합니다. 참고: 플레이어는 아이템을 보관하거나 판매할 수 없습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE25075B46C2FFBE72DC678D2B6D1582"
msgid "Edit Environment"
msgstr "환경 편집"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::11BC81AF43EBBC1B59F7E1AF64D74878"
msgid "Grants ability to adjust day/night or weather"
msgstr "낮/밤 또는 날씨를 조정할 수 있는 권한을 부여합니다"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E85DDA434629056628528783DCEAE941"
msgid "Media Admin"
msgstr "미디어 관리자"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C523E77649F58B0617715385DEE7E366"
msgid "Ability to be a media admin (seek, skip)"
msgstr "미디어 관리자 권한 (탐색, 건너뛰기)"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::36E911F64ECAFE57CC5DDA83F813D047"
msgid "Special Items Use"
msgstr "특수 아이템 사용"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/Condo/CondoPlayerPermissionManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC6A7A904E8067B8A92C969AC0E9346D"
msgid ""
"Grants ability to use weapons, projectiles, rc cars, instruments, jetpack, "
"speed, potions, etc. (bypasses any global setting)"
msgstr "무기, 발사체, RC 카, 악기, 제트팩, 스피드, 포션 등을 사용할 수 있는 권한을 부여합니다 (전역 설정 무시)"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2951C4F14EA97D7F3B6B9AA43641DCF3"
msgid "Kalleira"
msgstr "칼레이라"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EDB8D8624EC691F6660B5C8B092D092D"
msgid "Woah! @A new customer!"
msgstr "와! @새로운 손님입니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F583694C4A5D1EFB6612F397C7F3DE0E"
msgid "Welcome back! Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "다시 오신 것을 환영합니다! 다음에도 들러주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::83A7BDD3447DA3A538EC9F8393EEFF75"
msgid "I've missed you. @Well, not really. But don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "보고 싶었어요. @글쎄, 사실은 아니지만. 그래도 다음에도 들러주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6A2174C44E398587D089B2AB0C209A82"
msgid "Hey again, pal! Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "또 만났네요, 친구! 다음에도 들러주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7272BD6E4E047696B30C70B4BBCA6C79"
msgid "Hey there! Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 다음에도 들러주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DFC37C1A439FAD3A1AAFE880147B5877"
msgid "Welcome to The Stray, %customer%! Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "The Stray에 오신 것을 환영합니다, %customer%! 다음에도 들러주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8463B3034A5738C62CE44FB571449F6D"
msgid "Hey there! Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 다음에도 들러주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A80480C448A2E47DC5A3758B1334A9DB"
msgid ""
"The moon is looking very pretty tonight! Do you think I have a chance with "
"her?"
msgstr "오늘 밤 달이 아주 예쁘네요! 저 달과 잘 될 수 있을까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::10F7FE0044A5374DB5B242BEA8B138AA"
msgid "Ever feel like you've seen everything already?"
msgstr "모든 걸 다 본 것 같은 기분이 든 적 있나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E978DE864DEB5773948D6AA3C51640D9"
msgid "I wonder if the moon is looking at me?"
msgstr "달이 나를 보고 있는 걸까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::668C9BB14532CD6B521B4AB633A51D0E"
msgid ""
"I once saw a Cosmic Catsack. @They like to hide in gold for some reason."
msgstr "예전에 코스믹 캣색을 본 적이 있어요. @그들은 왠지 금 안에 숨는 걸 좋아하더라고요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78C9BF73430DD5A2D12ECCBA6B43C1D9"
msgid "I'm never tired. In fact, I haven't slept in five years."
msgstr "저는 절대 피곤하지 않아요. 사실 5년 동안 잠을 안 잤거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7D7F7A31479F29EFCCDC249F4CC75CB8"
msgid "When you think about it, the moon does look very pretty!"
msgstr "생각해 보면, 달은 정말 예쁘네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E820ADCE49E86D32B058DA84C24AD346"
msgid "Do you think I have a chance with the moon?"
msgstr "저 달과 잘 될 수 있을까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C8613CE476D98BAF49AB480D0DD339B"
msgid "I want to ask the moon out, but I am very nervous."
msgstr "달에게 데이트를 신청하고 싶지만, 너무 떨립니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EDA808A94E3D4C4552037F9D44842F30"
msgid "Hey, quit it!"
msgstr "야, 그만해!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C540BFC741C9AC328D15F2AE8D6C62A7"
msgid "Thanks for sticking around! Now, where's that yarn ball gone..."
msgstr "남아줘서 고마워요! 자, 그 실뭉치는 어디 갔지..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7FD056974950A9ED1433E69B07702032"
msgid "It was a pleasure. See you soon!"
msgstr "즐거웠어요. 곧 또 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C6EE906E44515273487AF8BA7ACFD7A8"
msgid "Hope you found something interesting. Catch you later!"
msgstr "재미난 걸 찾았길 바라요. 나중에 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B7CD6B084580DD073B93A484D423C506"
msgid "Psst. Over here."
msgstr "쉿. 이쪽이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7C7B18124147848366C5C0ADA1D1D4B8"
msgid "Can you talk to the moon for me? "
msgstr "달과 얘기 좀 해줄래요? "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::510E2B424101E2AC0715B3A73890927A"
msgid "Mysterious items for sale!"
msgstr "신비한 물건 판매 중!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2B3772AF4D71405E22144DAC8C49F44F"
msgid "Hey you! Yeah, you. Come here!"
msgstr "어이, 당신! 그래, 바로 당신. 이리 와요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9778E10D4208F15FF5E90D9EC66C3A7D"
msgid "Thank you so much! I've always wanted a %item%!"
msgstr "%item%을 늘 갖고 싶었어요! 정말 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::79B28F634BFA807CBDEFFBA07B745942"
msgid "This will make for a great gift for the moon, thanks!"
msgstr "달에게 좋은 선물이 되겠네요, 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::400CA19340BCEDD04EC2029246BC2504"
msgid "Aw, you shouldn't have!"
msgstr "어머, 이런 걸 다 해주고!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7F3C4EF34FAEF916244AE6B6F5B717D6"
msgid "#Hey what the heck!"
msgstr "#야, 이게 뭐야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::126B41F34A7BA1700CF1CDACFD0EC262"
msgid "#Rude!"
msgstr "#무례하네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD75E0E1486BA7C348AC66BAC72E0528"
msgid "#Ouch!"
msgstr "#아야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::10D08B49445EA78AB5F89C9AABF93DD6"
msgid "#Hey watch it!"
msgstr "#야, 조심해!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B25E2D3485C0FD2A43CCC8639E1A94E"
msgid "#This won't help your odds!"
msgstr "#그래 봤자 확률은 안 올라가!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CBDCE76542BC674F5D25B8B929B5F025"
msgid "Welcome, my best customer, %name%! Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr "어서 오세요, 제 최고의 손님 %name%! 자주 오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFE245AC402098EC8D25838EA3718ACF"
msgid "I am happy to sell to you anytime!"
msgstr "언제든 기꺼이 팔아드릴게요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F6682B3242971EB394418B80528F1F90"
msgid "I'd give you a discount, but I really need the money."
msgstr "깎아드리고 싶지만, 돈이 정말 필요해서요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::11BF513B4592AAB825457382DE8B883E"
msgid "Are you going to buy something or just stare?"
msgstr "살 거예요, 아니면 그냥 쳐다볼 거예요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::66B264B945AE22A5AE590788F09CB5F2"
msgid "I think you should buy that item. @No! @That one."
msgstr "그 물건을 사는 게 좋겠어요. @아니! @저거요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5390130E432DB475DC4A9EBBC6DA7FBF"
msgid "Hurry up! I've got a date with the moon. @I wish..."
msgstr "서두르세요! 달과 데이트가 있어서요. @그러면 좋겠다..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::67FE49F2498D643A0520219D4F42526A"
msgid "I've got other customers to server, you know?"
msgstr "저도 다른 손님을 응대해야 한다고요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4CA9A17B4C8672F441EFDFA7ACC5BC14"
msgid "Look, if you're not buying anything, at least move or something!"
msgstr "이봐요, 안 살 거면 적어도 비켜주든가!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D73034C44A593D6A503F048D65A7538C"
msgid "Are all humans as indecisive as you?"
msgstr "인간들은 다 당신처럼 우유부단한가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D55DDACA401BE04567A5EB83F3C764FE"
msgid "Nice pick. @Or is it?"
msgstr "좋은 선택이네요. @정말요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::35D972004E9AC888448E82AE425D70E9"
msgid "Buying that, huh?"
msgstr "그거 사시는군요, 네?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3564EC7748A3D0B7DD9762A51106B662"
msgid "Excellent choice, possibly."
msgstr "탁월한 선택이에요, 아마도."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::32E0C5134A084EAF3AE3788DF2BB4260"
msgid "You may have chosen correctly, but only time will tell."
msgstr "제대로 고르셨을지도 모르죠. 시간이 말해주겠지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::33E6D03841B900C0772DA6897DE11D14"
msgid "Woah! I'm gonna have to restock soon!"
msgstr "와! 머지않아 재입고해야겠네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4AE5CDCA4351B3FFBE35758A8758D4CA"
msgid "You do realize there are other items, right?"
msgstr "다른 물건들도 있다는 거 알지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::045550334EAD3CA89E5CF98A75695059"
msgid ""
"Be careful when drinking that; despite the label, the side effects are not "
"tiny."
msgstr "그거 마실 때 조심하세요. 라벨과 달리 부작용이 작지 않거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B89A3454987AB48784D2085AF0E9EB9"
msgid "Changing your mind already?"
msgstr "벌써 마음을 바꾸신 건가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C5BBB2B249D5841F7F9AD6A2A8CFEF41"
msgid "Ah, not what you wanted, huh?"
msgstr "아, 원하던 게 아니었나 보네요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C1DB3C9041D3F2233F6F01B5AD3451C3"
msgid "Excellent choices!"
msgstr "훌륭한 선택이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AB5E004D4CE8584838EBBE979A044A13"
msgid "Heh, heh, nice!"
msgstr "헤헤, 좋아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::81B87EFD4E3430020EA9E3AC62A25FFC"
msgid "Hey, do you mind standing back a bit next time?"
msgstr "저기, 다음엔 조금 뒤로 물러서 주실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD5906AF4A097964579FB08FFDADFF46"
msgid "Oh!@A large customer!"
msgstr "오!@큰 손님이시네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7DB25BAF44FA2CFD7041F19C41B2FB9E"
msgid "I see you've shopped here before, small person."
msgstr "여기서 전에 쇼핑하신 적 있죠, 꼬마야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B5C761474184CD600C772E8A716D0091"
msgid "Everything's on sale!"
msgstr "전부 세일 중이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::408DC7574BBF5278EB08A191216F578F"
msgid "Grab everything you can; there's a sale!"
msgstr "세일이에요, 있는 대로 다 챙기세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47E9478C42E7DAE6A2303F907008B592"
msgid "Sale! Sale! Buy! Buy!"
msgstr "세일! 세일! 사세요! 사세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::054C657947E89B7FB3D75888BDC52073"
msgid "The sale won't last long, hurry!"
msgstr "세일은 오래 못 가요, 서두르세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7E8523D94E2292B17E0ABCB0603CF10E"
msgid "This sale is better than the last! Quick!"
msgstr "이번 세일이 지난번보다 좋아요! 빨리요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E1D2C0F5414632C958152DBC850AE52E"
msgid "My sister is throwing another event up! Go check it out!"
msgstr "우리 언니가 또 이벤트를 열었어요! 한번 가보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3DF5014440EF81E254E69085ACAEB03D"
msgid "Normally, I'd participate in the events, but I'm busy."
msgstr "보통은 이벤트에 참여하지만, 지금은 바빠요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5A73F2BB43F1521377DC4F81EC659FBF"
msgid "Not one for events, huh?"
msgstr "이벤트엔 별 관심 없으신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0718030140673BE177123FA79083A823"
msgid "My sister really loves making those events, I'd go check it out!"
msgstr "우리 언니는 그런 이벤트 만드는 걸 정말 좋아해요. 한번 가보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D28D71842EACC85CAFE3DB6875921B9"
msgid "Events are really fun, but I'm always busy."
msgstr "이벤트는 정말 재미있지만, 전 늘 바빠요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F4844454D4EBACA078F85826DE14D02"
msgid "person"
msgstr "사람"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5CF8E6B9488EF9601F541FA0F9B0C187"
msgid "unexperienced shopper"
msgstr "풋내기 손님"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::25688B164C64341494BB92956C9E8F3E"
msgid "Scared Knight"
msgstr "겁먹은 기사"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5FDBC45046062D8242B033A55509A99D"
msgid "Do you...@ is there a dragon near?"
msgstr "저기...@ 근처에 용이 있나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F96DB38E4F9C97F30B00E3A361A23A9A"
msgid "Shh...@sh.h..."
msgstr "쉿...@쉬잇..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::558084264D2C56A49C8E32B85722016F"
msgid "Landin"
msgstr "랜딘"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8794707948B2754702C0E8862FFA7093"
msgid ""
"Hey, hey, hey! Whassup there, new face! Get on in here, and check out what "
"we've got!"
msgstr "야, 야, 야! 왔구나, 새 얼굴! 어서 들어와서 뭘 파는지 좀 봐!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57A1C081478B90A5089F6C82F8D75104"
msgid "Awwright! What's good? Walk on in here, and let's get you tuned up!"
msgstr "좋아! 뭐가 필요해? 어서 들어와서 조율 좀 해보자고!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BA24C6984E19B2188DDBE4846DE624AA"
msgid "Hey there, musician! Whaddya need today?"
msgstr "안녕하세요, 음악가님! 오늘은 뭐가 필요하세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AB8AEC224A6990A6E98319A20DD6540E"
msgid "'sup?"
msgstr "안녕?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::77AD81804C43050B8820D6805167FE3D"
msgid ""
"Have you ever listened to %title% by %artist%? It's got that sort of %genre%"
" vibe you can really %verb% to."
msgstr "%artist%의 %title% 들어봤어요? 정말 %verb%하기 좋은 %genre% 느낌이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::760B221B468F08B2AD8AD587374F575F"
msgid ""
"I miss having Central Circuit next door. I think he really enjoyed my tunes."
msgstr "옆에 Central Circuit이 있던 때가 그리워요. 그 양반은 내 연주를 참 좋아했거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C4CF31FB4EDFD877FF07239AEF3FBC42"
msgid "* Music continues blasting as you leave the store. *"
msgstr "* 가게를 나서는데 음악이 계속 쿵쾅거립니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E146213C41F691B5FDD758A088036DAB"
msgid "* Constant music can be heard. *"
msgstr "* 끊이지 않는 음악이 들립니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ADB33E3B4F772E7658B09EB5A8BC7083"
msgid "Catch ya later! * Loud music becomes increasingly louder. *"
msgstr "나중에 봐! * 음악이 점점 더 커집니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::822C1D4D4D25516540EBB3852B64B931"
msgid "* Loud music can be heard. *"
msgstr "* 큰 음악 소리가 들립니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E081C7E541CA713AB4FBC288B3873594"
msgid "Nice, I've been waiting for this one!"
msgstr "좋아, 이거 기다리고 있었어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB7BA2714C8FA1470E9E7296CFB81047"
msgid "Hey, dude! You need anything today or just looking?"
msgstr "이봐, 친구! 오늘 필요한 거 있어, 아니면 그냥 구경?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CE9A15A24ED1CED0AE2C0F8FFC4F3441"
msgid "*air drum solo*"
msgstr "*에어 드럼 솔로*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5537DC24453B6A1E92C556AD50823395"
msgid "Aw, man. I love this part of the song."
msgstr "아, 진짜. 이 곡 파트 너무 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3D377ED64B07C14D563CB99F1F6CAA5D"
msgid "Nice pick! That'll definitely amp up your condo."
msgstr "좋은 선택! 콘도가 확 살아나겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4673DBD747812D0A92956E93ABE05C97"
msgid "Nice, nice, nice!"
msgstr "좋아, 좋아, 좋아!"

