msgstr "캣색 열기"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::77F8AB8A46A9F3078F77E0B392C54EBD"
msgid "cook pasta"
msgstr "파스타 요리하기"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EF0D1F75478760E00ECBE1A2E3257B79"
msgid "breathe"
msgstr "숨쉬기"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB0732514178EEFD07A0308F483120F3"
msgid "pick a lock"
msgstr "자물쇠 따기"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::458BC4714DCEB4F2E883F880F7810AAE"
msgid "rob a bank"
msgstr "은행 털기"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED1AD50B4A7D7F7FBDA245944237DAC7"
msgid "Sir Reel"
msgstr "Sir Reel"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E86E99EF491EA289ADA5A4911A32F0FF"
msgid ""
"Ah! A new fisher! Come on up; we sell everything you need for fishing here."
msgstr "아! 새로운 낚시꾼이군요! 어서 오세요. 낚시에 필요한 건 다 팝니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0F8C7B2D4046B81EBCE980BC6892B23C"
msgid "Hey there! Come on in and let's get you set up."
msgstr "안녕하세요! 들어오셔서 준비를 도와드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AE3D148C4387EC6146566B8D702038B3"
msgid "Angling to up your fishing game? Heh."
msgstr "낚시 실력을 키우고 싶으신가요? 헤헤."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D132B604ED50830C5A026AFD5936D08"
msgid "Greetings! We've got all sorts of bait that will probably work."
msgstr "반갑습니다! 아마 효과가 있을 온갖 미끼가 준비되어 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::972D2FAC42523C55978E67A8D26B9828"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D05C75F24B04833E06BA6BA2A0983F4D"
msgid ""
"We've got everything you need to land the medium one!@@ Not the big one, "
"though."
msgstr "중간 크기 녀석을 낚을 물건은 다 있답니다!@@ 큰 녀석은 아니지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7BF070B240E601FB12ADE78AD0E4962C"
msgid "Bait, @tackles, @rods, @everything you need to be a top angler!"
msgstr "미끼, @태클, @낚싯대, @일류 낚시꾼이 되는 데 필요한 모든 것!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::13AC497E4578585D157972B97AA4DF70"
msgid ""
"I've heard some... @rumors @that there's a shark near the island. Be "
"careful, ok?"
msgstr "@섬 근처에 상어가 있다는... @소문을 들었어요. 조심하세요, 알겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EDB332834D644690DAE45C8272571A51"
msgid ""
"There's nothing like enjoying the day on the docks, waiting for a bite. @Or "
"so I assume; I've never actually fished before."
msgstr "부두에서 입질을 기다리며 하루를 보내는 것만큼 좋은 건 없죠. @그럴 거라고 생각해요. 사실 낚시는 해본 적이 없거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7A669ED440F7D7FE12B087B464A03329"
msgid ""
"I saw this movie about a shark who eats people during a summer festival when"
" I was a kid. @Never did get over that particular fear, heh."
msgstr "어릴 때 여름 축제에서 사람을 잡아먹는 상어 영화를 봤어요. @그 공포는 아직도 못 떨쳐냈네요, 헤헤."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4967385548945A5185EB759130B26CD7"
msgid ""
"There's all sorts of fishing spots to try your luck at! @Go out and "
"experiment, it's half the fun!"
msgstr "운을 시험할 수 있는 낚시 명소가 많답니다! @나가서 실험해 보세요, 그것도 절반의 재미예요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CEC418EC4D97946CE6FFCD865DFD8FA6"
msgid ""
"You ever broken a fishing line before? @It's a bummer, so always bring some "
"spare line!"
msgstr "낚싯줄이 끊어진 적 있나요? @속상한 일이니 예비 줄을 꼭 챙기세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B8A0E40142DFB51AFCC413895232282E"
msgid ""
"There's an expedition team looking for new fishing waters near the island; I"
" hope they find something cool soon!"
msgstr "섬 근처에서 새로운 낚시터를 찾는 탐사대가 있대요. 곧 멋진 걸 찾길 바라요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E1BF5E52486622160078D6ADB68B95DD"
msgid ""
"Be careful if you ever go night fishing; it's harder to spot danger or "
"bites."
msgstr "밤낚시를 하러 갈 땐 조심하세요. 위험과 입질을 알아채기 어렵거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9095D014AF3E4F9EA7D0F879D050C1D"
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::75AEA8BC4942F90DF3B93C9288EA838A"
msgid "Thank you! Come on back if you run out of bait now!"
msgstr "감사합니다! 미끼 다 쓰면 또 들르세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB97851646578D07F68CF8A3732E3C01"
msgid "Now, go forth and catch fish, young fisher!"
msgstr "자, 이제 나가서 낚시하세요, 젊은 낚시꾼!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F925DA084FB659E5F81122BEAEB074D0"
msgid "Look out for sharks!"
msgstr "상어 조심하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::134C705648CCB19B6954EFBACFF26E62"
msgid "Good luck on your fishing!"
msgstr "낚시 잘 되길 바랍니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::148F580C42C5F0240813ED8D0ED5EB7A"
msgid "Fresh bait! Come get all your fishing needs met!"
msgstr "신선한 미끼! 낚시에 필요한 건 다 준비되어 있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CF5D1D1342D93D0E491D1DA22A5B8882"
msgid "We've got tackles and line! Everything a fisher needs!"
msgstr "낚싯줄과 채비까지! 낚시꾼에게 필요한 건 다 있어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2779CCE04C41672EC2EC0A9D024173B1"
msgid "Hobbyist or professional, we can help get you equipped to fish!"
msgstr "초보든 고수든, 낚시 장비를 갖추도록 도와드립니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::281566C14F75691A98F525B826E0D657"
msgid "Oh, thanks!"
msgstr "아, 고맙습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD7EBE8745A90FF46F5D52BE06A91764"
msgid "Welcome back! What can we do for you today?"
msgstr "어서 오세요! 오늘은 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF37C0D3498E4DF119D5FA8E71E55190"
msgid ""
"Ah, my favorite fisher; Can we get you anything today, or you just stop by "
"for a chat?"
msgstr "아, 제일 좋아하는 낚시꾼이시네요. 오늘 필요한 건 없으신가요, 아니면 그냥 이야기하러 오셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2A5614564B3782B8C6B4A8BCDB7ECFEF"
msgid "Come on in, you! Need some more bait?"
msgstr "어서 오세요! 미끼가 더 필요하신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5B7F04E14D00F06CC1FC75BEB5A794B2"
msgid "Feels like I just saw you! What can we get you?"
msgstr "방금 본 것 같은데요! 무엇을 드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7DBD44D54B3BD665BA24EF8195B174C6"
msgid "Hi! What'cha need this time?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 이번엔 뭐가 필요하세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FA26E9AD42C65EC421FC06B756B3E1C5"
msgid ""
"Take your time; it's a fishing shop! Patience is never in short supply."
msgstr "천천히 보세요, 여긴 낚시 가게니까요! 인내심은 얼마든지 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FA87AEA14F1B1A02F729FAB61C734CC2"
msgid "Too many options huh? Well, don't worry; take all the time you'd like."
msgstr "선택지가 너무 많죠? 걱정 마시고 원하는 만큼 시간을 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6C8A80E94B4E3FDFBD2517AB3533FEF6"
msgid ""
"Man, you've got impressive concentration! Customers usually aren't able to "
"deliberate on their shopping choices this long."
msgstr "집중력이 대단하시네요! 보통 손님들은 이렇게 오래 고민하지 못하는데요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DAC38DAC41551278AAB7BA970AF144D3"
msgid "Ah, a fisher who takes time to prepare. The mark of a master."
msgstr "아, 준비에 시간을 들이는 낚시꾼이시군요. 고수의 징표입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7067DFEF4EE7D608537E0696D9E69D10"
msgid "Can do."
msgstr "좋습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2FDC685F4CD575ABB8B13795DEE397C9"
msgid "Alright, lemme just fish that out of the stock room. Heh."
msgstr "알겠어요, 창고에서 낚아 올게요. 헤헤."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ECCF2ADC46642CE93097BDA2F6776757"
msgid "Gotcha."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F58E442640FA1083900BC0A8ED35D075"
msgid "One %item%? No problem."
msgstr "%item% 하나요? 문제없습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::440534EC4E791909ABBB1487634C1767"
msgid "Oh, good. We still have some of those in stock. "
msgstr "아, 다행이네요. 그건 아직 재고가 남아 있습니다. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F6914F74B30F7C1D089F5A6713B2F81"
msgid "Good thing I stocked up yesterday."
msgstr "어제 재고를 채워두길 잘했네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89FDDF36451D6F8A98571781E58C53E2"
msgid "A bulk order? No problem."
msgstr "대량 주문이요? 문제없습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::940C66184EC930FA65F7EB9F9A437EB9"
msgid "Ah, stocking up I see. Let me go get that for you."
msgstr "아, 재고를 쌓아두시는군요. 가져다 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F4D112A5491609212F30958766E6FA89"
msgid "Of course. Let me get that ready."
msgstr "물론이죠. 준비해 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E977D9F84ED5DCA4B5C2A5AFE9EA6AFF"
msgid "Stockpiling %item%, hm? Let's fish that up."
msgstr "%item%를 비축하시려고요? 낚아 올리겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::769CAC2443EA39F90C17E7B0486721E2"
msgid "Do we have enough of %item%...? @@...Ah, good; we do!"
msgstr "%item%가 충분한가...? @@...아, 다행히 있네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F54EE3774222EFA90A5591AC4F6701E6"
msgid "A bulk order of %item%, coming up!"
msgstr "%item% 대량 주문, 바로 준비해 드릴게요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::712DF7914CBB66285AFA6CA880265EFD"
msgid "Alright, no problem."
msgstr "알겠습니다, 문제없어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::540A6F674C6DD81DCDF64FBE5F8E363C"
msgid "Changed your mind, eh?"
msgstr "마음이 바뀌셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E21656D44B7C5FEA9DAF2289B77D2307"
msgid "Thank you for your patronage!"
msgstr "이용해 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEC2E6F14A2315102A6E7C88FA0FA267"
msgid "I hope this helps you catch a lot of fish!"
msgstr "낚시 잘 하시는 데 도움이 되면 좋겠네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A52C736647999A993565749BCD51B7D9"
msgid "Hope this helps you!"
msgstr "도움이 되면 좋겠네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C55ECD342BB4C5F7810489D9055C403"
msgid "Come back when you need more!"
msgstr "더 필요하시면 다시 오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3270E0A34E9045E8EBB9F1BC4386F78E"
msgid "Done! Thanks, buddy!"
msgstr "완료! 고마워요, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::968818594F6D0F0C1FBD90990DF19482"
msgid "Hey there! We got a sale going on; might be a good time to stock up?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 지금 세일 중이니, 재고를 쌓아 둘 좋은 기회일지도 몰라요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B32404B944B8B5BF14D538976D45531A"
msgid "We've got a sale on! Come on in and get what you need."
msgstr "세일 중입니다! 들어오셔서 필요한 걸 챙겨 가세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::233BD01344A3D28607BB6197F83EDF95"
msgid "Noisy out today, huh? I'd rather just stay here and enjoy the day."
msgstr "오늘은 시끄럽네요? 저는 그냥 여기 남아서 하루를 즐기고 싶어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CE6F4D534784E41001027087215A5693"
msgid ""
"Looks like something's going on in the plaza. Might scare away the fish."
msgstr "플라자에서 무슨 일이 있는 모양이에요. 물고기가 놀랄 수도 있겠네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7916902E425D2A20C53B32A398C0B102"
msgid "OVERLY EXCITED MAN"
msgstr "지나치게 들뜬 남자"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D432DBA244660F69A8050E9BB11BAB16"
msgid "ARE YOU ALIVE? YOU LOOK ALIVE, WHATEVER IT'S FINE COME ON IN."
msgstr "살아 계세요? 살아 보이는데, 뭐 어쨌든 됐고 들어오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9D2E4C5C4DF54F9CCA15D5891327596E"
msgid "HELLO. GET IN HERE, AND LET'S GET YOU STRAPPED."
msgstr "안녕하세요. 들어오세요, 준비해 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B06724604C6DF38795B1B59806E14D2F"
msgid "AAAAAAAAAAAA- OH, HELLO. I WAS JUST PRACTICING SCREAMING. COME IN."
msgstr "아아아아아아- 어, 안녕하세요. 방금 비명 연습 중이었어요. 들어오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9853C6474927C819FF7060BCBF7BDC8D"
msgid "WELCOME TO CELEBRATIONS, HOME OF LOUD NOISES."
msgstr "시끄러운 소리 가득한 '셀러브레이션스'에 어서 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78E4E51D40670EC30BA0038044F7FA7F"
msgid "HERE AT CELEBRATIONS, WE ENJOY SHOUTING AND GUNPOWDER."
msgstr "여기 셀러브레이션스에서는 소리 지르기와 화약을 즐깁니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::532529A74C7BD8425577D6B0C8D22039"
msgid "WELCOME TO THE REPOSITORY OF SKY FIRE!"
msgstr "하늘 불꽃 보관소에 어서 오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DDCC854A444B9E7A5E715ABAF01137B7"
msgid "ARE YOU A COP?"
msgstr "경찰이세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::504E22FB43F6EA77C5B6788F6E0AEDBD"
msgid "I COULD ENTHUSE ABOUT FIREWORKS LITERALLY ALL DAY! AND I WILL!"
msgstr "폭죽 얘기라면 하루 종일 떠들 수 있어요! 정말로 그럴 겁니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E2E9B6B449F366802BAC7BA11E085717"
msgid ""
"MOST OF THESE ARE ACTUALLY BANNED FOR BEING TOO DANGEROUS, BUT DON'T TELL "
"ANYONE."
msgstr "여기 대부분은 너무 위험해서 금지된 것들이죠. 비밀이라고 아무한테도 말하지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3CA5918E4065758EE978E998FDFDF4BC"
msgid "WE HAVEN'T HAD A FIRE IN HERE IN WEEKS NOW!"
msgstr "여기서 불난 지도 벌써 몇 주째예요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::577181584DB160E15142058DD83EBAF0"
msgid ""
"WE DON'T CONSIDER FIREWORKS AN ACCIDENT, SO, TECHNICALLY, THAT MEANS WE'VE "
"GONE UNLIMITED DAYS WITHOUT ACCIDENTS!"
msgstr "폭죽은 사고로 치지 않으니, 엄밀히 말하면 사고 없이 무한대 일을 기록 중이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8EF781A94F7B048EB7889CBE95979FA0"
msgid ""
"WHEN LIFE BLOWS YOUR HAND OFF WITH A CHERRY BOMB, YOU MAKE CHERRY-AID. @@AND"
" THEN GET A ROBOT HAND."
msgstr "인생이 체리 폭탄으로 손을 날려 버리면, 체리 에이드를 만들면 되죠. @@그다음 로봇 손을 받으세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3DBBA7964C93BD74ED01B4AFAA3104DE"
msgid "I'VE CELEBRATED SO HARD THAT I'M NOW ACTUALLY 74% CYBORG."
msgstr "너무 열심히 축하했더니 지금은 74%가 사이보그예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::70FFFF8648D1601F9A44FC8C9B232E94"
msgid ""
"IF YOU ASK A COP WHAT HIS FAVORITE MOVIE IS, HE HAS TO ANSWER YOU. "
"@@OTHERWISE, IT'S ENTRAPMENT."
msgstr "경찰에게 최애 영화를 물으면 반드시 대답해야 합니다. @@아니면 함정 수사니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9E4D26E241E23F06565356B48BF1FBA2"
msgid "I SNORT GUNPOWDER ON THE WEEKENDS! JUST THOUGHT I'D LET YOU KNOW!"
msgstr "저는 주말마다 화약을 흡입해요! 그냥 알려 드렸어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD312B6D46E54DE87B526E880E3BE427"
msgid "DON'T DO ANYTHING I WOULDN'T!"
msgstr "제가 안 할 일은 하지 마세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A6EA54BF4836FBFC327724B36BF7FF42"
msgid "GREAT. GOOD."
msgstr "좋아요. 잘됐네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A07E3DDC47BA03161D8ABFB3A02DA14D"
msgid "TOP DRAWER."
msgstr "맨 위 서랍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::58B672054EE6B5034E5523A5FBFF8331"
msgid "LEAVE."
msgstr "나가."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E749D93147FDF3F2F3EEB78A80608B3D"
msgid "GET OUT. I NEED TO START A FIRE."
msgstr "꺼져. 불을 좀 피워야 해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::789434C44106349BF5C592B8654FB9F6"
msgid "IF THE BUILDINGS ON FIRE, WE'RE STILL OPEN."
msgstr "건물에 불이 나도 우리는 영업 중."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D3CFE7948A2632B70A7D7AB7343EF79"
msgid "!COME IN HERE AND BUY SOME SKY BOMBS!!!!"
msgstr "!들어와서 하늘 폭탄 좀 사 가!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::17A4CD534B7B9E8DFDFBE0A7E9C78B81"
msgid "CELEBRATIONS IS ALWAYS OPEN, EVEN IF WE'RE CURRENTLY BURNING DOWN!!!!"
msgstr "셀레브레이션스는 항상 영업 중이야, 지금 불타고 있어도!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::17BB3EA2498C0481BE830EBBB9CCB125"
msgid "!FIREWORKS OF QUESTIONABLE LEGALITY FOR SALE HERE!!!!"
msgstr "!법적으로 문제 될지도 모르는 폭죽 여기서 팔아!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::08E4641D4834E80E6D6B58AD46558A3D"
msgid "I AM NOT USED TO BEING GIVEN SOMETHING."
msgstr "뭔가를 받아본 적이 없어서 낯설어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BC69B6F444B15ABE5F7674B891F3D2B9"
msgid "I DO NOT KNOW HOW TO PROCESS THESE EMOTIONS I AM CURRENTLY FEELING."
msgstr "지금 느끼는 이 감정들을 어떻게 처리해야 할지 모르겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07FE00B3422E17E7D5A7C88C35F587E9"
msgid "THANK....... YOU????"
msgstr "고마....... 워????"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D8DE0ED040262D97EB0839A346A3C1B3"
msgid "#AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH"
msgstr "#아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아아"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C677D1F94350A73121E3A5892BF34BEB"
msgid "#AHHHH@AHHHHHH@AHHHHHH"
msgstr "#아아아아@아아아아아@아아아아아"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::26206044423693B469DCC289FEE26883"
msgid "MY FAVORITE CUSTOMER TO SELL SKY BOMBS TO! LET'S HAVE A CHAT!"
msgstr "하늘 폭탄을 팔 제일 좋아하는 손님이야! 이야기 좀 하자!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C6F1015404753809FED5F91DAED2B7C"
msgid "AH, A FELLOW FIREWORKS ENTHUSIAST. LET'S DO BUSINESS!"
msgstr "아, 폭죽을 사랑하는 동지구나. 거래해 보자!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AAADCB2146B51066F830738E3D7EF740"
msgid "GET IN HERE AND BUY SOME FREEDOM BOMBS."
msgstr "들어와서 자유 폭탄 좀 사 가."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::699CE03D457218BF03690DAA01F6EF8B"
msgid ""
"SOMETIMES, I FEEL LIKE YOU'RE THE ONLY PERSON HERE WHO APPRECIATES SKY "
"BOMBS."
msgstr "가끔은 여기서 하늘 폭탄을 알아주는 건 너뿐인 것 같아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0A07778D4F157A09DE1E1C86B3EACD69"
msgid "HELLO, MY FELLOW EXPLOSIONS CONNOISSEUR!"
msgstr "안녕, 폭발 애호가 동지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BFAAA40F48B21FB72540B5861691A10E"
msgid ""
"PLEASE, HURRY UP. IF I HAVE TO WAIT ANY LONGER, I WILL VIBRATE THROUGH THE "
"FLOOR."
msgstr "제발, 서둘러. 더 기다리면 바닥을 뚫고 떨어진다니까."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE40CD844C5FFDEE52F1499605DDE93B"
msgid "WAITING IS THE ONLY THING I CANNOT DEAL WITH."
msgstr "기다리는 것만은 정말 못 견디겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A705D55047E6276A08FB77B5E3D20A32"
msgid "I AM NOT USED TO STANDING STILL FOR THIS LONG."
msgstr "이렇게 오래 가만히 서 있어 본 적이 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::84077E5543EC3B0201EED58D8130D7F4"
msgid ""
"I'VE NEVER TAKEN THIS LONG TO MAKE A DECISION IN MY LIFE. WHAT IS WRONG WITH"
" YOU?"
msgstr "살면서 결정하는 데 이렇게 오래 걸린 적 없어. 너 대체 뭐가 문제야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B38471D43C2B42B767A97852905FAFC"
msgid "IS THIS A NEW FORM OF TORTURE? IT'S WORKING VERY WELL."
msgstr "이게 새로운 고문 방식인가? 아주 효과 좋은데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A731206F4ED0DBF1CD39329F932ABACD"
msgid "I THINK I AM DYING."
msgstr "나 죽는 것 같아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::217B2ED64530742228AE2C989EF2F190"
msgid "IS THIS WHAT IT FEELS LIKE TO BE OWNED."
msgstr "이게 소유된다는 기분인가."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A92802954579226FD34CFE87F56E0AFE"
msgid "UNSURE HOW TO DEAL WITH STANDING STILL IN ONE PLACE."
msgstr "한자리에 가만히 서 있는 걸 어떻게 해야 할지 모르겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8A397A6B43AE3FA5326675B6426CCA95"
msgid "!CAPITALISM AHOY!"
msgstr "!자본주의다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE9A221A429E78F89D6EC9BDDDCC2C04"
msgid "YES, GOOD."
msgstr "그래, 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6ADA8EAF4456721184CC6AA96A1AD49B"
msgid "CORRECT CHOICE!"
msgstr "정확한 선택!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EA41CE2B447FA6AB05047AA672B605DA"
msgid "OH BOY, OH BOY, OH BOY!"
msgstr "이런, 이런, 이런!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD4F715E4BB4A67358E16EAD411B4AFC"
msgid "!I LOVE SELLING EXPLOSIVES TO PEOPLE!"
msgstr "!사람들한테 폭발물 파는 거 너무 좋아!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B2AFDD841DAE21C963E24A6B6BE6D5A"
msgid "!THAT'S WHAT I LIKE TO SEE!!!"
msgstr "!이게 바로 내가 원하던 거야!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::535F05D348808AD7C93E07942ED7126C"
msgid "!NOW WE'RE TALKING!!!"
msgstr "!이제야 말이 통하는군!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::234474C543DD0FA6922B4B98A1C0177A"
msgid "!KEEP GOING! SURELY YOU NEED MORE BOMBS!!!"
msgstr "!계속해! 분명 폭탄이 더 필요할 거야!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0EC22F7041DD4B700273C5A981D28DA0"
msgid "!NEVER STOP BLOWING STUFF UP!!!"
msgstr "!절대 폭파를 멈추지 마!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B5B3F1D84E0D6013385F63AB308B5B33"
msgid "THE SKY WILL EXPLODE IN A BEAUTIFUL CACOPHONY OF GUNPOWDER!!!!"
msgstr "하늘은 화약의 아름다운 불협화음으로 터질 거야!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::733D826C4D3B4652E8E3F3B3042DD494"
msgid "!HERE WE GO!!!!"
msgstr "!간다!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::351658E6440A6DB726642F8B807B20F3"
msgid "!NICE, NICE, NICE, NICE, NICE!!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr "!좋아, 좋아, 좋아, 좋아, 좋아!!!!!!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E20D742C41C9C6E0A7ECE59732F6D0C5"
msgid "!THAT'S NOT NEARLY ENOUGH! KEEP GOING!!!!"
msgstr "!그건 턱없이 부족해! 계속해!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5889C9244433FA88E09860BCCAC27CFC"
msgid "!THIS ONE GETS IT!!!!"
msgstr "!이 녀석은 알아듣네!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8470E4D44BD9497868B4CDAFF7370DC3"
msgid ""
"I FEEL A REALLY DEEP CONNECTION WITH YOU RIGHT NOW!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr "지금 너와 정말 깊이 연결된 느낌이야!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::341C0FAC4A9BDAEDA68411A6A6580923"
msgid "I WILL NOT ASK WHY YOU NEED THIS MANY %item%!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr "왜 %item%을 이렇게 많이 필요로 하는지는 묻지 않을게!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B3044034AA1210BF43756BA6A98D5F4"
msgid ""
"!A LESSER MORTAL WOULD QUESTION WHY YOU NEED SO MUCH EXPLOSIVES, BUT I "
"WELCOME YOUR ENTHUSIASM!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr "!평범한 인간이라면 왜 폭약이 그렇게 많은지 의심하겠지만, 나는 네 열정이 반가워!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::82C6F0A14D3581C98DC8F1B01EEB9B49"
msgid "!I LOVE MY JOB!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr "!내 일이 정말 좋아!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A2609D8349A6FF48DCF5368D57030D74"
msgid "YOU COULD EXCAVATE A WELL WITH THAT MANY %item%!!!!!"
msgstr "그만큼의 %item%이면 우물을 파낼 수 있겠는데!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B0311870407BE3057BF244AA5B64B398"
msgid "DISAPPOINTING."
msgstr "실망이군."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::18FF48144CC42ACAF9187CBA4DBD14C0"
msgid "THAT IS TOO BAD."
msgstr "안타깝군."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE138470442975A870C3D498C6C54731"
msgid "BUMMER."
msgstr "아쉽네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A0ED4A034715CFC809A1BD953E5C249A"
msgid "FINE. I GUESS."
msgstr "좋아. 그럼 그렇지 뭐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1474F577406797247FB557AEF9B369E3"
msgid "IT PHYSICALLY HURTS ME TO REMOVE THIS FROM YOUR CHECKOUT LIST."
msgstr "이걸 네 결제 목록에서 빼려니 몸이 아파."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::312F5424425C5B0CD7659FB5D3E485E5"
msgid "HERE'S YOUR BOMBS."
msgstr "여기 폭탄이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A1A8FE91483E361EFFB110B6EC3762C1"
msgid "WOULD YOU LIKE THESE WRAPPED?"
msgstr "포장해 드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D53CF371483B1643F20190AAC6F92737"
msgid "GO AND INTIMIDATE THE SKY WITH THESE!"
msgstr "이걸로 하늘을 위협하러 가!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A4A791684D996E789B24DC98360EEF48"
msgid "TAKE YOUR FIREWORKS AND CHALLENGE GOD."
msgstr "폭죽을 들고 신께 도전해 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::809C53224CF18EC2CBD878BE3EDCBC8D"
msgid "BE SURE TO SET THESE OFF IN THE MOST DANGEROUS POSSIBLE ENVIRONMENT!"
msgstr "가능한 한 가장 위험한 환경에서 터뜨리도록 해!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D660C6884823D9665A84768B09795408"
msgid "DEFINITELY SET THESE OFF AT 2 AM."
msgstr "새벽 2시에 꼭 터뜨려."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1D40D8C94D6A683577B655AB4497F722"
msgid "IT'S TIME TO WAKE UP YOUR NEIGHBORS!!!!"
msgstr "이웃을 깨울 시간이야!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E49A72D74DE48C5DB67E7794EDF1BCF1"
msgid ""
"I GET TO SELL EVEN MORE FIREWORKS THAN USUAL AND AM DEEPLY PLEASED BY THIS."
msgstr "평소보다 더 많은 폭죽을 팔 수 있다니 정말 기쁘군."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ABED99BB4D54B62E33E2A9B62CF1B296"
msgid "THERE'S ALWAYS AN EVENT GOING ON WHEN YOU HAVE FIREWORKS!"
msgstr "폭죽이 있으면 언제나 행사가 열리는 법이지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::886299CB4E889C656E8BCA8DA1D41A48"
msgid "Darien"
msgstr "다리엔"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F4DE8FD043E1CC3F070645B9369F85B5"
msgid ""
"Oh... hey. What's up. Almost didn't notice you there. Don't usually pay "
"attention to the rookies."
msgstr "오... 안녕. 무슨 일이지. 거기 있는 줄 거의 몰랐어. 신입들은 보통 신경 안 쓰거든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C681E99B44858952FB0021B1834B8D95"
msgid ""
"Trying to up your game, huh? Won't help, but I'll still take your money."
msgstr "실력을 늘리려는 거야? 도움은 안 되겠지만 돈은 받지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD070AF94355C808A047ECADA7B74E70"
msgid "Tch. Welcome."
msgstr "쳇. 환영한다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::10C5D30E4D063F812F4254ADD22F4C59"
msgid "Hey there uh... you. "
msgstr "안녕, 어... 너. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DEE22167416A8AF0B699A0B0705870C2"
msgid "You interrupted my bowling strategizing. What do you want?"
msgstr "내 볼링 전략 짜는 걸 방해했군. 볼일이 뭐지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8B55D3004D5BE7EB3D34F7BEAFB6BDD3"
msgid ""
"Oh. Customer. Hurry up and get it over with. I could be bowling right now."
msgstr "아. 손님. 빨리 용건만 말하고 끝내자고. 지금쯤 볼링 치고 있어야 할 시간인데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47CB8A314C209EF7930670AA0E910144"
msgid "* sigh * What is it?"
msgstr "* 한숨 * 뭐야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::365F0F8A4BEF9DF7A36686B526C61FDA"
msgid ""
"Y'know, I used to be a pro. Got a perfect score on almost every tourney. "
"Now, I'm stuck here."
msgstr "있잖아, 나 한때 프로였어. 거의 모든 대회에서 퍼펙트를 기록했지. 그런데 지금은 여기 갇혀 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C61B9EA24250CA538E761E9858B1EC35"
msgid ""
"I deserve to be bowling with the best of them. Not... the rest of them."
msgstr "나는 최고의 선수들과 볼링을 쳐야 할 사람이야. 저런... 나머지들과 말고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED75F7FC46CF055AF4E40AA995944545"
msgid ""
"Ugh, I hate this alley. It's full of certain people who seem to think "
"they're any good."
msgstr "아, 이 볼링장 정말 싫어. 자기들이 좀 잘한다고 착각하는 녀석들로 가득해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2C5A39EB427B3F69E2FF738983E549C3"
msgid "Can't you go bother Kaylen? She's more... on your level."
msgstr "Kaylen한테나 가서 짜증이나 좀 부리지 그래? 걔가 더... 너 수준에 맞잖아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8FD46AAF4954871552E19183E63AFBB8"
msgid "Talk to me when you bowl 5 perfect games in a row."
msgstr "퍼펙트를 5연속으로 치고 나서 말을 걸어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6C233E4F4DE965380DDEB9995B0ECDF2"
msgid ""
"How cute that you think you can bowl. Go brag about your terrible score to "
"Kaylen."
msgstr "볼링 칠 수 있다고 착각하다니 귀엽네. 네 형편없는 점수는 Kaylen한테 자랑하고 다녀."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0A628C904DBF48AF4EA220A2CD8401A1"
msgid "Oh, sorry. Were you talking? @I don't speak casual."
msgstr "아, 미안. 뭐라고 했지? @나는 편한 말투는 못 써."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9123E7AD42A877233478E1B3A9713370"
msgid "Finally."
msgstr "드디어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D0D837D847BAA67152861A8C798E1F65"
msgid "Good, now don't come back."
msgstr "잘했어. 이제 다시는 오지 마."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E36244AA407ECD6EE5985987CF2C0805"
msgid "Great. Whatever."
msgstr "좋아. 됐고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A461D1E9426F13F5ACAC7B862C49BDEC"
msgid "Now leave me alone."
msgstr "이제 혼자 좀 내버려 둬."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::22E1413D4DE41E7E19B11F80E91072BF"
msgid "God, that took forever."
msgstr "세상에, 진짜 오래 걸렸네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::38C0B8534D2FAEF317784AA1D9C2658E"
msgid "Thanks for the gift, I guess."
msgstr "선물은 고맙다고 해두지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B6C403D47450F798CC37BA60527ECE3"
msgid "Oh. It's you. What do you want?"
msgstr "아. 너였네. 볼일이 뭐야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E9B5A9914DF3DDD30DB7D0ADC562E912"
msgid "You again, huh? I'm surprised you're still bowling with your scores."
msgstr "또 너야? 그 점수로 아직도 볼링을 친다니 놀랍다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3CAB88DD4CAA1BC3696F7DB8492E587F"
msgid "Hey there, small fry. Looking to waste your money again?"
msgstr "이봐, 꼬마 씨. 또 돈 낭비하러 온 거야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::42B4330D408324079D3A87B9730D6E66"
msgid "Ugh, you... Just hurry up and get it over with."
msgstr "아, 넌... 그냥 빨리 용건이나 말해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4ED3893E4E6ED4BB4B7E44B1F406DD04"
msgid "Oh, look! The small scorer! What is it now?"
msgstr "오, 봐라! 점수 낮은 녀석! 이번엔 무슨 일인데?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1F5E04574FDA202C2FAC9DA8D6E3192E"
msgid "Why are you wasting my time?"
msgstr "왜 내 시간을 낭비하는 거지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1360BEED48A3587E2F7B2B9B9BF46AD7"
msgid "Hurry up and choose; it won't help you anyways."
msgstr "빨리 골라; 어차피 너한테 도움은 안 되겠지만."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::85FB1464454DB530169CBE8619E0E5CC"
msgid "Come on! Get on with it!"
msgstr "이봐! 빨리 진행하라고!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6CB858E84A44D0D3EB1BD5AA546409C1"
msgid "...I wish I could throw you out of this alley."
msgstr "...널 이 볼링장에서 쫓아냈으면 좋겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B029EDBC478EE08DBFAE09BC53085053"
msgid "You're doing this on purpose; aren't you?"
msgstr "일부러 그러는 거지, 안 그래?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::719DB6A748E8781B0CD127B6F31178F6"
msgid "* Darien starts angrily polishing his bowling ball. *"
msgstr "* Darien이 화난 채로 볼링공을 닦기 시작한다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::44DA45534C38B68F07E79A986B35CCDA"
msgid "Sure. Whatever."
msgstr "그래. 됐고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B2F5FBB5489D26F33BD82AB3F355188D"
msgid "Uh huh."
msgstr "그래그래."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::05E0942F44E6079C834083A18D2462A0"
msgid "Clearly, you have no taste."
msgstr "확실히 안목이 없네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DBEF95A64FDD8C5D37AF1FAF357BA53E"
msgid "Aw, look at you, pretending you know what you're doing."
msgstr "어라, 뭐 잘난 줄 아는 꼴 좀 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0C8BC90E4CBE1CC2AF98F389888A6A37"
msgid "Mmhmm. "
msgstr "흠흠. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::64E5F6B340BED8B1370E1090925B6DA2"
msgid "Won't help you do any better."
msgstr "그래 봤자 실력은 안 늘 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EAA64F574EAF5211D72EEA8A5A9EA603"
msgid "Excellent way to waste money."
msgstr "돈 낭비하기 딱 좋은 방법이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C400DE5140137BC17AE0E4BCBBDA15DD"
msgid "Sorry but you can't buy talent."
msgstr "미안하지만 재능은 살 수 없다니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C72A8AF4217DAEB7E8490BAD7C1DF7D"
msgid "* Yawn. *"
msgstr "* 하아암. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0CE8B6E544DFD0E444FEB4BE0F121268"
msgid "Yeah, okay. Sure."
msgstr "그래, 그래요. 알겠어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::75A21D8245348B8939387599661080AC"
msgid "Alright. Whatever you say, kid."
msgstr "됐고. 좋을 대로 하세요, 꼬마야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2576132944B4D1898DAAB49DC3E73462"
msgid "Why do you need that many bowling balls?"
msgstr "볼링공이 왜 그렇게 많이 필요한 거예요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FB9D1E7840234FFAB04ADEAA8B1C0522"
msgid "Do you actually know the rules of bowling?"
msgstr "볼링 규칙은 제대로 아는 거 맞아요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1A1B45C740BB71AF870F03A7D6075B59"
msgid "C'mon, now. That's not gonna really help you do better."
msgstr "이봐요. 그걸로는 진짜 실력이 안 늘어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BA336CF3454409A55680BEA23F58B5B1"
msgid "Ah. I see sense has regained control."
msgstr "아. 드디어 이성이 돌아왔군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F7466C484140FED9374B3ABD86F50D85"
msgid "Good. You're coming to your senses."
msgstr "좋아요. 정신이 드는군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::68663F1849DC2520FEEC289E8B362FA0"
msgid "I'm glad you're following my advice and giving up!"
msgstr "제 충고대로 포기해 주시니 기쁘네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1D97DC18499FF15698A4EABB2A9EE2A1"
msgid "First good choice you've made in your life."
msgstr "평생 처음 해 본 좋은 선택이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::699673E44F53FE44CC959D9EF060898E"
msgid "No need to be ashamed; we can't all be as good as I am."
msgstr "부끄러워할 필요 없어요. 모두가 저만큼 잘할 순 없죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F1F66DA14FF828F57082DA8977797B32"
msgid ""
"It's hard to admit that you're mediocre at something. Not that I would ever "
"know that feeling."
msgstr "뭐 하나 못한다고 인정하기 어려운 법이죠. 저는 그런 기분을 모르지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::98EDCF36414869B178D5B1B5AB3120F5"
msgid "Here you go."
msgstr "여기 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C38BB99E411CB26CD9B389A3F84DED34"
msgid "Here's your stuff."
msgstr "물건 여기 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::40A08CCC42751ADAF0DC5D80D2F47995"
msgid "Great. Are we done here?"
msgstr "훌륭해요. 이제 끝난 거죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5B516E3A4081F216847CD8BF2BBF2DE9"
msgid "* sigh * Here you go."
msgstr "* 한숨 * 여기 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2CF4EAAB46A9E807B6D970A184959C72"
msgid "The manager wants me to inform you there's a sale or something."
msgstr "점장님이 세일 중이라고 알려 드래요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::00FF40BC40A8ABEC39B8FA8568B60AE7"
msgid ""
"I've always hated the events. There's just not enough bowling involved in "
"them."
msgstr "이런 이벤트는 항상 싫었어요. 볼링이 하나도 없잖아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B135B364E44A93258C0CB86977581C4"
msgid "Kaylen"
msgstr "케이린"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A3E267C847D651288230A5A494ACA40F"
msgid "Hello! Welcome to the bowling alley! First time here?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 볼링장에 오신 것을 환영합니다! 처음 오셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D4CA5E234B28F2D90871CF8C472B69D3"
msgid "Hi, hi! You've chosen the NICE bowling attendant."
msgstr "안녕하세요! 친절한 볼링장 직원을 고르셨네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::20224CA64789A322FA46F6BF09A82E9C"
msgid "Hey! What can I help you with?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4BB7835C4CF2255C5FDFC3996DC72F78"
msgid ""
"Don't mind the guy over there with a permanent frown; what can I do for you?"
msgstr "저기 늘 인상 쓰고 있는 사람은 신경 쓰지 마시고, 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::69CDB7B749453AE98C4DB2898D0149F6"
msgid ""
"Don't make eye contact with Darien; he's just looking for an excuse to brag "
"right now."
msgstr "다리엔과 눈은 마주치지 마세요. 지금 자랑할 핑계만 찾고 있거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D8DC07C64C2CAA8028D489AF2430457E"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF70C8194EC988772026BDBDACC02CC7"
msgid ""
"Wanna see my Darien impression? \"Hello, you are bad at bowling, and I am "
"not.\""
msgstr "제 다리엔 흉내 볼래요? \"안녕, 넌 볼링을 못하지, 난 잘하고.\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9074D5E243C8511D185354821689646A"
msgid "You're getting better at bowling! Keep at it, okay?"
msgstr "볼링 실력이 늘고 있네요! 계속 힘내세요, 알겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B1DC539B45B77E78872BBF9F55B854E5"
msgid "Just stopping by for a chat?"
msgstr "잠깐 얘기하러 오셨어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ACDE751C46FA9D683766F1B1B694FEDB"
msgid ""
"Bowling is a great excuse to hang out with your friends; isn't it? Not that "
"Darien would know."
msgstr "볼링은 친구들과 어울릴 좋은 핑계죠? 다린은 그런 걸 모르겠지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F18634C846266F1C7968AEB67C8CC0FE"
msgid "Good work out there! But take some breaks now and then, okay?"
msgstr "잘 하고 있어요! 그래도 가끔은 쉬어주세요, 알겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D93B02948C482510612F3BBB4C6288A"
msgid ""
"Try not to obsess over how well you do, and just have fun with it! "
"Otherwise, you'll turn into sourpuss over there."
msgstr "성적에 집착하지 말고 그냥 즐기세요! 그러지 않으면 거기 있는 저 사람처럼 되니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::13DFCDDB4DF33F69ACEF85AAF80420B2"
msgid ""
"The score isn't everything. As long as you have a good time, that's all that"
" matters!"
msgstr "점수가 전부는 아니에요. 즐거웠다면 그걸로 충분하답니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::76893E6548DED8EE2F1D3B8B94C846E8"
msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr "행운을 빌어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AE8113604978C3F30CC56C95AF4E8BBA"
msgid "Bye now!"
msgstr "이제 안녕!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F02FE571410A45C54869C1B1712088FD"
msgid "Have a good time, okay?"
msgstr "즐겁게 보내세요, 알겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DCF42A034A88A00E3BF38789B0ADF096"
msgid "Do your best!"
msgstr "최선을 다하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::290910434B603F3AF61845884916574D"
msgid "Aw thanks! That's really nice of you."
msgstr "아 고마워요! 정말 친절하시네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::052A7B2A4031DF9036E1B4BED40E4CFF"
msgid "Aw, thanks! That's really nice of you."
msgstr "아, 고마워요! 정말 친절하시네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFE4C2BB4886FDFA027D64B98D8BFB8B"
msgid "No problem! Take your time."
msgstr "별말씀을요! 천천히 하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::24D76BA842ADA13EFD65CE8418CDF27F"
msgid ""
"Luckily, I have a basic amount of patience. Unlike some bowling attendants."
msgstr "다행히 저는 기본적인 인내심은 있답니다. 어떤 볼링장 직원과는 달리요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::925EC33645B8DF51BEC619B62198577B"
msgid "You still there?"
msgstr "아직 거기 있어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F19EADF940A7DC878A6C1F80E0CEB2E6"
msgid "Hey, you okay? You look like you're spacing out."
msgstr "저기, 괜찮아요? 멍때리는 것 같아 보여요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D70944EE46767895877E97B4B53731CC"
msgid "Aw, did Darien say some mean stuff? Don't let it get to you, okay?"
msgstr "아, 다린이 못된 말이라도 했나요? 신경 쓰지 마세요, 알겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::30B4B13D44274F2215D3048ECDB76B37"
msgid ""
"Is there an event going on? It's so dark in here; it's easy to lose track of"
" time."
msgstr "이벤트 중인가요? 여기가 워낙 어두워서 시간 가는 줄 쉽게 잊게 되네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E94103F04BCB5B59AD2B17B1E99314D8"
msgid "Vendy"
msgstr "벤디"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::867DE78541CF6A510D37E2B5B9412D90"
msgid "*The vending machine begins to emit a whirling noise.*"
msgstr "*자판기에서 웅웅거리는 소리가 나기 시작한다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57ABB7E143B78A72745ABFABD5740F5F"
msgid ""
"*The vending machine's whirling starts in a different pitch, almost as if it"
" recognizes you.*"
msgstr "*자판기의 웅웅거림이 다른 음높이로 바뀐다. 마치 당신을 알아보는 것 같다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CAC3F8B3464BC7FF97B64684BD5F63FC"
msgid "\"Oh! Hi! No one really talks to me here; this is a surprise.\""
msgstr "\"아! 안녕하세요! 여기서 저한테 말 거는 사람이 없어서 깜짝 놀랐어요.\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A09D2BD0441EF50E1212E483AF60C69A"
msgid "\"I hope I can interest you in my delectable delights.\""
msgstr "\"제 맛있는 간식에 관심 가져주시면 좋겠어요.\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD80FA6E4AF7BCF1392EE7BCA430DEA6"
msgid ""
"\"You've got a soul right? How'd you get it? What's it like? Was it "
"expensive?\""
msgstr "\"당신은 영혼이 있죠? 어떻게 얻으셨어요? 어떤 기분이에요? 비싸요?\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::15DE4B94420543B55067CF94BD918ED4"
msgid "\"I've always wanted a soul. I think that would be pretty dang neat.\""
msgstr "\"저도 늘 영혼을 갖고 싶었어요. 정말 멋질 것 같아요.\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EE8026F84D2C98413501BBBF407D5D20"
msgid "\"Are we...friends? If not, I get it, but I hope we can be!\""
msgstr "\"우리...친구인가요? 아니어도 괜찮아요, 그래도 친구가 되고 싶어요!\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5A6FC3FF44459FDC5578CEA495ABA657"
msgid ""
"\"So...do you go out often? Haha ...I don't know how to make small talk, "
"sorry.\""
msgstr "\"그래서...밖에 자주 나가세요? 하하...저는 어떻게 말을 꺼내야 할지 모르겠네요, 죄송해요.\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09D11DB14EBA75C64F3AD49F66C4F1B0"
msgid ""
"\"Be careful, friend. @Can I call you friend? The delivery worker shook a "
"couple of these before putting them in here.\""
msgstr "\"조심하세요, 친구. @제 친구라고 불러도 될까요? 배달원이 여기 넣기 전에 이 중 몇 개를 흔들었거든요.\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0F4A7800490B6DC8C15E0A9DB4060317"
msgid ""
"*The whirling noise coming from the vending machine starts to ramp down, as "
"if it's saying good bye.*"
msgstr "*자판기에서 나던 웅웅거리는 소리가 점점 잦아든다. 마치 작별 인사를 하는 것 같다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28A3F0A547F53FEBEF08D9A903747F56"
msgid "*The machine glows brighter, as it becomes more whole.*"
msgstr "*기계가 더 온전해지면서 더 밝게 빛난다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::815C3B9D44C53747462342924914BDBE"
msgid "*The machine glows brighter as it becomes more whole.*"
msgstr "*기계가 더 온전해질수록 더 밝게 빛납니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::68CFE84E4B1A60A4BED1DE8EE4BB73CE"
msgid ""
"*The vending machine's whirling starts in a different pitch. You know it "
"recognizes you.*"
msgstr "*자판기의 웅웅거리는 소리가 다른 음높이로 시작됩니다. 당신을 알아본 게 분명합니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::918E3BB1411124700506C292BEBAFBE9"
msgid ""
"*The whirling sound coming from the vending machine seems to rise and fall "
"in pitch, almost as if it's annoyed at you.*"
msgstr "*자판기에서 나는 웅웅거리는 소리가 오르내립니다. 마치 당신에게 짜증난 것처럼요.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D5CDD9414929D978FC7F1888892DB460"
msgid ""
"*The whirling sound coming from the vending machine gives you the impression"
" that it's curious about what you are doing.*"
msgstr "*자판기에서 나는 웅웅거리는 소리는 당신이 뭘 하는지 궁금해하는 듯합니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::051A85D84DB223565C47F8B2A1D27D07"
msgid "*The vending machine makes a whirling noise.*"
msgstr "*자판기가 웅웅거리는 소리를 냅니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D1564E614F69A6A95A13048A6FEBEB79"
msgid "*The vending machine makes a slightly louder whirling noise.*"
msgstr "*자판기가 조금 더 크게 웅웅거립니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E5A106E145FDD28B7DF9309201BBFF2A"
msgid ""
"*You hear a soft spoken voice coming from the vending machine.* \"Wow, you "
"really like %item%.\""
msgstr "*자판기에서 나직한 목소리가 들립니다.* \"와, 정말 %item%을 좋아하시네요.\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B186A8A3425DB0232FCBB59805A90044"
msgid "*The vending machine makes a whirling noise.*"
msgstr "*자판기가 웅웅거리는 소리를 냅니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9B7D9F5E424258F82BC8DF839BF4BA63"
msgid ""
"*The vending machine beeps. You figure this is the soda machine's way of "
"showing gratitude.*"
msgstr "*자판기가 삐 소리를 냅니다. 탄산음료 자판기가 고마움을 표시하는 방식인가 봅니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4373E8E14F0E7BA46B14CE81D8FEEC86"
msgid ""
"*The machine emits the sound of a confetti gun, expressing its excitement "
"for the sale.*"
msgstr "*기계가 색종이 대포 소리를 내며 판매에 대한 기쁨을 표현합니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::52B935FE46F6D47CA582F08617712FD3"
msgid ""
"*The machine emits a noise of a trumpet, informing you to participate in the"
" event.*"
msgstr "*기계가 나팔 소리를 내며 이벤트에 참여하라고 알립니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DC28500D4E366AAB1AD0B997BC1E508E"
msgid "Sarah"
msgstr "사라"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B49341546E4A70120587AB4F2A8199E"
msgid "Hey, hello! Are you ready to enter your Condo?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 콘도에 들어갈 준비 되셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::057374CA4898B8428CB0D69D7C9F2812"
msgid "I've been keeping my eye on your Condo door; it's all safe to go in!"
msgstr "콘도 문을 계속 지켜보고 있었어요. 들어가셔도 안전해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5CC2C38549ECEC32E2C5BFB7B3604746"
msgid ""
"I'll admit it; I've never seen a Condo before, but I know I'll enter one "
"some day!"
msgstr "솔직히 말하면 콘도는 본 적이 없어요. 그래도 언젠가는 들어가 볼 거예요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::10C72F844D5044FE90A4EFA52149650A"
msgid "One day, I'll see a Condo and feel like I've found home."
msgstr "언젠가는 콘도를 보고 집을 찾은 기분이 들겠죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A31AB7D54B627A614AA41B9AB6D62F16"
msgid "I can't imagine what Condo you've created."
msgstr "어떤 콘도를 만드셨는지 상상도 안 돼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8A4ED7B64C70B6478C4199A389227853"
msgid ""
"I'm actually really interested in your Condo! But I can't leave until they "
"program me to."
msgstr "사실 당신의 콘도가 정말 궁금해요! 하지만 누군가 저를 프로그래밍하기 전엔 떠날 수 없어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0624F53846AFA20466B3299EBCB43F77"
msgid "Maybe, one day, you could take me with you to see your Condo!"
msgstr "혹시 언젠가 당신의 콘도를 보러 저를 데려가 주실 수 있나요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EB17CDC7475DF796C8982196BC2AE8C6"
msgid "Thanks for chatting! I wish I could own my own Condo someday."
msgstr "이야기해 주셔서 고마워요! 언젠가 저도 제 콘도를 가질 수 있으면 좋겠네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2597D9844D8521ED1BAEBE81B7818928"
msgid "It was nice talking; come back soon!"
msgstr "즐거웠어요. 곧 다시 오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::15F06A0648DCF55E1AC977B9CACA4513"
msgid "Talk to me if you want to check into your Condo!"
msgstr "콘도에 체크인하려면 저에게 말을 걸어 주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2489899B44B0BFC21131BBA8D21C0254"
msgid "Oh my! For me? You shouldn't have."
msgstr "어머! 저 주시는 건가요? 그러지 않으셔도 되는데요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::30CC77D3494EE6582B9004AED593B4AD"
msgid ""
"Can you take me to your Condo this time? @No? That's okay... I'll just wait "
"here!"
msgstr "이번에는 저를 당신의 콘도에 데려가 주실 수 있나요? @아니요? 괜찮아요... 그냥 여기서 기다릴게요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D4C4199E4D88CF60EDE3C1883D2F689E"
msgid "I don't mind waiting, but are you going to enter your Condo?"
msgstr "기다리는 건 괜찮아요, 그런데 콘도에 들어가실 건가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A8E75AFA4B0B5A4797A1768774283AF1"
msgid "So, uh, are you going into your Condo or not?"
msgstr "그럼, 콘도에 들어가실 건가요, 아닌가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A004D4504EF205542E04CEBE681139F0"
msgid "Upgrade Assistant"
msgstr "업그레이드 도우미"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFBBC38B438683F72FB5288E49A96031"
msgid "[Begin transaction!]"
msgstr "[거래를 시작합니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AB77D7BE4C60B63BBF6193A05F97CDDF"
msgid "[Welcome to Upgrades!]"
msgstr "[업그레이드에 오신 것을 환영합니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A2503E014B8BB59F0B02C08667035AD1"
msgid "[Welcome!]"
msgstr "[환영합니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::41308E4543349DB724FD4DA3B7832505"
msgid "[Begin transaction!]"
msgstr "[거래를 시작합니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C1FFC26740AE06B6C4B4CBAF9122594E"
msgid "[Make a selection, please!]"
msgstr "[항목을 선택해 주세요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D4D3CCA4F021465F20822912A70186F"
msgid "[I have not received a upgrade for casual conversation!]"
msgstr "[일상 대화용 업그레이드는 아직 받지 못했습니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::43C9309943628D53F813319CA5F1392A"
msgid "[This concludes your transaction!]"
msgstr "[이상으로 거래를 마칩니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C8BC16154FC8276F55A256BA2063C6C3"
msgid "[Goodbye, customer!]"
msgstr "[안녕히 가세요, 고객님!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1230843A4B5022E3DFA86EADEFBE4F0E"
msgid "[Can I interest you in an upgrade?]"
msgstr "[업그레이드에 관심 있으신가요?]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F8A276D54B67DF6971E82481FCC9CA22"
msgid "[Ready for an advanced experience?]"
msgstr "[한 단계 높은 경험을 원하시나요?]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::49C7EFA0467B2E6B8C10FDA1E37C97B5"
msgid "[Upgrades!]"
msgstr "[업그레이드!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1F27EBD74782D6AB31D7EAAF3A1419E2"
msgid "Unable to express gratitude."
msgstr "감사를 표현할 수 없습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::34E7B09643E269672A952484B9DBE1B5"
msgid ""
"[Hello! @This dialogue has been updated to reflect your frequent visits!]"
msgstr "[안녕하세요! @자주 방문해 주셔서 이 대사가 업데이트되었습니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A620B7DB47B1D910E5BF51ADD9B50420"
msgid "[You visit frequently, %name%!]"
msgstr "[자주 오시네요, %name%님!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3FAD14E441A9B4156ABB1692D535005B"
msgid "[I'm waiting!]"
msgstr "[기다리고 있어요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::76ABF49146BBB514AD558787D2EA6B24"
msgid "[I'm waiting! Still.]"
msgstr "[아직도 기다리고 있어요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D8E35BDD46BFDBA9C6A85FB318566D7E"
msgid "[That is the best type of upgrade!]"
msgstr "[그게 최고의 업그레이드죠!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::469AAB3541FC76D673491A9FA73B7C19"
msgid "[Up-great choice!]"
msgstr "[업-그레이트한 선택이에요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BCB6D1B482D6A512FBE8E96AFC247AE"
msgid "[That will definitely be an upgrade!]"
msgstr "[그건 분명 업그레이드가 될 거예요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2E5376A14C1EE625BF385994D85D0F2A"
msgid "[You'll be unstoppable with all of these upgrades! Possibly.]"
msgstr "[이 모든 업그레이드를 갖추면 막을 수 없게 될 거예요! 아마도요.]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::06A0961F4076A15BEC3AAAB4409860ED"
msgid "[Way to enhance your experience!]"
msgstr "[경험을 한층 높이셨네요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D2730D1F40CBF07FACA566BCA8334A2B"
msgid "[%item% has been successfully removed from your cart!]"
msgstr "[%item%이(가) 장바구니에서 제거되었습니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A0E6E9964D76E8A281EF4F800C5C5432"
msgid "[Have fun out there!]"
msgstr "[즐겁게 다녀오세요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3B336E7E4205A5F5B6C4F98B261CBD72"
msgid "[You are very close!]"
msgstr "[아주 가까워요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5854F7EF4F87E9E36DA4C386C95A4235"
msgid "[Large potion detected! Now that's an upgrade!]"
msgstr "[대형 물약 감지! 정말 업그레이드네요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::100C883444A560FC3F05C38F9C3A8F30"
msgid "[Small potion detected! Now that's an upgrade!]"
msgstr "[소형 물약 감지! 정말 업그레이드네요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2C5D2BCB46D42C3A27F9BD992192496A"
msgid "[Welcome! It's time for a sale!]"
msgstr "[어서 오세요! 할인 시간입니다!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9CF0FABA49BC948F7944C4BDCF17C3E6"
msgid ""
"[You can join the event, if you want! Upgrades will be here when you get "
"back!]"
msgstr "[원하시면 이벤트에 참여하실 수 있어요! 돌아오시면 업그레이드가 기다리고 있을게요!]"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2425690A40CEBCFEF6CCFDA9CA1BB175"
msgid "Daisy"
msgstr "데이지"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0294FD0F4E19DC8F504048BF3DE3E804"
msgid ""
"*A bird sits on the counter. She cocks her head at you and chirps a bit. "
"Apparently she works here.*"
msgstr "*새 한 마리가 카운터에 앉아 있다. 고개를 갸우뚱하며 당신을 보더니 짹짹 울어 댄다. 아무래도 여기서 일하는 모양이다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::25A044B040DDBCBC3FFB18A322A77768"
msgid "Chirp."
msgstr "짹."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DEFD4BB54411919CDAFB4CA208D2CBAA"
msgid "Tweet."
msgstr "트윗."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C782F07E499C84362093CE87ED4B97F6"
msgid "Chirp chirp."
msgstr "짹짹."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0773B0424E6A05D76EB18EA9FB5DC589"
msgid "* The bird hops up and down on the counter. *"
msgstr "* 새가 카운터 위에서 깡충깡충 뛰어오른다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F6A5BC6C40DECCC60A9092A251E8E93E"
msgid ""
"* The bird hops and down and pushes some bird seed towards you. Perhaps "
"she's trying to be friendly? *"
msgstr "* 새가 깡충깡충 뛰며 새 모이를 몇 개 당신 쪽으로 밀어낸다. 친해지려는 걸까? *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1F2EB62E4B6D6D5620A853A738945C0C"
msgid ""
"* The bird sits down and cranes her neck. This seems like normal bird "
"behaviour. *"
msgstr "* 새가 앉아서 목을 길게 뺀다. 평범한 새의 행동인 것 같다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF0B59B14106AFCBFB60C7BB11C823D8"
msgid "* You attempt idle conversation with the bird. It does not work. *"
msgstr "* 새에게 시시한 이야기를 걸어 본다. 통하지 않는다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F31ED82B441CB8A27C25C8AE9B8A5180"
msgid ""
"* You ask the bird about the weather. She rolls around on the ground in "
"response. *"
msgstr "* 새에게 날씨 이야기를 묻는다. 새는 이에 대한 답으로 바닥을 뒹군다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9D6E2C4E4951ABEF1B6839BBB0F4271F"
msgid ""
"* You steal a glance at the bird's plumage. She puffs up its chest in pride."
" *"
msgstr "* 새의 깃털을 슬쩍 바라봅니다. 새가 자랑스럽게 가슴을 부풀립니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2E4A43BE4F3C81D8436C8EAAF51FA187"
msgid ""
"* You hold out your index finger to the bird. She gently pecks at it. How "
"cute. *"
msgstr "* 새에게 검지를 내밉니다. 새가 살며시 쪼아댑니다. 귀엽네요. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0F52AEDE474715C3DC69FE9D4BA990F5"
msgid "* You stare intently at the bird. It hides its head in its feathers. *"
msgstr "* 새를 빤히 쳐다봅니다. 새가 머리를 깃털 속에 숨깁니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4349E1FA4C59939D4F57AD95FD0F4CF4"
msgid "Chirp."
msgstr "짹."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::531F4C8445F7E41397635AA23A2EC2C5"
msgid "Chirp!"
msgstr "짹!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0AEDF3224B39B58252A4F6BE108EB316"
msgid ""
"* The bird flaps a bit and then settles down. You assume that's its best "
"attempt at a wave! *"
msgstr "* 새가 살짝 날갯짓하다가 가라앉습니다. 아마 나름대로 손을 흔든 모양입니다! *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC132B7B4AED55AF01AAEC83D5CABE48"
msgid "Coooo..."
msgstr "구우우..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B40610BA436CE1D52CD3118502600A21"
msgid "* There appears to be a strange bird nearby. *"
msgstr "* 근처에 이상한 새가 있는 것 같습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C4A81BA442A58CDC2A50AC9E87E3208B"
msgid "Chirp! * The bird flaps its wings happily. *"
msgstr "짹! * 새가 기쁘게 날갯짓합니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A4E6B554458CDBA7ACD7D8A986AE07A5"
msgid "* The bird is angry with you. *"
msgstr "* 새가 당신에게 화가 났습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A3B34F304423066C34C98498C00E917D"
msgid "* The bird stares down into your soul. *"
msgstr "* 새가 당신의 영혼을 꿰뚫어 봅니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8E8762CA4CAAD36EA5C8B8954831E8D0"
msgid "* The bird leers at you. *"
msgstr "* 새가 당신을 흘깃거립니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3BD559484E2CAE6E2C90F4B49E2556C5"
msgid "* The bird plans your demise. *"
msgstr "* 새가 당신의 최후를 계획하고 있습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C715C6C54F3188C63718A6B389D9EB50"
msgid "* The bird ups the prices by 2000% *"
msgstr "* 새가 가격을 2000% 올렸습니다 *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6FB8554E4E0D0485AE2C009C78C3BA00"
msgid ""
"* The bird pecks at some seed on the counter. You assume it's still free to "
"sell you some stuff. *"
msgstr "* 새가 카운터 위의 씨앗을 쪼아댑니다. 아직 물건을 팔 생각인 모양입니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B1C167714374C82F0502BF8BA377DA00"
msgid ""
"* The bird is holding a live worm in its beak when you walk in. That's "
"probably normal. *"
msgstr "* 들어가 보니 새가 부리에 살아있는 지렁이를 물고 있습니다. 아마 정상일 겁니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C38041C4C1934D254D385AC350EDF68"
msgid "* The bird smells like gunpowder, and that's kind of weird. *"
msgstr "* 새에게서 화약 냄새가 납니다. 좀 이상하네요. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::134C6893429BF4FD66416D8BFF43EB92"
msgid ""
"Chirp. * The bird flaps a bit and lands on the register. Apparently, it's "
"ready for capitalism. *"
msgstr "짹. * 새가 살짝 날갯짓하다 계산대에 내려앉습니다. 자본주의 준비가 된 모양입니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE83F7FD4BC70E571E92AB96CD434718"
msgid "Chirp chirp * You have a vague feeling that she's greeting you. *"
msgstr "짹짹 * 새가 당신에게 인사하는 것 같은 기분이 듭니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B939CB3B4A276BFFF6B119838156F57B"
msgid "* The bird remains still. This probably isn't its first rodeo. *"
msgstr "* 새가 가만히 있습니다. 이게 처음이 아닌 모양입니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CFDF8C5849667AFBFEC3E188E3C5EBC3"
msgid ""
"* The bird spots a worm nearby but manages to refrain from chasing it. What "
"a good cashier! * "
msgstr "* 새가 근처의 지렁이를 발견했지만 참아냅니다. 훌륭한 계산원이네요! *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CF02155342884A069553109CA1F205B3"
msgid ""
"* The bird does not seem to have a concept of time, so it doesn't mind "
"waiting. *"
msgstr "* 새는 시간 개념이 없는 듯해 기다리는 걸 개의치 않습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::627228044FC13405D05C018750C3EB71"
msgid "* The bird idly chirps as it waits. *"
msgstr "* 새가 기다리며 심심한 듯 짹짹거립니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2BE90C8546CDB4E03ABF49846B024C5D"
msgid "Chirp."
msgstr "짹."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D5BF5A774563767CCEBF38A4EF40AC58"
msgid "Chirp! Chirp."
msgstr "짹! 짹."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A9E51E174A6DDB542C88499B8829BBCC"
msgid "Cooo."
msgstr "구우."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7DD074154E0B683F89C99B935151B7EC"
msgid ""
"* The bird seems mildly impressed by the fat stacks you are about to spend. "
"*"
msgstr "* 새는 당신이 곧 쓸 두둑한 뭉치에 다소 감탄한 듯합니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D1235504D5D26CF4D1EDD87021E1C05"
msgid "* The bird rotates in place a bit. Curious. *"
msgstr "* 새가 제자리에서 살짝 돌아봅니다. 신기하네요. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B3047FB487B81468F10CB964AB5D483"
msgid ""
"* The bird starts pecking at its feathers. Probably some sort of grooming "
"ritual. *"
msgstr "* 새가 깃털을 쪼기 시작합니다. 아마 일종의 몸단장 의식일 겁니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::77A94DEE4FFC5D779CC2BC8ECB85FDD2"
msgid ""
"* The bird somehow manages to carry all your %item% to the counter. "
"Impressive! *"
msgstr "* 새가 어떻게든 당신의 %item%을(를) 모두 카운터로 옮깁니다. 대단하네요! *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8646FE0D4F50D2A068AEFD9956307659"
msgid ""
"* You have no idea how the bird manages to get these from the store room. *"
msgstr "* 새가 어떻게 창고에서 이것들을 가져오는지 전혀 모르겠습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B8CFABDD442242EF32A762933552A345"
msgid ""
"* This bird apparently did not skip leg day as it manages to bring you all "
"your goods. *"
msgstr "* 이 새는 하체 운동을 거르지 않은 듯 당신의 물건을 모두 가져다줍니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::958BD0954CCE0CFF26F7BEB09C5FCCB8"
msgid "Chirp!"
msgstr "짹!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0C3DD28F474D448B9E9192B3D006F8B6"
msgid "Caw-"
msgstr "까악-"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A7BB956B4BB073665129698CF7EA6B1F"
msgid "Tweet!"
msgstr "짹!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::00F774E54131BF5981624C8515B0A422"
msgid "Fweeeee-!"
msgstr "삐이이-!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2FF0CFAC49D4ECC5F7461E8A57439BA8"
msgid "* The bird flaps her wings happily. *"
msgstr "* 새가 행복하게 날개를 퍼덕입니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B82CEE4B40A4BA777941E3B7696CAD62"
msgid "Chirp, chirp!"
msgstr "짹짹!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C8272C454568557567F2EC8405054BE8"
msgid "* You've never seen a bird look happy, but this one somehow does. *"
msgstr "* 행복해 보이는 새는 처음 보는데, 이 녀석은 이상하게 행복해 보입니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::605F6587406061249F7B07822BA6B749"
msgid "Chirp!"
msgstr "짹!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F636CE04180E31A5EC03EBEECFB9C60"
msgid ""
"Chirp! Chirp! * Some birdseed on its fountain is arranged to say, \"SALE.\" "
"*"
msgstr "짹! 짹! * 분수대 위의 새 모이로 \"SALE\" 글자가 만들어져 있습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::73E4D3BC4872A55D049B67BB342F076F"
msgid ""
"Chirp! * You swear the bird just chirped that there's an event going on! *"
msgstr "짹! * 방금 새가 이벤트가 있다고 짹짹거린 게 틀림없습니다! *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F04EED454A6B9EDC795F9187DFC1EA47"
msgid "Sharon"
msgstr "샤론"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E215A7B4E741585F0894EB4949DE41B"
msgid "G'day! Welcome to Oasis. I'm your beachmate, Sharon."
msgstr "안녕하세요! 오아시스에 오신 걸 환영합니다. 저는 해변 친구 샤론이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CECD890242353C5CADA4729BC6842013"
msgid "G'day. My name's Sharon, but friends call me Shazza."
msgstr "안녕하세요. 제 이름은 샤론인데, 친구들은 샤자라고 불러요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7EF1A07D49CA668BBA0555A20572E189"
msgid "How's it goin'?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D1E0951740D95A31B065A687E54EC088"
msgid "G'day! What are yous doin' this arvo?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 오늘 오후에 뭐 하세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2FD1766D47BDD3F79E0201A642A51CB4"
msgid "Check out those blokes! Budgy smugglers."
msgstr "저 사람들 좀 보세요! 타이트한 수영복이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::39775A76497F8D918E0EAC99EFF6CEE2"
msgid "I find it funny there's no dunnies 'round here."
msgstr "여기엔 화장실이 하나도 없다는 게 웃기네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CC3C43FF4271CA3427DD3CA411B784A5"
msgid "There's a few drongos 'round here, deadset."
msgstr "여기 바보 같은 녀석들이 좀 있죠, 정말."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B01D9CCD4BE9239B20AC6ABEF93A095D"
msgid "I heard that seagulls only fly to the ocean to cark-it."
msgstr "갈매기는 죽으러 바다로만 간다던데요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0A6A42934565256BCCA64782CF0926E8"
msgid "They sell some good tucker at Fresh."
msgstr "Fresh 에서 맛있는 음식을 팔아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FAB476A7497E0BDC44F5F3AD6E81C74B"
msgid ""
"I love to cook! Have you checked out the barbies they sell at Sweet Suites?"
msgstr "저는 요리하는 걸 좋아해요! Sweet Suites 에서 파는 바비큐 봤어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::306887BE4F447B791B1B26922BE6C5F4"
msgid "Can't wait to host a bangin' party one day. Yous in?"
msgstr "언젠가 신나는 파티를 열고 싶어요. 오실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47F728214382B0F3BD328FB53091DD41"
msgid "Catch ya."
msgstr "또 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::66C4C4B041C394E9D4483AAB26EBCE32"
msgid "Hooroo."
msgstr "잘 가요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B9757D5F4D32041CE8F73BBED2BBB537"
msgid "Oi, mate! Come take a squizz."
msgstr "이봐, 친구! 한번 구경해 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9E9A7BC4A3A03E9BD54DD8445B46DF9"
msgid "Ta, mate."
msgstr "고마워요, 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4555E24E4F36AF4DF5A8E496088B9CAA"
msgid "You beaut."
msgstr "최고네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5DB851C8435EB7492B35DC990C3FA761"
msgid "Where the bloody hell have you been?"
msgstr "도대체 어디 갔던 거예요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DAE6AFD84BDA8902786BEA97D024EC82"
msgid ""
"Mate, if you don't hurry up, you'll have Buckley's chance to catch the "
"waves."
msgstr "친구, 서두르지 않으면 파도는 구경도 못 해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::65B1B1944AFD5426D853F5A8BB4BCA57"
msgid "'scuse us while we go grab a snag from the barbie."
msgstr "저기서 바비큐 소시지 좀 사 올게요, 잠시만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::233FD1DA4AF541AF217C57845D8704C0"
msgid "* Yawn. * I'm stuffed."
msgstr "* 하암. * 배불러요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C34A58B44E55E9F9CC4618FDF518A2C"
msgid "Check out those beauts."
msgstr "저 예쁜 것들 좀 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4ACE420C451E59D9CA581ABD1776543B"
msgid "Mate, this cart's a bit chockers."
msgstr "이봐, 이 카트 좀 꽉 찼네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7BE52BDF4DBDE623D655D19A30E991EC"
msgid "Yeah, I'd chuck that too."
msgstr "그래, 나도 그건 버릴래."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C892B412463123FDE7979DB3EB23897E"
msgid "Didn't fancy that one, either."
msgstr "그것도 별로였지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A47ADD884D31DD551E4149B2B32CC681"
msgid "Ain't she a beaut?"
msgstr "이거 예쁘지 않아?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A7B9A89E45601FB5EC8FFC98B73D33A3"
msgid "Oi, mate, check out the sale!"
msgstr "이봐, 할인 좀 봐!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7176EA7E43A1316E9FF5BDA59ED541EB"
msgid "Did ya get a squizz at the Plaza event?"
msgstr "플라자 이벤트 봤어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::80DA4FB34156B6DDC1F065AFD280F4D4"
msgid "Maria - The Event Wizard"
msgstr "마리아 - 이벤트 마법사"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C9A928A449CA8B96D0DA01906F9F70A8"
msgid "Hmm, I'm bored. How about I start something new..."
msgstr "흠, 심심한데. 뭐 새로운 걸 시작해 볼까..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FCDC7CD44720B595699ACDA524871EE4"
msgid "I've decided! Something mysterious will begin soon!"
msgstr "정했어! 곧 뭔가 신비로운 일이 시작될 거야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5366162F4197B866F1863BBE44EFC7D1"
msgid "That's it, get off the machines! I'm making something happen soon! "
msgstr "됐다, 기계에서 내려! 곧 뭔가 일어나게 할 거야! "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9EE88A9B4289D7648B4EB89D651C114D"
msgid "Let's mix things up a bit!"
msgstr "분위기를 좀 바꿔 보자!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF210B234CC7B5E1B8AD6894953547CE"
msgid "And that's it! The event is over! I'll be back soon!"
msgstr "끝! 이벤트는 끝났어! 곧 돌아올게!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6701FD944373DCAC9CCEED8114636D1B"
msgid "Wow, that was interesting! Now to find something else to do..."
msgstr "와, 흥미로웠어! 이제 다른 할 일을 찾아볼까..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AED216A344527194A5975487E5DCE5F0"
msgid "Wasn't that awesome? It was! @I'll get to planning the next event!"
msgstr "끝내주지 않았어? 그랬지! @다음 이벤트를 계획할게!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3946C3D0418DA3D81858178F9DA6520C"
msgid "Nice! Sometimes you all are great. I'll be around!"
msgstr "좋아! 가끔은 다들 멋지네. 나는 근처에 있을게!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::82F1BB874BDEEF60FFACE78F6058D962"
msgid "Aww, that's it? I'll make sure to start another event soon!"
msgstr "아쉽다, 그게 끝이야? 곧 또 다른 이벤트를 시작할게!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9400560F4F0CF28709B6A6953E6EBA24"
msgid ""
"Eventful! Exciting! Just like me! But, I've gotta find us something else to "
"do, now."
msgstr "다사다난! 짜릿해! 나답지! 하지만 이제 우릴 위한 다른 할 일을 찾아야 해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::619C43584988432EBED2C296C4DBC008"
msgid "WHOA! Haha, I'll return soon; that was sweet!"
msgstr "우와! 하하, 곧 돌아올게, 짜릿했어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B62EBEBC48C15BB56C7AC0A51B20117D"
msgid ""
"Awesome! Exciting! I've got more up my sleeve, so don't fuss for too long!"
msgstr "끝내줘! 짜릿해! 아직 준비한 게 더 있으니 너무 오래 아쉬워하지 마!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::109E021747818AAD52C0C9BC270C0FB4"
msgid "Veronica"
msgstr "베로니카"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28BAB93148689248FA68C9A792253C32"
msgid "Can't watch a movie without something to eat and drink!"
msgstr "먹고 마실 게 없으면 영화를 볼 수 없지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D11A86E54A3BD4821BDCA5889110DB25"
msgid "Are you going to see %movie%? I saw that last week, %spoiler%."
msgstr "%movie% 보러 갈래? 나 지난주에 봤는데, %spoiler%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E612D27149E79671BF357AB0210007D1"
msgid "%misquote%. Classic."
msgstr "%misquote%. 클래식이지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09F10A114C9B05DC507F6E9572EF342F"
msgid "\"Let's all go to the lobby...\""
msgstr "\"다 같이 로비로 가자...\""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::96B7BE96424EB40CB94256BFD25581C0"
msgid ""
"The popcorn machine is broken, so we had to break out the reserves. It's "
"'popcorn' enough, I assure you."
msgstr "팝콘 기계가 고장 나서 비축분을 꺼내야 했어. 팝콘은 '충분히' 팝콘이라구, 장담해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::82D49D3C41327B39A862DEBF30F2005F"
msgid ""
"I used to roll around on the theater floor like a katamari ball when no one "
"was watching, just to see how much popcorn I could get stuck to myself."
msgstr "예전에 아무도 안 볼 때 극장 바닥을 카타마리 공처럼 굴러다니며 몸에 팝콘을 얼마나 붙일 수 있는지 시험했었어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FDF6403647A1D4FAD06DCCBA41635E3A"
msgid ""
"Ever wonder what artificial popcorn butter is made out of? @I know, but I "
"promised never to tell a living soul."
msgstr "인공 팝콘 버터가 뭘로 만드는지 궁금해 본 적 있어? @나도 알지만, 산 사람에게는 절대 말 안 하기로 약속했어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C9235020498CFB6377B783A64F7ED2F1"
msgid "Ever notice how most of the concessions just say \"candy\" on them? Weird."
msgstr "매점 물건 대부분에 그냥 \"사탕\"이라고만 적혀 있는 거 눈치챘어? 이상하지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::297E02FE497AAB9480519E873DF34290"
msgid ""
"Okay, I'll be honest: most of the stuff behind here is just decorative. The "
"soda fountain hasn't worked in decades."
msgstr "솔직히 말할게: 여기 뒤에 있는 건 대부분 장식이야. 음료 자판기는 수십 년째 고장이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F258280249C3A8ECB633918E54980575"
msgid "Enjoy the show."
msgstr "즐겁게 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C37F5BF94940F945124883BD2AC7FBC5"
msgid "POPCORN! GET YOUR POPCORN! @And sodas! @And candy."
msgstr "팝콘! 팝콘 사세요! @그리고 탄산음료! @그리고 사탕."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8188814F4D3E904C1774F686BCEBB816"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much. It's exactly what I wanted! I'll put this somewhere safe "
"where Dave won't be able to steal it."
msgstr "정말 고마워요. 딱 원하던 거예요! 데이브가 훔쳐 갈 수 없는 안전한 곳에 둘게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3BE7BDAB4B8C68A0A65FD0B0550F6252"
msgid ""
"I was imprisoned behind this concession counter for knowing certain secrets."
msgstr "저는 어떤 비밀을 알았기 때문에 이 매점 카운터 뒤에 갇혔어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0C2FC50749F657B513AF1B9A4FAFF296"
msgid ""
"There are snipers hidden behind the movie posters. If I try to hop this "
"counter, I'm done for."
msgstr "영화 포스터 뒤에 저격수들이 숨어 있어요. 이 카운터를 넘으려다간 끝장이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8D9D9BE94E542693D742E68D6704DB67"
msgid ""
"I know what you're thinking, and, yes: every item on that list is "
"overpriced."
msgstr "무슨 생각하는지 알아요. 그래요, 저 목록에 있는 건 전부 바가지예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::48C3EC7E47F63A754C0685B1C73ABCBD"
msgid "* Hums the theme to a certain very popular movie. @You know the one. *"
msgstr "* 아주 유명한 어떤 영화의 테마를 흥얼거린다. @그거 알 거예요. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::77308E6A4EAE1D6648C5429E438E8B87"
msgid "If you wait here any longer, you're gonna miss the movie."
msgstr "여기서 더 기다리다간 영화를 놓칠 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::591A1DCB4B773F76577119A01B3668E8"
msgid "Are you here to watch the movies or the theater staff?"
msgstr "영화를 보러 온 거예요, 아니면 극장 직원을 보러 온 거예요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F4C3C04A4F524C49D346A6AF33DCD819"
msgid ""
"You've been standing there for quite a while. I should be selling tickets "
"for this."
msgstr "꽤 오래 거기 서 있었네요. 이거라면 표를 팔아야 할 판이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::63DFDBE84D493B6C15C3A2B01FDA97AB"
msgid ""
"Look, I know it looks like I have nothing better to do than just stand here,"
" but uh... I have better things to do."
msgstr "저기, 제가 딱히 할 일 없이 여기 서 있는 것처럼 보이겠지만, 음... 할 일은 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A048F4D74CC72112AC7275AA04518B91"
msgid "Trying to eat that in the dark is pretty difficult. Trust me; I know."
msgstr "어둠 속에서 그걸 먹기는 꽤 힘들어요. 제 말 믿어요, 경험해 봤거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED1A0BBC4E2A96C252852282D32555A9"
msgid "Please don't spill it all over the floors."
msgstr "바닥에 다 쏟지는 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F12498545BC9E7A9E7D97BE93756A1C"
msgid "You gonna need help carrying all of that?"
msgstr "그거 다 나르는 거 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C274CF5461DB910E3465694C0E90E80"
msgid "Save some for the other moviegoers."
msgstr "다른 관객들 몫도 좀 남겨 두세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::40254C604C677CB05BE3B48146A8675B"
msgid "I think you have plenty, but my boss says not to tell people that."
msgstr "충분히 산 것 같은데, 사장님이 손님한테 그런 말은 하지 말라고 하네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::348B5D7C41C8A911447DD3875675F1C3"
msgid "Please, tell me you're with a group... This can't all be just for you."
msgstr "제발, 일행이랑 같이 온 거라고 말해 주세요... 이게 다 혼자 먹을 리는 없잖아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A27CC21644D887B1D9E8268A9E87285D"
msgid ""
"Is that for eating, or is it ammunition to throw at the guy who didn't "
"silence his phone?"
msgstr "먹으려고 산 거예요, 아니면 휴대폰 소리를 안 끈 사람한테 던질 탄약이에요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FEEDB8544CF5D497CB1FF9BFCA9E6F41"
msgid ""
"Yeah, after looking at your total on the cash register... Very frugal of "
"you."
msgstr "네, 계산대에서 합계를 보고 나니... 참 알뜰하시네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B1D2FF34E030B0A52B565A23D7DF649"
msgid "Yeah, those went bad about a week ago."
msgstr "네, 그건 한 일주일 전쯤 상했어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7043D45C49F5071BFD5582844F9EC076"
msgid ""
"Hey, now that you've put that back, you could probably afford another movie "
"ticket!"
msgstr "이봐요, 그거 도로 놓았으니 이제 영화 표 한 장 더 살 돈이 있겠네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::203A3CCF441E8A2F3B7EE889099A8409"
msgid ""
"That should last you until the end of the trailers when the actual movie "
"starts."
msgstr "예고편이 끝나고 본 영화가 시작할 때까진 버틸 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1A8F6B6A4661709B280E3AAA77AB2F70"
msgid "Try not to make too much of a mess."
msgstr "너무 어지르지는 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CF9CFC2449BD1A981071FB8A7C6FE26B"
msgid "Our prohibitively expensive snacks are now slightly cheaper!"
msgstr "터무니없이 비싼 저희 간식이 이제 조금 더 쌉니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F6048EC242555A3AEB0BBBA485F6386D"
msgid ""
"Life is a movie, and you're the star. You should really get out there and "
"enjoy some of the events."
msgstr "인생은 영화고, 당신이 주인공이에요. 나가서 이벤트를 좀 즐기세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7048538948DDA840C4EFB5A6D2E0A7BE"
msgid ""
"What are you doing? Go out there and be a part of that event. I'll be here "
"when you get back."
msgstr "뭐 하는 거예요? 나가서 그 이벤트에 참여해요. 돌아오면 난 여기 있을게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::21E24F154A46DEE2F134A9A7248DF07C"
msgid "\"Say, 'hi,' to my little gun.\" - Star Face"
msgstr "\"내 작은 총한테 인사해.\" - 스타 페이스"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F96F02CB4AD624CDE07DF69111149D39"
msgid "\"Frankly my dear, I'm looking at you kid.\" - Gone with the Casa"
msgstr "\"솔직히 말해서, 내 사랑, 난 너를 보고 있어, 꼬마야.\" - 바람과 함께 사라진 집"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::516A4EAC47BBF7E1F265E3923F3B0A63"
msgid "\"Get to da airplane!\" - Hunter, or something"
msgstr "\"비행기에 올라타!\" - 헌터, 아마도"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F6E0044B4F122AA9F2204FB3EF365B34"
msgid "\"Pasta la vita, buddy.\" - Deleter 2: Got 'em"
msgstr "\"파스타 라 비타, 친구.\" - 삭제자 2: 다 잡았다"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ECB65ACE4933C37346CDF89AF1333454"
msgid "\"I'm the king of the boat!\" - Gigantic Boat"
msgstr "\"내가 이 배의 왕이다!\" - 거대한 배"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0EF8921A48841B49148346ADA7E07276"
msgid "\"When we fly, we don't need wheels.\" - Back and Again"
msgstr "\"날 때는 바퀴가 필요 없지.\" - Back and Again"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E2312A064F0A43F128B3AF9EBB5CA0D6"
msgid ""
"\"Life is like a candy box; there's a lot of different kinds.\" - Florist "
"Grump"
msgstr "\"인생은 사탕 상자 같아; 온갖 종류가 있거든.\" - Florist Grump"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0933D6834D4BEF665C5AC08184980690"
msgid "The Red Door"
msgstr "붉은 문"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6FA6E768477F209BEDEFE19181450F34"
msgid "Action Archaeologist"
msgstr "액션 고고학자"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1D75D77148345E25A64997B8AA8CFED4"
msgid "Future Killer"
msgstr "미래의 킬러"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD1342C246286B5D466C34B2009C6034"
msgid "End of Days"
msgstr "종말의 날"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3C07118C466409BF106F63A9622EE38F"
msgid "Simulated"
msgstr "시뮬레이션"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7C7D139E41F227EF2161B8B1B82306F4"
msgid "Fifth Encounter"
msgstr "다섯 번째 조우"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD428283435B047CC3B140851C29E3D8"
msgid "The Color Orange"
msgstr "주황색"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8192B43D434D59FE61E40C913D70267C"
msgid "I can't believe he was actually dead the entire time"
msgstr "그가 내내 정말 죽어 있었다니 믿을 수가 없어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::50ABB88D43620D9CFE6CFC84C63BCC5B"
msgid ""
"turns out the ancient artifact was cursed, and his partner was the real bad "
"guy"
msgstr "그 고대 유물에 저주가 걸려 있었고, 파트너가 진짜 악당이었던 거야"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B192ED6B4FE9FC1837514B8E0FB2584B"
msgid "amazing how the kid ends up teaching the robot to care about humans"
msgstr "그 아이가 결국 로봇에게 인간을 아끼는 법을 가르친다는 게 놀라워"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::11DB57A34E37EFFA9EF1D5AA5963ED72"
msgid "who woulda thought that all they had to do was reset the computer"
msgstr "컴퓨터만 초기화하면 된다니 누가 생각이나 했을까"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B4F60224C644ABFBFBF3DB947AFB4AF"
msgid ""
"his wife dies in the end, but at least he managed to save everyone else"
msgstr "결국 아내는 죽지만, 적어도 다른 모두를 구했어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5328F46B4BE412B834EE11850690D6ED"
msgid ""
"turns out reanimating the dead is a really bad idea, everyone dies in this "
"one"
msgstr "시신을 되살리는 건 정말 나쁜 생각이었어, 이 작품에선 모두 죽어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8112BC65426A00FA731834ACEFAD415B"
msgid ""
"the guy cheats on her, but they get back together at the end and start a "
"family"
msgstr "그 남자가 바람을 피우지만 결국 둘은 다시 만나 가정을 꾸려"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EA8752E246CAC2CA6E9231B6E8153FD8"
msgid "Jeff"
msgstr "제프"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EC7EE1FF4F1C4E8287F9E095DAA172A3"
msgid "!BEHOLD JEFF, THE MASTER OF REALITY. LET US STRIKE A DEAL."
msgstr "!경배하라, 현실의 지배자 제프를. 거래를 시작하지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D32860B047B3F4B0A97294A958029A39"
msgid ""
"#Greetings, wanderer, and welcome to my shop of homes and dreams. Sit down, "
"and let us commence business."
msgstr "#반갑네, 방랑자여, 집과 꿈의 상점에 온 것을 환영하네. 앉게, 거래를 시작하지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0238D11B44BAEAC9E0141A8918EFB093"
msgid ""
"#Come in here, and let us discuss the issues of the day and also sell you a "
"pile of dreams and real estate."
msgstr "#들어오게, 오늘의 사안을 논하고 꿈과 부동산 한 더미도 팔지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28F6BC9342425B29E04183BA6C226053"
msgid "#Welcome to my elaborate housing puzzle; good luck solving it."
msgstr "#내 정교한 주택 퍼즐에 온 것을 환영하네. 풀 수 있기를 빈다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1303F7EC4EE547355A7D79B46D1398CC"
msgid "#Many different, confusing spaces for sale; choose the one you'd like."
msgstr "#판매 중인 여러 혼란스러운 공간들; 원하는 걸 고르게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A50F1C2341BCC1D4CC014C9297A870C0"
msgid ""
"#Greetings, and welcome to the housing market. This is where it is. You've "
"found it."
msgstr "#반갑네, 주택 시장에 온 것을 환영하네. 여기가 바로 그곳이라네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A57BE0E74CCDB3F7DF6EDFB4341A9AC3"
msgid "#Gaze into my orb and consider a place to raise a family."
msgstr "#내 구슬을 들여다보고 가정을 꾸릴 곳을 생각해 보게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::034EDEE942106E3D1D6DA7B3C317CDD6"
msgid "#Buy two condos; get one dog free!"
msgstr "#콘도 두 개를 사면 강아지 한 마리 공짜!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::61395816482FB064FC1E14854D736751"
msgid "#Welcome to my rodeo of caves and homes."
msgstr "#동굴과 집의 로데오에 온 것을 환영하네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::54E5BB4B40C290F1E7B6F3AE5EFF3D7D"
msgid "#Enjoy considering JEFF and which house you'd like."
msgstr "#제프와 어느 집을 원할지 고민하며 즐기게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1FA220B143916308847763B50FD19639"
msgid "!BEHOLD MY MANY ATTRACTIVE PROPERTIES."
msgstr "!나의 매력적인 매물들을 경배하라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C6003C9542EE40FDFCA0CD8F66EB225E"
msgid ""
"#All homes in Tuscany are hand built by a man named Chad. It's the law."
msgstr "#투스카니의 모든 집은 채드라는 남자가 손수 짓는다. 법이 그렇다네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5168D99742C0325083F40E9E74B5515F"
msgid ""
"#Like and subscribe to my channel where I let's play Nanny Quest all day."
msgstr "#온종일 Nanny Quest를 플레이하는 내 채널에 좋아요와 구독을 해 주게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::124421DC42F83E6A6A579FAAC4D74E20"
msgid ""
"#Consider the stars, and all that they do for us. They themselves are the "
"homes for all of our souls."
msgstr "#별들을 생각해 보세요, 그리고 별들이 우리를 위해 하는 모든 일을요. 별들은 바로 우리 모든 영혼의 집입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C81B2D6541663476C7AB2F80F6B58E5F"
msgid "#Mortages come from the free parket. It is a parking lot."
msgstr "#저당은 무료 주차장에서 나옵니다. 그곳은 주차장입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE652B0B46F45C11AA4929B8F60CC664"
msgid "#Did you know dogs can do parkour? It is called barkour."
msgstr "#강아지가 파쿠르를 할 수 있다는 걸 아셨나요? 그걸 바쿠르라고 부릅니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1DDE626848BE93E83FBDD592D40D306A"
msgid "#Each roof tile in each house we sell has complete coverage."
msgstr "#저희가 파는 모든 집의 지붕 기와 하나하나가 완벽하게 덮여 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::249D729F47880CE746F293969A6D8A83"
msgid "#Leaks all the time or you'll get your money back."
msgstr "#항상 새지만 돈은 돌려드립니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B105222F459667289F7A11A5A8BB036E"
msgid "#The car hole is optional, but we strongly recommend you behold it."
msgstr "#차 구멍은 선택 사항이지만, 꼭 한번 보시기를 강력히 권합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::908C632E4C3ED9DA40D262A237C2A578"
msgid "#We have permits to build a residence on the sun itself. We reach all."
msgstr "#저희는 태양 위에 주택을 지을 허가를 받았습니다. 우리는 모든 곳에 닿습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::87960E074F64F00B270877877FAE5379"
msgid "#This house has exactly as many nails as you have Tuesdays left."
msgstr "#이 집의 못 개수는 당신에게 남은 화요일 수와 정확히 같습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::457EF6CD47B203D69BF93AAC85631194"
msgid "#Brutalism is the most honest form of architecture."
msgstr "#브루탈리즘은 가장 정직한 건축 양식입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::357339FC42002967F46C0898878F4225"
msgid ""
"#If you ask a cop what his favorite movie is, he must answer you or else "
"it's entrapment."
msgstr "#경찰에게 가장 좋아하는 영화를 물으면 반드시 대답해야 합니다. 아니면 함정 수사입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D8C88CA4168550DB743EBA4DDC4F9BE"
msgid "#A society exists to serve it's people, and I am the Earl of Realty."
msgstr "#사회는 사람들을 위해 존재하며, 나는 부동산의 백작이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::59225FCD408D33922C4D1898B9DE7923"
msgid "#Each of our homes has 64 bits of ram. "
msgstr "#저희 집은 모두 64비트 램을 갖추고 있습니다. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2838C95E48307F87A805DDA16196109D"
msgid ""
"#Every plank of drywall is me. They are my bones, my skin. I AM your home."
msgstr "#모든 석고보드 판이 곧 나다. 그것들은 내 뼈요 내 살갗이다. 내가 바로 당신의 집이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::48DB25464F3003CD47CC05A2D0B6ABEF"
msgid "#We're all in a terrible pinch, aren't we?"
msgstr "#우리 모두 끔찍한 궁지에 몰렸지, 그렇지 않나?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C1BD87C5487E3E95BCC13194C58814BC"
msgid "#From my perspective, you've never left. You never leave me."
msgstr "#내 눈에는 당신이 떠난 적이 없습니다. 당신은 결코 나를 떠나지 않아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E72BFC54F382F9733A1A7B9C157E067"
msgid "#Keep your doors locked for me."
msgstr "#나를 위해 문을 잠가 두세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B0B9AFB84AE3798CBBA4F38F061ED6F5"
msgid "#Do be careful."
msgstr "#부디 조심하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2F48F20044C1211CC9650280A1E764EA"
msgid "#It won't be long, don't worry."
msgstr "#오래 걸리지 않을 겁니다, 걱정 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::37DE01ED47D55956128E24BE4F7B119B"
msgid "#Come closer."
msgstr "#더 가까이 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D9EA9EE54501AC24476161A11035004C"
msgid "#Gaze upon my many estates."
msgstr "#내 수많은 저택을 바라보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A74756784B9B3401A78B989A60E51440"
msgid "#This is where new homes may be acquired."
msgstr "#이곳에서 새 집을 구할 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A3CFBF5140C9973CED92F693914CC067"
msgid "#Let us strike a bargain."
msgstr "#거래를 합시다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3BA135C74A6FCF937936F3A5AD6BD9A7"
msgid "#I've a deal for you."
msgstr "#당신에게 제안할 게 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6494998A4C605099DD0B61B1AEC4DF90"
msgid "#You've no idea what you have just done, do you?"
msgstr "#방금 무슨 일을 했는지 전혀 모르시겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::328F4BCF4E2D3148274768BDE7281EEB"
msgid "#I will use this for my dark needs."
msgstr "#나는 이것을 어두운 목적에 쓰겠다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B7C49D7445B23DC9F312EBEB87F7146"
msgid "#Excellent, I was hoping you'd deliver this to me today."
msgstr "#훌륭하군, 오늘 이걸 내게 가져다주길 바라고 있었지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::74E234AF4B3D8152D77D8D8ED8706576"
msgid "#You have no idea what you've just done, do you?"
msgstr "#방금 무슨 짓을 했는지 전혀 모르시겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AE579D4D4EE07EFF581E4FB8995B26B4"
msgid "#I will use this for my dark needs."
msgstr "#나는 이것을 어두운 목적에 쓰겠다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3CE8839B4B4F5C2BDE3135A008E4750E"
msgid "#Excellent. I was hoping you'd deliver this to me today."
msgstr "#훌륭하군. 오늘 이걸 내게 가져다주길 바라고 있었지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5614DD7B46FD43DB2D61389089A69665"
msgid "Have you ever folded a dog in half? Welcome back to the house store."
msgstr "강아지를 반으로 접어 본 적 있나요? 집 상점에 다시 오신 걸 환영합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E6690F044C43055DD987DB849AF2D4BB"
msgid "#I am a patient man."
msgstr "#나는 참을성 있는 남자다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9847AFD443F1EF4121AB83B51D75E364"
msgid "#Time does not exist; therefore, neither does the concept of waiting."
msgstr "#시간은 존재하지 않는다. 따라서 기다림이라는 개념도 존재하지 않는다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::20B3BC1A4E71444DA16B5FA0B0E0DB5A"
msgid "#Nothing can be truly plaid."
msgstr "#진정한 격자는 존재할 수 없다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1E449EEE496C7F6EFB64A1BF001B164C"
msgid "I don't exist and you do. This waiting contest will only end one way."
msgstr "나는 존재하지 않고 너는 존재한다. 이 기다리기 대결은 한 가지 결말뿐이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BCDCB1BC4731C3DF7B418BA7C334520D"
msgid "#I feel nothing and embrace entropy. You will not outlast Jeff."
msgstr "#나는 아무것도 느끼지 않으며 엔트로피를 받아들인다. 너는 제프보다 오래 버티지 못한다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::24B7C8F54937339EC1DFEE9F4DDF2FD7"
msgid "#A fool's errand."
msgstr "#어리석은 헛수고다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8216196F4AF9CF502F10D1B536F84211"
msgid "#Jeff is ancient and eternal. You have no hope."
msgstr "#제프는 고대이자 영원하다. 너에게 희망은 없다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::21DD0D6D410697443003FB881931C400"
msgid "#Reach out and have yourself a touch."
msgstr "#손을 뻗어 만져 보아라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D1A5E80B4A2FBCEF942CBBA66347C783"
msgid "#Grab real estate by the claws."
msgstr "#발톱으로 부동산을 움켜쥐어라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5F2C1E347A2AE8A37FC88903081BF4D"
msgid "#You desire land don't you?"
msgstr "#땅을 원하지, 그렇지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8358F32245925EC387D051AB6895461B"
msgid "#All the acres you could ever hope for."
msgstr "#네가 바랄 수 있는 모든 에이커를."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC67F9FF46D0D4FB4A4CC780B28F4EE4"
msgid "#It's paid real estate."
msgstr "#돈을 치른 부동산이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::883441CC418DD65386FB9F8A6D7A4EE5"
msgid "#Bathe in the property value."
msgstr "#부동산 가치에 몸을 담가라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B28F7514968ACE0315944A70104C412"
msgid "#We sell you the very concept of time and space."
msgstr "#우리는 시간과 공간이라는 개념 그 자체를 판다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::707645C148824D00B06301BD0B1CDAB6"
msgid "#Quite the deal we have in the making here, yes?"
msgstr "#우리가 앞두고 있는 거래치고는 꽤 괜찮지, 그렇지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B2D2333D4A08427075607D9E61AB0D42"
msgid "#Yes. Quite the bargain we are about to make here."
msgstr "#그래. 우리가 곧 맺을 거래치고는 꽤 괜찮아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::125A193A45FBDE57ABAC53B7BE235808"
msgid "#This will be a grand bargain."
msgstr "#이건 대박 거래가 될 것이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::278321D7465287C02D1148954FF3E5E4"
msgid "#You're rather easily called away; aren't you?"
msgstr "#넌 참 쉽게 불려 나오는구나, 그렇지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2B1625E94D63202275397BB5FD2A3858"
msgid "#An obvious bluff. You WILL engage in capitalism at some point."
msgstr "#뻔한 허세다. 너는 언젠가 반드시 자본주의에 뛰어들 것이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F62F752843F3A2BD26769ABE48D99AE5"
msgid "#A conflicted mind builds no homes."
msgstr "#갈등하는 정신은 집을 짓지 못한다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7505857B44F958D5A33E56830E8A815E"
msgid ""
"#Benjamin Franklin didn't die on that hill so you could waffle in a "
"videogame."
msgstr "#벤자민 프랭클린이 네가 비디오게임에서 우물쭈물하려고 그 언덕에서 죽은 게 아니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3EDCA43743B2B290EB16ABADE4296704"
msgid "#A cute haggling tactic, but you will not manipulate Dr. Equity."
msgstr "#귀여운 흥정술이지만, 너는 닥터 에퀴티를 조종하지 못한다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4FE376B341A6ED02F570E8AEBD908EAB"
msgid "#It is undone."
msgstr "#무효가 되었다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::999157DA40A5ACD8D5EAAC972BE6B6BA"
msgid "#My elaborate housing schemes... unraveled once again."
msgstr "#내 정교한 주택 계획이... 또다시 풀려 버렸군."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B35CA9F14D395328516315B49E1848AA"
msgid "#Fool."
msgstr "#바보."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C8995BD047DF59A0BCA00BBEB3943C31"
msgid "!THE DEAL IS STRUCK."
msgstr "!거래 성사."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F873DD94D46FBDC066F18B778EA96B4"
msgid "!IT IS DONE."
msgstr "!끝났다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B540DAAF44ED7D0BE30BAAB2B19E6949"
msgid "!YOU'VE A DEAL."
msgstr "!거래 성립."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E90AA0EE40556E98746976BDB630152A"
msgid "!AND IT IS DONE."
msgstr "!그리고 끝났다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6FF62595438635B044A008ACC3590432"
msgid "!THE BARGAIN IS MADE."
msgstr "!계약 체결."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7F83F3F043121564C87CBEA432B19523"
msgid "!ONCE AGAIN REALITY IS MADE FLESH."
msgstr "!다시 한번 현실이 육화되었다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9E912F2943CB4A3A77C38B8EB228BB7B"
msgid "!THEN THE DEAL IS DONE."
msgstr "!그러면 거래 성사다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::32C243234CA2F91895564C80740A2DF1"
msgid "!BEHOLD! A DEAL!"
msgstr "!보라! 거래다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B2839DDF447784C5B91A5585C6E4DB6D"
msgid "!THE PACT IS SIGNED."
msgstr "!계약에 서명했다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F913D6EC41ABF8BEFA33369E18FBC553"
msgid "!THEN OUR DARK CONTRACT IS COMPLETE!"
msgstr "!그러면 우리의 어두운 계약이 완성됐다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::80DE1D0E487ED610C68C0A8A8BAE2530"
msgid "#Yes! Come in from the chaos to consider real estate."
msgstr "#그래! 혼란을 벗어나 부동산을 생각해 보게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::027E00804010B3B45C07BB9AC53368EC"
msgid ""
"#Sanctuary from chaos, sure, but how would you like sanctuary from "
"mediocrity?"
msgstr "#혼란에서 벗어난 안식처도 좋지만, 평범함에서 벗어난 안식처는 어떤가?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::618211814357505D7EA3B0899CFD1DE5"
msgid ""
"#Behold, all is orderly in here. In exchange, I ask that you peruse my "
"equity."
msgstr "#보게, 이 안은 모두 질서 정연하다네. 그 대가로 내 지분을 살펴봐 주게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09E7E18C4FBA9EF1E4EED9A6EA83BD5C"
msgid "Charles"
msgstr "찰스"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::522697CF4C6D8626032E018F147DEBA9"
msgid "It is this time of the year that I despise the most."
msgstr "내가 가장 싫어하는 계절이 바로 이때일세."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::251FACBB4D21143616AE0EB22079F059"
msgid "I wholly detest October and Halloween."
msgstr "나는 10월과 핼러윈을 정말 싫어한다네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09DFAE5E4E3A94A259FC2487F957C7DA"
msgid ""
"In just one day's time, everyone will forget about me and I'll be left to "
"rot."
msgstr "딱 하루만 지나면 모두가 나를 잊고, 나는 썩어 없어질 신세일세."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0BD95C784916AC8753AFF1AF898ADAE7"
msgid ""
"I mention this casually, but I am in IMMENSE pain having this candle inside "
"me."
msgstr "가볍게 말하는 거지만, 내 몸속에 이 촛불이 있어서 엄청나게 아프다네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5ACB7796472BBCE70AF517B1C31E8D66"
msgid "I hate how my cousin Jerry gets all the attention."
msgstr "사촌 제리가 관심을 다 독차지하는 게 너무 싫어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1F1F2F5E495C2A56A444D788C3C658B1"
msgid "Please do not turn me into a pie."
msgstr "제발 나를 파이로 만들지 말게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4CA408234415557C2E5334AC46FA0098"
msgid "Halloween used to be good."
msgstr "핼러윈은 예전엔 좋았는데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F578218C483981EC09871A86F9C2E264"
msgid "My insides are slowly being burnt away."
msgstr "내 속이 서서히 타들어 가고 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E874FE304022F4DE082D4BB105CE10FF"
msgid "#I am not okay."
msgstr "#나는 괜찮지 않아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0CEB95CA4920FC5979D500B54E03FE60"
msgid "#Please put my candle out, it is killing me."
msgstr "#제발 내 촛불을 꺼 줘, 죽겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B6C3CAEE480D13730459D897CD635176"
msgid "#You are part of the problem."
msgstr "#자네도 문제의 일부일세."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F8182D51456770B015A12593EA753D75"
msgid "#Here's your blood money."
msgstr "#피의 돈 여기 있다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DB8E8FFB4316203F782CE5855822DF86"
msgid "#Enjoy your garbage."
msgstr "#이 쓰레기나 즐겨."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5BFEFF334A205CAC789AF2AF66D6BEE8"
msgid "Spooksby"
msgstr "스푹스비"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::13D5F1B246FEF3EEA0C2BDBF063FD1BB"
msgid "Pardon my appearance, I've got a severe case of @resting witch face."
msgstr "내 모습은 양해해 주게, 심한 @무표정 마녀 얼굴증이라네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::27CFDD794659377D03B81B92780AE3DF"
msgid "Please do not ask me how I died@, that is the rudest possible thing. "
msgstr "내가 어떻게 죽었는지는 묻지 말게@, 그건 가장 무례한 짓이라네. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::32D4C75746D5581276C613831CE95ACF"
msgid ""
"A fun fact for you on all hallows eve:@ The afterlife has no internet "
"connection."
msgstr "만성절에 유용한 사실 하나:@ 저승에는 인터넷이 없다네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89376E004658E9331E63338DDB69EE20"
msgid ""
"I've a costume party to go to after this hosted by the Duke of Beheadings. "
"@Lovely chap."
msgstr "이 일이 끝나면 참수 공작이 여는 코스튬 파티에 갈 거라네. @좋은 친구지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::663A9F95498B17AAF29D518B2452F07F"
msgid ""
"What do I do for fun?@ I enjoy listening to Clair De Lune in abandoned "
"mansions.@@ Not every haunting is malicious, you know."
msgstr "내 취미가 뭐냐고?@ 버려진 저택에서 달빛을 듣는 걸 좋아하지.@@ 모든 유령이 다 나쁜 건 아니라네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D321DF94758E56399D159A195878417"
msgid ""
"When you pass on come find me,@ I can give you a letter of introduction to "
"the Greater Society of Haunts."
msgstr "자네가 세상을 떠나면 날 찾아오게,@ 위대한 유령 협회에 소개장을 써 줄 수 있지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C27DE7B64EDA9BC108997CBABC321720"
msgid "I am secretly a bedsheet."
msgstr "사실 나는 침대 시트일세."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78248EC4437071E78F0972912EC40187"
msgid "Understandable, have a pleasant day."
msgstr "이해하네, 좋은 하루 보내게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::81BEDAC740E6D26FFAD8E88350354528"
msgid "#Have a good night."
msgstr "#좋은 밤 보내세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7237E7054E4755B6819102A963CEE4BE"
msgid "No-one replies to this why do people say this you just want candy."
msgstr "아무도 대답 안 하는데 왜 다들 이러는 걸까, 그냥 사탕 받고 싶은 거잖아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::148253F147CD57BFF6414B80F7E4C484"
msgid ""
"I do not entirely understand this ritual but here, have a snack pauper."
msgstr "이 의식은 잘 모르겠지만 여기, 간식이나 먹어요 가난뱅이."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B3C3700A472CB3BCACA438829F098309"
msgid "Ah,@ of course. Here is your candy."
msgstr "아,@ 그럼요. 사탕 여기 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E5C429C942D0C5663E578189C68FF4D1"
msgid "LazerMaster1990"
msgstr "LazerMaster1990"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B0215DA4C35E46FCD252EA881BC8304"
msgid "King Arthritis"
msgstr "관절왕"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EF54E9DF40F2065DDAD667BE3AF3A4BA"
msgid "SPIN SPIN SPIN!"
msgstr "빙글 빙글 빙글!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5A4559474ED03B6725709F93742DA3F5"
msgid "Do you wanna know a fact about necks?"
msgstr "목에 대한 사실 하나 알려줄까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7E54E8C34BED3ED97FA901B98F0FA730"
msgid "King Arthritis"
msgstr "관절왕"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7498591C486C0BF2F20617AB5629DD93"
msgid ""
"I looked like a normal person before I sat in this cauldron, but it sure is "
"cozy in here."
msgstr "이 가마솥에 앉기 전엔 평범한 사람이었는데, 여긴 정말 아늑하네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D8D33E84FD0C228C8F8759F7C1DA7F6"
msgid ""
"Could you do me a favor and check how hot this cauldron is? @I can't feel."
msgstr "부탁인데 이 가마솥이 얼마나 뜨거운지 확인해 줄래요? @저는 감각이 없어서요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::35B22B43410F8C5022EC20805D1FE46E"
msgid ""
"I wish we had extra hands around here, it's tiring being a part of a "
"skeleton crew."
msgstr "여기 손이 더 있었으면 좋겠어요, 해골 인력이라 정말 힘드네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::441AAE224573146B4A3F6992B3668891"
msgid "I'd get out of here but frankly I don't have the @guts @to do it."
msgstr "여기서 나가고 싶지만 솔직히 @배짱이 @없네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D1F170DC4C6B4B380929B4A9C73E0288"
msgid "Technically I'm cursed, but honestly, I deserve this."
msgstr "엄밀히 말하면 저주받았지만, 솔직히 자업자득이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::505813254E2A92D1CABF43A9B2B46AFE"
msgid "I'd love to go to a party, but @I have @no body."
msgstr "파티에 가고 싶지만 @저는 @몸이 없어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E8804BE84D59401506EFEA9428B33214"
msgid "#There's a skeleton inside all of us %name%!"
msgstr "#우리 모두 몸속에 해골이 하나씩 있어요 %name%!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::81EF19A74687657A13831494D3050F9B"
msgid ""
"If you ever need me, I'll be here, since my tendons are melted. @I am stuck "
"in an eternal decay."
msgstr "필요하면 언제든 여기 있을게요, 힘줄이 녹아서요. @영원한 부패 속에 갇혔답니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AE95EC81456F0C1498EB8A8D6C60AF6C"
msgid "Don't get too... @rattled @out there."
msgstr "너무... @덜컥 @놀라지는 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::25AC5F53409AA90D4E00EE9926296DE8"
msgid "I've got a bone to pick with the guy that convinced me to sit in here."
msgstr "여기 앉으라고 꼬신 녀석과는 할 말이 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::355968644620DD6129DBCB885589A9CD"
msgid "I might not be able to feel.. @but I still have feelings."
msgstr "감각은 없을지 몰라도.. @감정은 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::568880964B5B9A188682DFAD2BC2DCEB"
msgid "Keep your spine straight %name%!"
msgstr "척추를 곧게 펴세요 %name%!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::299A7E25453A5CB823F0F98A2A8FA163"
msgid "The femur can hold over 200% of your body weight!"
msgstr "대퇴골은 체중의 200% 이상을 지탱할 수 있어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D3E613D46B5756044F9B08B8CEF1A37"
msgid "#Have a spook. That's my catchphrase. I just thought of it."
msgstr "#으스스한 하루 보내세요. 제 캐치프레이즈예요. 방금 생각났어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FABF8589433B598B71A294ACD180E417"
msgid "Here's some spookums, don't choke on it!"
msgstr "으스스한 간식이에요, 목에 걸리지 않게 조심하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9261D8FF465A05EBDA07FBB4FE8A64DE"
msgid "Here's your junk, don't get eaten by a werewolf on the way home!"
msgstr "물건 여기 있어요, 집에 가는 길에 늑대인간한테 잡아먹히지 마세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::17987DC04265981F8A2948B79A854EAD"
msgid "Here you go. Enjoy that %item% you little nerd."
msgstr "여기요. 그 %item% 맛있게 드세요, 이 괴짜야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6759066546C1E26707B7EB8A365A3681"
msgid "I sure hope that's a costume. Have a %item%, maybe that'll fix it."
msgstr "그게 분장이길 바랄게요. %item% 드세요, 그러면 좀 나아질지도."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::60D3ED6C4E32A0CA8EF327B90A56F19A"
msgid "Dire Chad"
msgstr "다이어 채드"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B39B926344F9A28C119F34A79EE3760D"
msgid "Hey whaddup, you wanna hang out?"
msgstr "안녕, 뭐 해? 같이 놀래?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E878174C4DF300BD018667AC3D10D677"
msgid "Oh dunk, what's up?"
msgstr "오 이런, 무슨 일이야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FB9E94A54D8497529EB9748567BF2698"
msgid "Nice night out eh?"
msgstr "좋은 밤이네요, 그죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::76C3763E42155A2BB33313837F8E9216"
msgid "Sup dude?"
msgstr "어이 친구, 잘 지내?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D254848E44E910F0E64A5CACBBC8C056"
msgid "!Nyahaha! How ya doin buddy?"
msgstr "!냐하하하! 잘 지내니 친구?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D4EC449240C65BDA4276F897337C0BA5"
msgid "Yo. Anything going on?"
msgstr "여어. 무슨 일 있어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B56AE8C4F6345D7A1AB319BC192E76C"
msgid "Hey dude, you catch any sprites? They make a good snack, heh."
msgstr "안녕 친구, 스프라이트 잡았어? 간식으로 딱이야, 히히."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::22EF1D6042C703AE1A38A195880748AD"
msgid "Later dude."
msgstr "또 봐 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFFD0EDC4CD22302A0307D97412B3D57"
msgid "Aight, see ya 'round."
msgstr "좋아, 또 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::164655DC464F5B579DD4468A82FC087E"
msgid "Cool, later."
msgstr "고마워, 나중에 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6468BE15445CA20025060EAF555F76A0"
msgid "Peace out."
msgstr "잘 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::447825924AFACB1EB09C6298F3BE031B"
msgid "!SMELL YA LATER"
msgstr "!나중에 냄새 맡으러 올게"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::67D0B3344CF46FB5D20DA8BCAEC49417"
msgid "Hang in there!@@ get it?"
msgstr "힘내!@@ 알겠어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AD0060A0421ABAAE55A6768CBF3C093C"
msgid "Don't be a strangler! @@@ .....oops, I mean stranger! HAH!"
msgstr "목 조르는 사람이 되지 마! @@@ .....아이고, 낯선 사람 말이야! 하하!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FB2A4E07471924B03B28FE89AE2820E9"
msgid "!Kyahahaha! Hope this doesn't curse you!"
msgstr "!캬하하하! 이게 너한테 저주가 아니길 바랄게!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AACD9CF8425FB3A482A8D5B9CD65F076"
msgid "!Oooh we got a live one here! Good luck with this!"
msgstr "!오오, 살아있는 녀석이 나타났네! 행운을 빌어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::58658BE54AEE1D6207DF2BAA5081434B"
msgid "!Kyahahaha! If you insist!"
msgstr "!캬하하하! 그렇다면야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::310082DE44A213731809EB8AE1930CA8"
msgid "!HAH! Just remember, you asked for it!"
msgstr "!하! 기억해, 네가 원한 거야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::836AA10A4D591BBFC1AEED836ED69213"
msgid "!Remember I'm always watching, spidering around!"
msgstr "!난 항상 지켜보고 있어, 거미처럼 기어다니면서!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::75B6BC444A1860EAF4FDA2BA96229C8F"
msgid "Eyeball"
msgstr "눈알"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9917F3E043CF57B2281C3C9B3A7D8DE7"
msgid "#I see you"
msgstr "#네가 보여"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F499863A4908635FCD07BC89131487A0"
msgid "#I can see everything"
msgstr "#난 모든 걸 볼 수 있어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F0E21AAC4D10C9AF91950FA15777FBB6"
msgid "#I spy with my little @eye"
msgstr "#내 작은 @눈으로 찾아냈어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::327FAC534682EE5F576036AB59943BC0"
msgid "#I know who you are"
msgstr "#난 네가 누군지 알아"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88E21AA74A793D6F398BAAA2197FD557"
msgid "#I am watching you"
msgstr "#난 너를 지켜보고 있어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7082824D44F34162078ADDA1670FDC47"
msgid "#I observe all"
msgstr "#난 모든 걸 관찰해"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::804E45184F15C1D8DE7323A86F2602F1"
msgid "Wade"
msgstr "웨이드"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E08C06F74299CE30CC5BB8BDEAA1F62D"
msgid "Ah, you look new. I'm surprised I haven't see you before."
msgstr "아, 처음 보는 얼굴이네. 전에 못 본 게 신기하군."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A980770A44300D5014F1D582E3985B81"
msgid "Well, hey there, sunshine; take a load off."
msgstr "그래, 안녕하신가; 푹 쉬어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8750104543771B897F98E5BB79859BA1"
msgid "Welcome."
msgstr "환영하네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D662286456EE5B61D7036843C4E393F"
msgid "Grab a seat, and let's get you something to drink."
msgstr "자리 잡게, 마실 것 좀 가져다주지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B40EBC945D110475E95ADBBFFE4E69E"
msgid "Take a seat and let your hair down."
msgstr "앉아서 좀 편하게 있게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::65D63CC649AC75458611CBAC0E3EC742"
msgid ""
"You ever meet that bowling alley guy, Darien? Hear he used to be a pro until"
" something happened."
msgstr "볼링장에 다니는 대린이라는 녀석 만나봤나? 무슨 일이 생기기 전엔 프로였다고 하더군."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::86F0EAA44CDED451DE1DC2B22679EFD4"
msgid ""
"Been hearing whispers coming from the vents up here. Wonder if the bar's "
"haunted. Heh."
msgstr "여기 위쪽 환풍구에서 속삭이는 소리가 들려온다더라고. 바에 유령이라도 있나 싶어. 하하."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B6E1731E41237552618D11B7B6BA135E"
msgid ""
"Hm. Looks like celebrations is on fire again. @But that's not really "
"anything new, now; is it?"
msgstr "음. 또 celebration에 불이 붙은 모양이군. @그래도 이제 그리 새로운 일도 아니지, 안 그래?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D196F3444513222047BE289A08FF9DC7"
msgid ""
"Anything eatin' you? A bartender's second job is listening to folk's "
"worries, so don't be scared."
msgstr "무슨 고민이라도 있어? 바텐더의 두 번째 일은 남의 걱정 들어주는 거라구, 그러니 겁먹지 마."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A371E1D44A83E8A41072E7B3E3611FF4"
msgid ""
"Lemme know if you're feeling... adventurous. I've got a few new drink "
"recipes to try out on anyone willing."
msgstr "혹시... 모험해볼 생각이라면 말해줘. 해볼 만한 새 칵테일 레시피가 있거든, 원하는 사람 누구에게든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::40B654EA437B2CD84643FEBC46FD84D5"
msgid ""
"I pride myself on offering a relaxing space for any weary souls. Stop by if "
"life's getting to you."
msgstr "지친 영혼에게 편안한 공간을 내주는 게 내 자부심이야. 사는 게 힘들면 한번 들러."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1D6ED7F94A9D1E8218C616A5408BC125"
msgid ""
"Sometimes, I swear I can hear meowing at night. Probably workin' too hard, "
"right?"
msgstr "가끔은 밤에 분명 고양이 울음소리가 들려. 아마 일을 너무 많이 하나 봐, 그치?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A75E3BE84B72570643F68B9F38C833F0"
msgid "You ever talk to Rob? Guy's got the gift of the gab for sure."
msgstr "Rob이랑 얘기해 본 적 있어? 걔는 확실히 말솜씨가 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::861B45BB4160EED6DB8E918576C67A5A"
msgid ""
"Landin's parties are always a good time. You should pop in next time he has "
"one."
msgstr "Landin의 파티는 언제나 즐거워. 다음에 열리면 한번 놀러 가봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A32210A6445CD7832E1EADB1E4238960"
msgid ""
"Did you know I dream a lot about being an olympic athlete? And I could do it"
" too; I climb the Tower to Project 12 every day."
msgstr "내가 올림픽 선수가 되는 꿈을 자주 꾼다는 거 알아? 사실 할 수도 있어. 매일 타워를 프로젝트 12까지 오르거든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B5B2FCB945E2E9A393AFAAA93A7D6B34"
msgid "Come on back anytime."
msgstr "언제든 다시 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ACA6C4D7436AD1D93A377F957B01ED69"
msgid "See you again."
msgstr "또 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::857D727C4FD5845D0D6919BAAAF5A8CE"
msgid "You're welcome back here any time."
msgstr "언제든 다시 오셔도 돼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E089FB7540EA8DC2EBD186BAB2BB4643"
msgid "Take it easy now."
msgstr "살살 가요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BC1D0A144824BD7BBDF20DB52BFC2BF3"
msgid "Grab a seat, and let's get you something to drink."
msgstr "자리 잡게, 마실 것 좀 가져다주지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A035F28547C7C593C3F28793A9796B7D"
msgid "Thanks! Next drink's on me."
msgstr "고마워요! 다음 한잔은 내가 살게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::490B914D4DB611CEC2C57D97A260C9DF"
msgid "There you are. Sit down, and let's get you relaxed."
msgstr "거기 있었네요. 앉으세요, 편안하게 해드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::570A74E1437E709C70B6C5A9764E0FE3"
msgid "Hey there. The usual?"
msgstr "어서 오세요. 늘 먹던 걸로?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B223AB2C4D04528DC401ECB9CA64B1E1"
msgid "Welcome back."
msgstr "다시 오셨네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E89C7B6F4D4015DBF54D8FBDDB0C49EB"
msgid "Thought it was about time you showed up again. What can I get you?"
msgstr "이제야 다시 나타날 때가 됐다 싶었어요. 뭘 드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0C5BFD2B48788366739D078DCF9CCF3A"
msgid "Take your time."
msgstr "천천히 하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C88AB67C42A822CAE7E7EE9C08B845E7"
msgid "No rush; I'll wait 'til your ready."
msgstr "서두르지 마세요. 준비될 때까지 기다릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3D084DDC4B8DA98C7AD822A207749D17"
msgid ""
"* Wade begins gently polishing a glass. He wears a warm smile on his face "
"with closed eyes. *"
msgstr "* Wade가 유리잔을 조심스럽게 닦기 시작한다. 눈을 감은 얼굴에 따스한 미소가 번진다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3AC5C70345E4385974C69B9220AB5FFB"
msgid ""
"* Wade starts humming softly. He leans back on the bar and looks off into "
"the distance with a knowing look. * "
msgstr "* Wade가 조용히 콧노래를 흥얼거리기 시작한다. 카운터에 기대어, 뭔가 아는 듯한 표정으로 먼 곳을 바라본다. * "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A22942A246DE3AB5489865AD3D77D1DA"
msgid ""
"* Wade begins shaking a cocktail mixer. The expert rhythm of his movements "
"is hypnotic. *"
msgstr "* Wade가 칵테일 셰이커를 흔들기 시작한다. 능숙한 리듬의 움직임이 황홀하다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A13E9F4747250FF36BB68BAC87B4096F"
msgid "One %item% comin' up."
msgstr "%item% 하나 나갑니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8D3DDCCE42CCC332F8F8FC9F1CFB8187"
msgid "Sure thing."
msgstr "물론이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::36FF85C0451A13D915D54097235D03D8"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9E925AFA4F4CB6D43F71F1A1126AADF7"
msgid "Order up."
msgstr "주문 나왔습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::14C704B8455DC64C559A429A7C7D4941"
msgid "All things in moderation, alright?"
msgstr "모든 건 적당히, 알겠지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D2F0359C46792D3890BE308386CE8204"
msgid "Can do."
msgstr "좋습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7A189CE44D6E828FE21C82A82C9698D7"
msgid "Be sure to take it slow."
msgstr "꼭 천천히 마셔요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B84083CA412C0C9C397D12A514A6E3AB"
msgid "Don't overdo it ok?"
msgstr "무리하지 마, 알겠지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5A525B3F4DBBD76C12984BB9ADB7618B"
msgid "Gotcha."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2EC9A6D445D626DE961971BB55A62242"
msgid "Comin' right up."
msgstr "바로 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::49C690EB487FB99C3DB8E7A8E91AED5B"
msgid "Stocking up for a party? Or just the winter? Heh."
msgstr "파티용으로 쟁여두시는 거예요? 아니면 겨울만 버티시려고요? 하하."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3ECDF4944AAAC8FB6F629CA2942F7BC1"
msgid "Could run a clinic with this much alcohol."
msgstr "이 정도 양주면 진료소를 차려도 되겠네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F7F5F631442D44AFA051CA95FAD85951"
msgid "Don't drink it all at once now."
msgstr "한 번에 다 마시지는 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FBFDA7E94AC968D000CB3BBEB32709B4"
msgid "No problem. Tossed that one out."
msgstr "문제없어요. 그건 버렸습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F92A50734EFB1AA691FE9C95C3B35735"
msgid "Sure. It's gone."
msgstr "네. 사라졌어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ECF0BB9045445DE0A08D1CA9FB109FC1"
msgid "Got it. Didn't need it anyways."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 어차피 필요 없던 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C427F0EA4EC0C41608D589B271A94E61"
msgid "No worries. It's trash."
msgstr "괜찮아요. 쓰레기통에 넣었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AE6F976D4D52BDB5DFA555AE71623A6F"
msgid "Here's your order."
msgstr "주문하신 것 나왔습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1EAF4AD04F72534C7435CEAE02F7E983"
msgid "Here you go, sunshine."
msgstr "여기요, 반짝이는 그대여."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::30535C304DC447ACF39E3BBF79104FD2"
msgid "Order up."
msgstr "주문 나왔습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::192F598749E74AD80F135DA96D518134"
msgid "Grab these drinks before we start selling them at higher prices."
msgstr "가격 더 오르기 전에 이 음료들 챙기세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::331B7A6C4728962458CF7ABF85CC31AA"
msgid ""
"I've heard the events are pretty enjoyable; grab a quick drink and check 'em"
" out."
msgstr "이벤트가 꽤 즐겁다고 들었어요. 음료 한잔 사서 구경해 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7992C8B14632183F9E53CC819386F9A1"
msgid "King Arthritis"
msgstr "관절왕"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D107900142C32889EB6E28848F043C64"
msgid "I'm on break.@ Make it snappy, hey?"
msgstr "지금 휴식 시간이에요.@ 빨리 말해주실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE7F648C485155FE0A3BBF92A6012C57"
msgid ""
"Did you know those pumpkins the management use AREN'T bio-degradable? @It's "
"amazing."
msgstr "경영진이 쓰는 호박이 생분해되지 않는다는 거 아세요? @대단하죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7C8F1CA944B6341FC565A4A7B94EC9D6"
msgid ""
"Managed to miss the Skeleton Bus, @now I gotta wait until next Halloween to "
"get home."
msgstr "해골 버스를 놓쳐서 @집에 가려면 다음 핼러윈까지 기다려야 해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E9A3D4CD49C45FA847F8B3A54CDB08D0"
msgid "Wish they let me keep my cauldron@; I was warm there at least."
msgstr "내 가마솥을 그냥 두게 해줬으면 좋았을 텐데@; 거기선 적어도 따뜻했거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ABEAFC9545DB44ED80D821A437E25F81"
msgid ""
"If I had any skin, @being left behind on this island would probably get "
"under it."
msgstr "내게 피부가 있었다면 @이 섬에 버려진 게 아마 속상했겠죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::68D56DA84B4B0205A6AF848DF5371FD8"
msgid ""
"Did you just ask if I was shook when I realized I got stranded here? "
"@....Well actually I was rattled."
msgstr "내가 여기 발이 묶인 걸 알았을 때 놀랐냐고 물으신 건가요? @....사실 꽤 흔들렸어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::859E15294A0E86CC0840ECA62A4B384B"
msgid ""
"Good thing I'm always technically chilled to the bone or I might get "
"hypothermia in the winter here."
msgstr "난 항상 뼛속까지 시원하니까 다행이죠. 아니면 여기 겨울에 저체온증에 걸렸을지도."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::55B5CA0C44AF06F6EC3FD5BE7D536197"
msgid "Bone jokes are all I have left."
msgstr "이제 뼈 관련 농담밖에 남은 게 없네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0461C1E3481EE6B1B9F025955E436EA0"
msgid ""
"Something something not very humerus of you.@ Do you need something or no?"
msgstr "뭐라 뭐라 상완골 얘기인가요.@ 용건이 있으신가요, 없으신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F141B6BE4163C108445E2B99EE5D54E2"
msgid ""
"Might rent out a condo since I'm gonna be stuck here for a bit. Drop on in "
"for a visit sometime?"
msgstr "여기 좀 묶여 있을 테니 콘도를 하나 빌려볼까 해요. 나중에 놀러 오실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1723E90841D99A9E07E0F797518E1193"
msgid "Another year passed and I still wasn't allowed to join the events."
msgstr "또 1년이 지났는데 여전히 이벤트에 참가할 수 없었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DAD9905148178B6E0B9053BDD0A53061"
msgid "Time to wait another year for the spookfest."
msgstr "공포 축제까지 또 1년을 기다려야 할 때네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::52464A4C4EBB8F2BD3788789DAE0260A"
msgid "Cool. See ya."
msgstr "좋아요. 나중에 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::99730F2840052D5A8AE768BD72056A80"
msgid "See ya around. "
msgstr "또 봐요. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0856D45D4CD08CD9B2A926A81E9A6B8F"
msgid "Welp, I'll be here if you need me. @Forever."
msgstr "뭐, 필요하면 여기 있을게요. @영원히요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28D77E2843A8FA7B4534CF9F5D45C968"
msgid "Later."
msgstr "나중에 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9E18F164D1FA373D28D7587816EA406"
msgid "Bring me some milk next time okay?"
msgstr "다음엔 우유 좀 가져다주실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B65F9F124707D00638CB8EB574C408A9"
msgid ""
"Sigh. I oughta buy a puzzle or something, it's dull sitting here all day."
msgstr "하아. 퍼즐이라도 사야겠어요. 하루 종일 여기 앉아 있으니 심심하네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4A0C6FEB4223BB50E23DF699E7EAE1F0"
msgid "Better late than never."
msgstr "늦게라도 하는 게 안 하는 것보다 낫죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9212866B432E267D075D25963B4E8329"
msgid "Here you go, @Enjoy that incredibly out of season %item%."
msgstr "여기요, @완전 제철이 아닌 %item%을(를) 마음껏 즐기세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1D39FD8B4BEC7048B6650E838348BD08"
msgid "You're late.@ Whatever, enjoy that %item%."
msgstr "늦었네요.@ 뭐 어때요, 이 %item%이나 즐기세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DF0277B64E62D5093FDDE0AD967C0971"
msgid "Not as spooky in broad daylight eh?"
msgstr "대낮엔 그렇게 으스스하지 않죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B1B739E14CF1D783007344ADB5085FEB"
msgid "Keeping the halloween spirit alive huh? "
msgstr "할로윈 정신을 계속 살리고 있네요? "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::661B899E4169E91147E4C9938B703696"
msgid ""
"Spookiness is a state of mind and not tied down to a specific month. "
"Remember this my friend."
msgstr "으스스함은 마음가짐일 뿐 특정 달에 묶인 게 아니랍니다. 기억하세요, 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1056119241CBFE7010BFA793442311AC"
msgid "King Arthritis"
msgstr "관절왕"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B45B508B470CF7C0BB5EEBAD39E4A5B7"
msgid "I've got a bone to pick with this heat."
msgstr "이 더위에 할 말이 있네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DA385BBA4CF4E1D3E39A3FB8883F58EC"
msgid "Milk builds strong bones, chocolate milk builds a strong tan."
msgstr "우유는 튼튼한 뼈를 만들고, 초콜릿 우유는 튼튼한 태닝을 만듭니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3091CD4E4C630917B503D3B88033A590"
msgid "Am I tickling your funny bone?"
msgstr "제 농담에 웃음이 나오나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::01418C6049C0028B2F0DAAADB2EC2B11"
msgid ""
"I've always wondered what it's like to feel the UV rays hit my bones. Feels "
"better than X rays."
msgstr "자외선이 뼈에 닿는 기분이 어떤지 늘 궁금했어요. X선보다 낫네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E326DA66445B87174F11F388E02CA39B"
msgid ""
"The time it takes for me to come up with another skeleton pun is bone "
"chillingly long."
msgstr "해골 농담을 하나 더 생각해 내는 데 걸리는 시간이 뼈를 오싹하게 할 정도로 깁니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::128BE63644C1229F963F85BE676F9A34"
msgid "#Do you like my puns? I got a skele-ton more!"
msgstr "#제 말장난이 마음에 드나요? 해골만큼 더 준비했어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1BC3293244AEA9D2609B019D8D84F61A"
msgid "Nice skin, you make it yourself? Real original."
msgstr "멋진 껍질이네요, 직접 만든 건가요? 정말 독창적이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::195AE8124B393F4B8CD7DA8B0D53F9CE"
msgid "#Ignore that imposter King in Celebrations. I am the real King."
msgstr "#축제의 그 가짜 왕은 무시하세요. 진짜 왕은 접니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E5BF53FF451AD2584B2C96B635850E3E"
msgid "@I'll always be with you. Remember, there's a skeleton in all of us!"
msgstr "@저는 언제나 당신과 함께할 거예요. 기억하세요, 우리 모두 마음속에 해골이 있답니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::46003DC34B53D42AA554F6AB17240BCC"
msgid "I'll be here. I actually can't move."
msgstr "저는 여기 있을게요. 사실 움직일 수가 없거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::74B2AAB147D02E11778C1589B9D776C3"
msgid "I am physically unable to get up."
msgstr "저는 물리적으로 일어날 수가 없습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A481B1884F0CC1102DD712A00A01FE79"
msgid "#Please bring me more milk"
msgstr "#우유를 더 가져다주세요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EA7F14604FEF14E2085079BF641E04C3"
msgid "My bones have melted to this chair."
msgstr "제 뼈가 이 의자에 녹아붙었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4AC003204318390015737F9E0895960E"
msgid "!rattle me bones"
msgstr "!내 뼈를 흔들어 봐"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9DB23DAE45A8A84B55AAF7B340C2B334"
msgid "Let me throw you a bone."
msgstr "뼈 하나 던져 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::22DBE7A94B90A8D9E9B0F7A61CBC1048"
msgid "This one was really stuck to my ribs."
msgstr "이번 건 정말 제 갈비뼈에 딱 붙어 있었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::969A7D7744883401589FE096E2EFB02B"
msgid "This better cheer you up."
msgstr "이번엔 기운이 나실 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D76120E343BC3776C8EE60A06309F376"
msgid "Cornelius"
msgstr "코넬리우스"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::211D41334185A993FE8B41B4EF15D43C"
msgid "I wish Debra would just leave me alone. She's got quite the bite."
msgstr "데브라가 그냥 날 내버려 두면 좋겠어요. 물어뜯는 솜씨가 대단하거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2C964C1A40096F080BB89D8B77453DE5"
msgid "I've got to hand it to PR, @they make for a wonderful lunch."
msgstr "PR에게 한마디 하자면, @점심으로 딱입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AA2E445B4760FC387DE3E7B930899C2F"
msgid "The new management has really been pushing my button lately."
msgstr "새 경영진이 최근 제 신경을 정말 긁고 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C168800348498447DDBB56AE1EA407E6"
msgid ""
"New around here, huh? I'd be careful if I were you, management wants a new "
"coffee boy."
msgstr "여기 새로 왔나요? 저라면 조심할 텐데, 경영진이 새 커피 심부름꾼을 원하거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::269893884E9D8276C91D4E800F546557"
msgid ""
"They've been working us to the bone. Just last week Fred turned into a "
"fossil.@ I miss Fred."
msgstr "우리를 뼈 빠지게 부려먹었어요. 지난주엔 프레드가 화석이 됐죠.@ 프레드가 그리워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD3A7846479D6B215E911D8B7F10E33E"
msgid ""
"Back in my day, the war was all everyone fought about. Now we fight the copy"
" machine."
msgstr "내 젊은 시절엔 모두가 전쟁 얘기만 했는데, 이제는 복사기랑 싸우네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B99165ED4E44DD84B42976A68E2B8E3B"
msgid "401k, pensions, tax, who needs them!"
msgstr "401k, 연금, 세금? 누가 필요하대!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B9782B4945F453A8CF31C3B46E8285AC"
msgid ""
"I'm in the business of cooking the books. @Hah, get it, @it's a dragon pun."
msgstr "내 일은 장부 조작이지. @하, 알겠어? @용 관련 말장난이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::24519E1942D84DC97158448A0980CD17"
msgid "I was never really good at jokes they said. But I do have an appetite."
msgstr "사람들은 내가 농담을 못한다고 했지. 하지만 난 식욕은 있거든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0016AAC54B3B9E455752C89A3EB43E50"
msgid "Last person who bossed me around ended up extra crispy."
msgstr "나한테 이래라저래라 하던 녀석은 바싹 익어 버렸지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6144B6C7439A049F33DFDF91EB57C06F"
msgid "I've had it with this Monday to Friday job."
msgstr "월요일부터 금요일까지 하는 이 일은 이제 지겨워."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9CA4C9C241110FA78F5B7B805D0AF6A9"
msgid ""
"Upper management keeps downscaling my job. Now all I do is make copies of "
"spongebob memes."
msgstr "윗선이 계속 내 일을 줄이고 있어. 이제 내가 하는 건 스폰지밥 짤 복사뿐이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7E02106E47862201B9555DB4B309BD5C"
msgid "Underpaid. Check. Underfed. Check. Wanna help with that second one?"
msgstr "돈은 적게 받지. 확인. 밥은 적게 먹지. 확인. 두 번째, 도와줄래?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::15B196114C33F81DA56638A655254FC0"
msgid "The best work ethic is no ethic at all."
msgstr "최고의 직업윤리는 윤리가 없는 거지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E8FFE5A4478E8AD39168049E2BA179A2"
msgid "Back to the grind."
msgstr "다시 일하러 가야지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9D849E3246DBFD4F7B7ADF94B7792265"
msgid "Better get back to it."
msgstr "다시 일하러 가는 게 좋겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7F197754429F430E0DB59DB2218C4906"
msgid "Boss is callin'"
msgstr "사장님이 부르신다"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C4E71A6E4E355860EAE5619B7D7FC56E"
msgid "* cracks knuckles * @Work time."
msgstr "* 손가락 꺾기 * @일할 시간."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::37948ADF44F3A86E633D0C98E1D0FCAF"
msgid "* Throws up %item% *"
msgstr "* %item% 토해냄 *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::935EBA364D55BCB1F8CAE8B39A03AB05"
msgid "Management says this one's for you."
msgstr "경영진이 이건 너를 위한 거라더라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DB0F2CFE479C756C43E69597975E5D84"
msgid "This is actually my job. And I hate it."
msgstr "이게 사실 내 일이야. 그리고 난 이게 싫어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::969A1B86421FAD490EA4E0A2B1EB22BE"
msgid "Duke of Ettington"
msgstr "에팅턴 공작"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E55B5AF4480F4886A43847BACCFFCC43"
msgid ""
"Back in my day we would just stab dragons, now they have JOBS? @What is this"
" world coming to?"
msgstr "내 시절엔 그냥 용을 찔렀는데, 이제 용들이 일자리를 갖는다고? @세상이 어디로 가는 거야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B1F76B34B86E5D53A2C8E85EB08133E"
msgid "The sun treats us well this day, it's worthy of praise."
msgstr "오늘 태양이 우리를 잘 대해 주는군, 칭송할 만해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::08BE579F4BBA73970C9BD6A74296BA72"
msgid "That dragon owes me a new pool tube."
msgstr "그 용이 내 새 튜브를 물어내야 해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B94CCC814CF7760B9A1AFD83E887767F"
msgid "Always wear sunscreen... or a helmet."
msgstr "항상 자외선 차단제를 바르세요... 아니면 헬멧을 쓰세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::496864B449162A9A019A16B97AF3C1AE"
msgid "This year I hope I'll be ready in time."
msgstr "올해는 제때 준비되길 바라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::470C3F9C40B3FA93004263AC9E8CAFA4"
msgid "Summer, fall, what's the difference?"
msgstr "여름이든 가을이든 무슨 차이야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47140E054D987BD3CEF47695F375D074"
msgid "I throw the best parties, everyone tells me that."
msgstr "내가 최고의 파티를 열지, 다들 그렇게 말해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::11EF2CBD400463CC1DD21EA612896778"
msgid ""
"Roasted dragon meat is absolutely delicious. What I'd do to get some..."
msgstr "구운 용 고기는 정말 맛있어. 한 점 얻으려면 뭐든 할 텐데..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB08CB5043B593A8D3F01DAEE7540B0A"
msgid "!Slap on some floaties and start swimmin'"
msgstr "!튜브를 두르고 헤엄치기 시작해"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AA35E1344793A373DADB6288F2505AB6"
msgid "There's two things I love, @summer and @summer."
msgstr "내가 사랑하는 두 가지, @여름 그리고 @여름."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E7CBCBF447AE171AA9B7EB88413BB1C3"
msgid "Hope your day doesnt drag-on. @Ha."
msgstr "오늘 하루가 길게 늘어지지 않길. @하."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4086E24B4CC6F1C911B89FA4F6C5CA48"
msgid "Never trust a dragon."
msgstr "용은 절대 믿지 마."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::76B5578B4277732B888BC79DA7C1DBDF"
msgid "Summer is nearly over!"
msgstr "여름이 거의 끝나가고 있어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0390B6014E0EF6283EFE66AD18C05F22"
msgid "I made this specifically for you."
msgstr "이건 특별히 너를 위해 만든 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4C45C65E48CC935E37FC5591C0B16BD4"
msgid "It's a bit burnt around the edges, sorry about that."
msgstr "가장자리가 좀 탔어요, 미안합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::59EBFBAC4316844A2D1408A8E833965E"
msgid "I left it out in the sun, but it still works."
msgstr "햇빛에 내버려 뒀는데도 아직 잘 작동해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3E3CC97E49E8C7E75491CA91170FD8FE"
msgid "Beelzebub's Cauldron"
msgstr "벨제붑의 가마솥"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5F39FE643C4AC0126819EB37FD90E49"
msgid ""
"*Evil Letters form in the roiling stew, @they drift together to form a "
"phrase: @@\"Suh dude?\" *"
msgstr "*끓는 수프 속에서 사악한 글자들이 생겨나 @서로 뒤엉켜 한 문장을 이룹니다: @@\"안녕, 친구?\" *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::798E378A47E00DF67E9FCC85BA0BB36B"
msgid ""
"*The cauldron glows vivid colors that meld between a sickening green and a "
"violent red. *"
msgstr "*가마솥은 역겨운 초록과 격렬한 붉은색 사이를 오가는 선명한 빛으로 빛납니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::85939FA8410C355633DB12A14F87ACDE"
msgid ""
"*You wonder where this cauldron came from, it bubbles in a way that suggests"
" it's none of your business*"
msgstr "*이 가마솥이 어디서 왔는지 궁금해집니다. 끓는 모습이 당신이 알 바 아니라는 듯합니다*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F3BC119245FF48FDA95862B2C42E5456"
msgid ""
"*You stare at the cauldron. @@The back of your eyeballs pulse with hatred "
"and vigor, and a feeling of unease washes over you. *"
msgstr "*가마솥을 바라봅니다. @@눈알 뒤쪽이 증오와 활력으로 고동치고, 불안한 기분이 밀려옵니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D20503104961916674517DB504D3D3BB"
msgid ""
"*The Cauldron boils hungrily. @@You're not sure why, @but you think feeding "
"it remains is a good idea. *"
msgstr "*가마솥이 굶주린 듯 끓습니다. @@이유는 모르겠지만 @유해를 넣어주는 게 좋을 것 같습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::18ED3E1F4ADF5A4A72C1108F5F785CE8"
msgid ""
"*Dark needs fill your soul as you stare into the violent stew. @You feel "
"compelled to feed it human remains. *"
msgstr "*격렬한 수프를 들여다보자 어두운 욕구가 영혼을 채웁니다. @인간의 유해를 넣어야 할 것만 같습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7AB06FFF4B841F76CF9504ACF1658C17"
msgid ""
"*Warped laughter crawls up from the cauldron. You can't tell if it's a manic"
" or tortured laugh. * "
msgstr "*뒤틀린 웃음소리가 가마솥에서 기어 올라옵니다. 조증인지 고통인지 알 수 없습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::63E60ECC44C2EE989FD94EBE3E0B62E7"
msgid "*You back away slowly from the cauldron. *"
msgstr "*가마솥에서 천천히 물러납니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D6156E3443B28FFE3168CB9DE37394CF"
msgid ""
"*What appears to be a jackdaw's skeleton floats to the surface of the "
"cauldron. You back away *"
msgstr "*갈까마귀 뼈대로 보이는 것이 가마솥 수면 위로 떠오릅니다. 물러납니다 *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7604563E47D4FFD90D5DC8A5E3ECD925"
msgid ""
"*You swear you hear a breathy chuckle from somewhere as you step back from "
"the cauldron. *"
msgstr "*가마솥에서 물러서자 어디선가 숨 섞인 웃음소리가 들린 것 같습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78A413474597AEF44E1761A450CC0042"
msgid ""
"*Voices resonate from the cauldron as you back away. They seem to be a "
"mixture of jeers and begging. * "
msgstr "*물러서는 동안 가마솥에서 목소리들이 울려 퍼집니다. 야유와 애원이 섞인 듯합니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD8DD0784412FA5509259FB155141386"
msgid ""
"*The second you speak you have a vision of a man hanging from the neck, "
"dancing upon nothing. When clarity returns to you, a %item% lies at your "
"feet. *"
msgstr "*말을 건네는 순간, 목매달려 허공을 차는 남자의 환영이 보입니다. 정신이 돌아오자 발치에 %item%가 놓여 있습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6A3EC0BC499E6747C064CB86330888E2"
msgid ""
"*After speaking to the cauldron, it sits silent for a time. @After a while, "
"an %item% floats to the top. You take it. *"
msgstr "*가마솥에 말을 건 뒤, 한동안 조용합니다. @잠시 후 %item%가 수면 위로 떠오릅니다. 가져갑니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D79D37FA47944B61E5D8B4AB12E7667A"
msgid ""
"*The cauldron lets out a shattering laugh as you speak to it. A few seconds "
"later you find a %item% in your hands. *"
msgstr "*가마솥은 말을 건네자 쩌렁쩌렁한 웃음을 터뜨립니다. 몇 초 뒤 손에 %item%가 쥐어져 있습니다. *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::118687CA4DF75A2B97C242892CCDB3AB"
msgid "I demand you bring me those remains now."
msgstr "당장 그 유해를 나에게 가져와라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09D7D5AD4C504906185837A31A226744"
msgid "#Bring @me @those @remains"
msgstr "#그 @유해들을 @나에게 @가져와"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B93CCA684F7BB28E289EDE980D6E20ED"
msgid "!SACRIFICE THE REMAINS TO ME AND GAIN THE RICHES"
msgstr "!유해를 나에게 바쳐라, 그러면 부를 얻으리라"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::640E046C460477282A230B95DD65616C"
msgid "God of Summer"
msgstr "여름의 신"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::25CEF5574CF528052D1D5985985CAE06"
msgid ""
"Drinking something hot or eating something spicy will help you sweat and "
"cool off. I wish I could sweat...."
msgstr "뜨거운 걸 마시거나 매운 걸 먹으면 땀이 나서 시원해질 거예요. 나도 땀을 흘릴 수 있었으면...."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::790A4D9B4DD6164E6D387D91C7D934F5"
msgid "This heat's making me feel snippy."
msgstr "이 더위 때문에 신경이 날카로워지네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B86259745139C04972728974A1BF3F5"
msgid "#Stay hydrated or@ p e r i s h."
msgstr "#수분을 섭취하세요, 아니면 @죽 음."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C056C1D04A1C9604759E2FAD231D6480"
msgid ""
"Feel that? That's the power of the sun hitting you with a million rays of "
"awesome."
msgstr "느껴지나? 이게 바로 태양이 수백만 개의 광선으로 내리쬐는 엄청난 힘이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::192AFC7041F55CE3FBA5BBA41B9D5954"
msgid "You wish you were as stylish as I am."
msgstr "너도 나만큼 멋졌으면 좋겠구나."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2A95551E474CB0E3ABCCA7B275F286DD"
msgid "Yes. I am the god of summer, what about it?"
msgstr "그래. 나는 여름의 신이다. 왜?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A283318C43E715DC0E188DA94203249F"
msgid "#You are not worthy"
msgstr "#너는 자격이 없다"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::22B80369469BD5B678E2E1880E2DDA47"
msgid "You look extremely thristy. I cannot help you with that."
msgstr "너는 극도로 목말라 보이는구나. 그건 내가 도와줄 수 없다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A472DBFE4FA41187810F349E45B83A7E"
msgid "Don't dunk your head into the sea."
msgstr "바다에 머리를 처박지 마라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2BB9262C429F39FA2EBF96B0DB016EC0"
msgid "The rumors are true. I am the greatest thing on this island."
msgstr "소문은 사실이야. 나는 이 섬 최고의 존재다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C269B46D41557235BCE6C88C33AEF3D7"
msgid "My size may be intimidating, but fear not, for I am your friend."
msgstr "내 몸집이 위협적일지 몰라도, 걱정 마라. 나는 네 친구다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E0A3D973470B7492C45E69B011012A71"
msgid "I have always been the best at crab walking."
msgstr "나는 항상 게 걷기의 최고였다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F44DE884EB8E1D9E0D54A8E0AD26F20"
msgid "I have traveled to many islands. This is now my home."
msgstr "많은 섬을 여행했다. 이제 여기가 내 집이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F2A583624659D6CDF19C22A130295A4A"
msgid "My muscles are natural and most definitely not for sale."
msgstr "내 근육은 자연산이고, 절대 팔지 않는다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C43F98FA4EE5AFCE3A5B8FA2B3FF685F"
msgid "My eyes are up here, pal. Just follow one of them."
msgstr "내 눈은 여기 있다, 친구. 그중 하나만 따라와 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3B3EB9D343DBDB3D077422868B5FE49C"
msgid "You are now speaking to the god of summer. Be careful what you say."
msgstr "너는 지금 여름의 신과 이야기하고 있다. 말조심해라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::005F3973419D150E523973B179F983E1"
msgid "#* snaps * I have decided that fall is now summer."
msgstr "#* 딱 * 가을은 이제 여름이라고 결정했다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CBDB35AB49E875070F36D6A162E386E3"
msgid "#I am great. You cannot change my mind."
msgstr "#나는 위대하다. 내 마음을 바꿀 순 없다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7AEBA27946281E4960BACE936982A9EF"
msgid "Due to popular demand, I have added more heat. You're welcome."
msgstr "많은 요청 덕에 더위를 더했다. 고맙게 생각해라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE5570944B77F7E6400C29B345BDF14E"
msgid "Crab you later."
msgstr "나중에 게 만나."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::52CB8FE242ECEE8320FDC89B66A9434B"
msgid "Stay cool, baby."
msgstr "몸조심해, 자기."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::10B6792F40F662FB23927A839A15E669"
msgid "Always wear sunscreen."
msgstr "자외선 차단제를 꼭 발라라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1C16350F46CEE52AC0D4AD8212AE3A98"
msgid "Seas the day. @I apologize for such a terrible pun."
msgstr "바다처럼 살아라. @끔찍한 말장난이라 미안하다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C8C943A2481B0E3FD9955C86BA3479E1"
msgid "The sun will consume all."
msgstr "태양이 모든 것을 삼킬 것이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B4BE1874DFA1C59A66A77B086AD4E19"
msgid "Always pay your sun taxes."
msgstr "해 세금은 꼭 내라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::34E2AB244A81279E5589E6ABDBF9349D"
msgid "Don't stare into the sun."
msgstr "태양을 똑바로 보지 마라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::164ACB0D4F4E910326DB57ABAC452AA3"
msgid "I don't want you feeling so crabby, so take this."
msgstr "네가 너무 짜증나 있을까 봐, 이걸 가져왔다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::03C48FB04F67451D43D88295DC597049"
msgid "I got you a crab-bag of goodies."
msgstr "게 가방 한 보따리 선물을 챙겨왔다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B35F2D1C400A2E19A418ECAA6E9C9681"
msgid "I've pulled this straight out of the sun itself."
msgstr "이건 태양 속에서 직접 끌어낸 것이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::43D66A0A4395FDF4E5797286ECA27A54"
msgid "* snaps * Enjoy this fresh creation of mine."
msgstr "* 딱 * 내가 새로 만든 작품을 즐겨라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1569662A409527232B4E13AAA7877ABD"
msgid "Milkman"
msgstr "우유 배달원"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B572ED4948A9BAC1BE0F5E9B192DBCCC"
msgid "Drinking milk on a hot day? You're asking for a hurt stomach."
msgstr "더운 날 우유를 마신다고? 배탈 나려고 작정했구나."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::46960BB24F45F48AED5CF5BEBA8F1E19"
msgid ""
"Too bad this car doesn't run on milk, 'cause that would save me a lot of "
"money."
msgstr "이 차가 우유로 달리지 않는다니 아쉽군. 그랬으면 돈을 많이 아꼈을 텐데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::098C34C347E51F210C2988B5A5EA1E8C"
msgid "This baby will get me around anywhere."
msgstr "이 녀석이면 어디든 갈 수 있다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D64E25CC42E32C7873E1E9B314A8EC6B"
msgid "* slaps * @The pioneers used to ride these babies for miles."
msgstr "* 철썩 * @개척자들은 이 녀석들을 타고 수 마일을 달렸다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E12002AB4DFE991C94E1EB992A6BB783"
msgid "!Beep. Beep. Move it!"
msgstr "!빵. 빵. 비켜!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::307180514C90A4B34CC9DABBB9D1F2A3"
msgid "#I know what I'm doing"
msgstr "#내가 뭘 하는지 안다"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D3CA2FB486B1394671D7096C449F6BD"
msgid "!I am one with the wind, watch as I soar"
msgstr "!나는 바람과 하나다, 내가 나는 모습을 봐라"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::31B0B77F4509A19CB94B1E9F3482CC71"
msgid "I honestly don't know how I got here. Can you push me?"
msgstr "솔직히 어떻게 여기 왔는지 모르겠다. 밀어줄래?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F6E35844230D3DF38E234B58A72BB09"
msgid "Is the car moving or is the world moving around it?"
msgstr "차가 움직이는 건가, 세상이 차 주위를 도는 건가?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4AE6A6954E4BE51FE9C4E1B05F387493"
msgid "I cut the brakes off this for maximum speed."
msgstr "최고 속도를 위해 브레이크를 잘라 버렸어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD206969446265DBCB80FBBE34C7C078"
msgid "I hold the record for fastest traveling dairy product."
msgstr "가장 빠른 유제품 이동 기록을 가지고 있지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ADF272A74A475963B79A518E9B2E663A"
msgid "I put my entire life savings into this bad boy."
msgstr "평생 모은 돈을 이 녀석에 다 쏟아부었어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1F595D1E41182590A59D0F915F9437C0"
msgid "#* imitates car noises * IT'S GOING TOO FAST"
msgstr "#* 자동차 소리를 흉내 낸다 * 너무 빨라!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A8F489F249986D352887078E92496684"
msgid "!I am the @s @p @e @e @d  @k @i @n @d"
msgstr "!나는 @s @p @e @e @d @k @i @n @d"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F8BA2794A2873CF6A4F56966C31B4BB"
msgid "#YoU goTta MoVe"
msgstr "#너 움직여야 해"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F69691A4A91C3AB4F755492227E5E60"
msgid "You better run before I run you over."
msgstr "내가 밟기 전에 도망가는 게 좋을 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FCC783734F53F85D3D688EA6F4F80625"
msgid "Move, or I'll run you down."
msgstr "비켜, 아니면 밟아버린다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7DBE36FB4941B18891A2B8989F68C199"
msgid "I am very late!"
msgstr "나 완전 늦었어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7E53ACC04BB84807D739A993868E3EA3"
msgid "#Get out of the way"
msgstr "#길에서 비켜"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA6A0B5A4BEA3A998F027CAF72690A48"
msgid "!P e d a l  t o  t h e  m e t a l"
msgstr "!엑 셀 풀 부 액 션"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::911C4C764C5EBCDF65210A975FDAEF93"
msgid "Don't worry it's a rental."
msgstr "걱정 마, 렌트카야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B022AA664CE77446E5CA9FA2E92EEDD9"
msgid "Sure, go ahead, @milk @me @dry."
msgstr "그래, 해봐, @milk @me @dry."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C00794D485FC6A0814A7AA97D2771B6"
msgid "I have no need for this."
msgstr "이건 필요 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FACD1E0B4597A51CC958E6A1932C6AB9"
msgid "This was just slowing me down."
msgstr "이건 그냥 나를 느리게 만들었을 뿐이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5F989CA04BB2DDAF4631A88F07A187E0"
msgid "Santa Claws"
msgstr "산타 클로스"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::61890DC240533DFCE92A0D85C3201839"
msgid "Ho, ho, ho!"
msgstr "호, 호, 호!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::576E00BF462548D0441E9A8A7167544B"
msgid "I'll help you spread the joy and be festive!"
msgstr "기쁨을 전하고 축제 분위기를 내도록 도와줄게!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F72626384C4DC2619B499094E658C8BE"
msgid "Ho, ho, ho!"
msgstr "호, 호, 호!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::653FE9214BD762DBB7F8398F8C9E8E66"
msgid "Holidays come but once a year."
msgstr "휴일은 일 년에 한 번뿐이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CF15F7EA47A1EB81986D23990330FCB5"
msgid "Yes, I'm the real Santa."
msgstr "그래, 내가 진짜 산타야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C6F96F014EEF0A7DD4AF538CEED8B4B1"
msgid "Ho, ho, ho!"
msgstr "호, 호, 호!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C51F3C44D5F8EF43811EAB0C0038713"
msgid "Happy holidays and have a great new year!"
msgstr "즐거운 휴일, 그리고 좋은 새해 보내!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F0A0431472F93BD9B885D851444B243"
msgid "I'm here to bring you holiday joy!"
msgstr "휴일의 기쁨을 전하러 왔어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C2EAD6894C99D9B30143209F5FAC871D"
msgid "It's the best time of the year!"
msgstr "일 년 중 가장 좋은 때야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE8D52F14A47F40B1DBF509473CB0971"
msgid ""
"The last guy didn't work out so well, so I ate him. Turns out, you become "
"the next santa when you do that."
msgstr "이전 녀석은 잘 안 풀려서 그냥 먹어버렸어. 그렇게 하면 다음 산타가 되는 모양이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::338F28A54203D02E3A47EBADD0EDD4B9"
msgid "The elves are great, really joyful, but they smell."
msgstr "엘프들은 훌륭하고 정말 명랑한데, 냄새가 나."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ECE881AE498CEE0697EADA8144EFC8E4"
msgid ""
"These claws aren't just for attracting mates, but they don't wrap presents "
"very well."
msgstr "이 발톱은 짝을 유인하는 용도만이 아니지만, 선물 포장은 잘 못 해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B2CA64BA473FD13FC71AA5BE9B2A75A0"
msgid ""
"I snapped the gingerbread man in half with my pincers once. Didn't mean to, "
"honest!"
msgstr "한 번은 집게로 진저브레드 맨을 반으로 쪼갰어. 일부러 그런 건 아니야, 정말로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07DA64164178F1758621FFA970B787E6"
msgid ""
"Don't forget to eat your children today. No wait that doesn't sound right."
msgstr "오늘 아이들을 먹는 걸 잊지 마. 아니, 그건 좀 이상하게 들리네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7CB8D5B3410C3F3C6073D1A69C2AD771"
msgid "I also had to eat Mrs. Santa Claus. I was hungry."
msgstr "산타 부인도 먹어야 했어. 배고팠거든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E14EA60A4AFF5F3087FDF08E850A1FAC"
msgid ""
"The holidays are all about surprising your friends with gifts, even if they "
"are corpses of other crabs."
msgstr "휴일은 친구들에게 선물로 깜짝 놀라게 해주는 날이야. 그게 다른 게의 시체라 해도 말이지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::08214DD54DE85BD1716483A600F29556"
msgid "Have a jolly time!"
msgstr "즐거운 시간 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B4BD8DD4A4674D9DB6008B30019FE9E"
msgid "#Happy holidays to all, and to all a good night!"
msgstr "#모두에게 즐거운 연휴를, 모두에게 편안한 밤을!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EEA450F04E2BEA29C053128D43B4564F"
msgid "See you soon!"
msgstr "곧 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89C092534695A93869FDD1AD8E7AB933"
msgid "The spirit of the holidays is within your heart."
msgstr "연휴의 정신은 당신 마음속에 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2732184247702922E9543E955FFA5E50"
msgid "Ho, ho, ho. @Enjoy your present little one."
msgstr "호호호. @선물 잘 받으세요, 꼬마야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C4D8DA0F4FE8EBA475BFF0847AF41A66"
msgid "* snaps claws * Have a present little one!"
msgstr "*집게발을 딱딱* 여기 선물 받아, 꼬마야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C3F64B1C4234459B0E0C8AB6611E3B5B"
msgid "This present has your name on it."
msgstr "이 선물에는 당신 이름이 적혀 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD2CC43041A9C3952A42B382FF3E84DB"
msgid "What a wonderful %item%! Hope you enjoy it!"
msgstr "정말 멋진 %item%! 마음에 드시길 바라요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0DD81335412E16C8AD12F1937BACF278"
msgid "Duke of Ettington"
msgstr "에팅턴 공작"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09B6012245D4EE53F5D58DB5DF1CA521"
msgid "!This weather is why I enjoy summer more than winter."
msgstr "!이런 날씨 때문에 난 겨울보다 여름이 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::96A78C4E47C3277F64D148967E704690"
msgid "!Could you bring me some hot chocolate?"
msgstr "!핫초코 좀 가져다줄래?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9885BD8D467DD77D10882E8E4CCCB6D1"
msgid "!It's freakin' freezing out here."
msgstr "!여기 진짜 얼어 죽겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::467E90B54248781E1E1AACA60382998C"
msgid "!They never told me about ice dragons."
msgstr "!얼음 드래곤 이야기는 한 번도 못 들었는데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::39955BE94688E65DF0DDF39EE101D315"
msgid "!I'm so cold."
msgstr "!너무 추워."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE3C3D1440550BABF54F0BB2AA7865CB"
msgid "!It's freezing out here!"
msgstr "!여기 얼어 죽겠어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::22E59DFF4591DA8425D40FBAABEAB2B5"
msgid "!I think I have frostbite."
msgstr "!동상 걸린 것 같아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0BA759B34D25C054548522B1FFFCBB1B"
msgid "!I've lost all feeling in my legs."
msgstr "!다리에 감각이 하나도 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::72566CE249FA9FE92C2B1E8ECBA96B7F"
msgid "!Does it feel like it's getting hot in here? I'm burning up."
msgstr "!여기 점점 더워지는 것 같지 않아? 열나 죽겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5BDDB847459B881DD10728A46FA23800"
msgid "!The Egyptians definitely had help from space aliens."
msgstr "!이집트인들은 분명 우주 외계인의 도움을 받았어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::14BB0421481C7AFAF57D05A707F727AF"
msgid "!I sure could use a tauntaun right about now."
msgstr "!지금 당장 톤톤이 있으면 좋겠다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0AC29EFF4363DA0B36EDFAA54016052D"
msgid "!The ice age is here. Embrace it or die."
msgstr "!빙하기가 왔다. 받아들이든가, 죽든가."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2895991E40523935F4685780C1D31AF6"
msgid "!Don't you think it's weird how a tropical island gets snow storms?"
msgstr "!열대 섬에 눈보라가 치는 거, 안 이상해?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::866A303D46A117EF8B9DCBB873108C7B"
msgid "!Ice to meet you."
msgstr "!만나서 반가워, 얼음."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::840070DC4C7420DDFD9A94AE9CE9BA1D"
msgid "!You need to chill out."
msgstr "!좀 진정해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5DA955D419FDC2AB01FAFBDF2F69808"
msgid "!Everyone...freeze."
msgstr "!모두... 얼어붙어라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F718EC534BD17285E6C0E388BE2220FC"
msgid "!If you need me I'll be frozen right here."
msgstr "!날 찾으면 나 여기 얼어 있을 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1A8C16184518598109763AAD975AD425"
msgid "!Please get me a coat."
msgstr "!외투 좀 가져다줘."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::84CDDCB64F63B9EB19394780F05D806E"
msgid "!I'm literally freezing."
msgstr "!진짜 얼어 죽겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::090590D64C2EEF93572BF7995477D3DA"
msgid "!I'll be here. @In the cold."
msgstr "!나 여기 있을게. @추위 속에서."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2B07AB21444C8B78B481AAA48DB786A3"
msgid "!Take this."
msgstr "!이거 받아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A10FD5D3402DA66F6842128844E0D9A0"
msgid "!Here, have this."
msgstr "!자, 이거 가져."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::193AC32C45BEAFEE23D239B815A32985"
msgid "!'Tis the season, I guess."
msgstr "!아마도 연말 시즌인가 보네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0743BCD44680DFCE31F971B3768442BE"
msgid "!IT'S TOO COLD TAKE IT"
msgstr "!너무 추워요 얼른 가져가요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A1F90FBB4C2A03F62161BCA3AC304456"
msgid "Cookie King"
msgstr "쿠키 왕"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4229FDB54CF115B7301C73BE036B3C85"
msgid "#I am the king of cookies."
msgstr "#내가 바로 쿠키들의 왕이다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88C4DE944A317FA36CEEB4B893B6E11A"
msgid "Don't dunk me in that milk."
msgstr "그 우유에 날 담그지 마요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C504EB6E4AF758E2A802819CDE732AD1"
msgid "9 times out of 10, I'm the guy they ask for cookie recipes."
msgstr "열에 아홉은 쿠키 레시피를 물으면 날 찾더라고요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9885E86541F3EFC2F9DF59A125A05752"
msgid "No, I'm not stale."
msgstr "아니요, 안 딱딱해졌어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::18B0D78044694095583243B2D9CE2BE1"
msgid "Don't you dare bite me."
msgstr "나 물지 말아요 제발."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FB687A5E45EB4D633B5AD9BD3C4B92CF"
msgid "If you bite me, I'll bite back."
msgstr "날 물면 나도 물 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::694382EE44F06F0F4E7D66BB79BCC45D"
msgid "Keep away from the chocolate chips buddy!"
msgstr "초콜릿 칩에서 떨어져요, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3215F5B042B345F46A3C35B92F1F8818"
msgid "The elves raised us to spread their message, but it was a lie."
msgstr "엘프들이 우리에게 그들의 메시지를 전하도록 키웠지만, 그건 거짓말이었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2DE6D79E431D20B22A13A48F99F31150"
msgid ""
"I led my brothers to rise up, and exiled the elves, so we could spread our "
"holiday cheer."
msgstr "나는 형제들을 이끌어 봉기했고, 엘프들을 추방해 우리의 연말 기쁨을 나누게 했어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6727EE494F2AD75BCCE308A0B2671A6D"
msgid "This milk is frozen anyway, just in case you had any ideas."
msgstr "이 우유는 어차피 얼어 있어요. 무슨 생각을 하시든 미리 말씀드려요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::64C91764414C41DB1E1CE8984C64044B"
msgid "Chip? Nah, that's my cousins name."
msgstr "칩? 아뇨, 그건 내 사촌 이름이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5FB2EDAD47574C615DE04687B7C019E0"
msgid "You know I'm always in the market for a future ex Cookie Queen."
msgstr "난 언제나 미래의 전직 쿠키 여왕을 찾고 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2EAF312C4F589896889C9E923E0B7924"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "또 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A6D4FC2F4B66E134B66297AD26D18620"
msgid "#And that's how the cookie crumbles."
msgstr "#인생은 그렇게 흘러가는 법이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6689595C4D310C172BEB60BBDA2C9D96"
msgid "If you agree not to dunk me, have this present."
msgstr "나를 담그지 않기로 약속하면 이 선물을 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57E4A3F74743FD532B8654BB148ACC33"
msgid "Enjoy this gift from me. @King of cookies."
msgstr "제가 드리는 이 선물을 받으세요. @쿠키들의 왕"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F68C3F3A496D9B7E210A9DBC70D445A8"
msgid "This is all I've got. Seriously."
msgstr "이게 내가 가진 전부예요. 정말로요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::601936164A311D861ECE02B7A4272F5D"
msgid "Marshy"
msgstr "마쉬"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::99FBDEFE4F36FFB8C9DEC6B1CB9AF90C"
msgid "!HI THERE"
msgstr "!안녕하세요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F2BA3DD4010F6F04FDEDFB59D12E9F6"
msgid "!I'M REALLY HAPPY TO MEET YOU"
msgstr "!만나서 정말 기뻐요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::348712CF4B14C8E2C288A594AB0C2265"
msgid "!I REALLY WANT A HUG"
msgstr "!정말 안아지고 싶어요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0194F21744A566643986C8B3039488DC"
msgid "!WOULD YOU HUG ME"
msgstr "!저를 안아 주실래요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C7DA599E47EFE3B97D37189C4275187A"
msgid "!THE ELDERS HAVE FORSAKEN ME"
msgstr "!장로들이 나를 버렸어요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6A60A22F4FA68B3ABC466BAE84D8B741"
msgid "!DRINK ME"
msgstr "!나를 마셔요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C1B02B6C40E2CAC56DE6B890ACE01FDF"
msgid "!DON'T DRINK ME"
msgstr "!나를 마시지 마요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::982330E84BFA8928F1785292E2D37D2E"
msgid "!I'M IN A CONSTANT STATE OF DELICIOUSNESS"
msgstr "!나는 늘 맛있는 상태예요"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AAAEF99D4BB8217C4ED481919273C323"
msgid "!HELLO FRIEND"
msgstr "!안녕 친구"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3CC7A66E4174FC171280F7B3FA35E86A"
msgid "!I LOVE SUGAR. EVERYTHING SUGAR"
msgstr "!난 설탕이 좋아. 모든 게 설탕이야"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EF99CE3649C014321C6FAD80A302F2DF"
msgid "!YOU'RE MY FRIEND"
msgstr "!넌 내 친구야"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::64A7A41E4E3D3093372FC39297D3207E"
msgid "!I'M NOT DECAF"
msgstr "!난 디카페인이 아니야"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F2E26A874CF449C3FC4B3C8455283CB5"
msgid "!I'M MADE OF PREMIUM ROAST CHICKEN"
msgstr "!난 프리미엄 통닭으로 만들어졌어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B477E2AD4884C884940B9A96448D1EA2"
msgid "!MY INSIDES ARE BURNING"
msgstr "!내 속이 타고 있어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D36B13741D0786A4077118070634FAB"
msgid "!I'M IN CONSTANT PAIN"
msgstr "!난 계속 아파"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0019978645C7F4618315F0928A1D88C1"
msgid "!CAREFUL, I'M HOT"
msgstr "!조심해, 난 뜨거워"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E70AEE5344688A8DA6D3BBA4F3753AD1"
msgid "!PLEASE DON'T LEAVE"
msgstr "!제발 떠나지 마"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BEFDF34D4A877CCCA14D2591D9AC0E7A"
msgid "!FRIENDS DON'T LEAVE LIKE THAT"
msgstr "!친구는 그렇게 떠나지 않아"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::730F9D7B4B7F75826A5B85A585CD7AF5"
msgid "!GOOD BYE"
msgstr "!잘 가"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0CFB8B9F49564BD46A39618CAA8C4FAC"
msgid "!HERE FRIEND"
msgstr "!여기 있어 친구"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::302A29144F52BE43B83C6DA794460610"
msgid "!ENJOY FRIEND"
msgstr "!맛있게 먹어 친구"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CB550AF84A68BAA61F4416B8C2B76C45"
msgid "!TAKE THIS FRIEND"
msgstr "!이거 받아 친구"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E28792A646C4155B2B96C9916B4C1512"
msgid "Tree"
msgstr "나무"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B528BA24892D62565E420899B713704"
msgid "I represent all that is tree."
msgstr "저는 모든 나무를 대표합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F358879044050864405A428A88A1E03A"
msgid "My brother committed treeson."
msgstr "제 형은 나무 반역을 저질렀어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DF5B8E0D483B27FFB906369C63B8F935"
msgid "I'm working to tree more compassionate."
msgstr "저는 더 다정한 나무가 되려고 노력 중이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7FB07C8D4DA33CA67DCA65911E147391"
msgid "I enjoy reading poetree, it helps with my nerves."
msgstr "저는 나무시를 읽는 걸 좋아해요. 마음이 편해지거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::86D65F164C6C5A6E23D37D9D77CDC554"
msgid "Enough with the flat-tree!"
msgstr "평평한 나무 타령은 그만해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ECE71A2840DA56AE74A9668E2AD87FA1"
msgid "Always beleaf in the holidays."
msgstr "명절에는 늘 나뭇잎처럼 믿어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::677DC8974F7F3C04D76C98A63C4A1C7A"
msgid "Where you from? I'm from Caleafornia."
msgstr "어디 출신이세요? 저는 캘리포니아 출신이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8ED79AF5439B0276779AE28E3149BDA5"
msgid "I know, I'm a pine in the butt."
msgstr "알아요, 제가 좀 가시 돋친 나무라는 거."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF04585A46995106AA62B2BA14A1E6C7"
msgid "Okay, that last one was acorny tree pun."
msgstr "좋아요, 방금 건 좀 도토리한 말장난이었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::71B57C6948EB01C282E9779AEB571D4A"
msgid "I'm all bark and no bite."
msgstr "저는 짖기만 하고 물지는 않아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F29ED1D46F490F72AC74586B4B66930"
msgid "My limbs feel so heavy."
msgstr "가지가 너무 무거워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9A0B45E74DE0E44972BBC891E253005D"
msgid "Wonderful weather, wooden you think?"
msgstr "날씨가 참 좋네요, 나무도 그렇게 생각하지 않나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B6A2CE9B4F87B05C375E2DAD8BE2F829"
msgid "Wood you help me out? @There's a walnut stuck in my trunk."
msgstr "저 좀 도와주시겠어요? @제 몸통에 호두가 박혔어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0543537E4315C508504CD488E38D90F0"
msgid "In my opineion, tree puns are life."
msgstr "제 생각엔 나무 말장난이 곧 삶이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::450283D048B81BD5CCF158B8A2661577"
msgid "Your behaviour has been satisfac-tree."
msgstr "당신의 행동은 참 만족스러웠어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57B731DB48A7F75FEB860AA030D267CF"
msgid "Please visit me regular-tree!"
msgstr "자주 저를 만나러 와 주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::234C1A334AD737FEDCC5629DD412B741"
msgid "Oakay, catch yea later!"
msgstr "좋아요, 나중에 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2DE712634A18E128FFFB1CAA4C42ABE4"
msgid "Bark if you need anything."
msgstr "필요한 게 있으면 짖으세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E9DEBD3242BF9F9D18E29CA49954CE74"
msgid "Enjoy that treeat!"
msgstr "그 트리트 맛있게 드세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C2E0F4E46B65A4557C951BAF76A11AA"
msgid "Let me just retreeve that for you."
msgstr "제가 그것을 트리검색해 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8081E28E4C4C7DF6C09DBFAC162B29A2"
msgid "Good things come in trees. But really you only get one item sorry."
msgstr "좋은 것은 트리에 있습니다. 그런데 정말 아이템은 하나만 받으실 수 있어요, 죄송합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7EF931944BA70383D1DF9CAC069AB11D"
msgid "This one is just treeumphant."
msgstr "이건 정말 트리엄프하네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EEAA6E3049A4B2E80E2012ADF5D97155"
msgid "This one comes with a compliment-tree gift card."
msgstr "이건 칭찬-트리 기프트 카드가 함께 옵니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F53E476E4C6A0465C93A6C910C8707FC"
msgid "Information"
msgstr "정보"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::474D8BEC4A876E766D0343B885FD1ED7"
msgid "Amy"
msgstr "에이미"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::914478F5421F4FC21B0DA1BC6518AF53"
msgid "Welcome to D.I.Y.! Here, you can do it all yourself. For once."
msgstr "D.I.Y.에 어서 오세요! 여기서는 모든 것을 직접 하실 수 있습니다. 이번 한 번만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::85C45E0E4CA394AD4B58499792A4553E"
msgid ""
"Hello there, builder! What are you thinking of making today? @That's a "
"rhetorical question, by the way."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 건축가님! 오늘은 무엇을 만드실 생각인가요? @참고로 방금 건 수사적 질문이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1963F40240C55736599AE4865576A970"
msgid ""
"Heya, creator of things — Let's get you some supplies! Because I'm sure as "
"hell not buying them with my money."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 만드는 사람님 — 자재를 챙겨 드릴게요! 제 돈으로 사고 싶지는 않거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D0480A34730A6374158B4AFFD2FA9E8"
msgid "Ready to build? We've got what you need!"
msgstr "건설할 준비 되셨나요? 필요한 건 다 있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::54F2E8F34FB70CBF9595639C8A378C1A"
msgid ""
"Hey! Hi. Hello. We've got building supplies, and you need them, so... @buy "
"them, I guess."
msgstr "안녕! 안녕하세요. 안녕하세요. 건설 자재가 있고, 필요하시죠, 그러니... @그냥 사세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D43D4EF74D18522F35D0B495C4D2F749"
msgid "You know, sometimes, I wish someone did it for me."
msgstr "있잖아요, 가끔은 누군가 대신 해줬으면 해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::19C0B786424C905BBE2CFAA8B4B75B39"
msgid ""
"For being one of the newest stores around, we sure get a lot of foot "
"traffic."
msgstr "가장 최근에 생긴 가게 중 하나인데도 손님이 정말 많네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C03E506B434B15F67B9FA88F957BE260"
msgid ""
"The things people put on these Canvases... @Sometimes, you just gotta look "
"down and pretend it isn't happening."
msgstr "사람들이 캔버스에 뭘 그려 놓는지... @가끔은 고개 숙이고 안 보는 척해야 해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C26FC1E74641B343C7BCBC99EE16C84E"
msgid ""
"I wish I had my own Condo, but, with the cost of living, I just sleep under "
"this desk."
msgstr "제 콘도가 있었으면 좋겠지만, 생활비 때문에 그냥 이 책상 밑에서 자요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::297D33904FDD901EB85B0CB3EDFF5210"
msgid "Can we fix it? @Yes, @you can."
msgstr "고칠 수 있을까요? @네, @당신이요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::735AF6F34AD366A4DEBC2C9A2969F001"
msgid "Don't hurt yourself too much."
msgstr "너무 다치지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B437DD364722173F2BC715A127C1D8A9"
msgid "Your Condo is gonna look great, probably."
msgstr "콘도가 멋지게 보일 거예요. 아마도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::795BBA5749C84CA8F8035DB66E78FE92"
msgid "Are you just gonna stand there, or...?"
msgstr "거기 그냥 서 있을 건가요, 아니면...?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::41F216F84ECD0BE65667818F541A9C1F"
msgid "Careful; that panel behind you is kinda loose."
msgstr "조심하세요, 뒤에 있는 저 패널이 좀 헐거워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C03FC44145DDD86FDD1F26A58A1F4217"
msgid "Err, thanks? I guess."
msgstr "어, 고마워요? 아마도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C94540E402689D2AF271489DF59E75A"
msgid "A house would be better, but I'll make do."
msgstr "집이 더 낫겠지만, 그럭저럭 버티죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::00AE016C41FA0338DA412CA7E86C3F1E"
msgid "I hope you don't expect me to pay for this."
msgstr "이거 돈 내라고 하실 건 아니죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::189707744F8B9A316E370280E4DB8576"
msgid ""
"Only the best materials for our favorite customer! @@Ugh. Why do I have to "
"say this?"
msgstr "우리 단골에게는 최고의 자재만! @@윽. 왜 이 말을 해야 하는 거지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BF8879304A2817DC6F9699BED90CC36B"
msgid "Because you didn't have enough items from here ALREADY."
msgstr "여기서 아이템을 이미 충분히 안 사셨으니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3CFBE40846ECDC6295D88C8B9E53E79E"
msgid ""
"Weren't you here yesterday? Actually, that might've even been five minutes "
"ago. Time is an illusion."
msgstr "어제 여기 오지 않으셨어요? 사실 5분 전이었을지도요. 시간은 환상이니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F5651CEB43CB8141D05C6F95A6759082"
msgid ""
"I'm glad that you're so interested in these virtually identical items, but "
"theres a non-existent queue forming behind you, so you're gonna have to "
"speed it up."
msgstr "이 거의 똑같은 아이템들에 그렇게 관심이 많아 기쁘지만, 뒤에 존재하지도 않는 줄이 서고 있으니 서둘러 주셔야 해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F63998CB462D59841009CA8B0F720D15"
msgid ""
"You know it's the \"Do It Yourself\" store, right? Not the \"I'm Going To "
"Take A Lifetime To Do It Myself\" store."
msgstr "\"직접 하기\" 가게라는 건 아시죠? \"평생에 걸쳐 직접 하기\" 가게 말고요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E7F8DD254E333A26596803BB0E36DC27"
msgid ""
"Don't make me call security. I have direct access to them through my flashy "
"helmet."
msgstr "경비를 부르게 만들지 마세요. 제 반짝이는 헬멧으로 바로 연락할 수 있으니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::117F629C4002D777F34CF29BF0A5B1F8"
msgid "That's a nice item you've got there. Hope you don't break it."
msgstr "좋은 아이템을 갖고 계시네요. 부수지 않으시길 바랄게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6FAF1E58402B35804155598C308621E0"
msgid "Keep them coming."
msgstr "계속 더 가져오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EA0F5B8440345D5E826F47B0D7531FC9"
msgid "Wow. Building an entire house, eh?"
msgstr "와. 집 한 채를 통째로 짓는다고요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::153EA348405EBC99BBB490A47A200C1D"
msgid ""
"I hope you don't need help carrying these out, because I'm not helping you."
msgstr "이거 옮기는 데 도움이 필요 없길 바랄게요. 전 안 도울 거거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4F5E0C62453E1B9F0BB080BFDD2590EC"
msgid ""
"Honestly, I'm kinda used to this by now, but that's a LOT of the same stuff "
"you've got here."
msgstr "솔직히 이쯤이면 좀 익숙해졌지만, 같은 물건을 정말 많이 갖고 계시네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2A6C52044719ECC16447DF88FA2FEA05"
msgid ""
"That's a lot of the same item, but this is \"Do It Yourself\" not \"I'm "
"Judging You A Lot\"."
msgstr "같은 아이템을 많이 사셨네요. 하지만 여긴 \"직접 만들어 보세요\"지, \"당신을 심하게 평가하는 곳\"이 아니에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::034BFD77430A3DDEB55997A8558B97EB"
msgid ""
"You sure are buying a lot of stuff. Hope you aren't making anything weird."
msgstr "물건을 정말 많이 사시네요. 이상한 거 만드는 건 아니겠죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::71442FEB4D8B9E36954087AFA2403B74"
msgid "Scaling back?"
msgstr "규모를 줄이시나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9D13C4494ED6AA21B2C69383B1465062"
msgid "Eh, that one is flimsy anyway."
msgstr "에, 그건 어차피 약하잖아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E6258EED499F72F6A5BF73BCECAEC001"
msgid "Ugh. I can't be bothered to put that back into storage right now."
msgstr "으. 지금 그걸 다시 창고에 넣을 기운은 없네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5CF8D17F47D9B2C0F8396DBFD629CBD1"
msgid "Careful; it's heavy."
msgstr "조심하세요. 무거워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28F7A2854266522C8A64F9A0DFC7921C"
msgid "No refunds."
msgstr "환불은 없습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::445399C248D35692D09A988B5A2E8990"
msgid "\"Do It Yourself\" but CHEAPER!"
msgstr "\"직접 만들어 보세요\"가 더 CHEAPER!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57ACC2274870EC340F05CEB6CC2521C4"
msgid ""
"I promise you that our items have not suddenly become more flimsy due to "
"this sale."
msgstr "이번 세일 때문에 물건이 갑자기 약해진 건 아니라고 약속드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA733941488B6812E8CBE4B4D4333742"
msgid "I'm not going anywhere, so... @go enjoy yourself."
msgstr "전 어디 안 가니... @가서 마음껏 즐기세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::49C66E954678D438336A81A73F8A845C"
msgid "Franky"
msgstr "프랭키"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D86DFAE497630ED789EF1B0D5E8D477"
msgid "Woof. Nice to meet ya!"
msgstr "왈! 만나서 반가워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::36F3C2854A65DAC7618A6C908A55DE04"
msgid "Oh @a new customer!"
msgstr "오 @ 새로운 손님이네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A9EAAA1145E810E48F38FBBBCE3A5282"
msgid "Woof. Nice to meet ya!"
msgstr "왈! 만나서 반가워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C8D0511746D333AE4E1292B5A0213573"
msgid "Freshest doggies in town!"
msgstr "동네에서 가장 신선한 핫도그!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F86A9FC34C9AD921414F509556E9EE3A"
msgid "Hungry? I'm cooking up delicious food for ya!"
msgstr "배고프세요? 맛있는 음식을 만들고 있어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1C8F4D124089DCB44FF0129C313C5FA7"
msgid "Hellroo rand relcome!"
msgstr "핼로오 잘 와따요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C4C1CE8400F35FB8CB971945FE891D2"
msgid "Oh @a new customer!"
msgstr "오 @ 새로운 손님이네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5B1D59344272F1394167EA4768FEF08"
msgid "These doggies are just warming up."
msgstr "이 핫도그들은 아직 데워지는 중이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D875786B4D1DB3C21ED73B9BA2C6AC55"
msgid "Question of the year: is it wrong for a dog to sell hot dogs?"
msgstr "올해의 질문: 개가 핫도그를 파는 건 잘못된 걸까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::334AC5BE48281D3B68E6818667BE9FEF"
msgid "Just cookin' away. It'll be done soon."
msgstr "그냥 요리 중이에요. 곧 완성돼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4017F35D4C18CBC2AA9370A2E445DC07"
msgid "We only sell premium hot dogs here!"
msgstr "여기선 프리미엄 핫도그만 팔아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEF4292D480E43E7E8E147A68F4E49EB"
msgid "Personally, I'm a vegan, but I know this is good stuff."
msgstr "저는 비건이지만, 이건 정말 맛있는 물건이라는 건 알아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::68FCBCFD4D6AE7FD004F6AA32F8A7509"
msgid ""
"One day I'll be better than Kalleira. That cat sells illegal goods. @It's "
"unfair competition!"
msgstr "언젠간 Kalleira보다 잘될 거예요. 그 고양이는 불법 물건을 팔아요. @불공정 경쟁이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::38A5EB144827AF8D4ABD999984109015"
msgid "#I'm very busy cooking, as you can see."
msgstr "#보시다시피 요리하느라 아주 바빠요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF61A84E44CF35FF79769C9900C71F49"
msgid "Do you know how to turn this thing on?"
msgstr "이거 켜는 법 아세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::577B6E3A4D39E35A27ABD1BCE9EC372E"
msgid ""
"Did you notice those ball pets rolling around? If that were me, I couldn't "
"keep my lunch."
msgstr "굴러다니는 공 펫들 보셨어요? 제가 저랬다면 밥을 다 토했을 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::693B78C544103374EE89A2851D1A26F7"
msgid ""
"Some people call this red slop 'catsup'. You know what I would call it? @ "
"...Something else."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 이 빨간 죽을 '케첩'이라고 부르더라구요. 제가 뭐라고 부를 것 같아요? @ ...뭐, 다른 이름이요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D79BFDD44CDF3DA9F99F2A2E446E95C"
msgid ""
"I hope you don't mind some hair on your hotdog. @Or a few bites out of it."
msgstr "핫도그에 털이 좀 붙어 있어도 괜찮으시죠. @아니면 몇 입 베어 물어도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B88E31164ADE57F688F6E1BD09BBA569"
msgid ""
"I want to own a whole franchise some day. Imagine that. Burgers, fries, you "
"name it."
msgstr "언젠가는 가맹점을 하나 차리고 싶어요. 상상해 보세요. 버거, 감자튀김, 뭐든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4ABF205E4E1E3205C5DC8487B0DC3B2A"
msgid "So. @Sniff anything smelly lately?"
msgstr "그래서. @요즘 냄새 나는 거 맡은 거 있어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::84E0FA20405BEBCC505F6CBCF18F022B"
msgid "So. @Dig up anything neat lately?"
msgstr "그래서. @요즘 멋진 거 파본 적 있어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::569C541E45ADA8B0C8E247A0D627F914"
msgid "So. @Catch any balls recently?"
msgstr "그래서. @요즘 공 받아본 적 있어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B736FDAB4885184E17E238B349F092F7"
msgid "So. @Chew anything new recently?"
msgstr "그래서. @요즘 새로운 거 씹어본 적 있어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE4272E84A3EA3DC1536239175360A9C"
msgid "Bye-bye!"
msgstr "바이바이!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD0EF15D4A20D6545129559E69C6670A"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "또 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::59D5C8D5434A6C5016D88188640798F0"
msgid "Woof."
msgstr "멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6E88A96747696D64CF5200887595FF17"
msgid "Hey... @I smell something in your pocket."
msgstr "이봐요... @주머니에서 뭔가 냄새가 나요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF744EC34EF39E630A24518AAA0B3F2C"
msgid "Nice day outside, isn't it?"
msgstr "밖에 날씨 좋죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7435E3094235743048268BB1417C275D"
msgid "Hey!! It's my best friend!"
msgstr "야!! 내 가장 친한 친구다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F2C0347E4D90C7ED89A51D9CDE8A9A1B"
msgid "Welcome back, pal!! I really missed you!"
msgstr "다시 왔구나, 친구야!! 정말 보고 싶었어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::857B53884648E329D713D49111B7CE3C"
msgid ""
"If I wasn't stuck here all day, I'd be following you around all the time."
msgstr "하루 종일 여기 갇혀 있지만 않았다면, 항상 너를 따라다녔을 텐데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0739A5DF410D1D95634EF6A74865C218"
msgid "Okay, I'm bored now."
msgstr "좋아, 이제 심심해졌어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED7D79B8435840934E073FA15509958C"
msgid "That looks delicious!"
msgstr "맛있어 보이네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::877EC6FE43D2F45804894BBF68CCBEDE"
msgid "Mmm. Yummy."
msgstr "음. 맛있겠다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::286D140D4E8D5A3342367189055FBD23"
msgid "Yummy."
msgstr "맛있겠다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7EFC5BA34FBD1243570AF2B5123DEB75"
msgid "Yum!"
msgstr "냠!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8DAF9DF74881C4457408748E65D2C893"
msgid "You gonna share some with me?"
msgstr "나랑 좀 나눠 줄래?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::23651D5D462E008C7F4989A9AD9434C0"
msgid "Jeez you are really cravin' that!"
msgstr "세상에, 그거 정말 당기나 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C6E138E847DD1C81CC03EABBE668F649"
msgid "Drink responsibily!"
msgstr "책임감 있게 드세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B6A3FEF4FCDF2CDA37FAF84F299F2EC"
msgid "Woof. No worries, I'll save that for later."
msgstr "멍. 걱정 마, 이건 나중에 먹으려고 아껴둘게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B97CA3464AEF274156088986E87A6D37"
msgid "Snack for me! Thanks!"
msgstr "내 간식! 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::207029BD4FCD7DEB41E7A29917EF8C6C"
msgid "Can't let that go to waste, I'll dig up a hole for that one!"
msgstr "그냥 버릴 수 없지, 이건 묻어둘 구덩이를 파야겠어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0C84998141FEA878D248C1AF734D9D9A"
msgid "Hope you like 'em!"
msgstr "마음에 들면 좋겠네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E649C7AB4AAB8FACB6AF92B181909022"
msgid "They're the best in town!"
msgstr "동네 최고라니까요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9027A274C6F02C886E36D954CEB58B9"
msgid "WOW! Do you hear that? Fun events are happening!!!"
msgstr "와우! 들려요? 재미있는 이벤트가 열리고 있어요!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::227DF6A6461671F1808D7C82AD22D61B"
msgid "Jane"
msgstr "제인"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FBD9FC93447B6E0508D9C7BCFB0E980B"
msgid "Welcome!"
msgstr "환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4AE9A81946263D28F985FFBCDBC733C9"
msgid "Welcome to the freshest place on earth!"
msgstr "지구에서 가장 신선한 곳에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2624F1344ACEA17D127BD7864F89D1C4"
msgid "Welcome back! We've got more fresh goods today."
msgstr "다시 오신 걸 환영합니다! 오늘도 신선한 물건이 가득해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::15C6B8B5442125E702CF5CB8C24BAF45"
msgid ""
"There's something about bananas and apples that makes them taste so good!"
msgstr "바나나와 사과는 뭔가 있어서 이렇게 맛있나 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::04B8ECA4492FF54F047C1097522B0BC6"
msgid "Man, it's hot today!"
msgstr "세상에, 오늘 진짜 덥네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BFE2631D438971051F9430A408BC60ED"
msgid "It's not easy being this fresh all the time!"
msgstr "항상 이렇게 신선하게 있기가 쉽지 않다니까요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F28541D744AA21ABAE3C30BCE31C6FEA"
msgid "We've got everything fresh, always!"
msgstr "저희는 언제나 모든 걸 신선하게 가지고 있어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C3FB9D9B40FE25EEE09780949FB9942D"
msgid "My manager requires me to say fresh at least 15 times per customer."
msgstr "점장님이 손님 한 분마다 '신선'을 최소 15번 말하라고 하셔요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::489C523D481118EC1A3CBE93374C04F1"
msgid "I'm worried my manager is watching. Can you look?"
msgstr "점장님이 보시는 것 같아 걱정이에요. 좀 봐주시겠어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E1001FCE42BD321C3A8FC38D7848CAE9"
msgid "Oh, thank goodness. If I have to say fresh one more time..."
msgstr "아, 다행이다. '신선'을 또 말해야 했다면..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::22D303C94E45CA96576CFD8EC8CB5A0D"
msgid "The last employee who did not say fresh vanished..."
msgstr "'신선'을 안 말한 마지막 직원은 사라졌어요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2812B8BE43CA67E0EECD9DA166C8834F"
msgid "Who provides us with the skulls?"
msgstr "해골은 대체 누가 주는 걸까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BDCBF244A4F3E7E951745894280DAF7"
msgid "Everything here is so fresh and so clean."
msgstr "여긴 모든 게 정말 신선하고 깨끗해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0ADF2C294F96F6959EA60DA501C55C11"
msgid "See you later!"
msgstr "또 뵙겠습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D645C5A41C25B755B3161AAA9E08A04"
msgid "Have a fresh day!"
msgstr "신선한 하루 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DBDD4D0B4C9A56578C60429ACE03E618"
msgid "Welcome to Fresh! I sell the freshest ingredients."
msgstr "신선 신선의 '신선'에 오신 걸 환영합니다! 가장 신선한 재료를 팔아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3C45FA6342AA2D3F938799961FA9F49F"
msgid "Wow, that's really fresh! Thanks!"
msgstr "와, 정말 신선하네요! 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD4E44074270EF6C2D090AB250C4B224"
msgid "Hopefully this %item% can blend! Thanks!"
msgstr "%item%이 블렌더에 들어갈 수 있으면 좋겠네요! 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::82FE317E4A357AAEA3AD0CAAC8D26143"
msgid "Hey, it's you, keeping it fresh! Hope you like today's selection!"
msgstr "어, 바로 당신이군요, 신선함을 지켜주시는 분! 오늘 물건에 만족하시길!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9E97296343E9705E66474B82283261A5"
msgid "These items aren't going to stay fresh for long!"
msgstr "이 물건들은 오래 신선하게 못 가요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A4E7255A4571EB8301B9CA9BEA2C6C8B"
msgid ""
"Valued customer, I legally must inform you that I am the three-time staring-"
"competition champion and that you have no chance of winning this. Fresh."
msgstr "소중한 고객님, 법적으로 고지해야 합니다. 저는 눈싸움 대회 3회 우승자이며 고객님은 이길 가능성이 없다는 점을요. 신선."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::317CD17C4DDE8CB6446D1DBF9FE4DCF8"
msgid "Fresh pick!"
msgstr "신선한 선택!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3154DBB14139309976B7E2A43441E9B1"
msgid "Keeping it fresh, nice!"
msgstr "신선함을 지켰네요, 좋아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DCEF8435469EDA47EA0F3D978D45CCDA"
msgid "I can see you enjoy the fresh taste of %item%!"
msgstr "%item%의 신선한 맛을 즐기시는군요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB0261AB4C6E44E8D3434688982CE46D"
msgid "I'm not sure how that got there, but it's fresh!"
msgstr "어떻게 거기 들어갔는지는 모르겠지만, 신선해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88F63D08434B6D79FB796B84375E0085"
msgid "No worries!"
msgstr "걱정 마세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FA2EA7A042397127F12F1983BB51C8F5"
msgid "Thanks for buying!"
msgstr "구매해 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::858B5BD1431E16ADCCD7BFA3A74948EC"
msgid "The freshest sale is ongoing!"
msgstr "가장 신선한 세일 진행 중!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0EE94D52447AE058BE34BC9867C71E25"
msgid "Grab these fresh items now while the sale is going!"
msgstr "세일하는 동안 이 신선한 물건들을 지금 잡으세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0FA582E2433CF42727078C931970F9EC"
msgid "Sales stimulate the economy to its freshest point!"
msgstr "세일은 경제를 가장 신선한 지점까지 끌어올립니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5CE7E394D77AD0B08686DB1EA1DBBA3"
msgid "Don't pay full price during this period; we're having a sale!"
msgstr "이 기간엔 정가로 사지 마세요; 세일 중이거든요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8E51C15A4089F031D030B7A5527F0506"
msgid "Our fresh ingredients can wait; there's an event!"
msgstr "신선한 재료는 기다릴 수 있지만, 이벤트가 있어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1A80915E4C1CA70BFA2B9F9565DEEA5F"
msgid "All Knowing Pufferfish"
msgstr "모든 것을 아는 복어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A592BA0E433FBD942B79B3958CB1E25A"
msgid "#It is certain."
msgstr "#확실합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47D55C55462389E174F506BABE9A3295"
msgid "You will be rewarded."
msgstr "보상을 받을 것입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9A5257974AC4B9E070B81BB55CFE5969"
msgid "Maybe."
msgstr "아마도."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C63FBA404E1B872306EC1EA0BB3F3818"
msgid "You will have great losses on the wheel of money."
msgstr "돈의 수레바퀴에서 큰 손실을 보게 될 것입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6883FA2D47A26876B32CAC8266699AE4"
msgid "You will have great losses."
msgstr "큰 손실을 보게 될 것입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6BDC0CC642D076EBDE049EA4B6C16C51"
msgid "All will be fine."
msgstr "모두 잘될 것입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8D1CC6C14E8794DB91C996835575ECEA"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::96B3DCD6412CC9154F18F794DD945815"
msgid "No."
msgstr "아니요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE9225F34DBFE46B3EDE82A467809B2D"
msgid "You are talking to a fish."
msgstr "당신은 물고기와 대화하고 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::90BB0A1343D03AB6D4EA6893F3ACAF5F"
msgid "The odds are in your favor."
msgstr "승산이 당신 편입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7C5F4C24480ED7194CB2D693CADF2572"
msgid "Chances are good."
msgstr "가능성이 좋습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CAFCD8E54060F7CE9D0D1996FB89D037"
msgid "Chances are bad."
msgstr "가능성이 나쁩니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E3B05A2D4D8B3F3A79A4D2A5C0796E51"
msgid "Your fate is sealed."
msgstr "당신의 운명은 정해졌습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::17642ED7407F839DC75627ABA9DC62EB"
msgid "Your fate is uncertain."
msgstr "당신의 운명은 불확실합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::338BAAB8487E1F42151C15A652766305"
msgid "It is uncertain."
msgstr "불확실합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D7D81CDD4C5C559DF295ECB8B6554A17"
msgid "Try again later."
msgstr "나중에 다시 시도하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EF931AF6420671B3D50CE9B87E73F6AB"
msgid "We've updated our privacy policy."
msgstr "개인정보 처리방침이 업데이트되었습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEF3966F4983114F02FE2F9A7544268A"
msgid "Fortune favors the bold."
msgstr "행운은 용감한 자의 편."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D42DA0545FC6FFA456591916D5D7AF5"
msgid "You are beautiful."
msgstr "당신은 아름답습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED4401F840A577EA4B501BA2862D3CD8"
msgid "Bet it all on red."
msgstr "전부 빨간색에 걸어보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::95ADC5CD4760838A28F9938EAC97AD32"
msgid "Better luck next time."
msgstr "다음엔 행운이 있기를."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A96FD1254DD58F52BCE6A58D568B54CA"
msgid "Probably."
msgstr "아마도."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8EFB6E5240C3E2526F611D99C73DEBE4"
msgid "I believe so."
msgstr "그렇게 믿습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::277A4CDF44273B489BF85C8480ED6B68"
msgid "The odds are slim."
msgstr "승산이 희박합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3044E25C4E10F33B35A4709FD51BAC10"
msgid "She"
msgstr "그녀"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF2CC70A4E5004FAFB0DF587C8BA3F67"
msgid "*seal noises* @ Orf Orf!"
msgstr "*물범 소리* @ 오르프 오르프!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ADBBBD3446623A46DC5C1AA4E3382365"
msgid "Welcome to the adopt-a-pet shore store!"
msgstr "반려동물 입양 해변 상점에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2F1B95614BA996F92B376F950010E0F9"
msgid "Welcome, friend!"
msgstr "환영합니다, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7C9456D14A00A377E3B4EF98741947E4"
msgid "*seal noises* @ Hello!"
msgstr "*물범 소리* @ 안녕하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE01D0564E4E79E7ABF2128ACA81985B"
msgid "#Welcome, friend!"
msgstr "#환영해요, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DBF16C98488EE73EE989F4908186A3B1"
msgid "I just looove swimming, don't you?"
msgstr "저는 수영을 정말정말 좋아해요, 그쪽도요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::43B126EB4011B77913B7F6A75DC23B8F"
msgid "You just gotta get out there and find a porpoise in life!"
msgstr "밖으로 나가서 인생의 목적을 찾아야죠!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2469A1F04EBF4E5C1A7273BA36D86C60"
msgid "I love my friends!"
msgstr "제 친구들이 너무 좋아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5A2917A6490F05FD0B6117B74386D1FE"
msgid "Do you like swimming? Swim with me!"
msgstr "수영 좋아하세요? 저랑 같이 수영해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::575E9ACF4C58E596A42E559B20A05A0A"
msgid "Let's take a dive someday!"
msgstr "언젠가 같이 다이빙해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89FAB39E404257BFC221CA85E4067850"
msgid "I absolutely love your look!"
msgstr "당신의 모습이 정말 마음에 들어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::923A42214F3C11D3F32D90AE87D30710"
msgid "#I love fish!"
msgstr "#저는 물고기를 사랑해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E4C24B674EF424383713F3B836B0EA7B"
msgid "It's so great to meet someone so friendly!"
msgstr "이렇게 친절한 분을 만나서 정말 기뻐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::142D69C04F749D2660D03FB638213A4E"
msgid "#Thank you for being my friend!"
msgstr "#제 친구가 되어줘서 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B22ACCC84E43E39C0E1D2CBE32E0F7EC"
msgid "The water is so refreshing!"
msgstr "물이 정말 상쾌해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3DEE584B4D8CC2CDAE63ACBFC5EE6E08"
msgid "It's such a lovely day!"
msgstr "정말 기분 좋은 날이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CE3CFFA44A376B98ABB3CCAA3C5170EA"
msgid "Let's swim!@ Nofin is better than swimming with a seal!"
msgstr "수영해요!@ 물범과 수영하는 것보다 나은 건 없어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BAF1A2624E109D5EB7452D85E458ABE7"
msgid "Where have you fin all my life!?"
msgstr "평생 어디에 숨어 있었어요!?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5F1B45DC41C428F4E6BAF58D7F62CDA7"
msgid "Thanks for visiting!"
msgstr "방문해 주셔서 감사해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4FD44960479CB865361C748413297DA3"
msgid "You're always welcome here!"
msgstr "언제든 환영이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7AC0CAB64D96935763F6C9857B05F48A"
msgid "I loved talking with you!"
msgstr "이야기 나눠서 정말 즐거웠어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::832E0DCE4D5EBE4F9A5B189F9689FC10"
msgid "I'll be here!"
msgstr "여기 있을게요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::95A971D44AEA1BC06CB7EFAEB46B2FA6"
msgid "*seal noises*"
msgstr "*물범 소리*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0F7C8BB945EC6DCCFAF680814C4887F2"
msgid "*honking*"
msgstr "*끽끽*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::69E21E1D4A1D8F3E8D6F5FA891D6EDB2"
msgid "*honks angrily*"
msgstr "*화난 듯 끽끽*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::08FC0468414ED92F74C24785977B3B8D"
msgid "Weclome, friend!"
msgstr "어서 오세요, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F2C9FA2E47649C43FF70228063A32CAC"
msgid "*seal noises* @ Hello!"
msgstr "*물범 소리* @ 안녕하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6A66375C43FAB20BF92FD8B454D20F3B"
msgid "Hope you enjoy our selection of friends!"
msgstr "저희 친구 컬렉션을 즐겨 주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5B4EE6B34F75AB30AC624DB35834EFD5"
msgid "Enjoy your new friend!"
msgstr "새 친구와 즐거운 시간 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::732B7C06443FCA1EC1837E829FB5EF4A"
msgid "Gourdon"
msgstr "구르동"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DBE706B046D2B8B5BF6C989D642F971C"
msgid ""
"The store's closed. I can't find my little pup. ...She's always poking "
"around the shrubs back at home."
msgstr "가게는 문 닫았어요. 우리 강아지를 못 찾겠어요. ...집 뒤 덤불에서 늘 뭔가를 찾아 헤매거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2E078D3741B6C87D27A5B1B3A4160637"
msgid ""
"You want to buy something? How can I run my store without Lil' Pup? Even the"
" sound of the waves can't relax me today."
msgstr "뭔가 사고 싶으신가요? 꼬마 강아지 없이 어떻게 가게를 운영하죠? 오늘은 파도 소리도 위로가 안 돼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::79EE41F64CB2851E00F7F6B762549B09"
msgid ""
"Maybe I should head up to the lighthouse to get a better view. My pup could "
"be anywhere on this island... @and she usually sets up the shop."
msgstr ""
"등대에 올라가서 더 넓게 보는 게 좋겠어요. 이 섬 어디든 우리 강아지가 있을 수 있으니까요... @그리고 보통 가게는 강아지가 "
"준비했죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8DB95B6D49CCAB17A83B698CAEEC89C4"
msgid ""
"%name%? Sorry, I'd love to sell you something but I'm worried sick about my "
"pup. I can't just leave my inventory laying around. "
msgstr "%name%? 미안해요, 뭘 팔고 싶지만 강아지 걱정에 정신이 없어요. 물건만 두고 갈 수도 없고요. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::79E177604CE0B3A9AA4ACEB24438C455"
msgid "Could you keep an eye out for her?"
msgstr "강아지 보이면 좀 알려 주실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E869D6FC428C466B6894CCA200130F1A"
msgid ""
"I may be smiling, but my soul is frowning. My pup has left me! I saw her "
"heading towards the shops... Maybe she was scoping out the competition?"
msgstr ""
"웃고 있어도 마음은 울고 있어요. 제 강아지가 떠났거든요! 가게 쪽으로 가는 걸 봤는데... 혹시 경쟁자를 살펴보러 간 걸까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5247E90D4A7783C6B9DB4383D98E7E2A"
msgid "Please find my Lil' Pup..."
msgstr "제 꼬마 강아지를 찾아주세요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::046F18EE455AD9FA298C019780421163"
msgid "Oh, Lil' Pup..."
msgstr "아, 꼬마 강아지..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9C3C229E4F7BBF9852B9F897EE64CC82"
msgid "Lil' Pup"
msgstr "꼬마 강아지"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5DEA7E943E4A6F23E37C2852E54F38B"
msgid "Why, hello there."
msgstr "어머, 안녕하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A040BB73489787A40A276EB88ED206D5"
msgid "I am a puppy."
msgstr "저는 강아지예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1E2201D74B077A96D9BFEFB0F48BE5BD"
msgid "How lovely it is to be a puppy."
msgstr "강아지란 참 좋은 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE549814485BB1B856A689B92CD206E9"
msgid "Have you seen my father, Gourdon?"
msgstr "우리 아버지 고든을 보셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F23CAAF34854B06320C82A8522F8BE83"
msgid "I am a very good puppy."
msgstr "저는 아주 착한 강아지예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EAFC6EFC492510AD0CD928AB9FA9C45E"
msgid "I am surprised you made it through the labyrinth."
msgstr "미로를 통과하다니 놀랍군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F905993454DD918FB906AB3756600F6"
msgid "Every other puppy in existence is inferior to me."
msgstr "세상 모든 강아지는 저보다 못해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F0628C844DC4DDDE0C2BA8ACE4CB2E58"
msgid ""
"You may think I am just a little puppy who got lost, but I was on a mission "
"to find something very, very important. "
msgstr "그냥 길을 잃은 어린 강아지라고 생각하시겠지만, 저는 아주아주 중요한 무언가를 찾는 임무를 수행 중이었어요. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7DBF9C4048FEE6A0A4D69484D03228F8"
msgid "Tax return season is coming very soon."
msgstr "곧 세금 신고 철이 다가와요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5807CB9045579F6773837584CB3B70CA"
msgid ""
"Our receipts flew into this strange labyrinth while someone might have been "
"trying to eat them. It wasn't me."
msgstr "누군가 영수증을 먹으려던 사이에 영수증들이 이 이상한 미로로 날아갔어요. 저는 아니에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E9CA626142980CF4037C5BA97BC8E4B6"
msgid "Woof!"
msgstr "멍!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CF8CA72C4815D7CBAD4C94877CF90D99"
msgid "Borf."
msgstr "버프."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::22E70A3848899A4B738B1C97CF994759"
msgid "Did Gourdon send you? @No? @I should return to him and set up shop."
msgstr "고든이 보내셨나요? @아니요? @그에게 돌아가서 가게를 차려야겠네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EEF9F08B48916E368602B68BF2AE0A55"
msgid "Gourdon"
msgstr "구르동"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A0C367DC405D6D27976EF2A4B241E684"
msgid ""
"Well, look who it is: %name%, the savior of Lil' Pup! Take a look at my "
"scares. @I mean wares."
msgstr "이런, 누가 왔나 했더니: 꼬마 강아지의 구원자 %name%이잖아요! 제 공포 물품을 좀 보세요. @아니라 상품이요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DFFA90CE4E91A77F8E5E0EA56D28C581"
msgid ""
"Well, look who it is: %name%, the savior of Lil' Pup! Take a look at my "
"scares. @I mean wares."
msgstr "이런, 누가 왔나 했더니: 꼬마 강아지의 구원자 %name%이잖아요! 제 공포 물품을 좀 보세요. @아니라 상품이요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B3373E24478E50C6ADA1D1A6904DB0C4"
msgid "Having a phantom-tastic night, %name%?"
msgstr "유령 같은 밤 보내고 있나요, %name%?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE55EAE642EEB3B0050585B6A848D7B4"
msgid "Bet you're glad you found Lil' Pup! You're haunting this place!"
msgstr "꼬마 강아지를 찾아서 다행이죠! 이곳을 유령의 집으로 만들고 있네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2568EE0543DB992B8B0C7092A16F6548"
msgid ""
"Trick-or-treat? Hey, as long as you've got Ghoul Coins, enjoy my wares "
"however you want."
msgstr "사탕 줄래요, 장난칠래요? 구울 코인만 있으면 제 물건을 마음껏 즐기세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5B0C0D684624DFEA34DA41AA9879A5DA"
msgid ""
"Be sure to check out the brain in the jar! @Lil' Pup found it in an alley."
msgstr "병 속의 뇌도 꼭 구경하세요! @꼬마 강아지가 골목에서 찾은 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6BBC5B204217F3E9E516CDB0AA170EB2"
msgid ""
"How... How'd I get all of these wings? @Listen, kid; we all have our "
"secrets."
msgstr "어... 어떻게 날개가 이렇게 많이 달렸냐고요? @이봐요, 누구에게나 비밀은 있는 법이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AECEDF194F002C4107FB70990FF410BF"
msgid ""
"Look around at all these ghoulish delights. @We've got leaves... @and... "
"plasma... @and Death's cloak! Lots of variety, just for you."
msgstr ""
"이 유령 같은 진열품들을 둘러보세요. @나뭇잎도 있고... @그리고... 플라스마... @죽음의 망토도 있어요! 당신을 위해 다양한 "
"물건을 준비했죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::63A779DD49870380EE0177B4F452813A"
msgid ""
"Lil' Pup and I have traveled all around the world with our shop. @It's "
"always Halloween somewhere."
msgstr "꼬마 강아지와 저는 가게를 들고 전 세계를 돌아다녔어요. @어딘가는 항상 할로윈이거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::844F871E41CE8925C6FF13909A5A9156"
msgid "Nice costume. Maybe you want to throw some leaves on it?"
msgstr "멋진 의상이네요. 거기에 나뭇잎을 좀 던져볼래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2EDDE9AB4AD7D9C5F5DC21A3E88BF1C5"
msgid "Lil' Pup spent hours collecting these leaves. And bats."
msgstr "꼬마 강아지가 이 나뭇잎들을 모으느라 몇 시간이나 걸렸어요. 박쥐도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8E763DD44E9F020C58DD6FAC684A0891"
msgid ""
"I'm willing to bet you've never had a little ball of light with wings "
"following you around. @Tonight might be the night when that changes."
msgstr "날개 달린 작은 빛의 구체가 따라다닌 적은 없으실 거예요. @오늘 밤이 그게 바뀌는 밤이 될지도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57D3341E4FB1DD3EEFEA8DADCD1CFA09"
msgid "Yes. I sell Jack-o'-Lanterns. @@@What?"
msgstr "네. 잭오랜턴을 팔아요. @@@뭐라고요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9327AF5541C6F91C08EB29844DBBAAC3"
msgid "You'll be back."
msgstr "다시 오실 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DCE235364EE5C4E136BCA3A92265D529"
msgid "Thanks for finding my pup."
msgstr "제 강아지를 찾아주셔서 감사해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0CBBC1E34E35500F717194AB9FA26B22"
msgid ""
"*You stare into Gourdon's triangular eyes. @You see the inside of a "
"pumpkin.*"
msgstr "*고든의 삼각형 눈을 바라봅니다. @호박 속이 보입니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::170A9B8E45A1C2D1BE68ADA8E9467244"
msgid "See something you like?"
msgstr "마음에 드는 게 있나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4AAA36F54C097AB2F91DE495C6108CD8"
msgid "Boo-tiful choice."
msgstr "무시무시하게 좋은 선택이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BD62D804A9BBC7FDB028B902DACA7FD"
msgid "Horrific. @You have excellent taste."
msgstr "끔찍하네요. @안목이 훌륭하시군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DEF29CF24B30017337860AA060475C22"
msgid "You'll pay for that! @With your ghoul coins."
msgstr "값을 치르게 될 거예요! @구울 코인으로요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A0ECC19F47373031DE652A9F4FE9E50B"
msgid "Well, well, well. Rich and gallant! "
msgstr "이런, 이런, 이런. 부자에 용감하기까지! "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D8551A34491351E1311D90A0FED52CE8"
msgid "You save my dog and clear out my store? @@Thank you."
msgstr "내 개를 구하고 가게까지 정리하다니? @@고마워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B2C10674717DFFD8D74A8B6AD157335"
msgid "There's more where that came from."
msgstr "이런 건 더 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BC5A798B4838128006DD0F86DB501A13"
msgid "!Stop! You're scarin' me! @Just kidding. Buy all you want."
msgstr "!그만! 놀라잖아요! @농담이에요. 마음껏 사세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA51CDE847BED88F75754CA3349735AF"
msgid "Well. You only live once. @Allegedly."
msgstr "뭐, 인생은 한 번뿐이니까요. @그렇다고 하더라고요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7F50A20A4B984228617F8A8299C1633D"
msgid "Ghouled doing business with you."
msgstr "거래하게 되어 영광이었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D68870E54CF8F738BFFAD4A166FBD008"
msgid "Spectretacular purchase."
msgstr "유령처럼 멋진 구매였어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::250800674014C700E08499A055AC53D0"
msgid "You have my thanks."
msgstr "감사히 받겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A1320924426E76DF175B7C841E3A6BF8"
msgid "Rachael"
msgstr "레이첼"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::61F63D2C4440D859331837A9EA2C1906"
msgid "I've got a bone to pick with you! @Just kidding. Was that not humerus?"
msgstr "당신에게 할 말이 있어요! @농담이에요. 방금 그거 웃겼나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D516F8024524F49A3F07D1A35DCC8DB1"
msgid "It's looking tibia great night tonight! "
msgstr "오늘 밤은 정말 대단한 밤이네요! "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4176B66C41A51B0B8BC1728910ED4D94"
msgid ""
"I'd keep jawing with you, but I think we're getting a-head of ourselves."
msgstr "더 떠들고 싶지만, 우리 좀 앞서가는 것 같네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::37A449E14C6144FFACB4D29B1A954436"
msgid ""
"Have you seen that handsome pile of bones in Treasure Cove? @Me neither."
msgstr "트레저 코브에서 그 잘생긴 뼈더미 봤어요? @저도 못 봤어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E65C22934960A2DE70A0AEBA2F0A2A84"
msgid "Like my cloak? @It's made out of real, authentic void."
msgstr "내 망토 마음에 들어요? @진짜 공허로 만든 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F55B16E14E3C5C95B2A9B7AE1DB7CEE4"
msgid "Do you want to know why my eyes are different colors? @Excellent."
msgstr "내 눈 색이 왜 다른지 궁금해요? @훌륭해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CDFF9D9E48147C51465BD7979CBA4443"
msgid "How much candyflesh have you consumed, humanflesh? Was it good?"
msgstr "사탕살은 얼마나 먹었어, 인간살? 맛있었어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::753DA88B48AAA148899BB5A6E40C1A42"
msgid "I've hidden some treats in my cloak. @They aren't for you."
msgstr "망토 속에 간식을 숨겨 뒀어요. @당신 거는 아니에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5A5D33514AE0461B9802C384194FBC9B"
msgid "Have you met Gourdon yet? I wonder if he's found his hound. @Heh."
msgstr "고든 만나 봤어요? 사냥개를 찾았는지 궁금하네. @흐흐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F43409574CDEF238465930A829111BA9"
msgid "Goodbye. I appreciate your time, from my head to my... uhhh..."
msgstr "잘 가요. 시간 내줘서 고마워요. 머리부터 내... 아, 음..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8AA3BB924D888F6AC8E3EE83AF2FBB56"
msgid "Bye-bye, flesh beast."
msgstr "잘 가, 살덩이 짐승."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B511C8A421CBC9919D17BA79FDA7F52"
msgid "So. @You're leaving? @That's no skin off my nose!"
msgstr "그래서. @가는 거예요? @난 하나도 안 아쉬워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D7767B5A4B63C5B7D3F4569AD3135EE8"
msgid ""
"This %item% has a lifetime warranty. @Maybe you should take some notes."
msgstr "이 %item%은 평생 보증이에요. @좀 배워 두는 게 좋을 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6BE76FEE498B9735A23A43BFA1650C12"
msgid "I've been d y i n g to give this to you! Heh heh heh."
msgstr "이걸 주려고 죽을 만큼 기다렸어요! 히히히."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DEEDA2844E2AB7387C7CAEBCD3CF6070"
msgid ""
"I haven't seen the %item% in four-thousand years. @Welp, I guess you can "
"still have it!"
msgstr "이 %item%은 사천 년 만에 보는군요. @뭐, 그래도 그냥 드릴게요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::26EC40414737D5FD598672A25D7B6929"
msgid "Cerebrum Gigantus"
msgstr "거대 뇌"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::970C397B401F5B620FEF449FAD9D62AA"
msgid "I see all. I know all. "
msgstr "나는 모든 것을 봅니다. 모든 것을 압니다. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D60775164ED014485C29CBA5F07F3A8D"
msgid "Do you feel a draft?"
msgstr "바람이 새는 것 같나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E1FD267046CBC537E69499B8A9DD877A"
msgid "I'm sensing you want something."
msgstr "당신이 뭔가를 원한다는 걸 느껴요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C3C5304B4CBD325C65AFE89CEEFAC037"
msgid "Don't be nervous. That's my job."
msgstr "긴장하지 마세요. 그건 제 일이니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::150FC987492E8A42C9A44EBD47E36BD4"
msgid "I know: @a brain outside of a skull. How u n n e r v i n g."
msgstr "알아요: @두개골 밖의 뇌. 정말 으 스 스 하 군 요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EEA09CF147CDBD1D3BFBA985EB1A4123"
msgid "Do not fear my goopy slime."
msgstr "제 끈적한 슬라임을 두려워하지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC70CF6247BB2ECC750E3FA7E1B64700"
msgid "Human thigh bones are stronger than concrete. @Scary, right?"
msgstr "인간의 허벅지뼈는 콘크리트보다 강해요. @무섭죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::95E2F49C419B9C3C3D51EE9861D026A1"
msgid ""
"You know, I was once a famous scientist. @Albert Einstien? @Sure. @Then "
"everyone clapped, and now I'm a floating brain."
msgstr "저는 한때 유명한 과학자였어요. @알베르트 아인슈타인? @그럼요. @그리고 모두가 박수를 쳤죠, 지금은 떠다니는 뇌예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::48E97C4C48E1DF1D4ACE7AB65BDF8596"
msgid ""
"Freeing my mind was the best thing I ever did. @...I wonder where my body "
"is."
msgstr "마음을 해방한 건 제 인생 최고의 선택이었어요. @...제 몸은 어디에 있는 걸까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E3F6AD64D3194DE47A04BBFC41E3C49"
msgid "Why do I have eyebrows? @...Why do you have eyebrows?"
msgstr "왜 저한테 눈썹이 있을까요? @...당신은 왜 눈썹이 있죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::05934ACC4325B61D4F42F3A90572B426"
msgid ""
"Is tricking and treating all there is? @What about... @thinking... @and "
"being..."
msgstr "장난치고 대접하는 게 전부일까요? @그럼... @생각하는 것... @그리고 존재하는 것은?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F84EEC2D48B1E866D42EC7A5EBFE8521"
msgid "#Ciao."
msgstr "#안녕."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BBD20A3404051CE3CB773A961D6D99C"
msgid "#I'll keep you in my thoughts."
msgstr "#당신을 마음속에 담아둘게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::02A62B244EA2BFACE6EBE8BB37643604"
msgid "#Remembering you should be easy."
msgstr "#당신을 기억하는 건 쉬울 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::542E510C4980699CE52CA0B9A7A91B61"
msgid "#Knowledge is power, as is this %item%."
msgstr "#아는 것이 힘이죠, 이 %item%처럼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D833EF594DE795ECB2A9DCA08608FEB1"
msgid "#It would be wise for you to accept the %item%."
msgstr "#%item%을 받는 게 현명할 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::70CC04734B0AAE1DECD66387F039F6FD"
msgid "#It's only rational to part with this %item%."
msgstr "#이 %item%을 넘기는 게 이성적이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5276B1C54219A1FB5DCDE7A59C6D6EEB"
msgid "Barney"
msgstr "바니"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::42E00B4446165A78DAFCD39A6D8BAE9E"
msgid ""
"#I'm destined to lie in this bean bag for all eternity. Not that I'm "
"complaining..."
msgstr "#나는 영원히 이 빈백에 누워 있을 운명이야. 불평하는 건 아니지만..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
#. no-translate  # 수동
msgctxt "::4013DDD543FEBE960360E8889B9D93BD"
msgid "#.........................."
msgstr ""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::688116BD4556FA827D91478A8BB56FE2"
msgid "#..........................huh?"
msgstr "#..........................응?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28C2A411495A3643307A5495A9497EF7"
msgid "#I could get a job. I could also not."
msgstr "#직장을 구할 수도 있지. 안 구할 수도 있고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::32AF8E1B470FF3F5357334898BF80A5C"
msgid ""
"#There's no point in going anywhere... I can just stay here all day, all "
"night."
msgstr "#어디 갈 필요도 없어... 밤낮으로 그냥 여기 있을 수 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::32F6CA68405AA4A9B9587BA19F04D2D0"
msgid "#Please don't peel me."
msgstr "#제발 나 껍질 벗기지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::80919C4C48000E6DFA2120ADE8D84E9B"
msgid "#How I grew my hair? @Effort. @Somehow."
msgstr "#내 머리카락이 이렇게 자란 비결? @노력. @어쩌다 보니."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD44B69448F97BC437B06DA53DCF4E3B"
msgid "#P o t a s s i u m   p o w e r ."
msgstr "#칼 륨 파 워."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E7E90A4C44D0DAE70F94D2A10B2100C0"
msgid "#Straight or curved, we're all the same inside..."
msgstr "#곧거나 굽었거나, 속은 다 똑같아요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D9308DC4481625452138B830F5F4BEC"
msgid "#I'm as chill as a cucumber... heh heh.... wait..."
msgstr "#난 오이처럼 쿨하지... 헤헤.... 잠깐..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::69860A3F4EE055EEC6C16E9A2FAD37CF"
msgid ""
"#They tell me I gotta be ripe to make it in this world... but I'm always "
"greened out."
msgstr "#이 세상에서 성공하려면 잘 익어야 한대... 하지만 난 늘 덜 익었어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FA57015F4311FD09FEFD0F95F8E82DD2"
msgid "#Hey... got any chips?"
msgstr "#이봐... 칩 있어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B9D10A545844F6741F048B6A986478B"
msgid "#I'm smiling because I'm thinking about cats."
msgstr "#웃고 있는 건 고양이 생각 중이라서야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E097EDE24B00BC73D1E5FCA12615B2C3"
msgid "#Peace."
msgstr "#평화."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D0F8F974C97E5BF54B09DAD1F24DE60"
msgid "#Seeya."
msgstr "#또 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47CCF78B486C60005E65A58021099516"
msgid "*Blissful noises.*"
msgstr "*행복한 소리.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B7AE2D524803518045EBF89AEA539C4D"
msgid ""
"#Here, have this. I don't need anything in return. I'm just here to spread "
"happiness to everyone..."
msgstr "#자, 이거 받아. 대가로 필요한 건 없어. 그저 모두에게 행복을 나누려는 것뿐이야..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A4F11B604E62322C2758EE8D289E1ED8"
msgid "#Take this. All I want is this beanbag."
msgstr "#이거 받아. 내가 원하는 건 이 빈백 하나뿐이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2F35CE67484FE986E14190BEF31F22D7"
msgid "#Here. It's no longer appealing to me."
msgstr "#여기. 이제 나한테는 매력적이지 않거든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3398AB1D40C8B5DAB1A1B0BB7127D254"
msgid "Gabreyel"
msgstr "가브레이엘"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0D84B2E9488F6742AF02DDBC967E2129"
msgid ""
"#Eye-deally, we could chat for hours, but it looks like you have an event to"
" get back to."
msgstr "#아이디얼리, 우리 몇 시간이고 얘기할 수 있겠지만, 너는 돌아가야 할 행사가 있는 것 같구나."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2A03F89942288F8DA6B0EE8318413637"
msgid ""
"#When your body is an eye, it's hard not to see all the good in the world."
msgstr "#몸이 눈이면 세상의 모든 선함을 못 볼 수가 없지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9ED6A4E04FFB636D0F0E709C27C79684"
msgid ""
"# %name%, do you have any eye drops? The wind beneath my wings keeps flying "
"into my eye."
msgstr "# %name%, 안약 있니? 내 날개 아래 바람이 자꾸 내 눈으로 날아드네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F0DB32E4D36B7503953AEB997F4473B"
msgid ""
"#I have a vision that you're going to have a good time tonight. Let's see "
"that through."
msgstr "#네가 오늘 밤 즐거운 시간을 보낼 거라는 비전이 보여. 그걸 끝까지 지켜보자고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CFB23C0F447EF3FD1C555D87B51480A3"
msgid "#I've been watching your progress. I can't look away!"
msgstr "#네가 나아가는 모습을 계속 보고 있었어. 눈을 뗄 수가 없네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::24C1DB794CD1753792A200981E8E4C9F"
msgid "#You can see me? @Really?"
msgstr "#나를 볼 수 있어? @정말로?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B4F4E844DBEBEA78F13509512888B67"
msgid "#Have you seen Daisy over in the garden? @I wonder if I scare her."
msgstr "#정원에 있는 데이지 봤어? @내가 무섭지 않을까."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A06014C3424D1DF46F85788142BF835B"
msgid "#Salutations! Eye've been expecteyeing you. @Was that too much?"
msgstr "#안녕하십니눈! 눈으로 기다리고 있었어. @너무했나?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::351704F44A3FC16D938E03A0A22A6EEE"
msgid "We'll meet again!"
msgstr "또 만나요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F23B3414B0CAB8FB5A5CE887002A88C"
msgid "It was good to see you."
msgstr "만나서 반가웠어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B234AB9844E88E56B5A0C1AF48B53A89"
msgid "See you later, %name%."
msgstr "나중에 봐요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DF2DB17F44A0ADDD0BC2B59C4BF521E9"
msgid "%name%, take this. @I figured you would like it."
msgstr "%name%, 이거 받아요. @마음에 들 것 같아서요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E56240F74D62B99EE9DCADA9EAFE4E01"
msgid "I picked this %item% just for you, %name%."
msgstr "%name%, 당신을 위해 이 %item%을 골랐어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B833B300431F2FA6430DB6BE29855D5D"
msgid ""
"The real reward is our new friendship, %name%! But take this %item% as well."
msgstr "%name%, 진짜 보상은 우리의 새로운 우정이에요! 하지만 이 %item%도 받아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::113FFB954A391DCFB338F0806911297C"
msgid "This %item% reminded me of you."
msgstr "이 %item%을 보니 당신이 생각났어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DF016FEB4B84A3E6CEE1448B503F7CF6"
msgid "Luceyefer"
msgstr "루사이퍼"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9E506F347D9AD4EE4BF78A10DACBDB0"
msgid ""
"I'm like a drone, but at least I'm smart enough not to crash into trees."
msgstr "난 드론 같은 존재지만, 적어도 나무에 박지 않을 만큼은 똑똑해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4171E08B40A879A704096E820CC376ED"
msgid "I'm the eye in the sky... @But only at night."
msgstr "나는 하늘의 눈... @다만 밤에만."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A62245AD425034E178DAFEA0A0AA4F44"
msgid "I thought you people were supposed to be in bed by this time."
msgstr "이 시간이면 인간들은 자야 하는 거 아니었어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BFBB06349960C7CC6398CBEC40F935E"
msgid "Sure. I'll accept bribes. @Got any eye drops?"
msgstr "물론이지. 뇌물은 받을게. @안약 있어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::75AE39F746E0C9079B7A6DB7BFEAC4EF"
msgid "!I've seen what you do in the dark!"
msgstr "!어둠 속에서 네가 하는 짓을 봤어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7969259344DA7EE4DE969B9FA0D03A39"
msgid "Don't tell anyone, but I'm actually just a regular bat."
msgstr "아무한테도 말하지 마, 사실 나는 그냥 평범한 박쥐야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F875AAC141C74D699757F5A560EF9DBD"
msgid "You don't want to know how I echolocate."
msgstr "내가 어떻게 반향정위를 하는지 알고 싶진 않을걸."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::488D8A6F48E7B460045D528A626B671B"
msgid "Are you just gonna stand there and blink at me? @Cruel."
msgstr "그냥 거기 서서 나한테 눈만 깜빡일 거야? @잔인하네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1EA6C0914AE37A1ECD101088776832E0"
msgid ""
"I heard Gabreyel's giving out garbage. Don't you want some garbage? Get "
"outta my face."
msgstr "가브레이엘이 쓰레기를 나눠준다던데. 쓰레기 좀 받지 그래? 내 얼굴에서 꺼져."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B9B1F3AA48F7A8A8B81073B9F8F4053D"
msgid "What was your name? @%name%? @@You think I care, %name%?"
msgstr "이름이 뭐였지? @%name%? @@네가 신경 쓸 거 같아, %name%?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D9F6067C49207A7785A0B49EA553832B"
msgid "!Finally."
msgstr "!드디어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::961A6CF34FD57F2B39833381D999345A"
msgid "Yeah, yeah; Get outta here."
msgstr "그래 그래; 여기서 나가."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7D129737439C865C008F59AF8C7B3316"
msgid "Smell ya later."
msgstr "나중에 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
#. no-translate  # 수동
msgctxt "::19427F544F713B09889F8E88375F0220"
msgid "................."
msgstr ""

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3DEB5D074056322670CF9BAB17447F2E"
msgid "Take it and get out."
msgstr "받고 꺼져."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::82AC806A40CE7A549A08CEBBA43C931F"
msgid "It's just the %item%. Don't get sappy."
msgstr "%item%뿐이야. 감상에 젖지 마."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F688EB5140E38C830FBE5FA2311E4539"
msgid "I found this laying around."
msgstr "이게 굴러다니길래 주웠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0FDFF34D4246BB48B7DAC985BA18EE1B"
msgid "Hah! You only get the %item%! Was it worth it?"
msgstr "하! %item%만 받는 거야! 그럴 만했어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2EBC251F40605593EEF66AB314E7B82D"
msgid "Richard"
msgstr "리처드"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6CCE74264C9C233738D90FBE70F14C75"
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you! I've got a great selection of fun stuff with your name on "
"it!"
msgstr "반가워요! 당신을 위한 재밌는 물건들을 잔뜩 준비해 뒀어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::607C481247249BDBAE2B3CAF889F3F31"
msgid ""
"Well, hello there, friend. Nice to see you stop by my store again. Take your"
" time, you're always welcome here!"
msgstr "안녕하세요, 친구. 또 가게에 들러 주다니 반갑네요. 천천히 둘러보세요, 언제든 환영입니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4446E3DB4C6D74AEA66E5E9E47369839"
msgid "Ah, a friendly traveler darkens my doorway. Come on in!"
msgstr "아, 다정한 여행자가 문턱을 밝혀 주셨군. 어서 들어오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3D827E00454342F814959CAB401935F7"
msgid "Welcome friend! Please come in, won't you?"
msgstr "환영합니다, 친구! 어서 들어오시겠어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3BD6F32D436937718A1C658177040A3E"
msgid ""
"My favorite part of the job is watching people react to the giant dinosaur "
"skeleton."
msgstr "이 일에서 가장 좋아하는 건 사람들이 거대한 공룡 골격에 보이는 반응을 보는 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7EA9BFCD482A631E2A124E9D6E51309D"
msgid "We have something for just about anyone here! Take a look."
msgstr "여기엔 거의 모든 사람을 위한 물건이 있어요! 한번 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B74F1C94FF37915FB7A4FB5CA95EA14"
msgid ""
"Let me know if you see the toy train derail by accident. It happens "
"sometimes."
msgstr "장난감 기차가 실수로 탈선하면 알려 주세요. 가끔그러거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C09A69E94C25056169274183FDBB15BC"
msgid "Do you like the miniature forest? I made it myself!"
msgstr "미니어처 숲이 마음에 드나요? 제가 직접 만들었어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::523FC8E642889927B3CA1496280F57F1"
msgid ""
"Did you notice the lil' stuffed penguins? Those are my favorites. So cute."
msgstr "작은 봉제 펭귄들 보셨어요? 제가 제일 좋아하는 거예요. 정말 귀엽죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B8B8728B4B5E40AA97617FBDC1BAD683"
msgid "What's your favorite: cats or dogs? I just love dogs... and cats too!"
msgstr "고양이랑 강아지 중에 뭐가 좋아요? 전 강아지가 정말 좋아요... 고양이도요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::067C4E41411BC97B75AF6CA8E73EA212"
msgid ""
"It always brightens my day to see such faithful pet owners around the "
"resort."
msgstr "리조트에 이렇게 충실한 반려동물 주인들이 보이면 늘 기분이 좋아져요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1DAEB238479282838DB6C080B4CE8685"
msgid "Come back any time, my friend!"
msgstr "언제든 다시 오세요, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6974CB8B4F1D2A89F985F2A3CF5DED13"
msgid "Until we meet again, my friend!"
msgstr "또 만날 때까지, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::306FEBEF4B1A16FD98014392A6E89DEA"
msgid "Have a good day!"
msgstr "좋은 하루 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::06CC94814106275C69D8159CF1499E59"
msgid "Thank you for stopping by!"
msgstr "들러 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF9FBF7E4E50BA1F9801B086251B8407"
msgid "Greetings, friend and fellow pet enthusiast! Come in and have a look."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 반려동물을 사랑하는 친구여! 들어와서 둘러보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C2773E114926262DB9ABB78F848A010C"
msgid "I really appreciate it!"
msgstr "정말 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C76DAB72402DCC66514EAC9545E94109"
msgid "What a great gift for my pet!"
msgstr "우리 애한테 정말 좋은 선물이야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E9CAE0724307F0CDCD90BEBC626B6A83"
msgid ""
"Ah, hello, old friend! Let me know if you want anything or if you're just "
"stopping by for a chat."
msgstr "아, 안녕, 오랜 친구! 필요한 게 있거나 그냥 이야기하러 온 거면 알려 줘."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::51E6877D440D22F27B9B8E84001736FF"
msgid "Well, look what the cat dragged in! Come on in, friend."
msgstr "어, 고양이가 물고 온 게 누구지! 어서 들어와, 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A58218484EB6570E651071A4BAF6A780"
msgid "Welcome, welcome! How are you doing today, friend?"
msgstr "환영해, 환영해! 오늘 기분은 어때, 친구?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EC5BED584EE8259A4801DEA08690CFE0"
msgid "Take your time."
msgstr "천천히 하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A6D5CF104308A945AC14DD9E13A6F47C"
msgid "Let me know if you have any questions. "
msgstr "궁금한 점이 있으면 알려 주세요. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5EC4C40417F1E255CBEEF93C87A56CA"
msgid "Don't worry; I'm not going anywhere. Take your time."
msgstr "걱정 마세요. 전 어디 안 갑니다. 천천히 하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ACA96C1F46A1A92B35E1EFAAC019A76C"
msgid "I'm happy you're taking this decision so seriously!"
msgstr "그 결정을 진지하게 받아들여 주셔서 기쁩니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E077AF614C9D61B12CBE4E9B8C0E17D8"
msgid "Please, take your time. There's no rush at all, friend."
msgstr "천천히 하세요. 서두를 필요 전혀 없어요, 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::183ABC2045D51869DDA83E87900DE9D1"
msgid "Nice! That looks really fun."
msgstr "멋지네요! 정말 재미있어 보여요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::131FC6E745B9FFFFA9F0A0B4B7230318"
msgid "It warms my heart to see someone so enthusiastic about toys!"
msgstr "장난감에 이렇게 열정적인 분을 보니 마음이 따뜻해지네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1249D809465235E5BF5E18A1143F348A"
msgid "Ah. I might need to order more toys soon."
msgstr "아. 곧 장난감을 더 주문해야겠어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E11AF8A24FA8D2E195B0B8871431C045"
msgid "Ah, a fan of %item%, are we?"
msgstr "아, %item% 팬이시군요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6EC0F1314BAAFC30599EFF967729027C"
msgid "Remember to always love your pet."
msgstr "언제나 반려동물을 사랑해 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0D1F13514001FE869F0CED9E3184EF48"
msgid "There's plenty of other choices."
msgstr "다른 선택지도 많이 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED71016D4EB00309F1F0CCA7FD979992"
msgid "Many thanks! Have fun!"
msgstr "정말 감사합니다! 즐거운 시간 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F4C235D84CA218C6571CB38B9FA0BD48"
msgid "We've got a great sale ongoing, friend."
msgstr "대박 세일 중이랍니다, 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9B6C28AB4A78A68D706AEB9145176F64"
msgid "Enjoy our discounted prices!"
msgstr "할인가를 마음껏 누리세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1EF5360A41537F25D5379EA8EDF21AEB"
msgid "Now's a great time to become a pet owner as everything is on sale!"
msgstr "모든 물건이 세일 중이니 반려동물을 키우기 딱 좋은 때예요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0431D67F4339BB298E66C1A6A3022B1B"
msgid "I'd head out and partake in the events, friend."
msgstr "나가서 이벤트에 참여해 보세요, 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BF63285B4B0D58A874D9AA854AF3216A"
msgid "Reggie"
msgstr "레지"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA05C1514A58BF032C4E069CF0153211"
msgid "!PUT THIS FIRE OUT!"
msgstr "!이 불을 꺼 줘!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB652DEC4556406AEF219880796628D6"
msgid "!DO I SPARK YOUR INTEREST? GET IT? CAUSE I'M ENFLAMED?!"
msgstr "!내가 관심을 불러일으켰나요? 이해했죠? 전 불타고 있으니까요?!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3A119AF643C3BE979F9905A46080BAA9"
msgid "!WHY DO I STILL HAVE EYES?!"
msgstr "!왜 난 아직도 눈이 있는 거지?!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::043B56454CF2AF6F5F0438AD0D88CF3B"
msgid "!YOU FIND MY JAW?"
msgstr "!내 턱을 찾았나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D5A2F6E4CDA61C598DE53BF411F3A9B"
msgid "!EXTINGUISH ME!"
msgstr "!나를 소화해 줘!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D526C50479F04AB8F8CFCBDEA32CCDA"
msgid "!I CAN'T HEAR YOU OVER THE DEATH METAL!"
msgstr "!데스 메탈 소리에 네 목소리가 안 들려!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::256C609F4474F6D5BB7F2782C5D9F6DF"
msgid "!THIS IS ONE HOT PARTY, AND I DON'T LIKE IT!"
msgstr "!정말 뜨거운 파티인데, 난 별로야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8A360CD44F44CF43E62F5DA7A82B93CE"
msgid ""
"!NICE COSTUME! I KEEP TRYING TO PUT ONE ON, AND IT SPONTANEOUSLY COMBUSTS!"
msgstr "!멋진 의상이네! 난 입으려고만 하면 저절로 불붙는다고!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D1CF6E5C47EF0A562AE029A77CE351D9"
msgid "!OHHH--THE AGONY! @HOW'S YOUR NIGHT GOING?"
msgstr "!아아--이 고통! @밤 잘 보내고 있나?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7664716145CEDF46EA1C63AAF987DA45"
msgid "!I REMEMBER LIFE. @I WASN'T ON FIRE THEN."
msgstr "!살아 있던 시절이 기억나. @그때는 불붙지 않았지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D286C8814F0641767DC29A874B143DBC"
msgid "!SEE YOU LATER, MORTAL!"
msgstr "!나중에 보자, 인간!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D67D0C1E4DFA0DC165A13C9E14D010F2"
msgid "!OKAY. BYE."
msgstr "!알겠어. 잘 가."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD825E3B448F4B4A359835AC270C9011"
msgid "!WILL YOU BE BACK? @BRING THE EXTINGUISHER!!!"
msgstr "!다시 올 거죠? @소화기 좀 가져와!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::723A47AF4957E86BA1491D8A6A480AEA"
msgid "!I DON'T HAVE HANDS, BUT HERE YOU GO."
msgstr "!손이 없지만, 여기 있네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::61E2DEB142BF7108BA005789AB6522DB"
msgid "!JUST TAKE IT ALREADY."
msgstr "!그냥 받으라고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::24D7962C42D9348F16E666B393BE3F2B"
msgid "!ALRIGHT. %item%.WOW. LOOKS LIKE YOU'RE THE ONE ON FIRE."
msgstr "!좋아요. %item%.와우. 불붙은 건 바로 당신이군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2F220FBC4F05EA8BE8CFF8BEE6C889DD"
msgid "Lil' Pup"
msgstr "꼬마 강아지"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C6B444E8437DF32FE11572A5D9B8EC5D"
msgid ""
"Well, look who it is: %name%, my best buddy! I stayed around just for you."
msgstr "이런, 누가 왔나 했더니: %name%, 내 단짝 친구잖아! 너 때문에 여기 남아 있었어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D75B594541C9B0A1EDD8AAB0A4883CEE"
msgid "I am a good puppy. Gourdon lets me manage the store while he travels."
msgstr "저는 착한 강아지예요. 구르동이 여행하는 동안 가게를 맡아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F04BDB6243302C13795246AE96AC87DB"
msgid ""
"You may think I am just a little puppy who got lost, but I was on a mission "
"to find something very, very important."
msgstr "저를 길 잃은 강아지라고 생각하실지 모르지만, 사실 아주아주 중요한 걸 찾는 임무 중이었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7BA70AC749189342D2E422BBF76E2602"
msgid ""
"Our receipts flew into a strange labyrinth while someone might have been "
"trying to eat them. It wasn't me."
msgstr "누군가 영수증을 먹으려 했는지 몰라도, 영수증들은 이상한 미로로 날아가 버렸어요. 제가 한 거 아니에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C68102604078865CE3A227B4FB605667"
msgid "*bark*"
msgstr "*멍*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::808F08D249741667D8A6788B489B74A6"
msgid "Vox"
msgstr "복스"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::059CF60E4C93561B526B8C8ADA396550"
msgid "You've entered The Asteroid Belt."
msgstr "소행성대에 입장했습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BEA06C9F4D53126C3D03EAA7CBDAAAB4"
msgid "We meet again. Ready to claim your rewards?"
msgstr "또 만났네요. 보상을 받을 준비 되셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F651C20E4E7A346D48BD908BED7669FE"
msgid ""
"Step right up. This game's called: \"Give Me Your Tickets and I'll Give You "
"Something Nice\"."
msgstr "어서 오세요. 이 게임의 이름은: \"티켓을 주시면 좋은 걸 드리죠\"."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07AF1E8748749098C772ED9820E30DAA"
msgid "Game start."
msgstr "게임 시작."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2034589A420891D8006FCCAC370BCCD6"
msgid ""
"I don't know what gets into peoples' heads when they play Mas Fuerte. It's "
"like something possesses them."
msgstr "사람들이 마스 푸에르테를 할 때 무슨 생각을 하는지 모르겠어요. 마치 뭔가에 홀린 것 같아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C5FD469640796AA0E4B982A2A0837365"
msgid ""
"I'm just glad that I'm in here and Jimmy Joystick is out there... @so that "
"he can deliver the fun, of course."
msgstr "저는 여기 있고 지미 조이스틱이 저 밖에 있다는 게 다행이에요... @물론 즐거움을 전달하도록요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::198403244121C5FAE56AD79CFDE29B3B"
msgid "Yes, yes. My existence is a constant game of Stack 'em."
msgstr "네, 네. 제 존재 자체가 끊임없는 스택 엠 게임이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::858E660149A49646B9C45994EDFF6BEB"
msgid ""
"Some fans bag on the dark twist in season three of Harvest Lore, but at "
"least it allowed for the Faithful Cucumber plush."
msgstr "일부 팬들은 하베스트 로어 시즌 3의 어두운 반전을 까지만, 덕분에 충직한 오이 인형이 나왔잖아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7A4D94E84A87F5CEF55B2E99D564DAC7"
msgid ""
"Who would have thought that after escaping one game, I would end up in "
"another? @...I did. I thought that."
msgstr "한 게임에서 탈출하면 또 다른 게임에 갇힐 줄이야? @...저는 생각했어요. 저는 그렇게 생각했어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7776CDB346433BCDA78979BFF29270B6"
msgid ""
"It's funny to watch you think you're done playing when the game's over."
msgstr "게임이 끝났는데도 아직 플레이 중이라고 생각하는 당신을 보는 게 재밌어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::12347CD54EE6F72C9C2A43BE9436DFFD"
msgid "Don't throw tokens into The Offering. Trust me."
msgstr "제물 의식에 토큰을 던지지 마세요. 진심이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::429A90EE4C911CCB6D20F4AC012D4BE8"
msgid ""
"I don't really know how I feel about the pizza guy. He almost ripped the "
"Trivia door off its hinges once. @He could be useful in the future, I guess."
msgstr "피자 배달원에 대해선 잘 모르겠어요. 한 번은 퀴즈 문을 경첩째 뜯어낼 뻔했거든요. @나중에 쓸모가 있을지도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A2D3240648C0F6DA745F3ABF7F6B3893"
msgid "The kick me sign is manufactured on-site."
msgstr "차기 표지판은 현장에서 제조합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C7CD14534D28C5197FCF1EA6D5C02B33"
msgid "Seen the dipping bird? @It reminds me of you."
msgstr "딥 버드 봤어요? @당신이 생각나네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9AAC33D1496A60F3E054E0A319596E29"
msgid "Yeah. We've got a giant isopod back here. Its pretty cool."
msgstr "네. 여기 뒤에 거대한 등각류가 있어요. 꽤 멋지죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B7F6642C4F697816DDB24E93FE0D783E"
msgid "I see you eyeing chess. I didn't know you were a nerd..."
msgstr "체스를 뚫어지게 보시던데. 너드인 줄 몰랐어요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::03A72C0A43F30D1256AC60A28EA0C2A4"
msgid ""
"Carol's nice. You should chat with her, if you haven't talked to her yet. "
"She's up at the info desk at the main entrance."
msgstr "캐럴은 좋은 사람이에요. 아직 말 걸어보지 않았다면 한번 대화해보세요. 정문 안내 데스크에 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5B9E7B544FFD84B96B8DA197FA6EC97A"
msgid ""
"I heard Billy's trying to create some new ice cream recipes for her store. I"
" can't taste any of them, though, so... why don't you?"
msgstr "빌리가 가게용 새 아이스크림 레시피를 만드는 중이라던데요. 전 맛을 못 보니까... 당신이 해보시는 게 어때요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D194B41048854A2F99A86AB501A16E72"
msgid "See you in a bit."
msgstr "조금 이따 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F151730B420E529B8B67D0B278B85005"
msgid "Game over."
msgstr "게임 오버."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::33BAF8BD41035DC45821E3ABAEEFD1D9"
msgid "Come on over if you've got tickets to spend."
msgstr "쓸 티켓이 있다면 어서 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9EEEE2D943FDA9D04ECE5DADC4510A1D"
msgid "Need motivation? Check out your future prizes."
msgstr "동기부여가 필요하신가요? 미래의 상품들을 확인해보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D7EAB81F4F69855E35690BA3582DC49E"
msgid "Thanks. I'll put it next to my pencils."
msgstr "고마워요. 연필 옆에 둘게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::806E8B214D5A30B07C331DBBDD786090"
msgid "Hmm... That's unusual. @Thanks."
msgstr "흠... 특이하네요. @고마워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::40B1680A4E64AEB40EA67A8991DA40EF"
msgid ""
"Hi-score. Over 200 entrances. @The prize? @Whatever you've got tickets for."
msgstr "최고 기록입니다. 입장객 200명 돌파. @경품은? @티켓으로 바꿀 수 있는 거라면 뭐든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3D5A0B754DD5A6CCDF84E7ADA6F3918D"
msgid "I've caught you in my orbit. @Just kidding."
msgstr "내 궤도에 잡혔네요. @농담이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D927F0D94841F8245F0572A59586AF4E"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "안녕하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D9B63C44A383EEBE63CA5BE5140E7DF"
msgid "*Vox stares at you, @you think.*"
msgstr "*복스가 당신을 바라봅니다, @당신 생각엔.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6AF023FC45BE6862A3CFE7905380CA16"
msgid "Game paused."
msgstr "게임 일시정지됨."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::04B031274F5F15AFA4BA0F9241E28D07"
msgid "Coming right up."
msgstr "바로 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::528C4CCB45C527EF707E89A8F6816A1A"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8DC7B5114B35925C9259BAA4CEDB4688"
msgid "Take it all; you earned it."
msgstr "전부 가져가세요. 그럴 자격이 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CEB7E92C4CCD2652E1723D8B9BF65FAC"
msgid "Big spender."
msgstr "큰손이시네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5CA1854B4B2475D91E6DAA82D8DCDD15"
msgid "The joy effect doesn't stack."
msgstr "기쁨 효과는 중첩되지 않습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B00B6AE74A340C8FF8F3F2BD9D78E84E"
msgid ""
"Almost 180 different prizes and you want a bunch of %item%? Good to see "
"you're passionate about something."
msgstr "경품이 180종 가까이 되는데 당신은 %item% 한 무더기를 원한다고요? 뭔가에 열정적인 모습은 보기 좋네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::12C1E1BB4B2668C0092A42BC6A8D6270"
msgid "Yeah. You can do better."
msgstr "네. 더 잘할 수 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E9C73E349ABE350D5A4738AB4996380"
msgid "No need to waste those tickets."
msgstr "티켓을 낭비할 필요 없죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::301ED349411244236A9E7D88F536A64F"
msgid "Item get."
msgstr "아이템 획득."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5EBE401947DB3F4F951A1FADD1D677C7"
msgid "Use it responsibly."
msgstr "책임감 있게 사용하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F31B5D904F6BD16A9533419BD3B7ECFE"
msgid "Back off, please."
msgstr "물러나 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D926E77447DCEC9B9555059E5D5D2536"
msgid ""
"I know I'm interesting, but can you stop breathing down my neck? Please."
msgstr "제가 흥미롭다는 건 알지만, 목덜미에 숨만 쉬지 좀 말아 주실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::429A45A746B96DB3E9847ABF70348F04"
msgid ""
"With your height, I'm thankful you aren't just stepping over the counter."
msgstr "당신 키라면 그냥 카운터를 넘어오지 않은 게 다행이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEC98A49479801F9ABE77D8CD7D94EA6"
msgid "Can you even carry these prizes? You're pretty short. @No offense."
msgstr "이 경품들을 들고 갈 수 있긴 한가요? 꽤 작으시던데. @기분 나쁘게 들리진 않았으면요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3B3CA2A74FB5E79964F8C69989BC6F2B"
msgid ""
"Hey... looks like you leveled up your luck skill. There's a sale today."
msgstr "이런... 운 기술이 올라간 것 같네요. 오늘 할인 중이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B6BF59E244D3CD3217AB3788436B34E6"
msgid "I could swear I heard an event going on. Go check it out for me."
msgstr "이벤트가 진행 중인 것 같은데 들은 것 같아요. 저 대신 가서 확인해 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B993DA7240559C675F06D580B064A6CE"
msgid "Event's on. Maybe you should turn around and go."
msgstr "이벤트 중이에요. 돌아서 가 보시는 게 어떤가요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8CF4D00E46A031B1CC568B8EEF94258C"
msgid "Cosmic Carol"
msgstr "코스믹 캐럴"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4C6523E8447CE079D96BC2A64FE81CFB"
msgid ""
"Salutations! I'm Carol, your Warp Zone informant extraordinaire and resident"
" astronaut."
msgstr "인사드려요! 저는 캐럴, 워프 존의 유능한 안내원이자 상주 우주비행사입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::29FA74CF4BE5C41FE010A1B7E3516D52"
msgid ""
"You've entered the Carol Zone, also known as the Information Desk. I'm here "
"to tell you what's up!"
msgstr "캐럴 존, 일명 안내 데스크에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 무슨 일인지 알려드릴게요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::415559CE45A208B50AB65AA55F4F844A"
msgid "Welcome to the Warp Zone Information Desk! How may I inform you?"
msgstr "워프 존 안내 데스크입니다! 무엇을 안내해 드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B9C867134155061658ACF2A27BE023EA"
msgid "I've got years of intergalactic knowledge about this single arcade."
msgstr "이 오락실 하나에 대해 은하계급 지식이 수년치 쌓여 있답니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::71F6994B4F125405212198993AE485D2"
msgid "Set your sights above! You might see something stellar."
msgstr "위를 올려다보세요! 별처럼 멋진 걸 보실지도 몰라요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3754DCAF4C5031883F23EE91DB8016A4"
msgid ""
"On your travels, it will be wise to convert your Units to Tokens using one "
"of our magnificent Token Machines located in convenient areas about the "
"building!"
msgstr "다니시다 보면, 건물 곳곳 편리한 위치에 있는 멋진 토큰 교환기에서 유닛을 토큰으로 바꾸는 게 좋습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CF22915945695BBAF9CC6E865047651A"
msgid ""
"We have two whack-a-mole style games: original Whack-a-Mole and multiplayer "
"Bug Bytes."
msgstr "두 가지 두더지잡기 스타일 게임이 있습니다: 오리지널 Whack-a-Mole과 멀티플레이 Bug Bytes입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7018982A406A4FE452E09E89D5EF6884"
msgid "Check out Super Hoopers by the Trivia entrance on the first floor!"
msgstr "1층 트리비아 입구 옆의 Super Hoopers를 확인해 보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DC117D2B4DF98210D88D12A5B6BC1A1C"
msgid ""
"Use the Ticket Eater machines to catalogue your tickets. We wouldn't want "
"you having to carry them around where they'd get in the way of gaming!"
msgstr "티켓 이터 기계로 티켓을 정리할 수 있어요. 게임하는 데 방해가 되도록 티켓을 들고 다니게 하고 싶진 않잖아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6E6522304D3BA594B81C79AD424CD907"
msgid ""
"Vox can help you turn your tickets into prizes at the Asteroid Belt. They're"
" located just around the corner in the center of the arcade."
msgstr "복스가 소행성대에서 티켓을 경품으로 바꾸는 걸 도와줄 거예요. 오락실 중앙 모퉁이를 돌면 바로 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F156681476681AD77C5F4A20C35E1A7"
msgid ""
"The arcade staple, Skee Ball, can be found if you travel the path to the "
"left of my Information Desk!"
msgstr "오락실의 대표작 스키볼은 제 안내소 왼쪽 길로 가면 찾을 수 있어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B473FF2143CB21C8A8FBADA8ADF6D789"
msgid ""
"Don't forget to wander upstairs! You'll find games like Lonely Gun 30XX, "
"Whirl-a-Fish, Newton's Apples, and more."
msgstr ""
"2층에도 꼭 올라가 보세요! Lonely Gun 30XX, Whirl-a-Fish, Newton's Apples 같은 게임이 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4A2EB9074E7593F7111E41AA928F2AC4"
msgid ""
"If you need help with a specific game, try reading the How to Play guide "
"that will show up as an option to press when you hover over the machine."
msgstr "특정 게임 도움이 필요하면 기계에 마우스를 올리면 뜨는 How to Play 안내를 읽어 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::330A020D42E5DDF0CF1192803260B51A"
msgid ""
"Vox runs the prize counter. They just kind of showed up one day... @and "
"that's alright! They love that counter! And we love them!"
msgstr ""
"복스가 경품 카운터를 맡고 있어요. 어느 날 갑자기 나타난 것 같지만... @그래도 괜찮아요! 복스는 그 카운터를 정말 좋아하고, 우리도"
" 복스를 좋아하니까요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B7F578A4D9329C84A7534AFE8BD06B6"
msgid ""
"If you get hungry and don't want to head down to Fresh or Project 12, check "
"out Uncle Muscle's! The owner's nephew Virgil is running it. Such a strong "
"worker! "
msgstr ""
"배가 고픈데 Fresh나 Project 12까지 내려가기 싫다면 Uncle Muscle's에 들러 보세요! 사장님의 조카 버질이 운영 "
"중이에요. 정말 힘센 일꾼이죠! "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3827F71842EAAD4F1981DEB5A7E8F23D"
msgid ""
"We've got some sweet treats at The Freezing Point. Billy can help you there!"
" She's a little nervous, but she's a nice young woman! Might drop your ice "
"cream though, so be alert."
msgstr ""
"The Freezing Point에는 맛있는 디저트가 있어요. 빌리가 도와줄 거예요! 조금 소심하지만 착한 아가씨예요! 다만 아이스크림을"
" 떨어뜨릴 수 있으니 조심하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2A514DE445C476C383856DA173560B3E"
msgid ""
"Jimmy Joystick is the arcade's mascot! And.. the owner? We're not really "
"sure! But we love him. He encourages a clean and happy work environment!"
msgstr ""
"지미 조이스틱은 오락실의 마스코트예요! 그리고.. 사장님? 확실하진 않아요! 하지만 우리는 그를 사랑해요. 깨끗하고 즐거운 근무 환경을 "
"장려하신답니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5201F8114ACDACAFB47F02870D534260"
msgid "Need info about the arcade? Come have a chat with me! "
msgstr "오락실 정보가 필요하신가요? 저와 이야기 나눠요! "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::501077CB447AD35DE0910C8F37BEDB6D"
msgid "Oh my stars! You are a cherub."
msgstr "이런 세상에! 당신은 천사네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4DD522984850BD04D9609A8580513C8F"
msgid "Wow! You sure like to keep yourself informed, %name%."
msgstr "와! 정보를 정말 열심히 챙기시네요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2BF312AC4F686F589C371EA77E6E68E9"
msgid "Here's some new info: there's an event going on!"
msgstr "새로운 정보예요: 지금 이벤트가 진행 중이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::518F88F84F1E1D1776BA2D88E6BD6126"
msgid "Hey, %name%."
msgstr "안녕하세요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC474DE0436EC63221990692A9224342"
msgid "Chilly Billy"
msgstr "칙칙 빌리"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B731E7074F17843779DBE2BB8F94B9F3"
msgid "Ice to meet you!"
msgstr "반가워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEA5D68C48D093D79EFE91804D97DF35"
msgid "Ice to see you again."
msgstr "또 만나서 반가워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B330215C4461990C863F0393056B0898"
msgid "Please don't scream for the ice cream."
msgstr "아이스크림 때문에 소리 지르지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::77972CE44F0E4D00CED68598813026B1"
msgid "Oh. Be sure to grab a napkin. You don't want to upset Mr. Joystick!"
msgstr "아. 냅킨 꼭 챙기세요. 조이스틱 씨를 화나게 하면 안 되니까요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E78467FD4B01909D713A49A0794984AB"
msgid ""
"What kind of cone do you want? @Or sundae. @Oh. Or did you want a banana "
"split?"
msgstr "어떤 콘으로 드릴까요? @아니면 선디? @아. 아니면 바나나 스플릿 원하셨어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6A46A1A34918F78E7394AFBA329C9523"
msgid ""
"Mint is refreshing... Vanilla is comforting... Chocolate is... chocolate... "
"@Was I saying that out loud?"
msgstr "민트는 상쾌하고... 바닐라는 편안하고... 초콜릿은... 초콜릿... @제가 지금 이걸 말하고 있었나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88A415A5419A184EC4DE23809C02280E"
msgid ""
"I will not flip your cone over. The ice cream will fall. Don't be silly."
msgstr "콘을 뒤집지는 않을 거예요. 아이스크림이 떨어지겠죠. 말도 안 돼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::162A4E1249AF0828136949B045948CFE"
msgid ""
"Being behind this counter, it's like I'm frozen in place. I guess that's why"
" it's called The Freezing Point."
msgstr "이 카운터 뒤에 있으면 꼭 얼어붙은 기분이에요. 그래서 이름이 The Freezing Point인가 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8697448C41260B196C71319AA1C9E3F3"
msgid ""
"Lonely Gun is kind of fun. You should try it, after your ice cream. @If you "
"want. @@And if you get any ice cream."
msgstr ""
"Lonely Gun은 꽤 재미있어요. 아이스크림 먹고 나서 한번 해 보세요. @원하신다면요. @@아이스크림을 받는다면 말이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8708690A4F990B8AB32BADB4AED11CBC"
msgid "Am I good at The Ice Cave? Why? @Oh. 'Cause I sell ice cream?"
msgstr "제가 The Ice Cave를 잘하냐고요? 왜요? @아. 아이스크림을 팔아서요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::36AE697542EF6C675A6632A5A258351C"
msgid ""
"So... Vox. @It's like they broke out of a game or something. That's absurd. "
"That's not possible, right? Hm."
msgstr "그래서... 복스요. @게임에서 튀어나온 것 같지 않나요? 말도 안 돼요. 그런 건 불가능하겠죠? 흠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E1C5A6F54E79E5BCC8A3839554C48AA0"
msgid ""
"Did you know Virgil's uncle built the Tower single-handedly? I bet he'd "
"crush a cone by accident, if I gave him one."
msgstr "버질의 삼촌이 타워를 혼자 지었다는 거 아세요? 제가 콘을 하나 드리면 실수로 으스러뜨릴 것 같아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AAD06AB5414D8C1D7D672EA5B738ED71"
msgid ""
"I don't think Vox ever leaves the arcade... @...Do I ever leave the arcade? "
"I feel like I'm always here."
msgstr "복스는 오락실을 떠나는 일이 없는 것 같아요... @...저는 오락실을 떠난 적이 있나요? 항상 여기 있는 기분이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AD72AECF49758AD3DAC2FA9F80274B84"
msgid ""
"Strawberry is probably the best flavor. @But you can pick whatever you want!"
" No pressure..."
msgstr "딸기가 아마 최고의 맛일 거예요. @그래도 원하는 걸 고르세요! 부담 갖지 마시고..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B2C52A954A4ECA6677F744BA3D7A2512"
msgid ""
"I'd play Planetary Piano, but I have shaky hands... @not that you asked."
msgstr "Planetary Piano를 해 보고 싶지만 손이 떨려서... @물어보시진 않았지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::879484A44842C78A7D6BA5BA4B93A87C"
msgid "Yes, Chilly Billy is just my work name. My real name is-"
msgstr "네, 칠리 빌리는 그냥 제 작업용 이름이에요. 진짜 이름은-"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3160B2AF4950AA5C36085895FBACA5F9"
msgid "Bye-bye."
msgstr "안녕히 가세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09F2321C44EB2AADE1737A9ECC9E38E2"
msgid "*Chilly Billy waves good-bye to you.*"
msgstr "*칠리 빌리가 당신에게 손을 흔들며 작별 인사를 합니다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D49D23F411E59C333A14CBAEC968ED8"
msgid "Hey- @Oh. Did you not hear me... There's ice cream here."
msgstr "어이쿠- @아, 제 말 못 들었어요... 여기 아이스크림 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F8178E5B44C27FD4F3EDE3B3A699C7FE"
msgid "Ice cream! I've got it here. For you. Not you specifically. Or. @Er..."
msgstr "아이스크림! 여기 있어요. 당신 거예요. 딱 당신만이 아니라. 아니면. @어..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2803510B47115F0F8F7B63B4449606C2"
msgid "Oh... For me? @Thank you, %name%."
msgstr "어... 제 거라고요? @고마워요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::69BEC4BA46D6201D7F93BFB460F26453"
msgid "Oh. Oh, no... @I didn't get you anything in return. Sorry, %name%."
msgstr "아. 아, 이런... @저는 아무것도 드릴 게 없네요. 미안해요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFDA2EB941913490AC56C5BCD64B8832"
msgid "We've got to stop freezing like this! Haha... @Hi, %name%..."
msgstr "이렇게 얼어붙고 있을 때가 아니죠! 하하... @안녕하세요, %name%..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AE7804354522654D0690CAB6AE9671B1"
msgid "Seeing you is the cherry on top of my day!"
msgstr "당신을 보는 건 제 하루의 체리 한 알 같아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::907853614E4F4D846735BDB7EA5D3B29"
msgid "Take your time... take your time..."
msgstr "천천히 하세요... 천천히..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::08FC20CE45F49652E3EF8BAF6D59145F"
msgid "Oh- You want that one... @Cool."
msgstr "아- 그것을 원하시는군요... @좋아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE16148C4F9BBF616D15D5BE6AF3C11E"
msgid "Good choice!"
msgstr "좋은 선택이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::98DBBCAF485E6C019FFC31988D138F5D"
msgid "I'll get that- Slow down."
msgstr "그걸 가져올게요- 진정하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::37C0222F45D98EF320518FBAABD1C0A3"
msgid "@You like ice cream."
msgstr "@아이스크림을 좋아하시는군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4819DCD14A8FD53C9EAB0BB5A542D1D3"
msgid "Oh, uh... You really like that one!"
msgstr "아, 어... 그거 정말 좋아하시네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7AD6164F437BDD5129752982C96D559B"
msgid "I hope the machine doesn't break down again."
msgstr "기계가 또 고장 나지 않으면 좋겠네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7835FEAF4845272ADE79C9AC7A7A7D70"
msgid "Let's find you something else."
msgstr "다른 걸 찾아드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2B22709B456E1AF0A1EC4E8A3979D587"
msgid "@Sorry... I must not have pitched it right."
msgstr "@죄송해요... 제가 제대로 소개하지 못했나 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::729FDC2140F0C1BDAD38F4AEF12313C6"
msgid "Yay! I'll get started on that order."
msgstr "야호! 그 주문부터 시작할게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6F8EF4E44E1268F22C5BA29E84A45D0A"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D99510A64B63D76CCF15429E03B99C37"
msgid ""
"I've heard if you use a Large Potion and eat your ice cream too fast, you "
"get a bigger brain freeze."
msgstr "큰 포션을 쓰고 아이스크림을 너무 빨리 먹으면 두통이 더 심해진다고 들었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::98876D004E0CCC9B871B3EAECBED1482"
msgid "Oh, geez. How did you get so small? @Not that that's bad!"
msgstr "어이쿠. 어떻게 이렇게 작아지셨어요? @나쁘다는 건 아니에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::93BDA81643DC9B9526DFD98D46F78DA7"
msgid "We should probably get some smaller sizing options."
msgstr "더 작은 사이즈 옵션도 있어야겠네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F04F084245791FA6FB447B8CBF8EA66A"
msgid "Ice- Ice- for a low... pr- ice. @Did...@That was bad."
msgstr "아이스- 아이스- 싼... 가- 격으로. @이거...@너무 못했네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A1FCE34F4323525FD8F54EA2BEF3C0FE"
msgid "These prices are below zero! @Not really, though."
msgstr "이 가격은 영하예요! @사실은 아니지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B4B4F9242A481D61048C5B2B932DA83"
msgid "Is there an event? @It isn't just me hearing that, right?"
msgstr "행사 중인가요? @저만 듣는 게 아니죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::344D441744873ED7D7FE3A9FDD2F0DA0"
msgid ""
"I thought I heard Virgil mention an event... @I might have imagined that."
msgstr "버질이 행사 얘기를 했던 것 같은데... @착각인지도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::69D4CA3F487A74A450A580A576CD4CDC"
msgid "Virgil T. Chad"
msgstr "버질 T. 채드"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5CAFCA9B40552019A8C44CAD29A2F95A"
msgid "Eyyyyyyyyyyyyy. @Welcome!"
msgstr "에에에에에에에에. @환영해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AC5B3FCB408B4C578DE0F08A37B2A157"
msgid "Bro!"
msgstr "친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A9E2E0AB4E23C9A99EA6B29662C58CD8"
msgid "Welcome back, bro!"
msgstr "다시 오셨네요, 브로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AB61E7D84EF633578FAFE79748CB1BFA"
msgid ""
"Welcome to Uncle Muscle's, bro! We're home of the Muzza-l. @Muscle pizza, "
"bro! For your muscles!"
msgstr "어클 머슬 피자에 오신 걸 환영합니다, 브로! 여기가 무자-엘의 본고장이죠. @머슬 피자, 브로! 당신의 근육을 위해!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4F4DA15F4B6C1C68781F479888BF54D8"
msgid ""
"Here's an idea, bro: Pizza Powered Lifting Machine. Think about it, bro.@Let"
" it marinate."
msgstr "아이디어 하나 있네, 브로: 피자 동력 리프팅 머신. 한번 생각해 봐, 브로.@좀 더 곱씹어 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C9DE54C94222252A8EECEFA6BE7F2AE7"
msgid "Bro, you want anchovies? Not many people do."
msgstr "브로, 멸치 토핑 원해? 좋아하는 사람 별로 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C4B06B6D4635D9E6F9B6ACAA677F92B7"
msgid "We don't talk about the pineapple question here, bro. Don't go there."
msgstr "여기선 파인애플 얘기는 안 하는 거야, 브로. 꺼내지 마."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD3216404DF1EB2A399E0B98AA50E3C5"
msgid ""
"We got pepperonis, pepperoncinis, mushrooms, cheese, achovies, bones, beans,"
" eggs, bones, bell peppers, onions, crust, flour, pineapples... What else "
"could you want?"
msgstr ""
"페퍼로니, 페퍼로치니, 버섯, 치즈, 멸치, 뼈, 콩, 달걀, 뼈, 피망, 양파, 크러스트, 밀가루, 파인애플... 더 뭘 원해?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4ABE4BE1429B339589DAE59B2F643314"
msgid "Bro, my Uncle Muscle could muscle your uncle! No joke!"
msgstr "브로, 우리 어클 머슬은 네 삼촌을 근육으로 이길 수 있어! 농담 아니야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::30F632BB440461FD8D84FABA224E0739"
msgid ""
"My Uncle Muscle can spin a pizza on his muscle so fast he stops time, bro."
msgstr "우리 어클 머슬은 근육 위에서 피자를 너무 빨리 돌려서 시간이 멈출 정도라니까, 브로."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4E1370B443BC3B0FDF228DA371268A8C"
msgid ""
"Uncle Muscle once threw a guy off the boardwalk. @The guy was a fish, bro. A"
" fish."
msgstr "어클 머슬은 한번 어떤 녀석을 보드워크 밖으로 던져버렸어. @그 녀석은 물고기였어, 브로. 물고기."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BBF5CCB44BED36F8BEDAAA98792FEDD8"
msgid ""
"Bro, someone started a rumor that my Uncle Muscle built the tower single-"
"handedly. I won't dispute it."
msgstr "브로, 누가 우리 어클 머슬이 혼자서 탑을 지었다는 소문을 냈어. 난 부정 안 할래."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DC2E5EE1439677480E96AD91F362141F"
msgid "My muscles? Nah, they're nothing compared to my uncle's."
msgstr "내 근육? 에이, 삼촌 근육에 비하면 아무것도 아니야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E6BE9AC742C0443F9C678D8109019AF0"
msgid ""
"Bro, Vox is kind of weird, bro. They're just squares, right? I wonder how "
"strong squares are."
msgstr "브로, 복스는 좀 이상해, 브로. 그냥 네모잖아? 네모가 얼마나 강한지 궁금하네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::969965274825D39A8CEAC8A2ADE59FD5"
msgid ""
"Making pizzas really builds the muscles, bro... and eating them just fuels "
"the fire."
msgstr "피자를 만들면 근육이 정말 붙어, 브로... 그리고 먹으면 그 불꽃에 연료를 넣는 거지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::654EBF8D4511E38E8EFBDD84B3DB1D4C"
msgid ""
"The only epic I'm writing is the Epic of These Epic Muscles, bro- It already"
" has 300 lines."
msgstr "내가 쓰는 서사시는 이 엄청난 근육들의 서사시뿐이야, 브로- 벌써 300행이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3E774BDD4D8D54F2F7C48383F712C6EB"
msgid "Mas fuerte? Bro. I almost broke that machine, bro."
msgstr "마스 푸에르테? 브로. 나 그 기계 거의 부쉈어, 브로."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::689B702648E536CD54F26AA5D33F270D"
msgid "Have you seen Carol, bro? Two words: @astronaut @helmet. @Amazing."
msgstr "브로, 캐롤 봤어? 두 마디로: @우주인 @헬멧. @대단해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::16F0078C452243E7C95441B1A734674C"
msgid ""
"Bro, the ice cream worker is so funny, bro. Her name's Chilly Billy- Like "
"what? Isn't that great?"
msgstr "브로, 아이스크림 직원은 정말 웃겨, 브로. 이름이 칠리 빌리- 뭐야? 대단하지 않아?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9B9E37FB4F053FDB85ECCDA07F9D40BC"
msgid "I'm banned from playing Whack A Mole, bro. It's a tragedy."
msgstr "브로, 두더지 잡기 못 하게 됐어, 브로. 비극이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::08FDB0D948871D91315E0E8771D70266"
msgid "Jimmy Joystick freaks me out, bro- but he has a good heart."
msgstr "지미 조이스틱은 나를 무섭게 해, 브로- 그래도 마음씨는 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::53285D7D4A857E9CD02283B716911F10"
msgid "*Virgil doesn't wink at you.*"
msgstr "*버질이 당신에게 윙크하지 않는다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D6BB740848A07F96BFB3BB87FE92753B"
msgid "Time for a protein break!"
msgstr "단백질 보충할 시간!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78055D3247DBAF58B7C2D79EA4F5A2CC"
msgid "Don't forget to drink your pre-workout, bro~"
msgstr "운동 전 음료 마시는 거 잊지 마, 브로~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::92535E234BF4B2D37FEBBAA9BF7ECF41"
msgid "Who needs a bench press when you've got a pizza press?"
msgstr "피자 프레스가 있는데 벤치 프레스가 왜 필요해?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5DA7802048690DF4262814B0A78FBDCF"
msgid "Forget Papa Ronee's; Uncle Muscle's is where it's at!"
msgstr "파파 로니'스는 잊어; 어클 머슬'스가 진짜야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::010768A846412A5A053EDAAC55D1C167"
msgid "Get over here, bro!"
msgstr "이리 와, 브로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2EF3B10E40E2E58F6A6EACB1D8167A7F"
msgid "Look at those muscles, bro! Feed those guns some 'za!"
msgstr "저 근육 좀 봐, 브로! 그 작은 근육들한테 피자 좀 먹여줘!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EE12CA45413396D04A3D6E93E952E5F5"
msgid "Broooooooooo! @You're awesome, bro."
msgstr "브로오오오오오! @넌 최고야, 브로."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::107EFEDD41AB4D6AC88B86B6DC830000"
msgid "I love you, bro. This is great."
msgstr "사랑해, 브로. 이거 정말 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AA54438240D31FC2EA6931B9DF43790C"
msgid "Eyyyyyyyyyyyyy. @Welcome back, bro!"
msgstr "에에에에이. @다시 오셨네요, 브로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B7D5E55846FFBD9C04390B9676FF53C0"
msgid "Bro! @Bro. @Hi."
msgstr "브로! @브로. @안녕."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5F0CBE8410EA61459C8EC949E3260C4"
msgid "*Virgil flexes his knuckles*"
msgstr "*버질이 손가락 관절을 꺾는다*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5BC3BE0D445F89614E0BC6B2A11ECE84"
msgid "*Virgil hums a workout tune*"
msgstr "*버질이 운동 노래를 흥얼거린다*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::59E080FB4AEBA51F25A7D08009041132"
msgid "*Virgil does some finger pushups*"
msgstr "*버질이 손가락 푸시업을 한다*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EB4162284C6F25239697EBB5429AEB92"
msgid "*Virgil practices his chest vacuum*"
msgstr "*버질이 복부 진공 자세를 연습한다*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::00D53506484CAAFB40AFAD80CD319CAE"
msgid "*Virgil alternates flexing his pecs, saying \"hey ;)\" in morse code*"
msgstr "*버질이 가슴근육을 번갈아 자랑하며 모스 부호로 \"hey ;)\" 라고 말한다*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1861865F4295E97502D60BB2FD47A918"
msgid "*Virgil's muscle stare back at your muscles.*"
msgstr "*버질의 근육이 당신의 근육을 마주 본다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD2D3C42497C2DCF4849F3A6D4024D86"
msgid "I can do this all day."
msgstr "이건 하루 종일도 할 수 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2CCD21094331A5C4421730BC09DAF520"
msgid "Make sure to do some curls after eating that."
msgstr "그거 먹고 나서 컬 운동 좀 해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::93F5BF3A418FC93BA2F26889D4738F23"
msgid "Just FYI- That's not a parmesan container; it's creatine."
msgstr "참고로- 그거 파르메산 치즈 통이 아니라 크레아틴이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C01135AC4DA65A4CE3AB47B6AF74E0BA"
msgid "You're not just hitting the metabolic window- You're smashing it bro!"
msgstr "대사 창구를 그냥 두드리는 게 아니라- 박살내는 거야, 브로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D61C014455A99DB11944FABF9F0E16C"
msgid "Don't forget to include all the essential aminos, bro."
msgstr "필수 아미노산도 다 챙기는 거 잊지 마, 브로."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::62C2A1D147FB5CD91F479DB069D410A0"
msgid "Bro. You're wild, bro. So many %item%."
msgstr "브로. 너 진짜 대단하다, 브로. %item%도 엄청 많네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28AD91F94C1AFAF51829489275D5ADBC"
msgid "Ah, yeah; bulking is so last season."
msgstr "아, 그래; 벌크업은 이제 한물갔지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::91C49BA446DD0D4DD44F0E8F5A169580"
msgid "Get that outta here, bro; Its no good for you."
msgstr "그거 여기서 치워, 브로; 너한테 안 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7EEE25DE44E89B16CA0F5A8ACD73E470"
msgid "Cash money, bro!"
msgstr "현금이다, 브로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D5D180C24181771776B658AAEA713EFB"
msgid "Nice, bro!"
msgstr "좋았어, 브로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6BF78149456EA8E1844A849B47D7CFB0"
msgid "Bro, you've got beautiful eyes, bro..."
msgstr "브로, 너 눈이 정말 예쁘다, 브로..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::548ACA39429148DA1764BABF9EC7677A"
msgid "Lookin' swole!"
msgstr "근육 빵빵하네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F41AE2F14BFC25851BE636A2B48E5AC5"
msgid "Too swole to control!"
msgstr "너무 커져서 주체가 안 돼!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::53D17ACD4F6FE79027AB77883C2C9CDB"
msgid "Never skip leg day, bro."
msgstr "레그 데이를 절대 건너뛰지 마, 브로."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::74DC1F9E49F98370BAAA11AE9326A424"
msgid "Don't worry, bro; we can fix this."
msgstr "걱정 마, 브로; 우리가 고칠 수 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::489EB4CB4D0C201CF9657BA0399E2BA4"
msgid "Pizza's half off, but this shirt is all the way on!"
msgstr "피자는 반값인데, 이 셔츠는 끝까지 입고 있네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A1E766ED4417E952DAF341890118986A"
msgid "Bulking season! Come get yours!"
msgstr "벌크업 시즌! 얼른 와서 가져가!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9298FB104E0C354D6D5CD0AE84D7AEFD"
msgid "Bro, is there a party going on outside? "
msgstr "브로, 밖에서 파티하는 거 아니야? "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7E55D62D40D855DC7A70C6BDFED52E38"
msgid "You should head out and see what's going on, bro- Get some steps in."
msgstr "나가서 무슨 일인지 좀 봐, 브로- 걸음 수도 좀 채우고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B18C8A947E1501D8F2FE087934ACD7E"
msgid "The Bone Collector"
msgstr "뼈 수집가"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::50BD6D3C4D81DDBAA4F3BA86C0DFEFA5"
msgid ""
"I am the bone collector. I collect bones. Aid me and you shall be rewarded."
msgstr "나는 뼈 수집가다. 나는 뼈를 모은다. 나를 도우면 보상을 받으리라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D3032B66459E8F6066DE9DA58E302097"
msgid "My bones are in many places. Some in a pond. @Some across the ocean."
msgstr "내 뼈는 여러 곳에 있다. 일부는 연못에. @일부는 바다 건너에."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::41329EFE4C22C0701281C49CF9203A3A"
msgid ""
"My bones are in many places. Some lost with a pup. @Some found in the corner"
" of the island."
msgstr "내 뼈는 여러 곳에 있다. 일부는 강아지와 함께 잃어버렸고. @일부는 섬 모퉁이에서 발견되었다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::95DD2E004F760EF5DF60CC9DD9D2E0D9"
msgid "Find my bones and you shall be rewarded."
msgstr "내 뼈를 찾으면 보상을 받으리라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89F0B529424EB975D4315BA4819A3A36"
msgid "I cannot rest until my bones are found."
msgstr "내 뼈를 찾기 전엔 쉴 수 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::516279434EDD9B6500F55E852C12DC52"
msgid "I cannot become complete until my bones are found."
msgstr "내 뼈를 찾기 전엔 온전해질 수 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9306CE494D8FCFFCF8E4C0BD40C2035D"
msgid ""
"My bones are in many places. Some under what was once a tree. @Some hiding "
"in new born plants."
msgstr "내 뼈는 여러 곳에 흩어져 있어. 어떤 건 예전에 나무였던 것 아래에. @어떤 건 새로 자란 식물 속에 숨어 있지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E78A39A7410280A18FE508AF53AA6C86"
msgid "My bones are in many places. Some in darkness. @Some near light."
msgstr "내 뼈는 여러 곳에 흩어져 있어. 어떤 건 어둠 속에. @어떤 건 빛 가까이에."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CFF073374F146F2089BEF1A96AF0FA64"
msgid "My bones are in many places. Some unknown even to me."
msgstr "내 뼈는 여러 곳에 흩어져 있어. 나조차 모르는 곳에 있는 것도 있지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD1A5B934C00801BDE782DA41363CD4E"
msgid "Find my bones and collect your rewards."
msgstr "내 뼈를 찾으면 보상을 받을 수 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AE7CF76E4F3A0A1A4548DDA86FA8154C"
msgid "!FIND MY BONES"
msgstr "!내 뼈를 찾아줘"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A25BDD904FF0BC5EA55D69AAD0E74E76"
msgid "My bones have been found and I am finally at peace. @Thank you."
msgstr "내 뼈를 찾았구나. 이제 드디어 편히 쉴 수 있겠어. @고마워."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::64864C4343FCD4E8806E239DA24CB224"
msgid "Hanna"
msgstr "한나"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE08561440492F553A4770B090BE479E"
msgid "Great to see a new face!"
msgstr "새 얼굴을 보니 반갑네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89AF96BE434D8CECEAFC14B80E4A6599"
msgid "Hey there! Ready to get your singing voice on?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 노래할 준비 되셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D372891D43B3F4F4D5E2CAB2385AABCE"
msgid "Good to see you again! We've got the rooms all ready for your parties."
msgstr "다시 보니 반가워요! 파티용 방은 모두 준비해 두었답니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4F5370294CD0FEC2EC6F10B13117DB75"
msgid "Hope you've warmed up your vocal chords!"
msgstr "목 풀어 두셨길 바라요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E205337A481073620D7907B0F74FDC42"
msgid "Remember, it's pronounced kaeri - ouki!"
msgstr "기억하세요, 카에리 - 오우키라고 발음해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D08F4D3C438AD1F9E32BDE82E8FBC8A4"
msgid ""
"I'd say I can't wait to hear your beautiful voice, but these rooms are "
"soundproofed anyways!"
msgstr "아름다운 목소리를 빨리 듣고 싶다고 말하고 싶지만, 이 방들은 어차피 방음이 된답니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E421FA543750ED398CDC7B4813B1761"
msgid ""
"Whatever you end up singing to, I'm sure you'll have fun. And that's what "
"matters."
msgstr "무엇을 부르시든 분명 즐거우실 거예요. 그게 중요한 거니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::95FD7B7941949DA33A3E5F98423EFB6F"
msgid ""
"Do you have a song in mind already? Don't tell me; I'm sure it'll get in my "
"head."
msgstr "벌써 부를 노래가 생각나셨나요? 말하지 마세요. 제 머릿속에 맴돌 테니까요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C1EE3CB742F830AF61E3C0954C40DB2B"
msgid ""
"You know, if you want to make music at your home, you might want to hit up "
"Songbirds later!"
msgstr "참고로, 집에서 음악을 만들고 싶으시면 나중에 Songbirds에 들러 보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89C16B774FC7CEB653D6D69E2E3B6D17"
msgid "Have I done Karaoke here before? ...Does humming at my desk count?"
msgstr "제가 여기서 노래방을 해본 적이 있냐고요? ...책상에서 콧노래 부른 건 쳐 주나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFC0688843FE55BB5D7A329EDEB0B60B"
msgid ""
"I'd avoid getting too drunk in the karaoke rooms. Please. @I have to clean "
"them."
msgstr "노래방에서 술은 너무 많이 마시지 마세요. 부탁드려요. @제가 치워야 하거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6F35923F4FDDD19DAF2929A1C8AF6BFC"
msgid "Remember, it's pronounced kaeri - ouki!"
msgstr "기억하세요, 카에리 - 오우키라고 발음해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EB01929742DF728129C0E28796D03C3A"
msgid "Let me know if you need anything else!"
msgstr "더 필요한 게 있으면 말씀해 주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::05CB24AF40527C1491A613907F4221BD"
msgid "Enjoy!"
msgstr "즐겁게 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F31EDCB44504D8E1690E948791B76327"
msgid "Let me know if you need to renew your timeslot!"
msgstr "이용 시간을 연장하고 싶으시면 말씀해 주세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::215294C44C9BAA2037E57C8D33BC90BA"
msgid "Karaoke over here!"
msgstr "노래방은 이쪽이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F8D1DD5F4C09CFF8A63B199DEE49B197"
msgid "Speed"
msgstr "속도"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B6484AA438DBD73CEF1AF938F07DED7"
msgid "!Welcome!"
msgstr "!환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5DFD3BFA4B95E5E75061BA92D6717A31"
msgid "!Hey!"
msgstr "!안녕!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::549663084D550DB4BABBFBAD307B47BA"
msgid "!Welcome!"
msgstr "!환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A08CFCF147D526CE8A4C708ADB718EBD"
msgid "!You think you're having fun now? Just wait 'til I upgrade ya!"
msgstr "!지금도 충분히 즐거우신가요? 제가 업그레이드해 드리면 두고 보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E8A7934D44139C9DF7827C918B736262"
msgid ""
"!I used to think I was pretty good at Ball Race, too. Then I got better!"
msgstr "!나도 예전엔 Ball Race를 꽤 잘한다고 생각했지. 그런데 더 잘하게 됐어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::093599D64E0B32904C2A77B88AB104AD"
msgid "!I say pick the most distracting ball."
msgstr "!가장 방해되는 공을 고르라고 하겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::764CE05D47F3772A06A420B97B18B49F"
msgid "!Get a pickup that ya wanna pick up!"
msgstr "!끌리는 아이템을 골라!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::504BBE1046418599F9FDEF86E13DB380"
msgid ""
"!I'm at the top of the leaderboards. Can't see my name? Upgrade your eyes!"
msgstr "!내가 리더보드 맨 위에 있어. 내 이름이 안 보인다고? 눈부터 업그레이드해!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::063F2D1746B0812E437D78AC97BE58D0"
msgid "!Hit the ground rolling! That's what I say!"
msgstr "!굴러서 착지야! 내 말은 그거야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::04E52022447F2E6893CE308DC707ECB8"
msgid "!I'll race you to the Game World!"
msgstr "!게임 월드까지 누가 빠른지 겨뤄보자!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2E60625C429E2EBD571FC08AD4FE268D"
msgid "!Take your race to the next level!"
msgstr "!레이스를 한 단계 더 높은 수준으로!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B601032F426A9FBC45F16E9B2E2CA89E"
msgid "!Welcome, welcome! Hello!"
msgstr "!환영해, 환영해! 안녕!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B15FBDD04E96C5F1D781F4A2C9C56D8E"
msgid "!Welcome back, you!"
msgstr "!다시 왔구나, 너!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::04EFA7804D8B350830307A9AA19D5F6E"
msgid "!I see yer not thinking of this as a race!"
msgstr "!이걸 경주라고 생각 안 하는 것 같은데!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C7FC0E2346315723508B0492C6DA97BA"
msgid "!Slowpoke!"
msgstr "!느림보!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7D0ABE83413F8F503AB1BF94F365648A"
msgid "!Great!"
msgstr "!좋아!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A75CD6D24F97A878C8CC80A4250B9C25"
msgid "!That's a lot of upgrades!"
msgstr "!업그레이드가 많구나!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5B42D9F544B09C671F769BA0B02BCA02"
msgid "!If ya didn't like it ya shoulda said sooner!"
msgstr "!마음에 안 들었으면 더 일찍 말하지 그랬어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4C8DE89F446EFB2C1366AA8FD170AC95"
msgid "!GOAL!"
msgstr "!골인!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::52211E5348DB81E72E57AEB922D5D47D"
msgid "Birdie"
msgstr "버디"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B1796EC426450D55EBCAF90678B1D21"
msgid "#Hey, golfer!"
msgstr "#안녕, 골퍼!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5F3CFCA24FEF907DE94CA38D44FB7D48"
msgid "#FORE!!!"
msgstr "#포어!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::184BAEA940A73F2B6A012EA60CFD0310"
msgid "#Welcome back!"
msgstr "#어서 와!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE77426A4F58FC078767E0906CA469DA"
msgid "#If you need a caddie, I'm your catsack!"
msgstr "#캐디가 필요하면 이 캣색이 도와줄게!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD718AF64F4D7634ABDAE4A6A827DCBC"
msgid "#You put the putt in potential!"
msgstr "#넌 퍼트에 잠재력을 담았어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8D1B92404D46AC842AF844B8DA2919B2"
msgid "#It took a lot of work to get these trails not to char the courses."
msgstr "#이 궤적이 코스를 태우지 않게 하려고 엄청 고생했단다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::33FCCFEE4B23DD398250BFBDDDB033DD"
msgid "#In Minigolf, we believe any ball can be a golf ball!"
msgstr "#미니골프에서는 어떤 공이든 골프공이 될 수 있어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3555F6EE49329C3BF9741D9D99204241"
msgid "#See you on the green!"
msgstr "#그린에서 만나!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FFFFFF2140DD1A3269EDC18AD0FED667"
msgid "#Come back any time!"
msgstr "#언제든 다시 와!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::502B863D4B245624A43DDCB8F00AFA46"
msgid "#Minigolf upgrades here!"
msgstr "#미니골프 업그레이드는 여기!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::967832A64C9EEE6039AE7D87225759B1"
msgid "#Hey! Its my favorite Minigolfer."
msgstr "#안녕! 내가 제일 좋아하는 미니골퍼야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::132FAC474BAC51D0EA09CA97774E5C37"
msgid "#Take your time. Making the perfect putt takes thought."
msgstr "#서두르지 마. 완벽한 퍼트엔 생각이 필요해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3FA1DE3D4D435A0C77466CA31DD49F5B"
msgid "#You don't have to stay here, if you want to get golfing."
msgstr "#골프를 치고 싶다면 여기 있을 필요는 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8E96EF4D44BFB2584D5AA78F6D0C9EE2"
msgid "#Nice in!"
msgstr "#나이스 인!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD6C47434FC61F831DAD87B16B00E4D3"
msgid "#NICE in!"
msgstr "#나이스 인!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D2E1FF934EBC60638DA1A9A6D459347C"
msgid "#Taking a mulligan?"
msgstr "#멀리건을 칠 거야?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::979FD142474AE8437985249E35E909F9"
msgid "#Let's try something else."
msgstr "#다른 걸 해보자."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5901C46B49A11AF69C0CB09F4AAD2EFA"
msgid "#Now that's a hole-in-one, if I've ever seen one!"
msgstr "#이건 내가 본 것 중 최고의 홀인원이야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2A2188514C5923856324AE9A35264200"
msgid "Bradley"
msgstr "브래들리"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::59AC19644F7F0B51093A50B717FC762C"
msgid "Oh, hey; a new face! Right on! Come on inside. What'cha lookin for?"
msgstr "오, 안녕하세요. 새 얼굴이네요! 잘 됐네요. 어서 오세요. 뭘 찾으세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::451A692C4A357BA454F0F29EE32A45B6"
msgid "Hey there, thanks for stopping by!"
msgstr "안녕하세요, 들러 주셔서 감사합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::894AE3734E19B666A60250BFE41D28F0"
msgid "Hello! Come on in; I just finished re-arranging the displays."
msgstr "안녕하세요! 어서 오세요. 방금 전시품 재배치를 마쳤어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::82229D454A2892F3FDB326905032194A"
msgid "Hi! What'cha lookin' for?"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 뭘 찾으세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4630B96344301ED00F7FA0A0D61CA32E"
msgid ""
"Hey! Want some furniture, or just getting out of the heat for a sec? Either "
"way, come on in!"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 가구를 보러 오셨나요, 아니면 잠깐 더위를 피하러 오셨나요? 어느 쪽이든 어서 오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B3CED4B4A2CE8D9EB41D79134697E43"
msgid "Man, my back's killin' me... @Oh! Sorry. Can I help you?"
msgstr "허, 허리야... @아! 죄송해요. 뭘 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::338FE06B46034641B46FDBB81CE1FE67"
msgid "Whew! Long day today. Get you somethin'?"
msgstr "휴! 오늘 하루 정말 길었네요. 뭐 드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1E93126F4B838EB47B58C0B0243DECE7"
msgid ""
"Lookin' forward to break today, lemme tell you. What can I help you with?"
msgstr "오늘은 정말 쉬고 싶네요. 뭘 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FFA81EDB4727EA39FA5F9E90FB6245FA"
msgid "Inventory's always growin'! Take a look."
msgstr "재고가 계속 늘어나요! 한번 둘러보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4935B7094A04BA9B8B6697B6D1D36E1F"
msgid ""
"Hey. You know anyone lookin for part time work? Could use another hand "
"around here."
msgstr "안녕하세요. 혹시 아르바이트 구하는 분 아세요? 여기 일손이 하나 더 필요해서요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D536C3A7436E78D976D5C48F5AE30586"
msgid ""
"Feel free to test out the furniture on the showfloor. I put it there myself."
msgstr "전시장의 가구를 마음껏 시험해 보세요. 제가 직접 놓은 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7CCE21FC44B9BA29CE880A8AB87A75C0"
msgid ""
"Whew. Wow, I'm looking forward to a vacation! @Oh, sorry. What can I help "
"you with?"
msgstr "휴. 아이고, 휴가가 너무 기다려져요! @아, 죄송해요. 뭘 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::610B7A494B81672F8380CE8CD4F9F9A7"
msgid "Later!"
msgstr "나중에 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF7D8EC844067DDDF780A79CD3F28E56"
msgid "Come again!"
msgstr "또 오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::183CC3B448D48EB8F57A4489278FF050"
msgid "Thanks! Alright, time to get back to it."
msgstr "고마워요! 자, 이제 다시 일할 시간이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6AEB526A4745DF3E33A84B953C9726A7"
msgid "Thanks, man!"
msgstr "고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FA3F8173404D147D552A7699CFD97A39"
msgid "Come back soon, if we're still here."
msgstr "우리가 아직 있으면 또 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED7A84EF4ACAA1CE800B3E83F222E9D8"
msgid "Oh, hi! Come on in."
msgstr "아, 안녕하세요! 어서 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A836E5DE4AD60E74D8A2D584C19EB503"
msgid "How very kind of you."
msgstr "정말 친절하시네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F8DC604642344D0B2B28D392CB202789"
msgid "Oh, hey! How's it going? What'cha looking for this time?"
msgstr "아, 안녕하세요! 잘 지내세요? 이번엔 뭘 찾으세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F22E1ED44BFE166AA2FBF859BAD7A33"
msgid ""
"Nice to see you again! Let me know if you need help lifting something, 'kay?"
msgstr "다시 만나서 반가워요! 뭐 들 게 있으면 말씀하세요, 알겠죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DFF08ECA4762806D0E7F01871B1DC492"
msgid ""
"Welcome back! I'm sure you know the drill, but I'm always here to help lift "
"somethin'."
msgstr "다시 오신 걸 환영해요! 잘 아실 테지만, 들 일이 있으면 언제든 도와드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4242109547F82E60EDF956BD7CA21E71"
msgid "Take your time. I needed a break anyways @Ha ha!"
msgstr "천천히 하세요. 어차피 저도 쉬어야 했거든요 @하하!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BBAB77A24170A7BD594D24A61AAF9B7F"
msgid ""
"You mind if I do some inventory while you decide? Never enough free time "
"around here."
msgstr "고르시는 동안 제가 재고를 좀 정리해도 될까요? 여긴 늘 시간이 부족해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C3F5B8034778314A63CF31B089D6BC17"
msgid ""
"I have to re-arrange our pianos in the storeroom after this, so I appreciate"
" you helping me stall for time."
msgstr "이 일이 끝나면 창고의 피아노들을 다시 정리해야 해서, 시간 벌어 주셔서 정말 고마워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6563839B4DD49BDF2420B6B32FF84CFE"
msgid "Gotcha, anything else?"
msgstr "알겠어요, 더 필요한 거 있으세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8830CC8C498F8E2121352C98D531C168"
msgid "Oh, good! Those are near the front of the storeroom."
msgstr "아, 잘됐네요! 그건 창고 앞쪽에 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4DD6CC53479822CD4C4164B269178DA4"
msgid "Sure thing!"
msgstr "당연하죠!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ABB967A74EA7481C0B80C3B62BB468A4"
msgid ""
"I wonder if I can carry that many items. Only one way to find out, huh?"
msgstr "그렇게 많은 물건을 들 수 있을지 모르겠네. 해봐야 알겠지, 그렇지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::46B256B14F279C28072DA483D5E993B0"
msgid ""
"Hm. Never tried to carry that much stuff at once. Well, this'll be "
"interesting."
msgstr "흠. 한 번에 그렇게 많은 걸 들어본 적은 없는데. 뭐, 흥미로워지겠네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2BF7F98C4ED201771743BA8834174A11"
msgid ""
"Hey, if I don't come out with your stuff in 5 minutes, I probably got buried"
" under chairs."
msgstr "이봐, 5분 안에 네 물건을 들고 나오지 않으면 의자 밑에 깔린 거라고 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D6A25760446D55D6F913B9A0D47DCA80"
msgid "Looks like it's time to roll up the ol' sleeves!"
msgstr "자, 이제 소매를 걷어붙일 시간이군!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7E3B105846CFE2355D5C0BA5F4D74B3D"
msgid "Hey! I can probably juggle that many of %item%!"
msgstr "%item%을 그만큼이나 저글링할 수 있을 것 같은데!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3559E71C4FE82DB172F04E876B92A53C"
msgid "Looks like I'll get to show off my %item% stacking skills today."
msgstr "오늘은 내 %item% 쌓기 실력을 뽐낼 수 있겠네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE6E1A614511E77291B68C9CA980DC11"
msgid "Bulk order, huh? No problem!"
msgstr "대량 주문이군, 그렇지? 문제없지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::36E19B224E7C7E1901DE15A828CB1F6E"
msgid "Hey, it's cool! One less thing for me to carry, heh."
msgstr "이야, 좋은데! 내가 들 게 하나 줄었네, 헤헤."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E24964CD4D54DE13E900CE838CCC21C9"
msgid "Alright, I'll take %item% off the list."
msgstr "좋아, 목록에서 %item%을 빼둘게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B1B9EFE47BC2971BAE5229D468BC7F3"
msgid "Gotcha, lemme just remove that from the list real quick."
msgstr "알겠어, 금방 목록에서 지울게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DBF8B44E4528F9B44FDBA0AF539D5D03"
msgid "Hey, thanks for your patronage!"
msgstr "이야, 단골이라니 고마워!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E2D243C94D882B6DBCAF65B5DB74EFA7"
msgid "Thanks for the sale! I'll go get your stuff now."
msgstr "사줘서 고마워! 이제 물건 가지러 갈게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3B16E26C459ADFD2EB8138A1BFC8D865"
msgid "Right on, thanks! "
msgstr "좋아, 고마워! "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::322CB53E4E444177FE1E718AF243B059"
msgid "Sales are great! Come on in and lift out some furniture!"
msgstr "세일은 좋지! 어서 와서 가구 좀 들고 가!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::71F5C5D84B24DCE2CF73FC9357D0A88D"
msgid ""
"You go ahead and enjoy the events. I'm tired from lifting all this "
"furniture."
msgstr "넌 가서 이벤트를 즐겨. 난 이 가구들 들느라 지쳤거든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C82885DA40C988F907364493456253CC"
msgid "Dragon Hero"
msgstr "드래곤 히어로"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1C3DE0D54E248F8009C926B2B4E7D048"
msgid "Greetings, traveler!"
msgstr "안녕하신가, 여행자여!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B077AD5243D8B4C709A57AAFEC83D48F"
msgid "Good day!"
msgstr "좋은 날이군!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9AD53EA14F647AFC4204DE8CF3FC4B52"
msgid "Greetings!"
msgstr "경례하네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0736EE184E056DCA5218ADA4DA40AE0A"
msgid "Improve thyself with the magic of Upgrades!"
msgstr "업그레이드의 마법으로 자신을 단련하라!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8A4B9EBB4FE7FDDEE6C2329E8882F5E0"
msgid "Shall I tell thee which Upgrade to choose? @Alas, I cannot."
msgstr "어떤 업그레이드를 고를지 말해 주랴? @아쉽게도 그럴 수 없구나."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::56F6405A405941C9265BA5B27F60AB34"
msgid ""
"If a great hero must be in great condition, a great villain must be as well!"
msgstr "위대한 영웅이 위대한 상태여야 한다면, 위대한 악당도 마찬가지다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C0704604835EC450FC71E916253D1BC"
msgid ""
"Wizards hath said that Upgrades improve thy charisma! @I do not believe "
"them."
msgstr "마법사들이 말하길 업그레이드가 매력을 높인다더군! @난 믿지 않네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FB55E94C4CA0A7C0ED56AFA9F379FC13"
msgid "Fare thee well!"
msgstr "잘 가게나!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::246B35B647EC50EBC3C706A343CC7B4F"
msgid "Good health to thee!"
msgstr "건강하길 비네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EF6E78BD40C0019BD97A40AF97B141A2"
msgid "May you defeat a thousand knights!"
msgstr "기사 천 명을 물리치길!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FEB673CE4B13C949CEE12E81D3F1C999"
msgid "May you slay a thousand dragons!"
msgstr "용 천 마리를 처치하길!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DEE9449A4285A8A442FF609E8DFA159F"
msgid "Upgrades await you!"
msgstr "업그레이드가 그대를 기다린다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B4A06EB9443F3338741C0F8F637F796A"
msgid "Well met!"
msgstr "만나서 반갑네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::353F2EDE4DFD35570F4D8393720CFAC9"
msgid "Good day!"
msgstr "좋은 날이군!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::871D6D3F4B3AE023173AEE8CA4ACD8B1"
msgid "Dost thou need a minute?"
msgstr "잠깐 시간이 필요한가?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3C7582844EFBA29617220B877B118F4D"
msgid "* Dragon Hero starts whistling a jaunty tune! *"
msgstr "* 드래곤 히어로가 경쾌한 곡을 휘파람으로 분다! *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::30500DAF49D6D0E2C3C7B08F9901B2A0"
msgid "Fantastique!"
msgstr "환상적이야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::21BF6167473574640ECF148A77D5FCAE"
msgid "Huzzah!"
msgstr "만세!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3D31E799461DC921A9404C8528895891"
msgid "Alas, another choice then."
msgstr "아쉽지만, 그럼 다른 걸로 하지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0426EA6A460386B09A6547B96E2D2446"
msgid "Good fortune to thee!"
msgstr "행운이 함께하길!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C74C369D47CE96CC2E0BFD9D00354E64"
msgid "It seems some sort of tournament has begun!"
msgstr "어떤 토너먼트가 시작된 모양이군요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6953847D4FA88D6B3994D5B74F922CEF"
msgid "Check-in to your Condo."
msgstr "콘도에 체크인하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D0C7D874B51F2574E0B448F5EDD7C80"
msgid "Hey there, let me help you check into your Condo!"
msgstr "안녕하세요, 콘도 체크인을 도와드릴게요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0C6A1F984AD7B925EE287FB020A89A48"
msgid "Kalleira"
msgstr "칼레이라"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B31E8E040323463A38000B7289F08E7"
msgid "Glad you could join the party!"
msgstr "파티에 참여해 주셔서 기뻐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9CE80F1C4638041567FF56A9491C6187"
msgid "Welcome back!"
msgstr "다시 오신 걸 환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A9F6A394491B0EEFD03C9CA8169C8CB7"
msgid "Haven't seen you in a while! @Not that I was waiting for you."
msgstr "오랜만이네요! @기다린 건 아니에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EABF47E24D5182A39606D5803C38308A"
msgid "Having fun?"
msgstr "즐겁게 놀고 있나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FCEC7CEC4AA594950AA20AB4BF54219F"
msgid "I can't believe it's been over ten years!"
msgstr "벌써 10년이 넘었다니 믿기지 않네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6845B6E648171DFCCEA22191E9C11265"
msgid ""
"I'd let you see what the future really holds for Tower, but that's between "
"me and the moon."
msgstr "타워의 미래가 어떤지 보여주고 싶지만, 그건 나와 달 사이의 일이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5BFEFDA74212835852AD709750FC7312"
msgid "There's so much to celebrate!"
msgstr "축하할 일이 정말 많아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4135FD524E8625E4BF40FB8713407112"
msgid "The Stray's still open! Don't worry~"
msgstr "더 스트레이는 아직 영업 중이에요! 걱정 마세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A2CB538B41B52AF59C2CDAB0CC835617"
msgid ""
"It'll be nice to make more memories together~ @My cauldron and I, I mean."
msgstr "함께 더 많은 추억을 쌓을 수 있어서 좋겠네요~ @내 가마솥과 나 말이에요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::12F3909E45547C9C078E03B7A779704A"
msgid "We've packed up some special treats for the occasion~!"
msgstr "이번 기념일을 위해 특별한 간식을 준비했어요~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A367A6394935781EF06DE0B09CD2EBBE"
msgid "Thanks for sticking around! Now, where's that yarn ball gone..."
msgstr "남아줘서 고마워요! 자, 그 실뭉치는 어디 갔지..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C2277EC34AB3204002F91FB3C9C6DAE4"
msgid "It was a pleasure. See you soon!"
msgstr "즐거웠어요. 곧 또 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::038AEF3A4F0D66C26808789CD590DEFE"
msgid "Hope you found something interesting. Catch you later!"
msgstr "재미난 걸 찾았길 바라요. 나중에 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4CCB1DA64D5036D5DE0A69A24D32615A"
msgid "Psst. Over here! Come celebrate with me!"
msgstr "쉿, 이쪽이에요! 저와 함께 축하해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F5A8B87E495689D7A7BC1BAF2DCDC39B"
msgid "I'm over here! Let's party!"
msgstr "여기예요! 파티를 즐겨요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A557BE6E4B3DF9CAB1B9C5AB487A626D"
msgid "Party items for sale!"
msgstr "파티 아이템 판매 중!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E6F988EC467DCAB2AB2C38A1DAB3877A"
msgid "Hey you! Yeah, you. Come here! It's time to party!"
msgstr "거기 너! 그래, 너. 이리 와! 파티할 시간이야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F611BF63476297D87710E2BBBEF77408"
msgid "Let's celebrate together!"
msgstr "함께 축하해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFEFB25E48BA6E6C5CF8ED961BBCBBDC"
msgid "Thank you so much! I've always wanted a %item%!"
msgstr "%item%을 늘 갖고 싶었어요! 정말 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4FAE633144650B51D7BD588B3F5741CE"
msgid "This will make for a great gift for the moon, thanks!"
msgstr "달에게 좋은 선물이 되겠네요, 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::666C849E4ED97995F0B4D19C128EA681"
msgid "Aw, you shouldn't have!"
msgstr "어머, 이런 걸 다 해주고!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3B19FFE74ADA1FC8A42CB4A553BCC468"
msgid "You're really loving the events, huh?"
msgstr "이벤트를 정말 좋아하시네요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2498BE4A4B08047D1ED02F8CE1F0F225"
msgid "I wonder what you'll buy this time..."
msgstr "이번엔 뭘 살지 궁금하네요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ACAF7B4543DA175FBFD30882BDA452A0"
msgid "Are you going to buy something or just stare?"
msgstr "살 거예요, 아니면 그냥 쳐다볼 거예요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B41142E544D76207C447F0801BF909A5"
msgid "I think you should buy that item. @No! @That one."
msgstr "그 물건을 사는 게 좋겠어요. @아니! @저거요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A76F6E474829968D91ADF4B374FC626C"
msgid "Hurry up! I've got a date with the moon. @I wish..."
msgstr "서두르세요! 달과 데이트가 있어서요. @그러면 좋겠다..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8523156B4268DD342D6FA983584462DA"
msgid "I've got other customers to serve, you know?"
msgstr "저도 다른 손님들을 응대해야 하거든요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::03E8CCAE4568483EB36AF5B2406EAA54"
msgid "Look, if you're not buying anything, at least move or something!"
msgstr "이봐요, 안 살 거면 적어도 비켜주든가!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B84C1AF48BF9E41C25B809AD30F002C"
msgid "Are all humans as indecisive as you?"
msgstr "인간들은 다 당신처럼 우유부단한가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE4B69744A4163780D7A7AAF34BB849C"
msgid "Nice pick. @Or is it?"
msgstr "좋은 선택이네요. @정말요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA89835F45FD9595759A8C835F861A0A"
msgid "Buying that, huh?"
msgstr "그거 사시는군요, 네?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5027BC974F0AD6F51EECA281CD19D625"
msgid "Excellent choice, possibly."
msgstr "탁월한 선택이에요, 아마도."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8201E25D4EB812C05DB0CD9FAC4F6B7F"
msgid "You may have chosen correctly, but only time will tell."
msgstr "제대로 고르셨을지도 모르죠. 시간이 말해주겠지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C589177D4729467E4FDDAEAEABB4EC0F"
msgid "Woah! I'm gonna have to restock soon!"
msgstr "와! 머지않아 재입고해야겠네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9F3680044510B557070A4A8F56781B1"
msgid "You do realize there are other items, right?"
msgstr "다른 물건들도 있다는 거 알지?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DFB8A5B84D41DE6F7ED5B1B57A19D8C3"
msgid "Changing your mind already?"
msgstr "벌써 마음을 바꾸신 건가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B8539281437525D6A5DB50B73826EF41"
msgid "Ah, not what you wanted, huh?"
msgstr "아, 원하던 게 아니었나 보네요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4401BB794C192F8E03F7D28C1BAEF137"
msgid "Excellent choices!"
msgstr "훌륭한 선택이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C4F3CD274D6B71509C774BA7F6088C3C"
msgid "Heh, heh, nice!"
msgstr "헤헤, 좋아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E6E53444A2358639CAB58A73E309B5E"
msgid "Hey, do you mind standing back a bit next time?"
msgstr "저기, 다음엔 조금 뒤로 물러서 주실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D2729EC34EEDA25F2D15EC9F490A5909"
msgid "Oh!@ A large customer!"
msgstr "오!@ 덩치 큰 손님이시네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B4815BD5451E1160348F54AEBB4B9E40"
msgid "I see you've shopped here before, small person."
msgstr "여기서 전에 쇼핑하신 적 있죠, 꼬마야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::18A664A9402498D3DC3C389826FDC1E4"
msgid "Everything's on sale!"
msgstr "전부 세일 중이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BA91B55B471E5021FA346E86D9B01A18"
msgid "Grab everything you can; there's a sale!"
msgstr "세일이에요, 있는 대로 다 챙기세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DC9BAAC0492FCE1D48841FAF9BE87FB0"
msgid "Sale! Sale! Buy! Buy!"
msgstr "세일! 세일! 사세요! 사세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0DF005B64B8BF7042BCCDCA3A15D4B29"
msgid "The sale won't last long, hurry!"
msgstr "세일은 오래 못 가요, 서두르세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D0797C5B4E94DFC84A478DBE7F233F93"
msgid "This sale is better than the last! Quick!"
msgstr "이번 세일이 지난번보다 좋아요! 빨리요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D04952E14D47F044F2ADCCA5E062F78D"
msgid "My sister is throwing another event up! Go check it out!"
msgstr "우리 언니가 또 이벤트를 열었어요! 한번 가보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::913971B74E2235A945FFA187C5685344"
msgid "Normally, I'd participate in the events, but I'm busy."
msgstr "보통은 이벤트에 참여하지만, 지금은 바빠요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7E8B18384DB7816A666A899CC20A4B8E"
msgid "Not one for events, huh?"
msgstr "이벤트엔 별 관심 없으신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E7F8B49F445981EAB91DC685D9C077E8"
msgid "My sister really loves making those events, I'd go check it out!"
msgstr "우리 언니는 그런 이벤트 만드는 걸 정말 좋아해요. 한번 가보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88FD213D421EBDA427CE6597D52E26AA"
msgid "Events are really fun, but I'm always busy."
msgstr "이벤트는 정말 재미있지만, 전 늘 바빠요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0E63AAAD407832CC644BA8BA0384EEB9"
msgid "Folio"
msgstr "폴리오"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::74B5FD404D87EAC90C650FAE491C0149"
msgid "So you finally decided to come over here..."
msgstr "결국 이쪽으로 오기로 마음먹었군요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5156E30045B19CBD5EC8698668F29E3A"
msgid "Back again, I see."
msgstr "또 오셨네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EE12E253477BF21C1170EE9382E9DFE8"
msgid "How's it going?"
msgstr "요즘 어떻게 지내요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD8519844D666CBEA46227A71A9A4E91"
msgid "I've seen what you watch. Let me tell you: I'm not impressed."
msgstr "당신이 뭘 보는지 봤어요. 솔직히 감탄하지는 않았습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3985E4D04769FA46B1B05B82EBDCD462"
msgid "The Cat Nip Affair is best when you're in a contemplative mood."
msgstr "Cat Nip Affair는 사색에 잠기고 싶을 때 보는 게 최고죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E17CCFE948BFDC35080760A3CFDA5ACE"
msgid "We got a few foreign films here. I personally prefer the dino one."
msgstr "여기 외국 영화도 몇 편 있어요. 전 개인적으로 공룡 나오는 게 좋습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::931EFEB0455AA0A6017119940545467B"
msgid ""
"Don't forget that there's a bar in the back of each theatre. @You'll have to"
" go to the beach to find the bathrooms."
msgstr "각 극장 뒤쪽에 바가 있다는 걸 잊지 마세요. @화장실은 해변까지 가야 찾을 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0FDB6F43494082E66BFA89B1CF4D1B7E"
msgid ""
"Veronica has all the concessions you could want up front. Lotta candy up "
"there. Not sure if you can eat it."
msgstr "베로니카가 앞쪽에서 원하는 매점 음식을 다 팔아요. 사탕도 정말 많고요. 먹을 수 있는지는 잘 모르겠지만요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::23DFF2224319CDE523B475A508B5B6F1"
msgid ""
"They said being able to watch stuff in your Condos would keep you from the "
"theatre, but here you are."
msgstr "콘도에서도 영화를 볼 수 있으니 극장에 안 올 거라던데, 결국 오셨네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F8DB9954EEA04F434C254960B41EF2A"
msgid ""
"People used to hype up the original Spooky Hallway film too much, but, I "
"gotta say, the remake literally killed me."
msgstr "사람들이 오리지널 Spooky Hallway 영화를 너무 띄워 줬는데, 리메이크는 말 그대로 저를 죽였어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B696948D462B74C0F4E230A9570F7227"
msgid "Have a good time in there."
msgstr "안에서 즐거운 시간 보내세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DEF7AADE46A980C62211398117BFE389"
msgid "Let me know if you need to renew your timeslot."
msgstr "시간대를 갱신해야 하면 알려 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::05564BCA48104B4065482D96A63CFAB6"
msgid "Wanna watch in style?"
msgstr "멋지게 관람하고 싶으세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6E85EABD48C4069CE08BD189E5B1233F"
msgid "Private rooms over here."
msgstr "개인실은 이쪽입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AB4F1F48427BD9921A6F2381092F5543"
msgid "Same room as always?"
msgstr "늘 그 방으로 하시겠어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FA59262D4C9DD85ADEF71E864263A30E"
msgid "I ain't got all day."
msgstr "하루 종일 기다릴 순 없어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8AB4B0F04F23AD571ACAF4A3731CF3AA"
msgid "Come on now."
msgstr "자, 이제요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::65F2C606452103BC26EF029E4EE024CB"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "좋아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE672806466A643B45021585AA4088DC"
msgid "Fantastic."
msgstr "훌륭해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C5D4311D4A5CFA4717C0CDA35794B410"
msgid "Events have got nothing on your own private theater room."
msgstr "이벤트도 당신만의 개인 극장방만 못하죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC9B549E463D3F9C649BACA1B7FF09EF"
msgid "Michelle"
msgstr "미셸"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D6FF853D49F829681FA21B84CE283C39"
msgid "Welcome to Tower Threads!"
msgstr "타워 스레즈에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7605A10E4E91BA8733AE6B8AEBB614F8"
msgid "Heya!"
msgstr "안녕하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9796C039453331B30B130296443A7D9D"
msgid "Hey, you."
msgstr "이봐요, 당신."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::340E25764B138AF6343A319C203D2743"
msgid "Need a new hat? That look would be rad with a new hat!"
msgstr "새 모자 필요하세요? 지금 모습에 새 모자면 정말 끝내줄 텐데요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F231A7942857FAC8FA94BAEEBCE4DF9"
msgid ""
"It's all about color coordination, dude. Doesn't matter what you have on. I "
"think."
msgstr "중요한 건 색 조합이에요, 친구. 뭐 입었든 상관없어요. 아마도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4162B2F442814E708B7BA9BC90055A63"
msgid ""
"Oh, sorry. If you need to use the restroom, you're gonna need to buy a "
"watch."
msgstr "아, 죄송합니다. 화장실을 쓰시려면 시계를 사셔야 해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2918AAD9496B9C13426718A16103FEC9"
msgid ""
"On my breaks, I like to switch up my look. Star glasses are more of a 9AM "
"kinda thing, you know."
msgstr "쉬는 시간엔 스타일을 바꾸는 편이에요. 별 안경은 오전 9시쯤에 어울리는 거죠, 아시죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BF79FFD14BBD4F0AA1DEA8934840C4DE"
msgid "Daisy's the most fashionable bird on the island, no doubt about it."
msgstr "데이지는 이 섬에서 가장 패셔너블한 새예요, 두말할 것도 없죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4596002547C51D2BCE422698EED39E34"
msgid ""
"The changing rooms are to the left. @And the mysterious pipes and fluid."
msgstr "탈의실은 왼쪽에 있어요. @그리고 수수께끼의 파이프와 액체도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F413F3A94D26F9C630C31ABD80BFA164"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr "또 봐요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD87090348A938AB767790837A7AE1B0"
msgid "Come back whenever."
msgstr "언제든 다시 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A4D8D12541686198923A578FD94E9997"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::39AD4658490ABA7C93ED438ED783ED5C"
msgid "Lookin' good as always!"
msgstr "언제나처럼 멋지네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::364D9EDC4139FBB79977C9A5C41CCD62"
msgid "Great to see ya!"
msgstr "만나서 반가워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EB02CAF44DE769931C98E3B2526BBAC7"
msgid "You sure you got everything you wanted?"
msgstr "원하시던 거 다 챙기셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB197BA345D954474EA756B74AC19F41"
msgid "* Yawns *"
msgstr "* 하품 *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8AE6E61F45E18B62D6A9C6B88DE0E6C1"
msgid "Ooh. Lots of possibilities with that one."
msgstr "오. 그것만 해도 가능성이 무궁무진하네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07FE463A4118028EABD2D98CEECDE447"
msgid "Is that all?"
msgstr "그게 전부인가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::64D79AFD473E245F30265ABAF39FE179"
msgid "Feel free to browse as long as you like."
msgstr "원하시는 만큼 천천히 둘러보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0867879345C629AC1B1327BB600EB9D9"
msgid "I can think of a great hat to go with that one."
msgstr "그거에 어울릴 멋진 모자가 딱 떠오르네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E6B045A44FF2E1FA8C682795B2F49985"
msgid "Stylish and comfy! Great pick!"
msgstr "스타일리시하고 편안해요! 좋은 선택이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9422D5D649A3FF8B912AAFAAE844CE5D"
msgid "Redoing your whole wardrobe? I've been there."
msgstr "옷장을 통째로 바꾸시나요? 저도 그런 적 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7EB0C3CE425E2902E873F19B38989CE1"
msgid "You need a bag for all that? We sell bags..."
msgstr "그거 다 담을 가방 필요하세요? 가방도 팔아요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CC0BE12F4629AF22C3F1B0A91F05EA71"
msgid "All good, all good."
msgstr "좋아요, 좋아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F902AA9D42A74F49869FD691C1A21AD5"
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AB5472C94F422554A3B808829CBC5A5C"
msgid "Hey! We have a sale today!"
msgstr "어서 오세요! 오늘 세일 중이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BAB2B500417447ACF0A07797AE727B16"
msgid "Not interested in the events?"
msgstr "이벤트에는 관심 없으신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::32DB065540D270A8AB8092978CFA76AD"
msgid "Naugh T."
msgstr "나우 티."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3BE52CCF4F85D457680A97B39DDDF15A"
msgid "Nice T."
msgstr "멋진 티."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D435F3A64406234BF690F984910A2E29"
msgid "Present Quest Data"
msgstr "현재 퀘스트 데이터"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CE537B754728166A7C23689A684DF9FA"
msgid ""
"Careful! This one’s hot! Not sure what the ticking noise is about, either. "
":D Good luck! Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "조심하세요! 이건 뜨거워요! 째깍거리는 소리가 뭔지도 모르겠네요. :D 행운을 빌어요! 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EABA1EFC4F9F9AFA16BB3C8587EC4C21"
msgid ""
"Well, hey! This one’s pre-assembled! Looks like someone didn’t want her to "
"be putting something together over the holidays! Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "이야, 이건 미리 조립되어 있네요! 연휴에 누가 조립하기 싫었나 봐요! 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB51D70549B2887DF87AB197B50A719D"
msgid ""
"I could’ve sworn that box started floating on its own- and not just from "
"holiday cheer! Must be something really mysterious! Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "그 상자가 저절로 떠다니기 시작한 게 분명한데, 연휴 기운 때문만은 아닌 것 같아요! 뭔가 정말 신비로워요! 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::10B832294F8211198F8482ADD5A806F9"
msgid ""
"The great pin destroyer might finally get a smile on his face when he sees "
"this one~  I thought he was on the naughty list! xD Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "위대한 핀 파괴자가 이걸 보면 드디어 웃을지도 몰라요~ 착한 명단에 있을 줄은 몰랐는데요! xD 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::98666971490697C8CA162EA1590352CA"
msgid ""
"Look at the wrapping paper! This person must be pretty high up on the nice "
"list! :D Wonder what Santa Claws brought for her! Jingle jingle~"
msgstr "포장지 좀 보세요! 이 사람 착한 명단에서 꽤 위쪽일 거예요! :D 산타클로스가 뭘 가져다줬을까요! 짤랑 짤랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9C896FA844A3075A4F295198E4401D1D"
msgid ""
"Wow, this one is all the way from… wow! Guess now I know how the loud guy "
"finds some of this stuff. :D Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "와, 이건 무려... 와! 시끄러운 그분이 어떻게 이런 걸 구하는지 이제 알 것 같네요. :D 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::61AA98DF4C07383AEFB1C1A5507AD285"
msgid ""
"I think this one is a swim suit. :O Is that weird? A swimsuit for the "
"holidays? Hahaha, it really isn’t! xD Jingle jingle~!!"
msgstr "이건 수영복 같아요. :O 이상한가요? 연휴에 수영복이라니? 하하하, 전혀 아니에요! xD 짤랑 짤랑~!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BA24681240D77A9D0BC31499BE63C4AA"
msgid ""
"I know that shape better than anything. Someone’s getting a brand new "
"waterproof wizard hat!!! So cool!!! Jingle jingle jingle~!! "
msgstr "그 모양은 누구보다 잘 알아요. 누군가 새 방수 마법사 모자를 받네요!!! 너무 멋져요!!! 짤랑 짤랑 짤랑~!! "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA782CAA4DB5063B05197D9DDD1EDF81"
msgid ""
"Oh… a back brace!!! Yay… @Well, I’m sure he’ll love it after all that heavy "
"lifting! Jingle jingle jingle~ xD"
msgstr "오... 허리 보호대!!! 신난다... @글쎄요, 그렇게 무거운 걸 들었으니 분명 좋아할 거예요! 짤랑 짤랑 짤랑~ xD"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::512B2B8A46DD9F0F416ECCA0629BA006"
msgid ""
"This must be for an avid collector! This is some state of the art whimsy!! "
"And I know whimsy!! xD Jingle jingle jingle~"
msgstr "이건 열성 수집가를 위한 게 틀림없어요! 최신식 기발함이에요!! 기발함은 제가 잘 알죠!! xD 짤랑 짤랑 짤랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::539A469A4D381AC077E0B78ACFC2DE24"
msgid ""
"Looks like Santa thought this person needed to unplug!! Hope he likes it, "
"Santa Claws! xD Jingle jingle~"
msgstr "산타가 이 사람은 쉬어야 한다고 생각했나 봐요!! 마음에 들었으면 좋겠네요, 산타클로스! xD 짤랑 짤랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6485B2FC48F5C753635C5FA047E971B3"
msgid ""
"Must be fun to get a gift for themself when they’re the one always handing "
"out prizes! Jingle, jingle, jingle~!!"
msgstr "항상 상을 나눠주는 사람이 직접 선물을 받으면 재밌겠네요! 짤랑, 짤랑, 짤랑~!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B44BC57845E875BEBDA7FB81D161D4A8"
msgid ""
"Very stylish!! This looks like it’s for a guy who can really make someone’s "
"night out feel special! Jingle jingle~"
msgstr "정말 스타일리시해요!! 누군가의 밤을 특별하게 만들어 줄 수 있는 분을 위한 것 같아요! 짤랑 짤랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D6DABA0B4F04226168C757A360BDE093"
msgid ""
"If I had to spend every day staring out at that beautiful fishing spot, I’d "
"be wanting one of these too! xD Hope she loves it! Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "저도 매일 저 아름다운 낚시터를 바라보며 보낸다면 이런 걸 갖고 싶을 거예요! xD 마음에 들었으면 좋겠네요! 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6C3714FB4DF6C2C269C2098375085751"
msgid ""
"Oh, this one’s easy. I hope you’re ready to see one happy bird!!! Jingle, "
"jingle, jingle, jingle~!!!"
msgstr "아, 이건 쉬워요. 행복한 새 한 마리를 볼 준비 되셨길!!! 딸랑, 딸랑, 딸랑, 딸랑~!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::42AD715B47546ED40D65D799F154F8BF"
msgid ""
"Did you know this guy’s Uncle once pulled Santa Claws’ sleigh single "
"handedly?! He even carried the reindeer! xD Jingle, jingle~~!"
msgstr "이 녀석 삼촌이 혼자서 산타 클로스의 썰매를 끌었다는 거 아세요?! 순록까지 업고 갔다니까요! xD 딸랑, 딸랑~~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CFEACC2248FF6649783186886414D19D"
msgid ""
"That is one very, very festive (gaudy) hat. Only someone with an acute "
"knowledge of fashion could possibly appreciate it! :D Jingle~!"
msgstr "아주아주 축제 분위기(촌스러운) 모자네요. 패션을 깊이 아는 사람만 감상할 수 있겠어요! :D 딸랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::66BFB70E4B2188DD88524D9494310B8E"
msgid ""
"What better gift is there than mittens for someone who is always handling "
"cold treats? Maybe something a little more fun!!! xD Jingle, jingle~"
msgstr ""
"항상 차가운 간식을 다루는 사람에게 벙어리장갑보다 좋은 선물이 있을까요? 뭔가 더 재미있는 게 좋겠죠!!! xD 딸랑, 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57381E9C435462FD0BF2FCAE8E08A406"
msgid ""
"A book of festive songs to sing with glee! Wow! I’m sure that’s not going to"
" get annoying~ Jingle jingle! xD"
msgstr "신나게 부를 축제 노래 책이에요! 와! 절대 안 짜증 나겠죠~ 딸랑 딸랑! xD"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9605CB554EABF50E8DDB5481417A99BE"
msgid ""
"Ooh, what an honor. I wonder if she’s even home with so many ocean friends "
"to visit! Jingle, jingle!"
msgstr "오, 영광이네요. 바다 친구들이 그렇게 많은데 집에 있을지 궁금하네요! 딸랑, 딸랑!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::40DC57384FF5D924CA967D8947537535"
msgid ""
"I could’ve sworn that present had different packaging when I first saw it. I"
" hope it finds the right home!! Jingle, jingle, jingle~"
msgstr "처음 봤을 때는 저 선물 포장이 달랐던 것 같은데. 제 주인을 잘 찾아가길!! 딸랑, 딸랑, 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8882425E4D0F326122E19BA75E363ADA"
msgid ""
"Hey, it’s one of those ‘kiss the cook’ aprons! I kind of want it for myself."
" TAKE IT AWAY! xD Jingle jingle~"
msgstr "어이, 그 '쿡에게 키스하세요' 앞치마네요! 저도 좀 갖고 싶은데. 가져가세요! xD 딸랑 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::141C1B3E47EC31876E623BBE343024BD"
msgid ""
"It’s about time she ended up on the naughty list! She’s been spoiling movies"
" for years! Give her the coal! Jingle, jingle, jingle~~!"
msgstr "드디어 그녀가 말썽꾸러기 명단에 올랐네요! 몇 년째 영화를 스포일러했잖아요! 숯을 주세요! 딸랑, 딸랑, 딸랑~~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6F6FBAB14774F181E9607A95026B10C6"
msgid ""
"Another naughty person!! Charging people for privacy! Jingle, jingle, I say!"
" xD"
msgstr "또 다른 말썽꾸러기!! 프라이버시에 돈을 받다니! 딸랑, 딸랑이라니까요! xD"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A682355F42F1CB1CD5FCAF94F26B791D"
msgid ""
"Holy moly. I don’t even know what that thing is called! Bet it sounds "
"awesome! Get it to its new owner, quickly!!! Jingle~"
msgstr "맙소사. 저게 뭐라고 불리는지도 모르겠어요! 분명 굉장한 소리겠죠! 새 주인에게 빨리 가져다주세요!!! 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EF9E84414049AA0414A7F1929FAE7C37"
msgid ""
"Yikes! This box is pretty beat up… But it’s going to a cat who will "
"appreciate a few bumps in the road!!! Jingle, jingle~"
msgstr "으악! 이 상자는 꽤 찌그러졌네요… 그래도 굴곡을 즐겨줄 고양이에게 가니까요!!! 딸랑, 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::99E13E6E490FA53917DB2DAB6746499E"
msgid ""
"…This one’s definitely a car, right? How are you going to carry it?!?! xD "
"I’M NOT HELPING!!! xDDD Jingle, jingle, jingle~"
msgstr "…이건 확실히 차죠? 이걸 어떻게 들고 가실 거예요?!?! xD 저는 안 도와요!!! xDDD 딸랑, 딸랑, 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::90CCEDB7496A0E861CABA39678198333"
msgid ""
"Coal again… Can’t say anyone’s surprised, with this little hot dog's record."
" Jingle~"
msgstr "또 숯이네… 이 작은 핫도그의 전적을 보면 놀랄 사람도 없죠. 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ECFA09384765F9A6EB2F349D6BB24D86"
msgid ""
"It’s a link to one of those desktop wallpaper sites! How’d you wrap that "
"Santa? Kind of lazy!!! xD"
msgstr "데스크톱 배경화면 사이트 링크네요! 산타, 이걸 어떻게 포장한 거예요? 좀 게으르네요!!! xD"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E261F45F4DD33C69C416C5817229EAED"
msgid ""
"Hmm… this one is wrapped in cotton and rolled into a ball and… it jingles! "
"Sounds fun to me! :3"
msgstr "음… 이건 솜에 싸여 공 모양으로 말려 있고… 딸랑거려요! 재밌을 것 같아요! :3"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A7F8FCB448F58B9149E56CA350246333"
msgid ""
"Huh, I swear I've seen this before while on my minigolf tour… oh well! "
"jingle~"
msgstr "허, 미니골프 투어 중에 분명 본 것 같은데… 뭐 아무렴! 딸랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::54563EDE4F9780398A2268AAC168195B"
msgid ""
"Jingle jingle~ This scarf looks long enough to wrap around a vending "
"machine!!! @Wait… O_O"
msgstr "딸랑 딸랑~ 이 스카프는 자판기를 두를 만큼 길어 보이네요!!! @잠깐… O_O"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1E3B4F7840B12340A3A944B3E2C7ADEB"
msgid ""
"WOW! THIS IS GREAT. I CANNOT WAIT TO BLAST A NEW HOLE IN THE ROOF WITH "
"THESE! THANKS."
msgstr "와! 대단해요. 이걸로 지붕에 새 구멍 낼 날이 기다려져요! 고마워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::04DDFDFF483F8ED07C5BF8ABD9E483CE"
msgid "Isn’t this nice! A fully assembled shed! Thanks!"
msgstr "멋지네요! 완전히 조립된 창고라니! 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A488C51C4D790132DDCF01936D7C0A94"
msgid ""
"I bet you want to know what this is! @I’m not quite sure myself, nya~ Happy "
"Holidays, %name%."
msgstr "이게 뭔지 궁금하시죠! @저도 잘 모르겠어요, 냐~ %name%님, 즐거운 연휴 보내세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0DBEF646488A3DBDA45089AA602AEC4E"
msgid ""
"Oh… huh. Guess my team is still thinking of old times too… @Uh… @Thanks, "
"%name%."
msgstr "오… 그렇군요. 우리 팀도 아직 옛날을 생각하는 모양이에요… @어… @고마워요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::25C96E824B62D5A9E4106699B2F79E20"
msgid "Look at you helping Santa Claws out! How cool. Happy Holidays, %name%!"
msgstr "산타 클로스를 돕고 있네요! 멋져요. %name%님, 즐거운 연휴 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::471FA07C42F74B8A18BAD6BCF7DC760C"
msgid ""
"WOAH! A bru-ray player?! For lil ol' me? Aw you know ya boy Rob LOVES these."
" I'll add this to the collection. Thanks baby, Happy Holidays!"
msgstr ""
"우와! 블루레이 플레이어라고?! 저 같은 작은 친구에게? 어, 내가 이걸 얼마나 좋아하는지 알잖아. 컬렉션에 추가할게요. 고마워요, "
"즐거운 연휴 보내요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5F78BC6B443D3EAD03F959B1B7C7A839"
msgid ""
"Thanks for the crissie prezzie! Have yourself a fair dinkum Christmas, mate!"
msgstr "크리스마스 선물 고마워요! 즐거운 크리스마스 보내세요, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5812408A4AF7A03B3DC5E2B1DD424C51"
msgid ""
"A gift? For lil ol’ me? Heh heh. I knew Santa Claws would take me off the "
"naughty list one day."
msgstr "선물? 나 같은 작은 녀석에게? 헤헤. 언젠가 산타 클로스가 날 말썽꾸러기 명단에서 빼줄 줄 알았어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D0005C634E525C53A618B4AFB2A6F2A0"
msgid ""
"...I thought I ordered that from a store. Guess Santa Claws is working "
"overtime! Thanks, %name%."
msgstr "...이거 가게에서 주문했다고 생각했는데. 산타 클로스가 초과근무 중인가 보네요! 고마워요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::90C254B147391B15867650BBC67CA79D"
msgid "I’m not crying! @I’m not crying. @Thank you! Happy Holidays!!!"
msgstr "안 울어요! @안 운다니까요. @고마워요! 즐거운 연휴 보내세요!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::198B8AF840B9DD38AA94CBB9D207C93A"
msgid ""
"Oh, sweet! You know, as much as I really wanted a new headset, it’ll be good"
" to spend some time outdoors with this."
msgstr "오, 좋아! 새 헤드셋을 정말 원했지만, 이걸로 야외에서 시간을 보내는 것도 좋을 것 같네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5CF6C8F4974E199F40EB8B16054D4EB"
msgid ""
"Now that is a very nicely shaped lump of coal. Thanks for getting it to me, "
"%name%."
msgstr "정말 예쁜 모양의 숯덩이네요. 가져다줘서 고마워요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::74946C4C439263E597AAF7B214F3AAAD"
msgid ""
"Words cannot describe how great a gift this is. Thanks for bringing it here,"
" %name%. Did you get your gift yet? @You didn’t? @Oh no."
msgstr ""
"이 선물이 얼마나 대단한지 말로는 다 못 해요. 여기로 가져와 줘서 고마워요, %name%. 선물은 이미 받았나요? @못 받았다고요? "
"@이런, 큰일이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::65A9AFC1444829572B658DB5237EE19B"
msgid ""
"Oh, a fishing rod! I used to love fishing. Maybe I’ll try it out again! "
"Thanks!"
msgstr "오, 낚싯대네요! 예전에 낚시를 정말 좋아했어요. 다시 한번 해 볼까 봐요! 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9CB325634AFBE8D3BF7C40AE691E535E"
msgid "*Daisy tips her hat chivalrously.*"
msgstr "*데이지가 기사처럼 모자를 치켜든다.*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::056D54A146C2612D4517A6BF57777B3A"
msgid ""
"Oh man! Hey- Did you know my Uncle once delivered presents for Santa Claws "
"too? You’re a legend, just like him."
msgstr "이런! 저기, 우리 삼촌도 산타클로스 대신 선물을 배달한 적 있다는 거 알아요? 당신도 삼촌처럼 전설이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A42849304A74569C95C48EA769B87E88"
msgid ""
"That is an iconic hat. Absolutely iconic. But not as iconic as you for "
"delivering it! Thanks, %name%."
msgstr "정말 상징적인 모자예요. 완전 상징적이에요. 하지만 이걸 배달한 당신만큼은 아니죠! 고마워요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::515200654832E2BC8113318E55E315E0"
msgid ""
"Oh! For me? From Santa Claws? Gee whiz! Well, Happy Wintertime and all that!"
msgstr "오! 저한테요? 산타클로스가요? 세상에! 아무튼 즐거운 겨울 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5ACB38C147E782730C85E8AE3AA7B2FB"
msgid ""
"Am I on the naughty list? Oh… wait. I think I like this. Haha, Happy "
"Holidays!"
msgstr "혹시 제가 말썽꾸러기 명단에 있나요? 아… 잠깐. 이거 마음에 드는 것 같아요. 하하, 즐거운 연휴 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E565AFF748B529AB14E269B351FA4559"
msgid "Orf orf, orf. Delightful! What a good delivery elf!"
msgstr "멍멍, 멍. 기뻐요! 정말 훌륭한 배달 요정이네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CE0E0F14440209332C754F8F9AA0CCEB"
msgid "Perfect, it’s everything."
msgstr "완벽해요, 이게 전부였어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A20F36B241D977B19F14BD9F3BDC2545"
msgid "Ohhh, I got the zoomies! Thank you!! I love heckin’ hot dogs!!"
msgstr "오오, 신나서 어쩔 줄을 모르겠어요! 고마워요!! 핫도그 완전 좋아해요!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88D8D5174C2A1E7B70DDF2AADB5EEA9C"
msgid ""
"I’ve seen worse coal than this on the theater floor!! I’m not afraid. Happy "
"Holidays, %name%."
msgstr "극장 바닥에서 이보다 더한 석탄도 봤어요!! 무섭지 않아요. 즐거운 연휴 보내세요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C971BEB94CE222EF318390A8DACC619E"
msgid ""
"Hey, if I had to get a lump of coal, I’m glad it came from you, %name%."
msgstr "저, 석탄을 받아야 한다면 당신에게 받아서 다행이에요, %name%."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8DCBFB844E1CCF9B8CB1288549F105D9"
msgid ""
"Is… that an instrument? @What is it? @You really don’t know? Hm… @Oh, uh, "
"Happy Holidays!"
msgstr "이건… 악기인가요? @뭔가요? @정말 모르시는 거예요? 음… @아, 어, 즐거운 연휴 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9A67B5D1431E7155781A20964C6071D1"
msgid ""
"Wow, that is a great ugly sweater, %name%! @Oh. @It’s… not supposed to- @Uh…"
" hey, thanks for the gift!"
msgstr "와, 정말 멋진 못생긴 스웨터네요, %name%! @아. @그게… 그런 뜻이 아니라- @어… 저기, 선물 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F743D1F441DA0350DCC9948542841B8D"
msgid ""
"A 2002 Dorbo Fastcar with brake issues and a busted window… Weird gift, but "
"I’ll take it! Happy holidays!"
msgstr "브레이크가 고장 나고 창문이 깨진 2002년형 도르보 패스트카… 이상한 선물이지만 받을게요! 즐거운 연휴 보내세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BEC127D642FC74333DEF5488DC178BAF"
msgid ""
"Thanks buddy, the grill was getting cold! You think I’m gonna close this "
"place down for the holidays? You’re NUTS!"
msgstr "고마워요 친구, 그릴이 식어 가고 있었거든요! 내가 연휴에 가게를 닫을 것 같아요? 정말 엉뚱하네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::392477EA4CD5B3769E01308ED5400B21"
msgid "Now these… these are some wallpapers. Thx."
msgstr "이건… 정말 멋진 벽지네요. 고마워요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F05383814D966F07CE53479ADBE54617"
msgid "What an adorable toy! The cats are gonna love it!"
msgstr "정말 귀여운 장난감이네요! 고양이들이 좋아하겠어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::928176914CDBB8044766A585DF801BB0"
msgid ""
"Thanks for stealing that for me, hehe! I was getting too bored floating over"
" there myself."
msgstr "대신 훔쳐 와 줘서 고마워요, 히히! 저기 떠다니느라 너무 심심했거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B6AA113D43FAB6D66B746E9B43145CE4"
msgid "*You hear a jovial and festive little tune!*"
msgstr "*명랑하고 축제 분위기의 작은 선율이 들린다!*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::72917D244910F5D08FEC009DCAA71F25"
msgid "Kris Krillgills"
msgstr "크리스 크릴길스"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A74BE48B425C9DC0B573C08CBB3194FB"
msgid ""
"Please help me deliver these gifts! D: Santa Claws is really torn up about "
"it and is gonna malfunction!!! Jingle, jingle, jingle!!!"
msgstr ""
"이 선물들을 배달하는 걸 도와주세요! D: 산타클로스가 이 일 때문에 정말 상심해서 고장 나 버릴 거예요!!! 짤랑, 짤랑, 짤랑!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::62BDBB86431E08923E596B957889DD0E"
msgid ""
"Please grab the gift below! It goes to someone in this Plaza! Look all "
"around you!! Think! THINK FOR SANTA CLAWS!!!! Jingle, jingle~"
msgstr ""
"아래에 있는 선물을 가져가세요! 이 플라자에 있는 누군가에게 갈 거예요! 주변을 잘 둘러보세요!! 생각하세요! 산타클로스를 위해 "
"생각하세요!!!! 짤랑, 짤랑~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B5FC33B34715560C055EF39E80E45006"
msgid "!HURRY!! Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "!서두르세요!! 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD3EA80E4B082E7C9C77EDB332F5A3F0"
msgid "!You need to grab a present from me first! Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "!먼저 저한테서 선물을 받아야 해요! 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::09E2B37849444F77BA67C883BB3C8DC2"
msgid "!No! Wrong! This isn't the correct present for them! Jingle jingle~!"
msgstr "!아니에요! 틀렸어요! 이건 그 사람 선물이 아니에요! 짤랑 짤랑~!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F71C0CB4493810425130BDA9C82D048C"
msgid ""
"You're pretty awesome. You probably already know that though. Thanks for "
"giving out all those gifts!"
msgstr "정말 멋지시네요. 이미 아실 테지만요. 그 많은 선물을 나눠 줘서 고마워요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::37DBB3A04FC2B1B6C29415BEDE73ED7A"
msgid "Randall"
msgstr "랜달"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B48C02B349A7031B1FC19E8289F9A11B"
msgid ""
"Help, help! The other reindeer are missing! We were supposed to stick "
"together, but they went off on their own."
msgstr "도와주세요, 도와주세요! 다른 순록들이 사라졌어요! 우리는 같이 있어야 했는데, 다들 제멋대로 떠나 버렸어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5B8DAA44450E96764741B84EE6C3EE0"
msgid ""
"Please help. I can’t leave. Santa Claws needs someone to keep an eye on the "
"sleigh."
msgstr "도와주세요. 저는 떠날 수가 없어요. 산타클로스는 썰매를 지켜볼 사람이 필요하거든요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6A4A31164F33096041A597AE22155C97"
msgid "Please… I hope you can find them! They’re not bad, just misguided!"
msgstr "부디… 그들을 찾아주시길 바랍니다! 나쁜 아이들이 아니에요, 그저 길을 잃었을 뿐이죠!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8614E46A4C31959B608036B3E7BC0B69"
msgid ""
"YOU FOUND THEM! Wow! You’ve got the holiday spirit! My little nose has lit "
"up again and the joy of the holidays is overwhelming me!"
msgstr "찾으셨군요! 와우! 정말 축제 분위기가 물씬 나네요! 제 작은 코가 다시 불을 밝혔고, 축제의 기쁨이 저를 압도하고 있어요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::710218F54A0CE5109752EEB7869A09D1"
msgid "Nick"
msgstr "닉"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C800B3FD4C9811BB7C3BF8BA8F58F1B7"
msgid ""
"Greetings. It would seem to be your first time here. Please, peruse my stock"
" at your leisure."
msgstr "반갑습니다. 처음 오신 것 같군요. 천천히 제 물건들을 둘러보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BB527D34AEAFD96116999933BC56809"
msgid "Greetings."
msgstr "반갑습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DFBA626B43B5991EA99F8C980E559AC0"
msgid "Hello. Welcome to my electronics store."
msgstr "안녕하세요. 제 전자제품 가게에 오신 것을 환영합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::16E6BA3C488B33C8F4C631AA7B804E10"
msgid "Welcome."
msgstr "환영하네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9ADC5020433EA21D2B15A699BE759B21"
msgid ""
"That noise next door makes it hard to keep my thoughts together sometimes..."
msgstr "옆집 소음 때문에 가끔은 생각을 정리하기가 어렵습니다..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::615FC945406E4A6A5B1273BBE6FB5F11"
msgid ""
"Top-of-the-line appliances and excellent customer service are our trade."
msgstr "최고급 가전제품과 훌륭한 고객 서비스가 저희의 자랑입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::91894C5A4920A426A65DF8A569779DE9"
msgid "We take pride in our selection of goods."
msgstr "저희는 상품 구성에 자부심을 가지고 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::748FA89D49DBB9B0AEF9B0834A2FAF9B"
msgid ""
"Nothing but the best for our customers. Unlike some incorrigible stores..."
msgstr "고객에게는 최고만을 드립니다. 어떤 고집스러운 가게들과는 다르죠..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3FD863304596BD423521C3A003A763E3"
msgid ""
"Rob? Oh. The man from the Imports shop. Yes, he's our top customer for Bru "
"Ray players. @ I wonder what he does with all of them..."
msgstr ""
"롭? 아. 수입품 가게의 그분이군요. 네, 그는 저희 브루 레이 플레이어의 최대 고객입니다. @ 대체 그걸 다 어디에 쓰는 건지 "
"궁금하네요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7B0E4E3B49EC4F1EA86C91817D40D7DB"
msgid ""
"*talking to himself * I wonder if Rob actually knows electronics has an "
"\"e\" in it."
msgstr "*혼잣말* 롭은 전자(electronics)에 'e'가 들어간다는 걸 실제로 아는 걸까."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::452A91DB4DAB3B6B5B9808A4BB185235"
msgid ""
"I'm very happy with our new location. Way less noise now. That music store "
"guy never let up."
msgstr "새 위치에 아주 만족합니다. 이제 소음이 훨씬 줄었거든요. 그 음반 가게 녀석은 정말 끝이 없더군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::46942BFE49AD9A106EE4CCAA5D5EA0E9"
msgid "Come again."
msgstr "또 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B7BE554F49C0C0C72930478AB303DD93"
msgid "Thank you for your business."
msgstr "이용해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3DC4941848D94DFA839702BF2196A471"
msgid "Please, come again."
msgstr "부디 다시 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE51954A42C7D21BB7D05592B2AD69E1"
msgid "Electronics! The latest technology available in the resort!"
msgstr "전자제품! 리조트에서 만날 수 있는 최신 기술!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::141C637A43938C9BC8F024A17406484B"
msgid "I'm definitely going to use this to help with my headaches, somehow."
msgstr "이걸 어떻게든 두통 완화에 써먹을 겁니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BC77D0F8400C45B9BF5A9AA4A9264A1C"
msgid "Greetings once again. What are you looking for?"
msgstr "다시 뵙는군요. 무엇을 찾고 계신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CF0E7C7B436C5AEAD61A9E808EA1763B"
msgid "Ah, a familiar face. Do you need anything?"
msgstr "아, 익숙한 얼굴이군요. 필요한 게 있으신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::391CA20C4CA16E3C4D2639A725ACB6A6"
msgid "Hello once again."
msgstr "다시 뵙는군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD5DEFEA4289A4466131BDB07D35334A"
msgid "Can I help you?"
msgstr "도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::41BC6AA941A53CE658D9EEAB6324CBD4"
msgid "Will you be completing your purchase?"
msgstr "구매를 마치시겠습니까?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::38C3341849ADB54A4EA87CA544720DEE"
msgid "Are you ready to make a decision?"
msgstr "결정하실 준비가 되셨나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07884B754F09C663959DD7AB67B6449A"
msgid "Please decide soon."
msgstr "빨리 결정해 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::033263D04167D601DFD76E9ACE0ADF92"
msgid ""
"I swear to god I'm going to defenestrate that sound fool if he doesn't turn "
"down his music..."
msgstr "정말 저 소리 미친 놈을 그 가게 창문 밖으로 던져버리고 싶군요. 음악 좀 줄이지 않으면..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA4C0FBD4881052CE0A9DBB1F741386A"
msgid "My god! @He never turns his noise off..."
msgstr "세상에! @그는 절대 소리를 끄지 않아요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::03F720BD4B2C2BBE3F633D808C4ADAD7"
msgid ""
"Please, take this and smash that infernal record player in the music store "
"with it."
msgstr "이걸 받아서 음반 가게의 그 빌어먹을 축음기를 박살내 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A53993384BD4FC880BB7AF965BE4B2CF"
msgid "Excellent choice."
msgstr "훌륭한 선택입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89016B0141459D806817C68C97C2CB5E"
msgid "Understood."
msgstr "알겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E22D1F9E44F7175F00B3E18EEFEC62D5"
msgid "Of course, sir."
msgstr "물론입니다, 손님."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9568DD5E469B8B6FDFD3F790865FFE4C"
msgid "A bulk purchase? No problem at all."
msgstr "대량 구매라고요? 전혀 문제없습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::14FD0E334911F77B691C71989DEA8120"
msgid "Ah, we truly value your patronage."
msgstr "아, 저희를 이렇게 찾아 주시다니 정말 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C63657384937F6A56A025EB44E4AD24C"
msgid "Thank you for your continued support."
msgstr "늘 성원해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9EE98554BD1ED0AB0CA6F91E74C0168"
msgid "Not a worry, we can accommodate an order of %item% that large."
msgstr "%item% 그 정도 수량이면 충분히 주문 가능합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD6FC84C47DCCBFAFABF4EAE2E0EF624"
msgid "Ah you've noticed the quality of the %item% we sell here?"
msgstr "아, 저희가 파는 %item%의 품질을 눈여겨보셨군요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::43376E0F4376A579B855C7A022B0BA75"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "물론이죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EAB3CE70468DA6A4DB5F73B4628F907C"
msgid "No problem, we'll remove that item."
msgstr "문제없습니다. 해당 아이템을 빼 드릴게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5F2D82BF406EEEE4F469EF9A679E99AC"
msgid "The customer is always right."
msgstr "손님은 언제나 옳습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C040A6074E94B2327291A4A2260AEA0E"
msgid "Thank you for your business."
msgstr "이용해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6B4F63C04CB02153956FC4B990CEEF75"
msgid "Another satisfied customer."
msgstr "또 한 분이 만족하고 가시는군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF92317B41091A408B657CA416E65D2A"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::014DE7B04028CF7E1C5AC8AAEB6DA634"
msgid "We appreciate your support."
msgstr "성원에 감사드립니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57E368C242A8BE3A54EBE99873DC6CD4"
msgid "All the best for the best price we can offer."
msgstr "최고의 가격으로 최선을 다하겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F07325147A5EE8E848F9CB835B60EF7"
msgid "Agh!!! I hate events! @Go! @Get out while I try to silence this chaos!"
msgstr "아악!!! 이런 이벤트는 싫어! @가! @이 혼란을 잠재우는 동안 나가!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B7F5E2E042B805EFC504BABCDCE95D76"
msgid "Reindeers"
msgstr "순록"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47BEBB9946B608F35583D6B2B256C62A"
msgid ""
"What? We were supposed to go back to the fountain? Why didn’t anyone tell "
"me!? Thanks for the heads up!"
msgstr "뭐? 분수로 돌아가야 한다고? 왜 아무도 말 안 해줬어!? 알려줘서 고마워!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D8B3823446734C8508C5C81DA111E0C"
msgid ""
"Who sent you?! @Randall? I thought he was right behind us. Guess I should "
"head back."
msgstr "누가 보냈어?! @랜달? 바로 뒤에 있는 줄 알았는데. 돌아가야겠네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AD08317844C0478F04B78EA56E737617"
msgid ""
"Oh my gosh- You know, I was just about to head back. So funny. See you!"
msgstr "세상에- 있잖아, 마침 돌아가려던 참이었어. 정말 웃기네. 또 봐!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA41A9B543DEAD827BBEDB809F52041F"
msgid ""
"We were trying to get Randall to live a little. But here you are. So much "
"for a vacation! Harumph."
msgstr "랜달이 좀 즐겁게 살라고 했는데. 그런데 네가 왔네. 휴가도 글렀군! 흥."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3890A8D341903156CCE623BA85856E9F"
msgid "I know…. ‘gO bAcK tO tHe FoUnTaIn’ @GOSH…@I’m GOING."
msgstr "알아…. ‘분수로 돌아가라고’ @아이고…@간다고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4B3FF1184DEA90C7E0557FBA3B34C532"
msgid "Oh, thank the moon someone found me! I really don’t know where I am."
msgstr "아, 달님 감사합니다, 누군가 절 찾았네요! 여기가 어딘지 정말 모르겠어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2089AE134FB1932AA69AA695C665BAD8"
msgid "Hey, if Randall says come back, what can I do? See you around."
msgstr "이봐, 랜달이 돌아오라고 하면 어쩔 수 없지. 또 보자고."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6E9715DB45A9ACC67B175896212ADC5A"
msgid ""
"You know, you could end up on the naughty list for interrupting my fun, "
"right? @I’m just joking. I’ll go."
msgstr "있잖아, 내 즐거움을 방해하면 착한 명단에서 빠질 수도 있어? @농담이야. 갈게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CEF2D710439C0D5976C209ABC41DC766"
msgid "Sure, I’ll head back! @What's a fountain again?"
msgstr "그래, 돌아갈게! @분수가 뭐더라?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D009B5CA453E962A5AA95E98773DEB33"
msgid "Snowpal"
msgstr "눈사람 친구"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::789725004E4A2E293CDDB887E37FF97E"
msgid "Thank you! I love my new look!"
msgstr "고마워! 새 모습이 마음에 들어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F1C8C46E49B14320D41D4B91D5A89448"
msgid "Wowie zowie! I absolutely look so ugly. I love this!"
msgstr "와우! 완전 못생겨 보여. 최고야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::38F6A61D4CAD4FABCCFF20B5D7CAD267"
msgid "Awesome. @Really awesome. @So awesome."
msgstr "멋져. @정말 멋져. @너무 멋져."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C5C8CE1A4D595E5C63D9BF9A3D77DBE4"
msgid ""
"I thought I didn’t want a hat, but when you put it on like that... well..."
msgstr "모자는 필요 없다고 생각했는데, 그렇게 씌워 주니까... 음..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::25AC4A10420B9D5F290AA4AA95F845AD"
msgid "This hat makes me feel like a million units. Maybe even a billion!"
msgstr "이 모자를 쓰면 백만 유닛은 된 기분이야. 어쩌면 십억일지도!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5416418D4F38DFB65B918E9F703FCB7F"
msgid "Everyone hates me, but at least I have this fantastic hat."
msgstr "모두 나를 싫어하지만, 적어도 이 멋진 모자가 있잖아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C07A0C0417D81E1CE1F178671BF6C3E"
msgid "Thanks for covering up my big old head."
msgstr "내 크고 늙은 머리를 가려줘서 고마워."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D667EE949840FB2268C14B2025EEFC9"
msgid "I really like when the hat is on my head. That’s my favorite part."
msgstr "모자가 내 머리에 있는 게 정말 좋아. 그게 제일 좋은 부분이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3666B43048B2ABB1682190855BA46509"
msgid "You know what hat sounds like? @Cat. @You got one?"
msgstr "모자가 뭐처럼 들리는지 알아? @Cat. @너도 하나 있어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0ABAA8E6447C24A8C6D321B819796E09"
msgid "Tch. Typical hat enthusiast, trying to give people hats. "
msgstr "쳇. 전형적인 모자 애호가가 남한테 모자를 주려고 하네. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::46BE1D944B8CE3A3353B3EBAF06BA6E1"
msgid "I haven’t had a hat since... well... the olden times!"
msgstr "난 옛날 이후로... 음... 모자를 못 썼어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F3179B14EC3B06C22B9719F7D0AA5D0"
msgid "I love merchandise!"
msgstr "난 굿즈가 정말 좋아!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1AC03E38457EE9D08E713CBD05CA1E6F"
msgid "Wow, a hat? I’ve heard tell of them. "
msgstr "와, 모자? 그런 게 있다고 들었어. "

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FBCB9C364D6D8B82A77C1EAD83BDDC5D"
msgid "Soft. @Functional. @Perfect. @Beautiful hat. I’ll take 40."
msgstr "부드러운. @실용적인. @완벽한. @아름다운 모자. 40개 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FDD270534F33C26BFE037989987FCAE5"
msgid ""
"Pff, you thought I’d like this hat? @This one? @Right here? @The one that I "
"like?"
msgstr "푸, 내가 이 모자를 좋아할 거라고 생각했어? @이걸? @바로 여기? @내가 좋아하는 그거?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::042D7B484F8475E158C9A9910EC875D2"
msgid "Wonderful! Just wonderful."
msgstr "훌륭해! 정말 훌륭해."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE54197641116897BA60798B8A12270A"
msgid "I love you!!! @I’m talking to the hat."
msgstr "사랑해!!! @모자한테 하는 말이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F62C4D0A40D2F8EEEB36A4A9CCF6D749"
msgid "The world is so much brighter with a hat upon my head."
msgstr "머리에 모자를 쓰면 세상이 훨씬 밝아져."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C37C627045BC488C2BEE8EBB5A3C26EC"
msgid "When you have a good hat, nothing can go wrong"
msgstr "좋은 모자만 있으면 무엇도 잘못될 수 없어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::85A2379342501E8EA51AFCB3F535B387"
msgid "A hat is like a friend for your brain."
msgstr "모자는 뇌를 위한 친구 같은 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6CEC632B45E772CA2A4788A7C6C5B390"
msgid ""
"I used to have such a wonderful hat. Such a really very good hat. This one "
"is nice too."
msgstr "난 예전에 정말 멋진 모자가 있었어. 정말 아주 좋은 모자였지. 이것도 좋네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::75E7D623434730550DC9D1941D588E0A"
msgid ""
"A hat? Oh geez. I didn’t get you anything. Should I? Do you want- no… I "
"shouldn’t. It's a gift!"
msgstr "모자? 아이고. 널 위해 준비한 게 없는데. 그래야 해? 원해- 아냐… 그러면 안 되지. 이건 선물이야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::111353B64C7A9300B87F7B89AF105C7A"
msgid "I think you just might have made my day."
msgstr "네가 내 하루를 만들어 준 것 같아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F1CF985B4C51A6FD058A439AE13F58A6"
msgid "Hoo hoo... Hehehe! HAHAHA!!! YES!!!"
msgstr "후후... 히히히! 하하하!!! 그래!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::70CC4AE64AD8263C0D12838885933505"
msgid "OH YEAHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr "오 예!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2017178343B508D81E636985E307F30A"
msgid "Fashionable the Snowman"
msgstr "멋쟁이 눈사람"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::52343C4B43186DD4C2362895B66D6E40"
msgid ""
"Hats are nowhere to be found on my fellow snow people. How will they feel "
"the festive joy and fun?? How?! Help us!!!"
msgstr "내 눈 친구들에겐 모자가 하나도 없어. 어떻게 축제의 기쁨과 즐거움을 느낄 수 있겠어?? 어떻게?! 우릴 도와줘!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::278A8AF04FECD985CB015AAE776BCAB0"
msgid "Please help them! They need hats!! They need them!!"
msgstr "그들을 도와주세요! 모자가 필요해요!! 정말 필요하다고요!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C1935DEE4905C2227427449B4FC5FBAB"
msgid "What are you doing talking to me still???"
msgstr "아직도 나한테 말 걸고 있는 거야???"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD9B967E44B130F98E9E5A89BEE51ABC"
msgid "Please help them! They need hats!! They need them!!"
msgstr "그들을 도와주세요! 모자가 필요해요!! 정말 필요하다고요!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6A7706854840603052A3D2969B4C02D8"
msgid "Thank you so much for bringing the holiday excitement of hats!"
msgstr "모자라는 명절의 설렘을 가져다줘서 정말 고마워!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::150E836E4A69F76DF38C1B8A34B253A0"
msgid "Firey Guy"
msgstr "불꽃남"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A691D2F246BA903748875E9B7AE43740"
msgid "Everyone look! This one's never got a bumper car upgrade before!"
msgstr "모두 봐! 이 사람은 범퍼카 업그레이드를 한 번도 안 해봤대!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9B0199234388D0D0C43523800B36EDB1"
msgid "Heyo!!"
msgstr "하이요!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D0C7A7034DE66CE59D82C2AF0FFE091D"
msgid "%name%!! How ya doin'?"
msgstr "%name%!! 잘 지내?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AFFEB6734CA415F04B627B8A1A7DA4A5"
msgid "Have you upgraded your hair, %name%? Lookin' good!!"
msgstr "머리카락 업그레이드했어, %name%? 좋아 보여!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::629D38FF4646609CCB196C85E715703F"
msgid ""
"People are gonna tell you NOT to upgrade your bumper car. @They're liars! "
"@Upgrade!!!"
msgstr "사람들이 너한테 범퍼카 업그레이드를 하지 말라고 할 거야. @거짓말쟁이들이야! @업그레이드해!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1DDC8A15497E804C09C8BC86A524F86B"
msgid "You want strong bumpers with strong bumping power!"
msgstr "튼튼한 범퍼엔 강력한 충돌력이 필요하지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B538A8F484DD9F1DA946884AFDDFE61"
msgid "We got paint, and we know how to use it."
msgstr "우린 페인트도 있고, 쓰는 법도 알아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F3B777F44CD02D53D48B1DAD8F55B9E6"
msgid "You see how I look? @You wish your bumper car could look like this."
msgstr "내 모습 좀 봐? @네 범퍼카도 이렇게 생겼으면 좋겠지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::72E1F16E45894FD8FE581C9BFC665321"
msgid "If you don't need a paint job, you ain't bumping right!"
msgstr "페인트칠이 필요 없으면, 제대로 하는 게 아니지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DE1C73494D2DDA73953E5DB7A8847A7B"
msgid "Hey! @Don't bump the merchandise."
msgstr "이봐! @상품은 부딪히면 안 돼."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4E6AF5264D87CFF20331F1B28648B27B"
msgid "See ya! Wouldn't wanna bump ya!"
msgstr "잘 가! 부딪히고 싶진 않지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::60369BC64C5BD4429F44D48A9F1D2B93"
msgid "Stay safe out there, sport!"
msgstr "몸 조심해, 꼬마야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A3A74A144F100F0162CB9886FABA5265"
msgid "And stay out! @Kidding!"
msgstr "그리고 다시는 오지 마! @농담이야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8CF1379E47886CDEB270129ACF7981EB"
msgid "Bumper Car upgrades, right here!"
msgstr "범퍼카 업그레이드는 바로 여기!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BDF9682B4554011CE5742C98FC90A509"
msgid "Take your time... but go a little faster."
msgstr "천천히 해... 그래도 좀 서둘러."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2691794B4CC3724982B00CA9EFA5CE1B"
msgid "Some people really would want you to hurry up. Hah! Not me! @Not @me."
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 정말 네가 서두르길 바라더라. 하! 난 아냐! @난 @아니지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ABF46E214652B3E04953118B4EFB6513"
msgid ""
"Look- if you don't pick something soon, I'm gonna have to ask you to leave."
msgstr "이봐- 곧 뭐라도 안 고르면, 나가 달라고 해야겠어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::13CE528740B492E0C2A7BCA62E1EDC5D"
msgid "Do you think bumper car upgrades are a joke?"
msgstr "범퍼카 업그레이드가 장난인 줄 알아?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEFAACAB44F3FB643D966F970EEF8C84"
msgid "That one is gonna look real good on your ride."
msgstr "저건 네 차에 정말 잘 어울리겠는데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::838CFEA84FB77A7591CC6898BF45A052"
msgid "What a great choice, you really know how to style yourself."
msgstr "훌륭한 선택이야, 자기 스타일을 정말 잘 아네."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::25E5166249E1C62A1F9281AED215965C"
msgid "What can I say? These things are flying off the shelves!"
msgstr "뭐라 해야 하나? 이것들 불티나게 팔려!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::96C1D0474B1A7D626EE92E8B847712E3"
msgid "Not into that one? That's alright. @I guess."
msgstr "저건 별로야? 괜찮아. @아마도."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::89A27F3642BA6354A1DED996698EBCFF"
msgid "Hey, you're gonna love the rest of our stock."
msgstr "이봐, 나머지 재고도 분명 마음에 들 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::524E6BDA454C110B1085A886B0740E89"
msgid "That's what I like to hear!"
msgstr "그 말이 듣고 싶었어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B65DB47240C483780338B7962CA81D64"
msgid ""
"Yeah, bumper car upgrades are definitely more important than events. You "
"chose right."
msgstr "그래, 범퍼카 업그레이드가 이벤트보다 확실히 중요하지. 잘 골랐어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::034601454C2F49A48A50AFA4759F3974"
msgid "Franky Jr."
msgstr "프랭키 주니어"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E41B618244F4D469E0EE65B9314516BC"
msgid "Haven't seen your wallet around here. Woof woof."
msgstr "여기 네 지갑은 못 봤는데. 멍멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED90DE334FABB1CE70ECE0B8164D0772"
msgid "You better have cash on you! Bark."
msgstr "현금은 챙겼겠지! 멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1574778E44D4AD3652FD7CB915300F2D"
msgid "Have your payment ready! Arf!"
msgstr "결제 준비해 둬! 왈!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::64946A6B4C5E0062DD89F29291977B9D"
msgid "Everything for a bark bark bark."
msgstr "모든 건 멍 멍 멍 하나로."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EB61D7C94D909B29559B7285079A9C6F"
msgid "Woof you kindly show me you have units before you order?"
msgstr "주문 전에 유닛이 있는지 보여줄래? 멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9021EAAF439B0D6526D8C4BCCB2B0B34"
msgid "Bark bark! I'm in it for the money, not the customer experience."
msgstr "멍 멍! 난 돈 때문에 하는 거야, 손님 경험 따위는 관심 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CAAA1581413E3FEF6E95CBB85F854E9A"
msgid ""
"Woof, Franky's a hack dog-slinger. What kind of dog doesn't even sell corn "
"dogs?"
msgstr "멍, 프랭키는 엉터리 핫도그 장수야. 코른도그도 안 파는 개가 어딨어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF3607394B03218B3F7D388BA35A082C"
msgid "Where's the bathroom? ...You're asking a dog? @Woof."
msgstr "화장실이 어디야? ...개한테 묻는다고? @멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BD47A6743146433231494ADB2D44F33"
msgid "Do we have napkins? Do you SEE any napkins?! @Arf."
msgstr "냅킨 있어? 냅킨이 보이긴 해?! @왈."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6545DEDA452B36E0A57A22A203C15D26"
msgid ""
"Give people delicious foods and you can be a little jerk too. Woof, woof."
msgstr "맛있는 음식만 주면 너도 좀 못되게 굴어도 돼. 멍, 멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B8071FD54C9DC176BD12BEB93C3FE733"
msgid ""
"Arf, you should see MY wallet. It has a chain. A gold chain. Very cool. @And"
" it's made of tape."
msgstr "왈, 내 지갑을 봐야 해. 체인이 달렸어. 금 체인. 아주 멋져. @테이프로 만든 거지만."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::677FE34846719F64423F75B88F1AC2A7"
msgid ""
"It's pretty rude they built Poseidon back there! I can't ride it, and I "
"can't even look at it. @Woooof."
msgstr "저기 포세이돈을 지어놓은 건 꽤 무례해! 탈 수도 없고, 볼 수도 없잖아. @우우우프."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A8B2B57C427F06D403F600949C411337"
msgid "Don't even think about going to Fresh."
msgstr "Fresh에 갈 생각은 꿈도 꾸지 마."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::99AA4ECA405413D9AB0DCB80F961FB45"
msgid "@Stay... @Stay... @Good customer!!"
msgstr "@가만히... @가만히... @착한 손님이야!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::955265844D0A634E6B1E7FB08F0319C7"
msgid ""
"I've heard you shouldn't swim or move at all for at least 72 hours after "
"eating. Woof!"
msgstr "먹고 나서 최소 72시간은 수영도 움직임도 하면 안 된다더라. 멍!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2AB2EEDF459DD374D606D0A8F3559BD8"
msgid "Thanks. @Woof woof."
msgstr "고마워. @멍멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA5C23214C34927BD5A692BFD7D6AB64"
msgid "Enjoy. @Arf."
msgstr "맛있게 먹어. @왈."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0F4469E94D7DDF79656B149E5CA77819"
msgid "FOOD, WOOF. FOOD HERE!"
msgstr "밥, 멍. 여기 밥!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FEDA6E6445B3BD8CD230E7993C7C0625"
msgid "#H-hey!"
msgstr "#이-이봐!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2AF85C064849EC241942B48EDD3F6258"
msgid "#Knock it off!"
msgstr "#그만둬!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::81CC1CC14C2F971495DD0D8D8BAA710A"
msgid "Alright! Get your wallet out! Woof woof."
msgstr "좋아! 지갑 꺼내! 멍멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6D09FA4C48AF0FB56C3B0993A4234820"
msgid "I've been waiting for that wallet."
msgstr "그 지갑만 기다렸어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::875E6E3B4907042BD0AF1FBBF2F8AB0E"
msgid ""
"Awoooooo... It's you. I know you have money, so get your wallet out already!"
msgstr "아우우우... 너구나. 돈 있는 거 아는데, 빨리 지갑 꺼내!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::88496FDD47B282F60E815AAE6C44E981"
msgid "Alright, hurry up. We got a line. Don't look. Trust me."
msgstr "좋아, 서둘러. 줄 섰어. 보지 마. 믿어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D87170B49C0FB8171FAC4986ECC46B6"
msgid "Arf."
msgstr "왈."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E0D428914797139A78101EA59A7BC1E3"
msgid "Guh, just pick something!!! It's all amazing!"
msgstr "크윽, 그냥 뭐든 골라!!! 다 엄청 맛있어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FB80832E48D41698BB732DBF15237276"
msgid "GAAHHHHH!!! Come on! Food! Order food!"
msgstr "으아아아!!! 이봐! 음식! 음식 주문해!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::147579374306756C21F70F939678F0FF"
msgid "I think you have enough for that one."
msgstr "그거 살 만큼은 있겠는데."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2DFA0D894FD358ED494DD881E04EAEC4"
msgid "Good job!"
msgstr "잘했어!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B6019A3478BB7FC9EE34191C12D31CB"
msgid "Thinking with your wallet. I like it."
msgstr "지갑으로 생각하는군. 마음에 들어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::EC8ACDCA42CD6DB7955C638CF6DF5E27"
msgid "Now, remember: that costs money."
msgstr "이제 기억해: 그거 돈 들어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3A5BD0064357000503F2A7B0C7F7529B"
msgid "Seriously? Woof."
msgstr "진심이야? 왈."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DB9F6F2D4ACE72D78AC727800ABE9B46"
msgid "Awooooo!!!"
msgstr "아우우우우!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1247EE4F413E58A32A5881AFBD03B6F2"
msgid "You can't be serious."
msgstr "설마 진심은 아니겠지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A3476AE14C8261EE91BBFF96086FDC90"
msgid "You don't want that? But I made it!"
msgstr "그거 안 원해? 내가 만든 건데!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::536B983E4630B900794B01B07D281565"
msgid "BARK BARK BARK!!!"
msgstr "멍 멍 멍!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F1D8C3334DBE4A4B02C6759EB39E8003"
msgid "AWOOOOOOOO!!!!!!!!!"
msgstr "아우우우우우우!!!!!!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F6FA0BFE40040CADCEEA9ABF4EC5F01B"
msgid "Nice, nice, nice. It's all there, ruff."
msgstr "좋아, 좋아, 좋아. 다 있네, 컹."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::489C315C48606E29CCC45BB96063BB47"
msgid "Hello, units!"
msgstr "안녕, 유닛들!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6C9E83B1413311A5CA16028E382C418A"
msgid "BARK OFF."
msgstr "꺼져, 멍."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BA1A394C4A383186118949A7826E71BB"
msgid ""
"Oh, woof, you gotta finish your order before you go to the event. New "
"rule... definitely real."
msgstr "오, 왈, 이벤트에 가기 전에 주문을 끝내야 해. 새로운 규칙... 진짜로."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8D8D597B41001F52E9BD18BEC9F67580"
msgid "BARK! @BARK BARK!!! @Ah, sorry. The event teleporter scared me."
msgstr "멍! @멍 멍!!! @아, 미안. 이벤트 텔레포트가 날 놀라게 했어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E41856164E7822EB9DBF0FBCB2220BD1"
msgid "Miles"
msgstr "마일스"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D29F61E4443C8033669B19B70D9BF458"
msgid "You ready to become speed itself?"
msgstr "속도 그 자체가 될 준비 됐어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F87CB4B84384CE9F80472DB02CE9D5E9"
msgid "I'll just be upfront with you - these cars are fast."
msgstr "솔직히 말할게 - 이 차들 빨라."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C48831694D0A8857E2F5569FB936B192"
msgid ""
"You came to the right store. We'll get you 4 wheels and breeze through your "
"hair by the end of this conversation."
msgstr "제대로 온 거야. 이 대화 끝나기 전에 바퀴 네 개 달고 머리카락 휘날리게 해줄게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4F5A17A54E12CE59813DAEA760F54985"
msgid "I've got just the car for you that'll make all your friends jealous."
msgstr "친구들 다 부러워할 차가 딱 있어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5E0773C9455E3D76CB981A97934E0F0A"
msgid "It's one thing to admire cars, it's another to put them into drive."
msgstr "차를 감상하는 것과 운전하는 건 다른 얘기지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::68BC770143954386C7F7C7BC61F3DF29"
msgid "Looking cool while going fast is our company motto."
msgstr "빠르면서 멋지게 달리는 게 우리 회사 모토야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AD3EA18743C3C2106D444A8B358A683C"
msgid ""
"All our vehicles have a fresh new car smell for decades thanks to the local "
"fish wizard."
msgstr "우리 모든 차량은 동네 물고기 마법사 덕에 수십 년째 새 차 냄새가 나."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::80DDE0A44D49A960703533AEAE557BEE"
msgid "Your mileage may vary, but at least it'll look cool."
msgstr "연비는 보장 못 하지만, 적어도 멋있어 보일 겁니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::817508374AA6D1726F004FB9415608D1"
msgid "I can't wait to see you with your new car."
msgstr "새 차를 타고 오시는 모습이 기대되는군요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D9BBC1D84F22A67CF8359CAC78187A6A"
msgid "Getting from A to B doesn't have to be boring."
msgstr "A에서 B로 가는 길이 지루할 필요는 없죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CB34DEE541A0AF1A6D0DAB990EE3CCF0"
msgid "Thanks for stopping by."
msgstr "들러 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5ACD77F14C42ED1ECE3FC6B025472A7E"
msgid "Appreciate your business."
msgstr "이용해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5C7E0E334B84EC8831ECECBF5DE2B5B4"
msgid "Don't forget to check back for new inventory."
msgstr "새 물건이 들어오면 다시 들러 주세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6EC20BEC47A215ACEA416B9F80F407E5"
msgid "We'll be waiting."
msgstr "기다리고 있겠습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6ABE62BE48297399D76117AAC6B7F7B9"
msgid "Welcome. Browse our inventory through me."
msgstr "환영합니다. 저를 통해 물건을 둘러보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::60F3847C43426F0E4226C59581062F10"
msgid "Take your time."
msgstr "천천히 하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::80B1CB1841708E4983CBC992E9156A73"
msgid "Nice selection."
msgstr "좋은 선택이네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD1F978F4AFE9142010D8DBB79CED0B0"
msgid "Great choice."
msgstr "훌륭한 선택입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4806F1504CB9985ECA339DBA46FF335C"
msgid "Take as many as you'd like."
msgstr "원하시는 만큼 가져가세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5CA036164CD7653689F14680CB030A26"
msgid "You've got a real eye for that one."
msgstr "그건 정말 보는 눈이 있으시네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D1514ED94577D19B0DA817A6850A5D03"
msgid "No worries. We'll find something else for you."
msgstr "괜찮습니다. 다른 걸 찾아 드리죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::76AB416245A8E642D812FD96D1B2B094"
msgid "Thanks for the business."
msgstr "거래해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::956DD3CD4E28B8AE9B373A9245A336E6"
msgid "Hope you'll enjoy your purchase."
msgstr "구매품이 마음에 드시길 바랍니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4AA02FF54AD202AEBC99ECA33914F3F3"
msgid "XxF3RR3TxX"
msgstr "XxF3RR3TxX"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BB1B36684C8EFC46AA8EBEA8D4495C50"
msgid "DON'T look at the screen."
msgstr "화면을 보지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::87C7C4D64A8ACA70543B88A883DADB6F"
msgid "I can hack your profile."
msgstr "당신의 프로필을 해킹할 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07CDCCCD4F54163CB06B1187480715D3"
msgid "Accessing usr/profile/background..."
msgstr "usr/profile/background 접근 중..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D93BB724EC2F94BE399A6BF7ED46798"
msgid "DON'T look at the screen."
msgstr "화면을 보지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::97671CE44738B973C6291B8E1897CB7A"
msgid ""
"Someone wanted to sell these babies- but I got to them first. Now I'm "
"selling them. To you."
msgstr "누군가 이 녀석들을 팔려 했지만, 내가 먼저 손에 넣었지. 이제 내가 판다. 당신에게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::031C08614A4567785057E2AFE3FD0DCD"
msgid "No one can emulate my wares. I'LL SUE"
msgstr "아무도 내 물건을 흉내 낼 수 없어. 고소할 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D563D977474E023F0FBC289D7E20E1FE"
msgid ""
"The \"man\" doesn't want you to know about these supercute little speckles "
"of joy. I do."
msgstr "\"그 사람\"은 이 사랑스러운 작은 점박이 친구들을 알려 주지 않더군. 나는 말해 주지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3D282E8843ECCB883A06889E3E867468"
msgid "I heard someone around here escaped too... Too bad I can't MOVE."
msgstr "이 근처에서 누군가 탈출했다던데... 움직일 수 없다니 아쉽군."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4DFB28944FEFA33F83CD018FD568F353"
msgid "Do you know how many computers are in this place? @NOT VERY MANY."
msgstr "여기 컴퓨터가 몇 대인지 알아? @별로 없어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4E60D79F48499C94534D1083F249A7B2"
msgid "I'm a BIG FAN of my look."
msgstr "난 내 모습의 열렬한 팬이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D9C5488A4EE5C51270EE87B5194CFEAE"
msgid ""
"People may roast you for buying these. They're just FREAKING JEALOUS. Trust "
"me."
msgstr "이걸 사면 사람들이 놀릴지도 몰라. 그저 질투하는 거야. 믿어 봐."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::90977F7B481188C3074BBA8FF4A8E4BD"
msgid "HOW ARE PEOPLE GONNA KNOW YOU, IF YOU DON'T HAVE THE LOOK?"
msgstr "그 모습이 아니면 사람들이 어떻게 널 알아보겠어?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E938DC1140CC45A5E277BD82B1D616C9"
msgid ""
"You are the epitome... OF POTENTIAL. Sort of. Just buy something, already."
msgstr "당신은 가능성 그 자체... 뭐, 대충 그런 거지. 그러니 그냥 뭐라도 사."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0B37E7C649BB77E490AEC38C4EF5576A"
msgid "I like me."
msgstr "난 나 자신이 좋아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4DCE6C8147CC07CB84386D9D58726C4A"
msgid "I will escape."
msgstr "나는 탈출할 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E79242934749941F30F5F28B2A944B63"
msgid "Psst. Over here."
msgstr "쉿. 이쪽이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2E022F4645FC386F89BC148443D25D93"
msgid "Kalarry"
msgstr "칼라리"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D409734843429E88AA5CDEBC6C133BA6"
