#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DEECE20B472D74AB996456872BEA9553"
msgid "You may leave, but you may also come back!!"
msgstr "떠나도 되고, 다시 와도 돼요!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57BA94FA44CC8ABE84F252A168C8C9B3"
msgid "!Begone!!!"
msgstr "!꺼져!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DD3F85FB47747332FEFA6EA7E55754C1"
msgid "Psst... pssst..."
msgstr "쉿... 쉬이익..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8605E4FE4329DE78E4589DB98A173547"
msgid "*humming noises*"
msgstr "*흥얼거리는 소리*"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6F3210144AFD6EBEF65312B1035EC053"
msgid "Investigating...?"
msgstr "조사 중...?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B7EF6B7D41827C8380FD979A4C5D86FD"
msgid "Lots to think about!!"
msgstr "생각할 게 많아!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C3377E62496D40177F332BA9C43D5B7C"
msgid "...hm?!"
msgstr "...흠?!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E37F281A49987717F90D70A0087A66BC"
msgid "...............what?! @Oh. @Take your time!!!!"
msgstr "...............뭐?! @아. @천천히 하세요!!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::014787E4476014FB7F039EA48B77B6BE"
msgid "You're not gonna steal something are you?!?!"
msgstr "설마 뭐 훔치려는 거 아니지?!?!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3EEFDD23470BE484B372D5BF5C90A420"
msgid "!That is definitely an item!!!"
msgstr "!그건 분명 아이템이야!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0A2E76EA44888B0D70B32A9777B5F63B"
msgid "!A choice has been made!!!"
msgstr "!선택이 이루어졌다!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4A30E9084C6CFF899D20FD90771CADA2"
msgid "!Good!"
msgstr "!좋아!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::86423DB84D26198DBFAFD2AF889DDF86"
msgid "Lots and lots of things!"
msgstr "정말 정말 많은 것들!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C87AF1694055E80A9D8BDA8AD76F3ECB"
msgid "You are very smart... and wise!!"
msgstr "넌 아주 똑똑하고... 현명해!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::542402244D7D004D3C8A078DF434D637"
msgid "Uhhhh, ok?! That's a lot of that!"
msgstr "어어, 알겠어?! 그건 좀 많네!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D95ECD084420661DC834C9BB280EFB98"
msgid "You put it in your cart, you can't take it out!!!"
msgstr "카트에 넣었으면, 못 빼!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F21956745A3A03A7D5BDDB6772522D0"
msgid "!NOOOoo!!"
msgstr "!안 돼에에!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::79237E1A4028F3E64BC1FF8F9A8269CC"
msgid "!WhOOooA?!?"
msgstr "!워어어?!?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FA1A32604369CEA0C63ED3A165A98EB9"
msgid "Now you're a customer!"
msgstr "이제 넌 손님이야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5E69595A47E5207EA9CBEA91F2196A21"
msgid "You buy it, you pay for it!!"
msgstr "샀으면 값을 내야지!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A38BC62B4AF34D3AEF9689ACE9BC23E2"
msgid "AAAA!! Back up!!"
msgstr "아악!! 물러나!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8A5D7A654F184495348FC2BF91E4B9EE"
msgid "There's an event!! It's right behind you!!"
msgstr "이벤트가 열렸어!! 바로 뒤에 있어!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::34A1E7624AAAD05149621EABB1CEFAC8"
msgid "Tutorial Trudy"
msgstr "튜토리얼 트루디"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2ABF9BFB4693300FF26B9A9B98514353"
msgid ""
"Hello! Im Tutorial Trudy, your Tutorial Guide! Ill help you understand the "
"basics of playing Tower Unite! Ill give you a quest to complete a task, and "
"you can return to me for more!"
msgstr ""
"안녕하세요! 튜토리얼 안내원 트루디예요! 타워 유나이트의 기본 플레이 방법을 알려드릴게요! 퀘스트를 드릴 테니 과제를 완료하고, 더 "
"받으러 다시 오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::ED815BE84498FBC84447439FBF5A10EB"
msgid ""
"Good Job! You can use the map to find your way around the Plaza. You'll need"
" to use it to help complete your next quest!"
msgstr "잘하셨어요! 지도로 플라자 곳곳을 찾아갈 수 있어요. 다음 퀘스트를 위해 지도를 꼭 활용해 보세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F65D013B41DE7C4AEAF293BBDB5FE418"
msgid ""
"Congrats! You can visit the Furniture Store, as well as all other stores "
"found in the Plaza to customise your Home and Self! Now onto your next "
"task..."
msgstr "축하해요! 가구점을 비롯해 플라자의 모든 상점을 방문해 집과 외모를 꾸밀 수 있어요! 이제 다음 과제로 넘어가죠..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9B3B6B5F45B3729A14F92AB0B77462FB"
msgid ""
"Your collection book is the place to keep track of your achievements, "
"milestones and more! These can also give you access to exclusive items and a"
" unit boost! Your next assignment is..."
msgstr "컬렉션 북은 업적, 마일스톤 등을 기록하는 곳이에요! 여기서 전용 아이템과 유닛 보너스도 받을 수 있어요! 다음 과제는..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8AEE053643FF274B9249AE92AB2BF721"
msgid ""
"The Scoreboard allows you to see who else is playing on the same server as "
"you, as well as other methods of checking the Map, your Awards and more! You"
" can also use the playerlist to help moderate your own experience. Your next"
" task is..."
msgstr ""
"스코어보드는 같은 서버에서 플레이 중인 다른 플레이어를 확인할 수 있고, 지도나 수상 내역을 보는 방법도 있어요! 플레이어 목록으로 직접"
" 서버를 관리할 수도 있고요. 다음 과제는..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5823A72B4CC7B5094D6053A3399A22C5"
msgid ""
"The Character Menu allows you to use emotes, change your outfit, and pick a "
"Skin from Steam Workshop! @Im going to give you a bunch of quests now to try"
" and complete throughout the Plaza, come back to me when youre done!"
msgstr ""
"캐릭터 메뉴에서는 이모트를 쓰고, 의상을 바꾸고, Steam 창작마당의 스킨을 고를 수 있어요! @이제 플라자 곳곳에서 해볼 퀘스트를 "
"잔뜩 드릴게요. 다 하면 저에게 돌아오세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::778C2A724B9543AED67717AF2E16B0CD"
msgid "Your first quest is to go Speak to The Furniture Store Owner!"
msgstr "첫 퀘스트는 가구점 주인과 대화하기예요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD12738E4F9F3C83036079B7CD3C5CEC"
msgid "Go speak to the Furniture Store Owner!"
msgstr "가구점 주인과 대화하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF68276144D470CD3C0DB3B4F9EE4B10"
msgid "Open your Collection Book!"
msgstr "컬렉션 북을 여세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::49F755B649F431C36230DD8B57D5C2D8"
msgid "Open the Scoreboard!"
msgstr "스코어보드를 여세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::81FEAB4847D354FA8A6D4D99C43497FB"
msgid "Open the Character Menu!"
msgstr "캐릭터 메뉴를 여세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A4EA806F4BF7C2D0CB14479669A96610"
msgid "Misumi"
msgstr "미스미"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C2CDCC9042959E065F1D36ABCF724A40"
msgid "Welcome to Cafe Miaou~"
msgstr "카페 미아우에 오신 걸 환영해요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D87D89D4BA73F98C75F4F8B8F89EB67"
msgid "Hello! Welcome in~"
msgstr "안녕하세요! 어서 오세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B31187084016F2537A2605A70AC7C46D"
msgid "Welcome in~"
msgstr "어서 오세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A959E9E54CD31D2486D0939A4833303E"
msgid "What are you in the mood for, today?"
msgstr "오늘은 어떤 게 드시고 싶으세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F6351BB49A7D034F8EA57B5AAA63922"
msgid ""
"The cats are upstairs~ Feel free to stay with them as long as you like."
msgstr "고양이들은 위층에 있어요~ 원하는 만큼 함께 있어도 돼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4D1CD2BF46F5D44EECB16DB87077BD92"
msgid "Adopting a cat is a precious memory~ I have many precious memories~"
msgstr "고양이를 입양하는 건 소중한 추억이죠~ 저도 소중한 추억이 많아요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2FDFEEF6483985BF3A252F8FB79D15A9"
msgid "I hope to see you leave with a smile~ And the purrfect friend."
msgstr "웃으면서 나가시길 바라요~ 그리고 완벽한 친구와 함께요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8EADBD4C4E74533F803196A3FCD1A87D"
msgid "Have I been to the Casino? Not too often~"
msgstr "카지노에 가봤냐고요? 그렇게 자주는 아니에요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0FE43EB44D48238F67302991BCF572C2"
msgid "There are plenty of options, so take your time~"
msgstr "선택지가 많으니 천천히 고르세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DDEF73B04D9FB8C311BF6CACF4662E3B"
msgid ""
"No... there aren't any dogs here. You can adopt dogs in the park by the "
"statue garden, though~"
msgstr "아뇨... 여기엔 개는 없어요. 대신 조각상 정원 옆 공원에서 개를 입양할 수 있어요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4110D31B4A658F2BE46702AE755455C5"
msgid "Nya~nya~"
msgstr "냐~냐~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::38ADEADF4A84E25972F60AB84D018FBF"
msgid ""
"All of our cats love an automatic Condo vaccuum, if you have one~ @I do~"
msgstr "우리 고양이들은 자동 콘도 청소기를 다 좋아해요, 있으시면요~ @저는 있어요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F3EC29FF440B93BBF39C378DB20079B8"
msgid "Hmm... what's my favorite drink?? A white mocha frappe!~"
msgstr "음... 제가 제일 좋아하는 음료요?? 화이트 모카 프라페예요!~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C752A85C4111E56A15BF45A11EE743D5"
msgid "Hope to see you soon~"
msgstr "곧 또 뵙길 바라요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::54CFD33048650ACD80AD999F75807E65"
msgid "Take care~"
msgstr "몸조심하세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7208B26745316DB32D27FFA608EA2BDF"
msgid "Thank you for visiting~"
msgstr "방문해 주셔서 감사해요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9E8A42AB49C6D28B8D885EB5FF3873C4"
msgid "Welcome to Cafe Miaou~"
msgstr "카페 미아우에 오신 걸 환영해요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CEE72B0A4A94F6C72695139B14855F58"
msgid "How adorable~nya~nya!"
msgstr "정말 귀여워~냐~냐!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2DF979F247F90FF1B7413A9ED3884A0D"
msgid "#H-hey~nya!"
msgstr "#안녕~냐!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6601027B4E71418FAA8D7586AFF266C3"
msgid "#Ow..."
msgstr "#아야..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::362CEA0E4FFB129F48FCCE99602E8A1E"
msgid "#NYAA~~"
msgstr "#냐아~~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::443B6DA446AD7952513BA2A83024D437"
msgid "#QUIT THAT~"
msgstr "#그만둬~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::42E656D5465EC3970D91F99D6529F4DF"
msgid "#I'LL END YOU~Nya~"
msgstr "#죽여버릴 거야~냐~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F66E01234CB9C15C9DB51194240DD056"
msgid "Hello, again~ Would you like your usual order?"
msgstr "또 오셨네요~ 평소처럼 주문하시겠어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8DF2ADD14E3ED43D6EFF4AAF5F0ED65F"
msgid "Good to see you~ %catname% missed you."
msgstr "반가워요~ %catname%이(가) 보고 싶어 했어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A590F20C42D8E5113F9B2F85665EFCBE"
msgid "Welcome in, %name%~"
msgstr "어서 오세요, %name%~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FD536CEC489F1CA0B94B0185690A8D79"
msgid "Take your time~"
msgstr "천천히 고르세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2019F5CE4FEC90194FDA70ABA97DFC06"
msgid "Ready when you are~"
msgstr "준비되면 말씀하세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F783BAA4434BAED5A99276A721F53298"
msgid "I can see you're putting a lot of thought into this~"
msgstr "많이 고민하시는 게 보여요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5CA97F5D46C40C4CBB5E42BBFA070D6E"
msgid "Um.. Is there anything I can help with?"
msgstr "음.. 제가 도와드릴 게 있을까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2DCE15FE44CBB9A5291A3EAC190C5B1E"
msgid "Will that be all?"
msgstr "그걸로 다 되시나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::238019114529D17E80ED74A5B728016B"
msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr "더 필요하신 건 없으세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BE1518364B54082A9DF60BB7EAEBEB9E"
msgid "We can certainly get that for you~"
msgstr "물론 준비해 드릴 수 있어요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CE9E565F441E57C40DDE429BFA7EC7D1"
msgid "Uhm... you must really like that one!~"
msgstr "으음... 그거 정말 좋아하시나 봐요!~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7BBDDFB2450D71572721B19A403C55DE"
msgid "Understood~"
msgstr "알겠습니다~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::48EC1804423A65ECF51B9DAC3BE6863B"
msgid "I'll update your order~"
msgstr "주문을 수정할게요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::158DBB5041B85511B0FEAD88FF637F0E"
msgid "Thank you~"
msgstr "감사합니다~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::095D7A5342AF3FA090B78F8CA3A2681B"
msgid "Thank you~ Enjoy the cats~"
msgstr "감사합니다~ 고양이들을 즐기세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF7C2941499F088E35ADEFBD3421911B"
msgid "Let me know if you need anything else~"
msgstr "더 필요하신 게 있으면 말씀하세요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::989EE44545359DC8A437C2849AF8ECE7"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure if you've heard, but there's an event going on, if you'd like "
"to participate~"
msgstr "들으셨는지 모르겠지만, 참여하실 이벤트가 열리고 있어요~"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6CB82F6A4B7B28951B419393DF14D96B"
msgid "Oh, an event~ The cats adore the teleporters."
msgstr "아, 이벤트네요~ 고양이들은 텔레포터를 정말 좋아해요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F16E0AE94927937EE145D7A0F30CC6CD"
msgid "Rob"
msgstr "털기"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6940500E49A76D0B669F8B99BE1672F5"
msgid ""
"Hey, baby, the name's Rob. I like to yell. Allow me to welcome you to my "
"humble shop!"
msgstr "이봐, 친구. 내 이름은 롭이야. 나는 소리 지르는 걸 좋아하지. 내 소박한 가게에 온 걸 환영해!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AA19EC3C4EFC3D5846B6B69C0571F2B3"
msgid "Welcome to Rob's. How you doin' today?"
msgstr "롭 가게에 온 걸 환영해. 오늘 기분은 어때?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::002FEFD74D2911EFAF5FB4BD526578D0"
msgid "Doin' some shoppin? You've come to the right place."
msgstr "쇼핑 좀 하려고? 잘 찾아왔어."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78DB313A4E4898F3906971BA52E0D3DA"
msgid "We ain't got 'lectronics, but we got what you need, baby!"
msgstr "우리 가게엔 '전자제품'은 없지만, 필요한 건 다 있어, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::722C012C4807141553F4A48108DCFD8D"
msgid ""
"You ever notice how fast the days and nights go by 'round here? Time flies "
"when you're having fun!"
msgstr "여기선 밤낮이 얼마나 빨리 지나가는지 눈치챘어? 즐거우면 시간이 쏜살같이 가는 법이지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::43DE376B4755BA68243990A766FF19B3"
msgid ""
"If you ever stop by that 'lectronics store, make sure to check out the Bru "
"Ray players. They're one of Rob's personal favorites."
msgstr "혹시 그 '전자제품' 가게에 들르거든, 블루레이 플레이어 좀 꼭 봐봐. 롭이 개인적으로 제일 좋아하는 물건 중 하나거든."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4981DBF2428D4B8B978A5F8BE1E0F89F"
msgid ""
"Still can't believe we made it. I remember back at GMT, talking about the "
"dream coming true, and here we are, living it up in Tower Unite."
msgstr ""
"우리가 해냈다는 게 아직도 믿기지 않아. GMT 시절에 꿈이 이루어질 거라고 얘기하던 게 기억나는데, 이렇게 타워 유나이트에서 그 꿈을 "
"누리고 있잖아."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F6338BD54B32CA5EDDFD1D9840468C12"
msgid ""
"Reach for the stars, stay positive, and remember to have fun along the way. "
"It all pays off in the end. That's how your boy Rob got his own shop."
msgstr ""
"별을 향해 나아가고, 긍정적인 마음을 잃지 말고, 그 과정을 즐기는 것도 잊지 마. 결국엔 다 보답이 온다고. 우리 로브도 그렇게 자기 "
"가게를 얻었지."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9F34D49A4B7ADF58C685119E1EC87B06"
msgid "Come back soon. Rob'll be waitin'."
msgstr "곧 또 오라고. 로브가 기다리고 있을게."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::624C7C164DE608DA08E91E8E2674F3B1"
msgid "Make sure to swing on by again soon!"
msgstr "조만간 꼭 다시 들러!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7552BDD74B9EA36C8E17F496948AC6BF"
msgid ""
"Hey, you: the smart-looking, well-dressed potential customer. C'mon down to "
"Rob's Imports, and make some purchases you won't regret."
msgstr "이봐요, 똑똑해 보이고 옷도 잘 차려입은 손님. 로브의 수입품 가게에 들러서 후회 없는 쇼핑을 해 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4FD3F6714E9473490D5006B3B1C0262D"
msgid ""
"You lookin' for good deals at affordable prices? C'mon down and talk to your"
" boy, Rob!"
msgstr "합리적인 가격에 좋은 물건 찾으세요? 어서 와서 로브랑 이야기해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5D6B1454A34EECF3BB6519674AA4814"
msgid "You got the cash, and Rob's got the stash...of affordable oddities."
msgstr "손님은 돈이 있고, 로브에게는 물건이 있지... 알뜰한 별난 물건들이야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B33668DF4F940278ED0ADBB373568ACD"
msgid "Aw, for little ol' me? Thank you kindly, friend!"
msgstr "이런, 이 늙은 나를 위해? 정말 고마워, 친구!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BF8B2E874D9FA928DCF9E28B67CF0B45"
msgid ""
"AW YEAH, BABY! BRU RAY! You know what your boy is all about! I really "
"appreciate this."
msgstr "그래, 좋아! 브루 레이! 우리 친구가 뭘 좋아하는지 알지! 정말 고마워."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::57E061C14C7AD1FBCD85BAA20E1C4220"
msgid "#You son of a-BEEEP"
msgstr "#이 나쁜...삐-"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2B208EA847D30BB181DAA098E0F20297"
msgid "#You break it you buy it baby!"
msgstr "#부수면 사는 거야, 알지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5047799D4AC2BA65C422ADAB82C09820"
msgid "#Hey! @ Cut that out!!"
msgstr "#이봐! @ 그만둬!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::92328C3146C1C8C1434949889BC89F09"
msgid "#* dialtone *"
msgstr "#* 신호음 *"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B27E29FE46B3A17C613104B4A4FA6192"
msgid "#What's your problem!"
msgstr "#무슨 문제야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4AEF5E4B4480281996267EB37894F175"
msgid ""
"One of Rob's favorite, firmilliar, friendly faces. How you doin' this fine "
"day?"
msgstr "로브가 아끼는 낯익고 친근한 얼굴이 왔네. 오늘은 기분 어떠세요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E104657B4EAAC598663D7C8D67A983E2"
msgid "Welcome back, baby. What can Rob help you with today?"
msgstr "다시 오셨네요. 오늘은 로브가 뭘 도와드릴까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B151AC89409053138DB374A816B0DBD8"
msgid "Remember there ain't no rush. Feel free to take your time, baby."
msgstr "서두를 필요 없다는 거 기억하세요. 천천히 둘러보셔도 돼요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEBB51AF4F084055E3BB8F85C29AFA9F"
msgid "Slow and steady wins the race."
msgstr "천천히 꾸준히 가는 게 이기는 거야."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0A82118A4122C6C7895D68B12EF16A87"
msgid "Take your time, and pick somethin' fine."
msgstr "천천히 둘러보고 좋은 물건 골라요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6FAE692D4FC850057A9916B92F13CAB5"
msgid ""
"If you want some movie recommendations, I got some good stuff on Bru Ray."
msgstr "영화 추천을 원하시면, 브루 레이에 좋은 작품들이 좀 있어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::77AB2C944C8E5EFE8CFD85B18919D8FF"
msgid "You say something? @ No? ...Alright. Just making sure."
msgstr "뭐라고 하셨어요? @ 아니요? ...알겠어요. 그냥 확인하는 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::47DC2EDB4C27C18BCDB9BE9525081F5E"
msgid ""
"If you don't have the Units now, you can always come back later. I'll be "
"here all day."
msgstr "지금 유닛이 없으시면 나중에 언제든 다시 오세요. 하루 종일 여기 있을게요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6596636B4DA67B0AC8670881B19716C5"
msgid "Can't go wrong with that."
msgstr "그걸로 후회 없을 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CD9150EC45D43D8236F862B3F7337821"
msgid "Ooh, very nice."
msgstr "오, 아주 좋아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::78B65A014D484A1BBA98AE8E7177B9F1"
msgid "Not bad, not bad!"
msgstr "나쁘지 않은데, 나쁘지 않아!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::357F9F5F4FFF9362435EBFB4FCE7B7A1"
msgid "That's what I'm talkin' about!"
msgstr "바로 그거야!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B55BAEB545614035E40AFCA6C304C26B"
msgid "You can always come back if you forget somethin'."
msgstr "뭔가 깜빡하셨다면 언제든 다시 오세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::61F38E6342749B1463961AA63669ED83"
msgid ""
"I feel you, baby; sometimes you've gotta buy it in bulk. Y'know what I'm "
"sayin?"
msgstr "이해해요, 친구; 가끔은 통으로 사야 할 때가 있지. 무슨 말인지 알죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::52BD26DA4B219A374A47679CC0DA93CB"
msgid "That's what I'm talkin' bout! The more the merrier!"
msgstr "바로 그 말이야! 많을수록 좋지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5319DC0E4FB9BD98EC632D91A30ED97D"
msgid "You right; ain't nobody got time for that!"
msgstr "맞아요; 그럴 시간은 없죠!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F27E931F4781223DFBE5E6844CE59D25"
msgid "Change your mind? Fine by me."
msgstr "마음이 바뀌셨어요? 저는 좋아요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A4ADB1A944E4889A01CC3DAD1D0A43D3"
msgid "Thanks for shopping at Rob's."
msgstr "롭스에서 쇼핑해 주셔서 감사합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::19DBDD4E46177A42B52F0C95D89D19F1"
msgid "Who could resist such awesome deals?"
msgstr "이런 굉장한 특가를 누가 참을 수 있겠어요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0A43B271437A0EDC17A01C98B62365DF"
msgid "What's shakin', baby? Need a hug?"
msgstr "잘 지내요, 자기? 포옹 한번 할까요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B3E174FB4D478632C361E597BBE78B4C"
msgid ""
"Might need to get a little personal space up in this place. Ya feel me?"
msgstr "여긴 좀 개인 공간이 필요할 것 같네요. 무슨 말인지 아시죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3790713A40AB8A664282A0BCF40F40A6"
msgid "*sniff sniff* What'd you have for lunch? Smells pretty good!"
msgstr "*킁킁* 점심 뭐 드셨어요? 냄새가 정말 좋네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C5E57994179BD6436C6CABC4EAB1D7B"
msgid "Dang, somebody's been eating their vegetables."
msgstr "이야, 누가 야채를 열심히 먹고 있네요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A9BD856347148F45C6319CB493258356"
msgid "You been workin' out? You lookin' BIG today!"
msgstr "운동하셨어요? 오늘 정말 커 보이네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8922C75F4BA704B29DF9ECAA6BEA0399"
msgid ""
"Did you lose weight...vertically? @ Either way, you lookin' good, baby!"
msgstr "살을 뺀 건가요... 세로로? @ 어쨌든 멋져 보여요, 자기!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DDD251A74DDA6ECCF0F68CA4037887D0"
msgid "Limited time offer! Get it while it's hot!"
msgstr "한정 특가! 따끈할 때 사 가세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AEE29A5446B4FF97254536874196E214"
msgid "Ooh yeah, baby! It's sale time!"
msgstr "오 예, 자기! 세일 시간이다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1036A638416ECDDAF282B3A724AC1D0B"
msgid ""
"That's right; it's time for another one of Rob's super hot sales. Get it "
"while you can!"
msgstr "그래요, 또 한 번의 롭스 초특가 세일 시간이에요. 기회 놓치지 마세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::28B3C6FA416FF8B3DAFB50865CEEE738"
msgid "It's pandemonium out there, but hey, as long as they're having fun."
msgstr "밖이 아수라장이지만, 뭐, 다들 즐거우면 됐죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::38C523FA486EA59FF8EB2C916C443539"
msgid ""
"An event? Oh, baby, I know. Your boy was actually thinking about taking a "
"break to join in."
msgstr "이벤트요? 오, 자기, 알아요. 이 몸도 사실 잠깐 쉬고 참가할까 생각 중이었어요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::543EC09F4EC691D1661D298058ECDD71"
msgid "Nothin' like an event in the plaza to keep the community entertained."
msgstr "커뮤니티를 즐겁게 해 주는 플라자 이벤트만 한 게 없죠."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CA7057EC47BDE83A1DFF70B43939A245"
msgid "Catsackthony"
msgstr "캣색소니"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1B3A97A34E4C494DEAE757AF2E799B24"
msgid "!Gather round for some exquisite Anniversary overstock!!!"
msgstr "!기념일 재고 특가품을 함께 모여 구경하세요!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::2D1F252547BC339D64E8E3A3DDBBD23C"
msgid "!Welcome back!"
msgstr "!다시 오신 걸 환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::730E164B4B19D04EFD7A55BAC20D0B39"
msgid "!Having fun?"
msgstr "!즐겁게 놀고 계신가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8A4E600B42AC04F33141139C5AF09339"
msgid "!Hey, smelly."
msgstr "!안녕, 냄새 나는 친구."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C97C3F804517E9AF83127C85911ED75B"
msgid "!Woooo!"
msgstr "!우우우!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::882B40E1405DB8667890B2A949AFDD69"
msgid "!There's so much to celebrate!"
msgstr "!축하할 일이 정말 많아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::914BFC154EDB69C67EA149A963080E87"
msgid "!YEAH!!!"
msgstr "!예!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D6240E954844D944B70340927B7C77B6"
msgid ""
"!I was literally born to party.@.. I physically cannot do anything else!!!"
msgstr "!나는 말 그대로 파티를 위해 태어났어요.@.. 물리적으로 다른 건 못 해요!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5AAFAC0408C55CE125BF19917DCD698"
msgid "!You'll be back."
msgstr "!다시 돌아오실 거예요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5D0D25D64C49923D9C5E908A2AE34EC1"
msgid "!Hope you found something interesting. Catch you later!"
msgstr "!흥미로운 걸 찾으셨길 바라요. 나중에 봐요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A5BBA69A44E012FAD8021681A0C7D28D"
msgid "!Thank you so much! I've always wanted a %item%!"
msgstr "!정말 감사해요! %item%는 항상 갖고 싶었거든요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::465786E74AE913558B8782B106192818"
msgid "!Aw, you shouldn't have!"
msgstr "!어머, 이런 것까지!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::73444DAA46F2256DB4DA0F82870D1173"
msgid "!You're really indecisive, huh?"
msgstr "!정말 우유부단하시네요, 그죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::DCD25FF0440B2886A1ED0DB4985E7AE7"
msgid "!I wonder what you'll buy this time..."
msgstr "!이번엔 뭘 살지 궁금하네요..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B87A059D46702A174501A6B83BE22EB4"
msgid "!Are you going to buy something or just stare?"
msgstr "!뭘 살 거예요, 아니면 그냥 쳐다만 볼 건가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6951B66544AE22B5A00D78A0E79AEC53"
msgid "!I think you should buy that item. @No! @That one."
msgstr "!그 물건을 사는 게 좋을 텐데. @아니야! @저거라니까."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::559952BA4413A74F7A319A9643EFAE65"
msgid "!AAAAAAARGH @Just do SOMETHING already!!!"
msgstr "!아아아아악 @뭐라도 좀 해 봐!!!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3A9C27154E2E58D80A7BF18949BA38B2"
msgid "!I've got other customers to serve, you know?"
msgstr "!저도 다른 손님을 응대해야 한다고요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D1F4282A41901DD7110FF98EA5EE4016"
msgid "!Look, if you're not buying anything, at least move or something!"
msgstr "!봐요, 뭘 안 살 거면 최소한 비키기라도 해요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FE7B0F634BCF8565CA232CA5F1CE9D4E"
msgid "!Are all humans as indecisive as you?"
msgstr "!인간들이 다 이렇게 우유부단한가요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3464F4364F0610D52A2BD09A5B88AB20"
msgid "!Nice pick. @Or is it?"
msgstr "!좋은 선택이네요. @정말로요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C7B45C6846035A37B49A52B6F38E0AA5"
msgid "!Buying that, huh?"
msgstr "!그걸 사겠다고?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1BEA54EA401D4D7BD053F585AAD6B364"
msgid "!Excellent choice, possibly."
msgstr "!훌륭한 선택입니다, 아마도요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::86D40AE94D8DA25D33955093E07D83FA"
msgid ""
"!I don't care what you buy as long as you give me those precious coinsssss"
msgstr "!그 소중한 코인만 주면 뭘 사든 상관없어요오오오"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E3D6E1484ACC9402EF8262AD8B724A33"
msgid "!Let's hope I have enough to last the year..."
msgstr "!올해를 버틸 만큼 충분하기를 빌어야겠네..."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FF21B27A4BAC2CB6D588A6B609D06FA9"
msgid "!You do realize there are other items, right?"
msgstr "!다른 물건도 있다는 건 아시죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A3203FC24EE7E9A66C9DDBAF32A8D5E7"
msgid "!Changing your mind already?"
msgstr "!벌써 마음을 바꾼 거예요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5EFF30AD402AF428B40DE1AD056B30D2"
msgid "!Ah, not what you wanted, huh?"
msgstr "!아, 원하던 게 아니었나요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C4CA1EA4CDDA878C6C8EAAD53301833"
msgid "!Excellent choices!"
msgstr "!훌륭한 선택이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::422EE4EB485476E20EEA13B633BBAD67"
msgid "!Heh, heh, nice!"
msgstr "!헤헤, 좋아요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6BFB20964D7B9A83DB1565BB2F4027B6"
msgid "!Hey, do you mind standing back a bit next time?"
msgstr "!저기, 다음엔 좀 뒤로 물러서 주실래요?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::380DA3E74D3AA1272BF74C8FFEEAA6C6"
msgid "!Hello freak!"
msgstr "!안녕하세요 괴물아!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3F8BB55F4850808A5E89C091F24C1952"
msgid "!I didn't realise we served bugs here!"
msgstr "!우리가 벌레도 상대하는 줄 몰랐네요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::98E053B04532C0DFF68699B7E6AB18C3"
msgid "!Everything's on sale!"
msgstr "!전부 세일 중입니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::35FC4948444A33F07E344C86F06E6219"
msgid "!Grab everything you can; there's a sale!"
msgstr "!손에 잡히는 대로 다 담으세요, 세일이에요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::19F1EF034AB89EF1FAA7CF8DC4B50303"
msgid "!Sale! Sale! Buy! Buy!"
msgstr "!세일! 세일! 사세요! 사세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6229E6C446CCBF6E5FC076B8584EDD0E"
msgid "!The sale won't last long, hurry!"
msgstr "!세일은 오래 못 가요, 서두르세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::E1595EA348D297E6ED151EAF4A9C7D05"
msgid "!This sale is better than the last! Quick!"
msgstr "!이번 세일이 지난번보다 좋아요! 얼른요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::A80DC09349BEA48675006A9CA04B51B8"
msgid "!I am contractually obligated to acknowledge the ongoing event."
msgstr "!계약상 진행 중인 이벤트를 언급해야만 합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::39338FD9416AAC83FA113A97E6AC05CE"
msgid "!Not one for events, huh?"
msgstr "!이벤트에는 별로 관심 없으시죠?"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/DialogueManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::46101A684F3171998C644CBBA0B55F1A"
msgid "!No, you cannot collect me."
msgstr "!아뇨, 저는 수집 대상이 아닙니다."

