msgid "Use your backpack to store your weapon of choice."
msgstr "백팩에 원하는 무기를 보관하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1C83CE63489E37FE103EB28EB0CA2C4F"
msgid "The more zombies you slay, the more you'll be rewarded."
msgstr "좀비를 많이 처치할수록 보상이 커집니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C15F30884A46355E91E246BD7C920A9B"
msgid "The egon cannon is one of the most powerful weapons in the game."
msgstr "이곤 캐논은 게임에서 가장 강력한 무기 중 하나입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::0AAB563348ACC8D035A88D9274D5DDCE"
msgid "You can bounce the saw blades off the walls with the Dissector."
msgstr "디섹터로 톱날을 벽에 튕겨낼 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::16E588354D0B6CDA9FF3F5A0CAD2761A"
msgid "Explosives from players will not hurt you."
msgstr "다른 플레이어의 폭발물은 당신을 해치지 않습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::473627DE4DAA7F386E28B8AE85764500"
msgid "You can upgrade your starting weapon to something more powerful."
msgstr "시작 무기를 더 강력한 무기로 업그레이드할 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7F58254840C48A177EBFCEBFA1E8E9A0"
msgid "Journalist camera flash is quick, but very powerful."
msgstr "기자 카메라의 플래시는 빠르지만 매우 강력합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9267BFC44DB07C9534F68E808BFBCC3C"
msgid ""
"As a Survivor, your shield will keep you invulnerable from all attacks."
msgstr "생존자일 때는 보호막이 모든 공격으로부터 무적을 유지해 줍니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6DE609FE41674387252934963D95DAC3"
msgid ""
"As a Doctor, your health kit will reward you with points as you heal other "
"teammates."
msgstr "의사는 다른 팀원을 치료할 때마다 체력 회복 키트로 점수를 얻습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F68D133404570237FDF47B6F3B44EEB"
msgid "The Doctor is the only class that can heal other teammates."
msgstr "의사는 다른 팀원을 치료할 수 있는 유일한 클래스입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::05ACD45647281166B48305BAF9E06AFC"
msgid "Use your adrenaline shot to temporarily speed up."
msgstr "아드레날린 샷을 사용하면 잠시 동안 빨라집니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::32E4054C4EB8FD21B41F66855C8D4ED5"
msgid "The infected can see where you are at all times."
msgstr "감염자는 당신의 위치를 항상 볼 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7511AB9C4B8D8EFEA25BE5AEC98B22AA"
msgid "Each round you'll get a new set of weapons."
msgstr "라운드마다 새로운 무기 세트를 받습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::31060CEC4B63EABB893A529059B59212"
msgid "Your radar displays both infected and survivors."
msgstr "레이더에 감염자와 생존자가 모두 표시됩니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8F4C223442E72C6F8E0F268FA5B1E683"
msgid "Flak Handcannon is a great insta-killer."
msgstr "대공 수총은 즉사시키는 데 아주 좋습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5BCC66594AEEB1D33E49F4B63C29EB86"
msgid "Team up against an enraged infected."
msgstr "격노한 감염자에 맞서 팀을 이루세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BD3B91334D844678CD26668B0D692BE3"
msgid "Plan your attacks, as survivors can only see infected on their radar."
msgstr "생존자는 레이더에서 감염자만 볼 수 있으니 공격을 계획하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D03741AF45F70402E3E7FFA78C480F44"
msgid "Before the infection, anyone can start off as the infected."
msgstr "감염 전에는 누구나 감염자로 시작할 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1303816C455D4D0F3551E99C3E3FCBF1"
msgid "Press the button or throw the birb at the dragon to disable it."
msgstr "버튼을 누르거나 새를 용에게 던져 무력화하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::9BD50F5A4A9792085ED013BC2101F988"
msgid "The higher your knight rank, the more Units you'll earn."
msgstr "기사 등급이 높을수록 더 많은 유닛을 얻습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::65B8565140B2689941846B9454022BD1"
msgid ""
"Slaying the dragon will increase your knight rank, but if you die, you'll "
"start again."
msgstr "용을 처치하면 기사 등급이 오르지만, 죽으면 처음부터 다시 시작합니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::B39EFB104E31CD1A63E218AEA5B55F15"
msgid "Birb gets scared easily."
msgstr "새는 쉽게 겁을 먹습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::316ADEFD4D311EF3B030DB9E9A32D31D"
msgid "You can dash forward for only so long as a knight, use it sparingly!"
msgstr "기사는 일정 시간만 앞으로 대시할 수 있으니 아껴 쓰세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8C56F70A482EEB6D3918629B1C71FC8C"
msgid "You can taunt the dragon as a knight. Try not to get eaten during it."
msgstr "기사는 용을 도발할 수 있습니다. 그동안 잡아먹히지 않도록 조심하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::8D5829704DFEDFDA73128086044B8C5D"
msgid "Dragons can wag their tail and swat away knights."
msgstr "용은 꼬리를 흔들어 기사를 쳐낼 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AB50A441406786DDA72E418779011A08"
msgid "A dragon's roar will scare off knights."
msgstr "용의 포효는 기사를 쫓아냅니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D22D17DE4E60D68090480AA7E177F793"
msgid "Use your knight friends to distract the dragon."
msgstr "기사 동료를 이용해 용의 시선을 끄세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F851EFA04C141B61810B10A3E13A6F33"
msgid "Don't become dragon food."
msgstr "용의 먹이가 되지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::06747AA74D6EAFEDCD333D9D67032C21"
msgid "A dragon can crush you from above."
msgstr "용은 위에서 당신을 짓밟을 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::7AAF0D6A4940583DBD323FA0CBE3A7FE"
msgid ""
"If you're having trouble seeing where to putt, rotate the camera by holding "
"the right mouse button."
msgstr "퍼트 방향이 잘 보이지 않으면 마우스 오른쪽 버튼을 누른 채 카메라를 회전하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::838950484FFE83FD937C58B5A12B6893"
msgid ""
"If something is blocking your view, you can zoom in with the mouse wheel."
msgstr "시야를 가리는 것이 있으면 마우스 휠로 확대할 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::3FFC4669403F1F55F777CAA5591BC29F"
msgid "Get a feel for the course to improve your game."
msgstr "코스를 익혀 실력을 키우세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1F78E19041DB83D9663E848B692B59D9"
msgid "Pick a target while aiming to increase your accuracy."
msgstr "조준할 때 목표를 지정하면 정확도가 올라갑니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4589D66E45476BD11296158E54D44B45"
msgid "Watch your speed, don't hit your ball at maximum power all the time."
msgstr "속도를 조심하세요. 항상 최대 힘으로 공을 치지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1E2CF4C2487706EF60392481A47FA30F"
msgid "Concentrate on clearing the hazards on the course."
msgstr "코스의 장애물을 제거하는 데 집중하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FBD5A5784824EDFEFB776AB95B699417"
msgid "Practice makes perfect."
msgstr "연습이 완벽을 만듭니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4851B55843C282119F014BB307CCDC0D"
msgid "It is customary to scream really loudly when getting a hole-in-one."
msgstr "홀인원을 하면 크게 소리 지르는 것이 관례입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::5620C42746EFBED786C642BE67C52D0C"
msgid "Avoid putting into water."
msgstr "물에 들어가도록 퍼트하지 마세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4ABEBA2B45D8A33AC6B4989091FDF997"
msgid ""
"Keep an eye on the power bar when making a shot to get a feel for how much "
"power you need."
msgstr "샷을 날릴 때 힘 게이지를 보며 필요한 힘의 감을 익히세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::C83213F3445152EE1574D88EF4011A7C"
msgid "Fancy a new hat? Press C to change it."
msgstr "새 모자가 끌리나요? C 키를 눌러 바꾸세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::F9F07FB54264E1A021358594C456C054"
msgid "Avoid falling off the sides."
msgstr "옆면에서 떨어지지 않게 조심하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::AF0C9D804E00ADBE8F1F4DA3647AE3D9"
msgid "Collect as many melons as you can for extra Units."
msgstr "메론을 최대한 많이 모아 추가 유닛을 얻으세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::CB5AFC0643C06DB21D89169B29B6B466"
msgid "Sometimes the easier route is the best route."
msgstr "때로는 쉬운 길이 가장 좋은 길입니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::4F102CCD4414BB8A5550FB9DF94C5EA5"
msgid "The faster you are, the harder it will be to brake."
msgstr "빠를수록 브레이크를 잡기 어려워집니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::6501B9A14B19F22C6786F9BAA28BDECB"
msgid "Quickly grab items to slow down the other racers."
msgstr "아이템을 재빨리 집어 다른 레이서를 늦추세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::1DD508FF41104CF6A2878AB7EFA64138"
msgid "The golf hole stops players immediately."
msgstr "골프 홀에 들어가면 즉시 멈춥니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::BF2438C440440B9585D0BDBABEA342B8"
msgid "Use the Moon Power to grant yourself invincibility from items."
msgstr "문 파워를 사용하면 아이템 공격을 무효화할 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FFE814994940A5337881F5A6094E6778"
msgid "The Birb will protect and steal items that you collide with."
msgstr "버브는 부딪친 아이템을 막아주거나 훔쳐갑니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::77957CBC4FBFAFA2407546A0C084C3FB"
msgid "Watch out for the All Powerful Sun!"
msgstr "전능한 태양을 조심하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::865B3CA5423DE88D8057F3B9CBD65C29"
msgid "Use Melons to speed boost past other racers."
msgstr "메론을 사용하면 다른 레이서를 제치고 가속할 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::D8923FF04F002E15014AB5BFBD25BBA3"
msgid "You can fling items forward with your mouse wheel up."
msgstr "마우스 휠을 위로 굴리면 아이템을 앞으로 던질 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::65E20BC545FAA78973EF3EB460114785"
msgid ""
"Drift by jumping then turning into the direction you want to drift towards."
msgstr "점프한 뒤 드리프트할 방향으로 꺾어 드리프트하세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::344B81A043CD0767F8EC0DB291F9521A"
msgid "Drifting for longer gives you a bigger mini-boost."
msgstr "드리프트를 오래 유지할수록 미니 부스트가 커집니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::FC2B9D30406C222FBDF2449FC13E513F"
msgid "You can change to first person with the reload key."
msgstr "재장전 키를 누르면 1인칭으로 전환됩니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::620D994F4AC8F82DAD7B91B82DCC0BC5"
msgid "Honk your horn with the interact key or left bumper."
msgstr "상호작용 키나 왼쪽 범퍼로 경적을 울릴 수 있습니다."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/GameplayTipsManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::40D2B10B415B53BCC3E498B19715EED5"
msgid "Plug in your controller for finer control and rumble!"
msgstr "컨트롤러를 연결하면 더 세밀한 조작과 진동을 즐길 수 있습니다!"

