#. Tower/Content/Manifests/LocationInfoManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::07B3F2054E091BDAAAFC5AAE7E458D4A"
msgid ""
"Feeling lucky? Gamble at 3 different kinds of slot machines, try your luck "
"at Spin to Win, and play a few rounds of video poker, video blackjack, and "
"Texas Hold'em."
msgstr ""
"운을 시험해 보시겠어요? 3가지 슬롯머신에서 도박을 즐기고, Spin to Win에서 운을 시험하며, 비디오 포커, 비디오 블랙잭, "
"텍사스 홀덤을 몇 판 플레이해 보세요."

#. Tower/Content/Manifests/LocationInfoManifest.uexp
msgctxt "::19BEC9854750CF120DB1BE8EBA9922F2"
