#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ActivitiesTour.uexp
msgctxt "::5A8094FF4679D7F65EE68FAF32EF0BEE"
msgid ""
"You can earn Units by <b>playing games</> and activites within Tower Unite!"
msgstr "타워 유나이트에서 <b>게임</>과 활동을 즐기면 유닛을 얻을 수 있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ActivitiesTour.uexp
msgctxt "::37D8BCCF4A84524DD096EDA1B49A9EEA"
msgid ""
"The <b>Casino</> requires Units to gamble, but is another good way of "
"earning even more Units!"
msgstr "<b>카지노</>에서 도박하려면 유닛이 필요하지만, 더 많은 유닛을 버는 좋은 방법이기도 합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ActivitiesTour.uexp
msgctxt "::5F70D3C5490E7F3CBEDC94B897237314"
msgid ""
"The <b>Game World Ports</> has access to Games that occur outside of the "
"Plaza, including <b>Minigolf</>, <b>Ball Race</>, <b>Virus</>, <b>Kart "
"Racing</> and more!"
msgstr ""
"<b>게임 월드 포트</>에서는 <b>미니골프</>, <b>볼 레이스</>, <b>바이러스</>, <b>카트 레이싱</> 등 플라자 "
"밖에서 열리는 게임을 즐길 수 있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ActivitiesTour.uexp
msgctxt "::EE93B32842283AA6DE0744B6C59806A7"
msgid ""
"These <b>games</> are the <b>primary way of earning Units</>, and feature "
"more in-depth game play and plenty of level variety including those made by "
"the community!"
msgstr ""
"이 <b>게임들</>은 <b>유닛을 버는 주요 방법</>이며, 더 깊이 있는 게임 플레이와 커뮤니티가 만든 것까지 다양한 레벨을 "
"제공합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ActivitiesTour.uexp
msgctxt "::C354C89F47D8D821AA9B35B7195CC59F"
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "계속"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ActivitiesTour.uexp
msgctxt "::619524A44666C0E8E930269B9A0EE81E"
msgid "Skip Tutorial"
msgstr "튜토리얼 건너뛰기"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeInteriorTour.uexp
msgctxt "::025851114B3E1820C2B07D8FD5BFB309"
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "계속"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeInteriorTour.uexp
msgctxt "::F468BF884793530E093E6E8F615ED247"
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "건너뛰기"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeInteriorTour.uexp
msgctxt "::62056B1E445B695D06D6FF90329C965F"
msgid "Welcome to the <b>Arcade!</>"
msgstr "<b>아케이드</>에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeInteriorTour.uexp
msgctxt "::255AA1CD4CDCE0F5F59467953167445B"
msgid ""
"The Arcade is filled with many fun arcade games, from Carnival Games, Coin "
"Pushers to Shooters and more!"
msgstr "아케이드에는 카니발 게임, 코인 푸셔부터 슈터까지 다양한 재미있는 아케이드 게임이 가득합니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeInteriorTour.uexp
msgctxt "::541653014ACE92B7697A6ABD80E8D3A1"
msgid "WELCOME TO"
msgstr "환영합니다"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeInteriorTour.uexp
msgctxt "::FA87510C4F246A8E2E11B29C57B506DE"
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "계속"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeInteriorTour.uexp
msgctxt "::7668CD574E3F576A0A5FF4B8FACE1C9A"
msgid "Skip Tutorial"
msgstr "튜토리얼 건너뛰기"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::08172FB74A1666E7BB29E6A2589B5ED2"
msgid "To Use"
msgstr "사용 방법"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::2F3733344DAFBFCAB0152EB4A9F26118"
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "계속"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::65A8B5514B660D8457E3D1832F5E9ED9"
msgid ""
"Once you've grabbed <b>Tokens</>, you can choose from ANY of the games "
"within the Arcade to play!"
msgstr "<b>토큰</>을 얻으면 아케이드 안의 어떤 게임이든 골라 플레이할 수 있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::BD6ADF9D42C7D3A131D247A81332667C"
msgid ""
"Each game also has a <b>leaderboard</> with other players highest scores "
"across Tower Unite. You can find these boards next to most games!"
msgstr ""
"각 게임에는 타워 유나이트 전체 플레이어 최고 점수를 보여주는 <b>리더보드</>도 있습니다. 대부분의 게임 옆에서 이 보드를 찾을 수 "
"있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::AD1DA80B46C14087FC4A37A4A2BA4D7A"
msgid " to buy any prize you'd like!"
msgstr " 키로 원하는 상품을 구매하세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::5B174E4A436BB957FC96809C61AC286E"
msgid "Every time you play one of these games, you earn "
msgstr "이 게임을 할 때마다 다음을 획득합니다 "

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::4DA6F94C4319ADE61C27DFBB82010EB0"
msgid ""
"These <b>Tickets</> can be used to buy things at <b>The Asteroid Belt</>, "
"our Ticket Prize Booth!"
msgstr "이 <b>티켓</>은 티켓 상품 교환소인 <b>소행성대</>에서 물건을 사는 데 쓸 수 있습니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::51B7654D490860BAB78537B5F6AD437A"
msgid ""
"But first, you must approach our <b>Ticket Feeders</>, which convert your "
"hard earned tickets into spendable <b>Ticket Currency</>!"
msgstr ""
"하지만 먼저 <b>티켓 투입기</>로 가야 합니다. 이 기계는 힘들게 모은 티켓을 쓸 수 있는 <b>티켓 화폐</>로 바꿔 줍니다!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::1E4B3EEA420A2155D90756902D2E72B5"
msgid ""
"You can even try out our <b>Pluck-a-Pal</> crane game, and bring home a new "
"plush toy!"
msgstr "<b>플럭어팰</> 인형뽑기 게임도 해 보고 새 봉제 인형을 집에 가져가세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::60A76811476FDB4E897E11A9601F0E28"
msgid ""
"Then once you're done, go speak to our attendee <b>Vox</>, or approach any "
"of the items on display and press"
msgstr "그런 다음 다 끝났으면 직원 <b>복스</>에게 말을 걸거나, 전시된 아이템에 다가가 눌러 보세요"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::328E4BA445DEF138B146898B9F559C43"
msgid " Tickets"
msgstr " 티켓"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTicketsTour.uexp
msgctxt "::48D78312437146BEF0EA81945AD385EA"
msgid "Finish Tutorial"
msgstr "튜토리얼 완료"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTokenTour.uexp
msgctxt "::5D9CD61949BA12C956B5DC8E4AF233FB"
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "계속"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTokenTour.uexp
msgctxt "::047CA00F44C4A6E8A73ABBB9499A4B55"
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "건너뛰기"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTokenTour.uexp
msgctxt "::36EC69F24424E6B37B12B3802A25D0E3"
msgid "In order to play these fun games, you'll need to purchase"
msgstr "이 재미있는 게임들을 하려면 다음을 구매해야 합니다"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTokenTour.uexp
msgctxt "::0ADC6A3F491414307151FB8680DC0BC9"
msgid ""
"Visit a <b>token machine</> and hit the big red button to convert your "
"currency!"
msgstr "<b>토큰 기계</>에 가서 큰 빨간 버튼을 눌러 화폐를 바꾸세요!"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTokenTour.uexp
msgctxt "::C141FB654AD8AFE9FC00549C53FE730C"
msgid " with "
msgstr " 으로 "

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTokenTour.uexp
msgctxt "::08639E4C4470E6C7F4D630B7337C1B16"
msgid " Units"
msgstr " 유닛"

#. Tower/Content/Tutorial/ArcadeTokenTour.uexp
msgctxt "::69E2CE984AAB2AF0DA411F96342DCAD5"
msgid " Game Tokens"
msgstr " 게임 토큰"

